msgid "Pull of the mark"
msgstr "Atratzione de su sinnu"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:pull_of_the_mark:description
msgid "You feel an inexplicable pull toward something familiar, as if a piece of you is tethered to a distant past. An echo of guidance whispers faintly in your mind, urging you to seek clarity from those who once knew you best."
msgstr ""
"Intendes un'atratzione chi no ischis ispiegare cara a una cosa connota, "
"comente chi unu cantu de tene esseret ligadu a unu passadu antigu. Un'eco de "
"ghia ti murmutat a boghe bassa in sa mente e t'ispronat a chircare craria "
"dae chie ti connoschiat mègius, una borta."

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:potent_venom
msgid "Potent venom"
msgstr "Velenu potente"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:burning
msgid "Burning"
msgstr "Brusiadura"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:rockfall
msgid "Rock fall"
msgstr "Rocas chi ruent"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:swamp_foot
msgid "Swamp foot"
msgstr "Pee de paule"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:unsteady_footing
msgid "Unsteady footing"
msgstr "Passu pagu firmu"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:clinging_mud
msgid "Clinging mud"
msgstr "Ludu apitzigosu"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:clinging_mud:description
msgid "Thick mud clings to your legs, hindering your movements and making it harder to act swiftly or strike with precision."
msgstr ""
"Ludu ispissu s'apìtzigat a sas ancas tuas: ti trobeat sos movimentos e ti "
"faghet prus difìtzile a fàghere a lestru o a corfire cun pretzisione."

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:cinder_rage
msgid "Cinder rage"
msgstr "Fùria de chisina"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:frostbite
msgid "Frostbite"
msgstr "Cungeladura"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:shadowsleep
msgid "Shadow sleepiness"
msgstr "Sonnu de s'Umbra"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:petristill
msgid "Petristill"
msgstr "Pedrafirma"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:petristill:description
msgid "A creeping layer of stone overtakes the infliced's form, dulling its reflexes but hardening its body against harm."
msgstr ""
"Una pedde de pedra s'isterret a pagu a pagu subra de su corpus de chie nde "
"est corfidu: li mìnimat sos riflessos, ma l'intostat contra a sos dannos."

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:divine_judgement
msgid "Divine judgement"
msgstr "Giudìtziu divinu"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:divine_punishment
msgid "Divine punishment"
msgstr "Castigu divinu"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:baited_strike
msgid "Baited strike"
msgstr "Corfu de esca"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:baited_strike:description
msgid "An overcommitment to attacking that sharpens accuracy at the cost of defensive footing."
msgstr ""
"Un'atacu tropu atrividu chi afinat sa pretzisione, ma faghet pèrdere firmesa "
"in sa defensa."

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:trapped
msgid "Trapped"
msgstr "Atrapadu"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:splinter
msgid "Splinter"
msgstr "Àstula"

#: actorconditions_mt_galmore2.json:unstable_footing
msgid "Unstable footing"
msgstr "Terrinu pagu seguru"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_worm
msgid "Brainworm infection"
msgstr "Infetzione de bermes de su cherbeddu"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_diadem
msgid "Incompatible biology"
msgstr "Biologia incumpatìbile"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_diadem:description
msgid "A magical item attempts to draw it's full power, but it was tailored for a different creature."
msgstr ""
"Un'ogetu màgicu chircat de bogare totu su podere suo, ma est istadu fatu pro "
"un'àtera creadura."

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_poison
msgid "Poisonous vapors"
msgstr "Vapores velenosos"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_poison:description
msgid "Emitted by the creatures adapted to the poisoned environment."
msgstr "Los bogant sas creaduras chi si sunt adatadas a s'ambiente avelenadu."

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightportflame
msgid "Searing burn"
msgstr "Brusiadura forte"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_scimitar
msgid "Soft metal"
msgstr "Metallu modde"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_scimitar:description
msgid "The material of your weapon bends easily, weakening your defense for a short time, but its flexibility allows for strikes targeting subtle gaps in your enemy's guard, before it reforms back to its original shape by some unknown means."
msgstr ""
"Su materiale de s'arma tua si pìnnigat fàtzile e ti mìnimat sa defensa pro "
"pagu tempus, ma sa flessibilidade sua permitit de corfire in sos tretos prus "
"dèbiles de sa guàrdia de s'inimigu, in antis chi torret a sa forma sua de "
"prima in calicuna manera chi nemos connoschet."

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_trollregen
msgid "Troll regeneration"
msgstr "Rigeneratzione de troll"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_shadow
msgid "Umbral step"
msgstr "Passu de s'umbra"

#: actorconditions_brightport.json:brightport_shadow:description
msgid "A master rogue glides through the shadows as if dancing."
msgstr ""
"Unu ladru espertu iscurret in mesu de sas umbras comente chi esseret "
"ballende."

#: actorconditions_lake_laeroth_2.json:heros_body
msgid "Hero's body"
msgstr "Corpus de eroe"

#: actorconditions_lake_laeroth_2.json:scylla
msgid "Scylla's bite"
msgstr "Mossu de Scilla"

#: actorconditions_lake_laeroth_2.json:solid_impact
msgid "Solid impact"
msgstr "Impatu tostu"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:feebleness
msgid "Weapon feebleness"
msgstr "Debilesa de s'arma"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:deathtouch
msgid "Deathtouch"
msgstr "Tocu de morte"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:vainglory
msgid "Curse of Vainglory"
msgstr "Maleditzione de sa Vana glòria"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:revealed
msgid "Revealed"
msgstr "Iscobertu"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:revealed:description
msgid "Your focus sharpens, making enemy movements easier to anticipate."
msgstr ""
"S'atentzione tua s'afinat e ti faghet prus fàtzile a prevìdere sos "
"movimentos de sos inimigos."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:withering_focus
msgid "Withering Focus"
msgstr "Atentzione chi si nche sicat"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:withering_focus:description
msgid "Focus and precision deteriorate, weakening both offense and defense."
msgstr ""
"S'atentzione e sa pretzisione si degradant: s'atacu e sa defensa si "
"debìlitant."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:kazaul_exposure
msgid "Kazaul exposure"
msgstr "Espositzione a Kazaul"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:kazaul_exposure:description
msgid "Defensive structure is methodically compromised, reducing resistance to damage."
msgstr ""
"Sa defensa benit debilitada cun mètodu, e sa resistèntzia a su dannu si "
"mìnimat."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:reclaimed_resilience
msgid "Reclaimed resilience"
msgstr "Resistèntzia recuperada"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:gilded_burden
msgid "Gilded burden"
msgstr "Càrriga dorada"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:gilded_burden:description
msgid "Wealth weighs the soul down."
msgstr "Sa richesa est unu pesu in s'ànima."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:kazaul_mortality
msgid "Kazaul mortality"
msgstr "Mortalidade de Kazaul"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:kazaul_mortality:description
msgid "A severing influence that withdraws the Kazaul gaze, returning the body to its natural and fragile state."
msgstr ""
"Un'influèntzia chi segat su ligàmene e nche tirat sa mirada de Kazaul, e "
"torrat su corpus a s'istadu suo naturale e fràgile."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:heartstone_poisoning
msgid "Heartstone poisoning"
msgstr "Avelenamentu de Pedra de coro"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:heartstone_poisoning:description
msgid "A poisoning that seeps into the body like a slow-burning chill, numbing the limbs while twisting the mind with fevered dreams and creeping despair. Those exposed for too long grow weak, hollow-eyed and restless."
msgstr ""
"Un'avelenamentu chi intrat in su corpus comente unu fritu chi brùsiat a "
"lentu: faghet pèrdere su sentidu a sos membros e intòrtigat sa mente cun "
"bisos de frebba e unu disisperu chi creschet a pagu a pagu. Chie b'abarrat "
"espostu tropu tempus si debìlitat, s'inchietat e li benint sos ogros "
"fundudos e bòidos."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:bone_fracture_range
msgid "Marrow rend"
msgstr "Segada de su meuddu"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:bone_fracture_range:description
msgid "Deep internal damage causes the target to steadily lose health as its strength bleeds away."
msgstr ""
"Unu dannu internu e profundu faghet pèrdere a su bersàlliu salude a sighidu, "
"mentras sa fortza sua si nche andat."

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:head_trauma
msgid "Head trauma"
msgstr "Tràuma de sa conca"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:vital_piercing
msgid "Vital piercing"
msgstr "Perforatzione vitale"

#: actorconditions_undertell.json:vital_piercing:description
msgid "The wound seeps life from within, bleeding away the target's life while dulling its ability to land decisive blows."
msgstr ""
"Sa ferida nche bogat sa vida dae intro: su bersàlliu perdet sàmbene e vida e "
"li si mìnimat sa capatzidade de assentare corfos detzisivos."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_gamestart
msgid "Oh good, you are awake."
msgstr "Ah, bene, ses ischidu."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_visited
msgid "I can't seem to find your brother Andor anywhere. He hasn't been back since he left yesterday."
msgstr ""
"Non resesso a agatare a frade tuo Andor in perunu logu. No est torradu dae "
"cando si nch'est andadu eris."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail3
msgid "Never mind, he will probably be back soon."
msgstr "No importat, at a torrare de seguru a curtzu."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default
#: conversationlist_crossglen_leonid.json:leonid_continue
#: conversationlist_umar.json:umar_return_2
msgid "Anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr "Ti potzo agiudare in calicuna àtera cosa?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:0
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:1
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:2
msgid "Do you have any more tasks for me?"
msgstr "Tenes àteros incàrrigos pro mene?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:3
#: conversationlist_umar.json:umar_return_1:0
#: conversationlist_umar.json:umar_return_1:8
msgid "Do you have any tasks for me?"
msgstr "Tenes incàrrigos pro mene?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:4
msgid "Is there anything else you can tell me about Andor?"
msgstr "Mi podes nàrrere calicuna àtera cosa de Andor?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:5
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:6
msgid "I have a present for you."
msgstr "Tèngio unu regalu pro tene."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:7
msgid "I was searching for Andor."
msgstr "Fia chirchende a Andor."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:8
msgid "What kind of book is it that you have in your hand?"
msgstr "Ite genia de libru est cussu chi tenes in manu?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:9
msgid "Yes, I'm here to deliver the order for a 'Plush Pillow'. But what for?"
msgstr ""
"Eja, so inoghe pro cunsignare s'òrdine de unu 'Cabitzale modde'. Ma pro ite "
"ti serbit?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_default:10
msgid "I don't know...something feels wrong. I thought maybe you were in danger."
msgstr ""
"No l'isco... b'at calicuna cosa chi no andat. Pensaia chi forsis fias in "
"perìgulu."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_tasks
msgid "Oh yes, there were some things I need help with, bread and rats. Which one would you like to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"Ah, eja, b'aiat unas cantas cosas in ue mi serbit agiudu: su pane e sos "
"sòrighes. De cale cheres faeddare?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_tasks:0
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_done:0
msgid "What about the bread?"
msgstr "E su pane?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_tasks:1
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_done:0
msgid "What about the rats?"
msgstr "E sos sòrighes?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_tasks:2
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_done:1
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_done:1
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_all_tasks_done:0
msgid "Never mind, let's talk about the other things."
msgstr "No importat, faeddamus de sas àteras cosas."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_done
msgid "Thanks for getting me the bread. There are still the rats."
msgstr "Gràtzias de m'àere leadu su pane. B'at galu sos sòrighes."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_done
msgid "Thanks for taking care of the rats. I'd still love some bread."
msgstr ""
"Gràtzias de ti èssere ocupadu de sos sòrighes. Ma unu pagu de pane mi diat "
"praghere meda galu."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_all_tasks_done
msgid "Not for now. Thanks for taking care of the bread and rats."
msgstr ""
"Pro como nono. Gràtzias de ti èssere ocupadu de su pane e de sos sòrighes."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_andor1
msgid "As I said, Andor went out and hasn't been back since. I worry about him. Please go look for your brother. He said he would only be out for a short while."
msgstr ""
"Comente t'apo naradu, Andor est essidu e dae tando no est prus torradu. So "
"preocupadu pro issu. Pro praghere, bae a chircare a frade tuo. Aiat naradu "
"chi diat èssere istadu a fora petzi pro unu pagu."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_andor2
msgid "Maybe he went into that supply cave again and got stuck. Or maybe he's in Leta's basement training with that wooden sword again. Please go look for him in town."
msgstr ""
"Forsis est torradu a intrare in cussa gruta de sas provistas e est abarradu "
"presu. O forsis est in sa cantina de Leta, a s'allenare torra cun cussa "
"ispada de linna. Pro praghere, bae a lu chircare in bidda."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_start
msgid "Oh, I almost forgot. If you have time, please go see Mara at the town hall and buy me some more bread."
msgstr ""
"Ah, mi nde fia belle ismentighende. Si tenes tempus, pro praghere bae a "
"bìdere a Mara in sa domo comunale e còmpora·mi unu pagu de pane."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_continue
msgid "Did you get my bread from Mara at the town hall yet?"
msgstr "As giai leadu su pane meu dae Mara, in sa domo comunale?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_continue:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_allares4:0
msgid "Yes, here you go."
msgstr "Eja, lea."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_continue:1
#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_continue:1
#: conversationlist_crossglen_odair.json:odair_continue:2
#: conversationlist_jan.json:jan_return:0
#: conversationlist_fallhaven_nocmar.json:nocmar_continue:2
#: conversationlist_fallhaven_unzel.json:unzel_return_1:1
#: conversationlist_prim_inn.json:prim_cook_return_2:0
#: conversationlist_blackwater_harlenn.json:harlenn_return_3:1
#: conversationlist_blackwater_harlenn.json:harlenn_lookforsigns_1:0
#: conversationlist_prim_bjorgur.json:bjorgur_return_2:0
#: conversationlist_prim_fulus.json:fulus_return_2:0
#: conversationlist_blackwater_throdna.json:throdna_purify_1:1
#: conversationlist_kaverin.json:kaverin_return1:1
#: conversationlist_maevalia.json:maevalia_h2:1
#: conversationlist_guynmart2_npc.json:guynmart_wise_112:1
#: conversationlist_guynmart2_npc.json:guynmart_wise_114:1
#: conversationlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_widow_roots10_0:3
#: conversationlist_stoutford_combined.json:caeda_10:0
#: conversationlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_widow_thorns20_0:0
#: conversationlist_stoutford_combined.json:blornvale_shop1_2:1
#: conversationlist_brimhaven.json:anakis_did_you_find_my_sister:0
#: conversationlist_brimhaven.json:anakis_did_you_take_revenge:3
#: conversationlist_brimhaven.json:brv_guard_captain_25:0
#: conversationlist_brimhaven.json:mikhail_news_40:0
#: conversationlist_brimhaven.json:mikhail_news_30:1
#: conversationlist_brimhaven_2.json:inspiring_snake_master_25:0
#: conversationlist_brimhaven_2.json:brv_churchman_i1:5
#: conversationlist_fungi_panic.json:bogsten_10_10:1
#: conversationlist_fungi_panic.json:bogsten_30_10:1
#: conversationlist_fungi_panic.json:bogsten_50_10:1
#: conversationlist_fungi_panic.json:zuul_khan_70_10:0
#: conversationlist_fungi_panic.json:zuul_khan_115:0
#: conversationlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_prog_12:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_allares4:1
msgid "No, not yet."
msgstr "Nono, galu nono."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_complete
msgid "Thanks a lot, now I can make my breakfast. Here, take these coins for your help."
msgstr ""
"Gràtzias meda, como potzo fàghere s'ismurzu. Lea, custas monedas sunt pro "
"s'agiudu tuo."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_complete2
msgid "Thanks for the bread earlier."
msgstr "Gràtzias pro su pane de prima."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_bread_complete2:0
#: conversationlist_charwood1.json:khorailla1:2
#: conversationlist_kantya.json:kantya1:0
#: conversationlist_twoteeth.json:twoteeth_c4:1
#: conversationlist_guynmart2_npc.json:guynmart_child_90:0
#: conversationlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_widow_roots30_2:0
#: conversationlist_brimhaven_2.json:oromir_basement_help_10:1
#: conversationlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery_arghes:0
#: conversationlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_nanette_12:0
#: conversationlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_hadena_7:1
#: conversationlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_ainsley_3:0
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "De nudda."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start
msgid "I saw some rats out back in our garden earlier. Could you please go kill any rats that you see out there?"
msgstr ""
"In antis apo bidu unos cantos sòrighes in s'ortu nostru, a palas de domo. "
"Pro praghere, dias pòdere andare a ochìere totu sos sòrighes chi bides in "
"cue?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start:0
msgid "I have already dealt with the rats."
msgstr "Mi so giai ocupadu de sos sòrighes."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start:1
msgid "OK, I'll go check out in our garden."
msgstr "Andat bene, ando a bìdere in s'ortu nostru."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start2
msgid "If you get hurt by the rats, come back here and rest in your bed. That way you can regain your strength."
msgstr ""
"Si sos sòrighes ti ferint, torra inoghe e pasa in su letu tuo. Gasi podes "
"recuperare sas fortzas."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start3
msgid "Also, don't forget to check your inventory. You probably still have that old ring I gave you. Make sure you wear it."
msgstr ""
"E non ti nde ismèntighes de controllare s'inventàriu tuo. Est probàbile chi "
"tèngias galu cussu aneddu betzu chi t'apo dadu. Ammenta·ti de ti lu pònnere."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start3:0
msgid "OK, I understand. I can rest here if I get hurt, and I should check my inventory for useful items."
msgstr ""
"Andat bene, apo cumpresu. Si mi ferint, potzo pasare inoghe, e dia dèpere "
"controllare s'inventàriu meu pro chircare ogetos ùtiles."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_start3a
msgid "One more thing: Look at that basket on the floor over there. It belongs to Andor and he might have left something useful inside."
msgstr ""
"Un'àtera cosa: abbàida cussu cadinu in terra, in cue. Est de Andor e forsis "
"b'at lassadu a intro calicuna cosa ùtile."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_continue
msgid "Did you kill those two rats in our garden?"
msgstr "As ochidu cussos duos sòrighes in s'ortu nostru?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_continue:0
msgid "Yes, I have dealt with the rats now."
msgstr "Eja, como mi so ocupadu de sos sòrighes."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_complete
msgid ""
"Oh you did? Wow, thanks a lot for your help! Please take Andor's training shield - you're going to need it.\n"
"\n"
"If you are hurt, use your bed over there to rest and regain your strength."
msgstr ""
"A beru? Bravu, gràtzias meda pro s'agiudu tuo! Pro praghere, lea s'iscudu de "
"allenamentu de Andor: t'at a serbire.\n"
"\n"
"Si ses feridu, imprea su letu tuo, in cue, pro pasare e recuperare sas "
"fortzas."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_rats_complete2
msgid ""
"Thanks for your help with the rats earlier.\n"
"\n"
"If you are hurt, use your bed over there to rest and regain your strength."
msgstr ""
"Gràtzias pro s'agiudu tuo cun sos sòrighes.\n"
"\n"
"Si ses feridu, imprea su letu tuo, in cue, pro pasare e recuperare sas "
"fortzas."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_10
msgid "Just like my father once did, I want to give you a book to take with you on your way."
msgstr ""
"Comente aiat fatu una borta babbu meu cun megus, ti chèrgio dare unu libru "
"de giùghere cun tegus in su caminu tuo."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_20
msgid "This book is some kind of diary, in which you can record unusual experiences and achievements that you may have on your way."
msgstr ""
"Custu libru est una genia de diàriu, in ue podes iscrìere sas esperièntzias "
"istranas e sas impresas chi as a fàghere in su caminu tuo."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_30
msgid "Would you like to have it?"
msgstr "Lu cheres?"

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_30:0
msgid "Yes, sounds great."
msgstr "Eja, mi paret bellu meda."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_30:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella0:4
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "Nono, gràtzias."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_40
msgid "No problem. I won't bother you with it again."
msgstr "Non b'at problema. Non t'apo a istorbare prus cun custa cosa."

#: conversationlist_mikhail.json:mikhail_achievements_50
#: conversationlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel_34
#: conversationlist_ratdom_npc.json:ratdom_audir_2
#: conversationlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_mapmaker_6a:0
msgid "Here you are."
msgstr "Lea."

#: conversationlist_mikhail_foodpoison.json:mikhail_rats_start2a
msgid "Another way to regain your strength is to eat some food. You can buy some for yourself from Mara at the town hall. But watch out - I hear that raw meat can sometimes give you food poisoning."
msgstr ""
"Un'àtera manera de recuperare sas fortzas est a mandigare. Podes comporare "
"màndigu dae Mara, in sa domo comunale. Ma ista atentu: apo intesu chi sa "
"petza crua a bortas podet dare s'intossicatzione alimentare."

#: conversationlist_mikhail_foodpoison.json:mikhail_rats_start2b
msgid "If that happens, perhaps the town priest can do something to help you.  Otherwise, just rest until you feel better."
msgstr ""
"Si ti càpitat, forsis su preìderu de sa bidda podet fàghere calicuna cosa "
"pro t'agiudare.  Si nono, pasa finas a cando no istas mègius."

#: conversationlist_mikhail_foodpoison.json:mikhail_rats_start2c
msgid "Me, I can't really afford the meat, so I just stick to my bread!"
msgstr ""
"Deo, sa petza non mi la potzo permìtere, e duncas mi cuntento de su pane meu!"

#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:audir1
msgid ""
"Welcome to my shop!\n"
"\n"
"Please browse my selection of fine wares."
msgstr ""
"Benebènnidu a sa butega mea!\n"
"\n"
"Abbàida puru sa mercantzia bella chi tèngio."

#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:audir1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_armor:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_alain1:0
msgid "Please show me your wares."
msgstr "Pro praghere, mustra·mi sa mercantzia tua."

#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:audir1:1
msgid "Do you have a pickaxe by chance?"
msgstr "Tenes unu picu, pro casu?"

#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:arambold1
msgid ""
"Oh my, will I ever get any sleep with those drunkards singing like that?\n"
"\n"
"Someone should do something about them."
msgstr ""
"Deus meu, apo a resèssere mai a dormire cun cussos imbriagos chi cantant "
"gasi?\n"
"\n"
"Calicunu diat dèpere fàghere calicuna cosa contra a issos."

#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:arambold1:0
#: conversationlist_lodar.json:lodar_d1:9
#: conversationlist_maevalia.json:maevalia_q1:0
#: conversationlist_maevalia.json:maevalia_h2:0
#: conversationlist_maevalia.json:maevalia_d1:0
#: conversationlist_undertell.json:lethgar_female_ghost_welcome_10:0
#: conversationlist_undertell.json:lethgar_female_ghost_lethgar_60:0
msgid "Can I rest here?"
msgstr "Potzo pasare inoghe?"

#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:arambold1:1
#: conversationlist_crossglen.json:mara_default:0
#: conversationlist_crossglen_tharal.json:tharal1:0
#: conversationlist_fallhaven_tavern.json:ganos:0
