#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:1
msgid "1/1 andor:914  (Search for Andor - I visited my new residence on the top of Mt. Galmore. There I would help the people of Dhayavar as a hero and protect them from villains. Or would I become a villain myself? We'll see.)"
msgstr ""
"1/1 andor:914  (In chirca de Andor - Apo bisitadu sa domo noa mea in sa "
"punta de su Monte Galmore. In cue dia agiudare sa gente de Dhayavar comente "
"eroe e la dia amparare dae sos malefatores. O mi dia fàghere deo unu "
"malefatore? Amus a bìdere.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:2
msgid "0/4 vacor:60  (Missing pieces - I have killed Unzel and told Vacor about the deed.)"
msgstr ""
"0/4 vacor:60  (Bìculos chi mancant - Apo mortu a Unzel e l'apo contadu a "
"Vacor.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:3
msgid "4/4 vacor:61  (Missing pieces - I have killed Vacor and told Unzel about the deed.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 vacor:61  (Bìculos chi mancant - Apo mortu a Vacor e l'apo contadu a "
"Unzel.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:4
msgid "4/4 bonemeal:100  (Disallowed substance - I have brought the bones to Thoronir. He is now able to supply me with bonemeal potions.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 bonemeal:100  (Sustàntzia proibida - Apo batidu sos ossos a Thoronir. "
"Como mi podet dare potziones de farina de ossos.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:5
msgid "0/4 bonemeal:110  (Disallowed substance - I have brought the bones to Thoronir. Of course he wouldn't produce any bonemeal potion from them though, since Lord Geomyr has banned their use.)"
msgstr ""
"0/4 bonemeal:110  (Sustàntzia proibida - Apo batidu sos ossos a Thoronir. Ma "
"est craru chi non nde diat fàghere peruna potzione de farina de ossos, ca "
"Lord Geomyr at proibidu s'impreu issoro.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:6
msgid "0/3 guynmart:210  (Roses - Lovis prepared a surprise for me east of the castle.)"
msgstr ""
"0/3 guynmart:210  (Rosas - Lovis m'at aprontadu una sorpresa a oriente de su "
"casteddu.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:7
msgid "3/3 guynmart:211  (Roses - Then I took my leave of Unkorh.)"
msgstr ""
"3/3 guynmart:211  (Rosas - Tando apo saludadu a Unkorh e mi nche so andadu.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:8
msgid "0/4 kaverin:21  (Old friends? - I have declined to help Kaverin.)"
msgstr "0/4 kaverin:21  (Amigos betzos? - Apo refudadu de agiudare a Kaverin.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:9
msgid "4/4 kaverin:100  (Old friends? - I have found Vacor's old hideout.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 kaverin:100  (Amigos betzos? - Apo agatadu su cuadòrgiu betzu de Vacor.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:10
msgid "0/4 feygard_shipment:80  (Feygard errands - Gandoren thanked me for helping him deliver the shipment.)"
msgstr ""
"0/4 feygard_shipment:80  (Incàrrigos pro Feygard - Gandoren m'at "
"ringratziadu ca l'apo agiudadu a giùghere sa cunsigna.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:11
msgid "4/4 feygard_shipment:82  (Feygard errands - I have reported back to Ailshara.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 feygard_shipment:82  (Incàrrigos pro Feygard - Apo contadu totu a "
"Ailshara.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:12
msgid "5/5 darkprotector:40  (The dark protector - For helping with both the lich and the helmet, Ulirfendor has given me the dark blessing of the Shadow.)"
msgstr ""
"5/5 darkprotector:40  (Su protetore iscuru - Pro l'àere agiudadu siat cun su "
"lich siat cun s'elmu, Ulirfendor m'at dadu sa beneditzione iscura de "
"s'Umbra.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:13
msgid "4/4 darkprotector:41  (The dark protector - For helping with both the lich and the helmet, Ulirfendor wanted to give me the dark blessing of the Shadow, but I declined.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 darkprotector:41  (Su protetore iscuru - Pro l'àere agiudadu siat cun su "
"lich siat cun s'elmu, Ulirfendor mi cheriat dare sa beneditzione iscura de "
"s'Umbra, ma deo l'apo refudada.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:14
msgid "0/3 rogorn:50  (The path is clear to me - Minarra thanked me for dealing with the thieves, and told me that my services to Feygard will be appreciated.)"
msgstr ""
"0/3 rogorn:50  (Su caminu est craru pro mene - Minarra m'at ringratziadu pro "
"m'èssere ocupadu de sos ladros, e m'at naradu chi Feygard at a apretziare "
"sos servìtzios mios.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:15
msgid "3/3 rogorn:55  (The path is clear to me - After telling Minarra that she must have mistaken the men for someone else, she seemed a bit suspicious, but thanked me for helping her look into the matter.)"
msgstr ""
"3/3 rogorn:55  (Su caminu est craru pro mene - A pustis chi apo naradu a "
"Minarra chi depet àere confusu sos òmines cun àtera gente, pariat unu pagu "
"suspetosa, ma m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere agiudada a investigare sa "
"chistione.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:16
msgid "0/1 loneford:55  (Flows through the veins - Kuldan thanked me for solving the mystery of the illness in Loneford. They will start bringing in water with help from Feygard instead of drinking from the well from now on. Kuldan also told me to visit the castle steward in Feygard if I want to help further.)"
msgstr ""
"0/1 loneford:55  (Curret in sas venas - Kuldan m'at ringratziadu pro àere "
"iscobertu su misteru de sa maladia de Loneford. Dae como in antis ant a "
"cumintzare a giùghere abba cun s'agiudu de Feygard, imbetzes de bufare dae "
"su putzu. Kuldan m'at naradu fintzas de andare a bìdere a s'intendente de su "
"casteddu de Feygard si chèrgio agiudare galu.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_details:17
msgid "1/1 loneford:60  (Flows through the veins - I have promised to keep Buceth's story a secret. If Andor was indeed here, he must have had a good reason for doing what he did. Buceth also told me to visit the chapel custodian in Nor City if I want to learn more about the Shadow.)"
msgstr ""
"1/1 loneford:60  (Curret in sas venas - Apo promìtidu de mantènnere segreta "
"s'istòria de Buceth. Si Andor est istadu a beru inoghe, depet àere àpidu una "
"bona resone pro fàghere su chi at fatu. Buceth m'at naradu fintzas de andare "
"a bìdere su custode de sa cresiedda de Nor City si chèrgio ischire de prus "
"subra de s'Umbra.)"

