msgid "0/4 darkprotector:41  (The dark protector - For helping with both the lich and the helmet, Ulirfendor wanted to give me the dark blessing of the Shadow, but I declined.)"
msgstr ""
"0/4 darkprotector:41  (Su protetore iscuru - Pro l'àere agiudadu siat cun su "
"lich siat cun s'elmu, Ulirfendor mi cheriat dare sa beneditzione iscura de "
"s'Umbra, ma deo l'apo refudada.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:10
msgid "3/3 rogorn:50  (The path is clear to me - Minarra thanked me for dealing with the thieves, and told me that my services to Feygard will be appreciated.)"
msgstr ""
"3/3 rogorn:50  (Su caminu est craru pro mene - Minarra m'at ringratziadu pro "
"m'èssere ocupadu de sos ladros, e m'at naradu chi Feygard at a apretziare "
"sos servìtzios mios.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:11
msgid "0/3 rogorn:55  (The path is clear to me - After telling Minarra that she must have mistaken the men for someone else, she seemed a bit suspicious, but thanked me for helping her look into the matter.)"
msgstr ""
"0/3 rogorn:55  (Su caminu est craru pro mene - A pustis chi apo naradu a "
"Minarra chi depet àere confusu sos òmines cun àtera gente, pariat unu pagu "
"suspetosa, ma m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere agiudada a investigare sa "
"chistione.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:12
msgid "4/4 loneford:55  (Flows through the veins - Kuldan thanked me for solving the mystery of the illness in Loneford. They will start bringing in water with help from Feygard instead of drinking from the well from now on. Kuldan also told me to visit the castle steward in Feygard if I want to help further.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 loneford:55  (Curret in sas venas - Kuldan m'at ringratziadu pro àere "
"iscobertu su misteru de sa maladia de Loneford. Dae como in antis ant a "
"cumintzare a giùghere abba cun s'agiudu de Feygard, imbetzes de bufare dae "
"su putzu. Kuldan m'at naradu fintzas de andare a bìdere a s'intendente de su "
"casteddu de Feygard si chèrgio agiudare galu.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:13
msgid "0/4 loneford:60  (Flows through the veins - I have promised to keep Buceth's story a secret. If Andor was indeed here, he must have had a good reason for doing what he did. Buceth also told me to visit the chapel custodian in Nor City if I want to learn more about the Shadow.)"
msgstr ""
"0/4 loneford:60  (Curret in sas venas - Apo promìtidu de mantènnere segreta "
"s'istòria de Buceth. Si Andor est istadu a beru inoghe, depet àere àpidu una "
"bona resone pro fàghere su chi at fatu. Buceth m'at naradu fintzas de andare "
"a bìdere su custode de sa cresiedda de Nor City si chèrgio ischire de prus "
"subra de s'Umbra.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:14
msgid "0/4 farrik:70  (Night visit - Farrik rewarded me for helping the Thieves' Guild.)"
msgstr ""
"0/4 farrik:70  (Visita de note - Farrik m'at premiadu pro àere agiudadu su "
"Grèmiu de sos Ladros.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:15
msgid "4/4 farrik:90  (Night visit - The guard captain thanked me for helping him plan to catch the thieves. He said he will also tell other guards that I helped him.)"
msgstr ""
"4/4 farrik:90  (Visita de note - Su capitanu de sas guàrdias m'at "
"ringratziadu ca l'apo agiudadu a pensare unu pianu pro aferrare sos ladros. "
"At naradu chi at a nàrrere fintzas a sas àteras guàrdias chi l'apo agiudadu.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:16
msgid "1/1 jolnor:20  (Spies in the foam - I have convinced the guard outside the Foaming Flask tavern to leave after his shift ends.)"
msgstr ""
"1/1 jolnor:20  (Ispias in s'iscuma - Apo cumbintu sa guàrdia in foras de su "
"tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu a si nch'andare cando acabbat su turnu suo.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:17
msgid "0/1 jolnor:21  (Spies in the foam - I have started a fight with the guard outside the Foaming Flask tavern. I should bring his Feygard royal guard ring to Jolnor once he is dead to show Jolnor that he has disappeared.)"
msgstr ""
"0/1 jolnor:21  (Ispias in s'iscuma - Apo cumintzadu a cumbàtere cun sa "
"guàrdia in foras de su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu. Cando at a èssere "
"morta, dia dèpere giùghere a Jolnor s'aneddu suo de sa guàrdia reale de "
"Feygard, pro li mustrare chi est isparèssida.)"

#: conversationlist_debug.json:dbg_scores_10_details:18
msgid "4/4 beer_bootlegging:90  (Beer Bootlegging - I informed the guard captain at the Foaming flask tavern all about the beer bootlegging operation.)"
