#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_frederich_beforelecture
msgid "Class is about to begin, please sit down. I will accept questions after the lecture is over."
msgstr ""
"Sa letzione est pro incumentzare, pro praghere setzi·ti. Apo a rispòndere a "
"sas preguntas cando at a èssere acabbada sa letzione."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena
msgid "Ah, this deer soup smells just heavenly."
msgstr "Ah, custa minestra de cherbu tenet unu fragu de paradisu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena:0
msgid "Could you sell me some traveling supplies?"
msgstr "Mi dias pòdere bèndere unas cantas provistas pro su biàgiu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_franz1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella1:3
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella0:3
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_frederich_afterlecture:0
msgid "Could you tell me what you know about the library theft?"
msgstr "Mi dias pòdere nàrrere su chi ischis de sa fura de sa biblioteca?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_milena:2
msgid "Soup from those creepy deer? Yuck."
msgstr "Minestra de cussos cherbos chi faghent timòria? Ischifu!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick
msgid "He notices your presence and looks at you. His face quickly turning into a smile."
msgstr "Ti notat e t'abbàidat. Sa cara sua s'aberit luego in unu risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor7
msgid "She was my student, and like many young bakers, she aspired to make a name for herself and became a researcher. But one day, she decided to leave Brightport, and I have not heard from her since."
msgstr ""
"Fiat un'istudiante mea e, comente a medas paneteras giòvanas, l'atiraiat de "
"si fàghere unu nùmene, e s'est fata chircadora. Ma una die at detzìdidu de "
"lassare Portu Lughente, e dae tando no apo prus tentu novas suas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor7:0
msgid "She might be my only clue to solve a problem. Is there really nothing you can tell me about her whereabouts?"
msgstr ""
"Issa diat pòdere èssere s'ùnicu indìtziu meu pro risòlvere unu problema. A "
"beru non mi podes nàrrere nudda de in ue podet èssere?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor8
msgid "Hmm, it sounds like you've found yourself in some kind of argument. If it helps, she left a lot of her writings and research at my house for safekeeping. You can read through them. I hope it proves helpful."
msgstr ""
"Mmm, paret chi ti sias agatadu in mesu de calicuna chistione. Si ti podet "
"agiudare, at lassadu in domo mea medas de sos iscritos e de sas chircas "
"suas, pro chi deo los allogare. Los podes lèghere. Ispero chi ti siant "
"ùtiles."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_cratelockedroomguard
msgid "Where do you think you're going?"
msgstr "In ue pensas de andare?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_key
msgid "Hmm, let me think."
msgstr "Mmm, lassa·mi pensare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor5
msgid "Yes, I have seen Brightport change. I've lived through its tumultuous times. Why do you ask, young fellow?"
msgstr ""
"Eja, apo bidu Portu Lughente cambiare. Apo bìvidu sos tempos suos prus "
"agitados. Pro ite mi lu preguntas, giòvanu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor5:0
msgid "I'm looking for a person who lived here a long time ago named Bryma. Have you heard of them?"
msgstr ""
"So chirchende una persone chi biviat inoghe tempus meda a como, chi si narat "
"Bryma. Nd'as intesu faeddare?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor6
msgid "That's a name I haven't heard in more than 20 years! "
msgstr "Custu est unu nùmene chi no apo intesu dae prus de 20 annos! "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor3
msgid "Ho, ho, what resplendent blue waves."
msgstr "Ho, ho, ite undas biaitas e lughentes."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor3:0
msgid "Can you please tell me that story again?"
msgstr "Mi podes contare torra cussa istòria, pro praghere?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor3:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor:1
msgid "You must have been living here for a long time, right?"
msgstr "Depes èssere bivende inoghe dae meda tempus, beru?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor4
msgid "It would be my joy, young fellow."
msgstr "Cun praghere mannu, giòvanu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor1
msgid "During the normal time of the year, the water that flows through Brimhaven does so uninterrupted. But when the rainy season starts, the flow becomes a monstrous maelstrom, overflowing onto the plains and into the lake."
msgstr ""
"In su restu de s'annu, s'abba chi colat in Brimhaven curret chene "
"interrutziones. Ma cando incumentzat s'istajone de sas abbas, sa currente si "
"faghet unu remolinu mostruosu, chi nch'essit in sas campuras e intrat in su "
"lagu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro0
msgid "Hss, speak to the leader."
msgstr "Hss, faedda cun su cabu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor2
msgid "That, and the confluence of other rivers to the east, which drain into the lake, causes the water level to rise and flood the grasslands surrounding the lake. It reaches up until the foundation of the houses but never rises more than the second stair step."
msgstr ""
"Custu, e s'unione de àteros rios a oriente, chi si nch'isbòidant in su lagu, "
"faghent artziare su livellu de s'abba e inundare sos prados a inghìriu de su "
"lagu. Lompet finas a sas fundamentas de sas domos, ma non nch'àrtziat mai "
"prus de su segundu iscalinu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor2:0
msgid "Wow, that's fascinating!"
msgstr "Lampu, custu est interessante a beru!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro1
msgid "You are friend of us now."
msgstr "Tue amigu nostru, como."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor0
msgid "Do you know why the houses in Brightport that are closest to the shore of the lake, have foundations made of stone?"
msgstr ""
"Ischis pro ite sas domos de Portu Lughente prus a curtzu de s'oru de su lagu "
"tenent sas fundamentas de pedra?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_richimor0:0
msgid "I don't know, why?"
msgstr "No isco, pro ite?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_chimney
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crate_failure
msgid "There doesn't seem to be anyone around."
msgstr "Non paret chi b'apat nemos in giru."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_lizard2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_charwood_shortcut2
msgid "The statue emits a slight glow"
msgstr "S'istàtua bogat una lughe lèbia"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_lizard1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_s1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_n1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_sw1
msgid "Before you stands an imposing stone statue, overgrown with moss."
msgstr ""
"In antis tuo b'at un'istàtua de pedra manna e imponente, prena de mùschiu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_lizard1:0
msgid "Light."
msgstr "Lughe."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro
msgid "Human again? Why come here, not welcome. Leave."
msgstr "Umanu torra? Pro ite bènnere inoghe? Non benebènnidu. Bae·nche."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyrocave1:0
msgid "I mean no harm. Bryma said your kind's been troubling her, so I came to find out why."
msgstr ""
"Non chèrgio fàghere male. Bryma at naradu chi sa gente tua l'est infadende, "
"e duncas so bènnidu a ischire pro ite."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro:1
msgid "I was just out for a stroll, and you bolted like your tail was on fire. Thought I'd see what all the fuss was about"
msgstr ""
"Fia petzi faghende una passigiada, e tue ses fuidu comente si ti esseret "
"brusiende sa coa. Apo pensadu de bìdere ite fiat totu cussa presse"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock4_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock6_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock1_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock3_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock5_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_rock2_1
msgid "You rummage through the pile and find a few cooled lava rocks."
msgstr "Remenas in su muntone e agatas unas cantas pedras de lava frita."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_common
msgid "Hey $playername, how is your search going?"
msgstr "Ehi $playername, comente andat sa chirca tua?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_common:0
msgid "I'm still looking for Andor."
msgstr "So galu chirchende a Andor."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons_gaveup
msgid "Hello, friend. It's a shame you helped our friend but couldn't help us."
msgstr ""
"Salude, amigu. Est una làstima chi as agiudadu s'amigu nostru, ma no as "
"pòdidu agiudare a nois."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons_gaveup:0
msgid "Well I'm a bit busy searching for my brother."
msgstr "Bene, deo so unu pagu impinnadu chirchende a frade meu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_smugglercave
msgid "Behind the planks is a cave entrance. A cold draft chills your skin."
msgstr ""
"A palas de sas tàulas b'at s'intrada de una gruta. Unu currente de àera "
"frita ti faghet bènnere su fritu in sa pedde."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_smugglercave:0
msgid "[Squeeze in through the gap.]"
msgstr "[Passare a fortza a traessu de s'aberta.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_smugglercave:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_s1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_n1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_trapdoor:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_sw1:1
#: conversationlist_undertell.json:morvath_after_fifth_master:0
#: conversationlist_undertell.json:thalen_after_fifth_master:0
#: conversationlist_undertell.json:vaelzahr_after_fifth_master:0
#: conversationlist_undertell.json:zaroth_after_fifth_master:0
msgid "[Leave.]"
msgstr "[Si nch'andare.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central3
msgid "Now that I have discovered the rest of the statues, I should spell the letters to form the activation word."
msgstr ""
"Como chi apo iscobertu sas àteras istàtuas, dia dèpere nàrrere sas lìteras "
"pro formare sa paràula de ativatzione."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central2
msgid ""
"After a bit of examination you notice something engraved on the statue's base. Strange symbols unlike any you have seen before.\n"
"\n"
"Straight and cluttered lines. They don't look like any of the symbols you know. Next to them is an odd pictogram\n"
"\n"
"                                           *            \n"
"\n"
"*                 \n"
"                                   #\n"
"                                                   *"
msgstr ""
"A pustis de l'àere esaminada unu pagu, notas una cosa isculpida in sa base "
"de s'istàtua. Sìmbulos istranos, diferentes dae cale si siat àteru chi as "
"bidu in antis.\n"
"\n"
"Lìnias deretas e ammuntonadas. No assimìgiant a perunu de sos sìmbulos chi "
"connosches. A costàgiu b'at unu disinnu istranu\n"
"\n"
"                                           *            \n"
"\n"
"*                 \n"
"                                   #\n"
"                                                   *"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:0
msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:1
msgid "G"
msgstr "G"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:2
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:3
msgid "T"
msgstr "T"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:4
msgid "H"
msgstr "H"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:5
msgid "L"
msgstr "L"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central5:6
msgid "E"
msgstr "E"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central4
msgid "It's probably related to the activation word. I should find the rest of the statues. "
msgstr ""
"Est probàbile chi siat ligadu a sa paràula de ativatzione. Dia dèpere "
"agatare sas àteras istàtuas. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescnezio16
msgid "Ask my colleague Androni, he is working with the ingredients right now."
msgstr ""
"Pregunta a su collega meu Androni, est traballende como cun sos ingredientes."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_central1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_s1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_n1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_statue_sw1:0
msgid "[Examine it closer.]"
msgstr "[L'esaminare mègius.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk0
msgid "We protect Brightport from the critters of the wilderness and barbaric monsters such as those lizardmen. All by decree of our king, Lord Geomyr. "
msgstr ""
"Nois amparamus Portu Lughente dae sas bèstias de sos logos agrestes e dae "
"mostros bàrbaros comente cussos òmines-tziligherta. Totu pro decretu de su "
"re nostru, Lord Geomyr. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:ink_paper
msgid "I have ink and paper on me, I should sit down at one of the tables and write my question."
msgstr ""
"Tèngio tinta e pabiru cun megus, dia dèpere sètzere in una de sas mesas e "
"iscrìere sa pregunta mea."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk1
msgid "Those Nor City agitators are a dime a dozen; however, we can only act under Feygard law. The first thing we need is evidence."
msgstr ""
"Cussos provocadores de Nor City sunt a muntones; ma nois podimus "
"intervènnere petzi sighende sa lege de Feygard. Sa prima cosa chi nos serbit "
"sunt sas proas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk1:0
msgid "What could serve as evidence?"
msgstr "Ite diat pòdere serbire comente proa?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons_after
msgid "Enjoy your reward, traitor. Just remember, that gold won't keep you safe when my friends set their eyes on you!"
msgstr ""
"Gosa·ti su prèmiu tuo, traitore. Ammenta·ti però chi cussu oro no at a "
"bastare a ti mantènnere seguru cando sos amigos mios t'ant a pònnere s'ogru "
"a subra!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk8
msgid " If you came here to tell me, there may be some truth to your words, kid. If you want to do the right thing for the glory of Feygard, then see if you can find anything I could order my men to act on. But don't stick your neck out too much, those savages will stop at nothing. "
msgstr ""
" Si ses bènnidu a mi lu nàrrere, forsis b'at calicuna cosa de beru in sas "
"paràulas tuas, pitzinnu. Si cheres fàghere sa cosa giusta pro sa glòria de "
"Feygard, tando bide si resesses a agatare calicuna cosa subra de sa cale "
"potza ordinare a sos òmines mios de intervènnere. Ma non ti pongas tropu in "
"perìgulu: cussos bàrbaros non si firmant dae nudda. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk8:0
msgid "I'll do my best, Glory to Feygard!"
msgstr "Apo a fàghere su mègius chi potzo. Glòria a Feygard!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk8:1
msgid "Sure, but I'm doing this because I want to, not because of your silly laws."
msgstr ""
"Seguru, ma lu fato ca lu chèrgio deo, non pro neghe de sas leges tontas tuas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk9
msgid "Any progress on that investigation of yours?"
msgstr "B'at progressos in cussa indàgine tua?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk9:0
msgid "I found their hideout and inside was this blade."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su cuadòrgiu issoro e a intro b'aiat custa lama."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk9:1
msgid "I found a bunch of goods hidden in a cave east, here's a blade I took."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu muntone de mercantzia cuada in una gruta a oriente; ecu una "
"lama chi apo leadu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk9:2
msgid "Sorry, I couldn't find anything. "
msgstr "Mi dispraghet, no apo pòdidu agatare nudda. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk9:3
msgid "Sorry, I couldn't find anything."
msgstr "Mi dispraghet, no apo pòdidu agatare nudda."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk9:4
msgid "Not yet. But I'll find something substantial soon. "
msgstr "Galu nono. Ma luego apo a agatare una cosa de importu. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk6
msgid "Reputable eyewitnesses. Records. In case of swindling or smuggling, illegal merchandise. Word of mouth means nothing."
msgstr ""
"Testimòngios de fide. Documentos. In casu de trampas o de contrabbandu, "
"mercantzia illegale. Sas boghes chi current non contant nudda."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk6:0
msgid "I think I heard them mention a smuggling cave of sorts, that they use to evade the law."
msgstr ""
"Mi paret de los àere intesos faeddare de una genia de gruta de su "
"contrabbandu, chi impreant pro fuire dae sa lege."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk7
msgid "As if they could ever evade the watchful eyes of my men! Although..."
msgstr ""
"Comente si diant pòdere mai fuire a s'ogru atentu de sos òmines mios! Però..."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk4
msgid "Grr... This is blackmail. I get it. What is it? What do you want?"
msgstr "Grr... Custu est unu ricatu. Apo cumpresu. Ite b'at? Ite cheres?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk4:0
msgid "You've put my two acquaintances, Dynes and Barthold, in a tough spot with your rules. I'd appreciate it if you gave them some leeway, unless you want others to hear about your \"activities\"."
msgstr ""
"As postu sos duos connotos mios, Dynes e Barthold, in una situatzione "
"difìtzile cun sas règulas tuas. Diat èssere bellu si lis lassares unu pagu "
"de logu, francu chi non cheres chi sos àteros iscant de sas \"atividades\" "
"tuas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk5
msgid "Have it your way, and keep those papers away from my subordinates. If word got out, my reputation would be ruined! But don't think this will last for long..."
msgstr ""
"Comente cheres tue, ma mantene cussos pabiros a tesu dae sos òmines mios. Si "
"sa cosa esseret connota in giru, sa reputatzione mea diat èssere ruinada! Ma "
"non penses chi custu at a durare meda..."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk2
msgid "Lizardman you say? That is extremely serious. I will call my men and we will hurry to save him!"
msgstr ""
"Un'òmine-tziligherta, naras? Custu est grave meda. Apo a tzerriare sos "
"òmines mios e amus a currere a lu sarvare!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella
msgid "Welcome to the Brightport Academy. I'm Dibella, the Headmaster's assistant."
msgstr ""
"Benebènnidu a s'Acadèmia de Portu Lughente. Deo so Dibella, s'assistente de "
"su diretore."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk3
msgid "What? [The commander gulps dryly.] Who told you that? And anyway, my favorites are orchids!"
msgstr ""
"Ite? [Su cumandante ingurtit in sicu.] Chie ti l'at naradu? E in prus, sos "
"frores chi m'agradant de prus sunt sas orchideas!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk3:0
msgid "I also heard you love rolling in the flower fields and smelling the roses. I think the others would love hearing that too. [Wave around the records of him visiting a flower shop.]"
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu fintzas chi t'agradat a ti rodulare in sos campos de frores e a "
"fragare sas rosas. Penso chi a sos àteros lis diat agradare meda a ischire "
"fintzas custu. [Mòvere in s'àera sos documentos chi mustrant sas bisitas "
"suas a una butega de frores.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate1_1
msgid "Might be a little cramped inside."
msgstr "A intro podet èssere unu pagu istrintu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate1_1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate1_1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate2_1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate2_1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate3_1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate3_1:1
msgid "[Hide in the crate.]"
msgstr "[Si cuare in sa càssia.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate1_1:2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate2_1:2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_hide_script_crate3_1:2
msgid "Maybe I should check the other ones. [Leave]"
msgstr "Forsis dia dèpere controllare sas àteras. [Si nch'andare]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_4
msgid "[You see a girl sitting at the table with her arms resting on it and her head lowered.]"
msgstr ""
"[Bides una pitzinna sètzida a sa mesa, cun sos bratzos postos a subra e sa "
"conca bàscia.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_4:0
msgid "Umm, excuse me..."
msgstr "Mmm, iscusa..."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_4:1
msgid "I'd better not bother her."
msgstr "Est mègius a no l'istorbare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_frederich2
msgid "It's only a matter of time before he spits out the names of his accomplices."
msgstr ""
"Est petzi una chistione de tempus in antis chi nos nàrgiat sos nùmenes de "
"sos còmplitzes suos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_5
msgid "Greetings, my name is Fiamma. I forge my swords as finely as I bake my bread. How can I help you."
msgstr ""
"Salude, mi naro Fiamma. Fato sas ispadas meas cun sa matessi cura cun sa "
"cale fato su pane. Comente ti potzo agiudare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_1
msgid "Sigh. My friends convinced me to run to the bakery for some snacks, and now I'm stuck in this dusty room doing extra tasks because I was late to class."
msgstr ""
"Ahi. Sos amigos mios m'ant cumbintu a currere a sa paneteria pro pigare "
"calicuna cosa de mandigare, e como so tancadu in custu aposentu prenu de "
"prùere a fàghere còmpitos in prus ca so arribadu tardu a letzione."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_1:0
msgid "Bakery?"
msgstr "Paneteria?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_1:1
msgid "That's too bad, bye."
msgstr "Est unu dannu. Adiosu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2
msgid "I would rather work on these terrible assignments than be in that Feygard professor's history class."
msgstr ""
"Prefèrgio a traballare in custos còmpitos terrìbiles che a èssere in sa "
"letzione de istòria de cussu professore de Feygard."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2:0
msgid "Can you tell me who this professor is?"
msgstr "Mi podes nàrrere chie est custu professore?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_3
msgid "Excuse me, but I don't have time to play around. Can't you see that I'm studying?"
msgstr "Iscusa, ma non tèngio tempus de pèrdere. Non bides chi so istudiende?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_citizen0
msgid "Excuse me, I have no time for discussion."
msgstr "Iscusa, non tèngio tempus pro chistionare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_citizen0:0
msgid "Neither do I."
msgstr "E mancu deo."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_citizen0:1
msgid "How boorish."
msgstr "Ite maleducadu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick7
msgid "I wish I could, but now's not the right time. This incident that's happened left my mind in a haze."
msgstr ""
"Mi diat praghere, ma como no est su momentu giustu. Custu fatu chi est "
"sutzèdidu m'at lassadu sa mente in sa nèbida."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_genericlizard_friend
msgid "You are welcome here, but don't overstep boundaries."
msgstr "Inoghe ses benebènnidu, ma non passes sos lìmites."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick6
msgid "That's terrible news. But strangely, I'm not that surprised. Something about his behavior before graduation was bothering me."
msgstr ""
"Custa est una nova terrìbile. Ma, cosa istrana, no est chi mi nde ispante "
"meda. B'aiat calicuna cosa in su cumportamentu suo, in antis de sa làurea, "
"chi mi daiat pistighìngiu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick6:0
msgid "That might be something that could help my search. Could you tell me more?"
msgstr ""
"Custu diat pòdere èssere una cosa chi m'agiudat in sa chirca mea. Mi nde "
"podes contare de prus?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit
msgid "Hello kid. Name's Counterfeit. I specialize in exactly that. Now please leave me be, I have work to do."
msgstr ""
"Salude, pitzinnu. Mi narant Falsàriu. Est pròpiu cussa s'arte mea. Como, pro "
"praghere, lassa·mi in pasu, tèngio traballu de fàghere."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit:0
msgid "I need a copy of the key for the library here in Brightport. Could you help me with that"
msgstr ""
"Mi serbit una còpia de sa crae de sa biblioteca de Portu Lughente. Mi dias "
"pòdere agiudare"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit:1
msgid "I seriously doubt that's your real name."
msgstr "Dudo meda chi custu siat su nùmene beru tuo."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick5
msgid "By the way, did Andor accompany you here? I was hoping I could ask for his help on something."
msgstr ""
"A propòsitu, Andor est bènnidu cun tegus? Isperaia de li pòdere pedire "
"agiudu pro una cosa."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick5:0
msgid "Andor has been missing and I was sent here to search for him."
msgstr "Andor est isparèssidu e m'ant mandadu inoghe a lu chircare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons21
msgid "That's a dangerous thing you're saying, there is no way you can do that. He's not exactly a sheep; Gunfryk is a skilled and cunning warrior."
msgstr ""
"Est una cosa perigulosa custa chi ses narende: non bi la podes fàghere de "
"peruna manera. No est pròpiu una berbeghe; Gunfryk est unu gherreri àbile e "
"furbu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_priest_story
msgid "Behind it, lies a story."
msgstr "A palas de custu b'at un'istòria."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick4
msgid "Still, though, it's been a while, huh? Six years since my father sent me to Crossglen for safety, when I met Andor and you."
msgstr ""
"Ma est passadu unu bellu pagu de tempus, eh? Ses annos dae cando babbu m'at "
"mandadu a Crossglen pro èssere seguru, cando apo connotu a Andor e a tie."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons20
msgid "Yeah, he really complicated things. That guard outside has been there watching us for a year now. We've only managed to stay afloat thanks to a cave I use to hide some merchandise."
msgstr ""
"Eja, at complicadu meda sas cosas. Cussa guàrdia de foras nos est abbaidende "
"dae un'annu. Semus resèssidos a abarrare a galla petzi pro more de una gruta "
"chi impreo pro cuare unu pagu de mercantzia."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons20:0
msgid "Then all that it takes should be getting rid of him?"
msgstr "Tando bastat a si nche lu leare dae in mesu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick9
msgid "You would? But still, I'm not sure. This might be as difficult as finding a needle in a haystack."
msgstr ""
"Lu dias fàghere? Ma galu no isco. Podet èssere difìtzile che a agatare "
"un'agu in unu muntone de pàgia."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick9:0
msgid "You can trust me. I've solved all sorts of mysteries on this journey."
msgstr ""
"Ti podes fidare de mene. In custu biàgiu apo risòlvidu misteros de cada "
"genia."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick8
msgid "At this rate I will be freed of suspicion, but if they don't find the stolen document while I'm on room arrest, my reputation might never recover."
msgstr ""
"De custu passu, m'ant a liberare de sos suspetos, ma si no agatant su "
"documentu furadu mentras so serradu in s'aposentu, sa reputatzione mea diat "
"pòdere non si torrare mai a pesare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick8:0
msgid "I heard of the incident. I could help you with it."
msgstr "Apo intesu de su chi est sutzèdidu. Ti dia pòdere agiudare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons27
msgid "What's wrong, Barthold? With Gunfryk dead, we've got free rein! "
msgstr ""
"Ite b'at, Barthold? Cun Gunfryk mortu, semus lìberos de fàghere su chi "
"cherimus! "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons26
msgid "You killed him!? You're really tough! But him being dead is not ideal."
msgstr "L'as mortu!? Ses tostu a beru! Ma chi siat mortu no est su mègius."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons29
msgid "Anyway, here's your reward. With skills like yours, you'll surely find more work to do for our friends in Nor City."
msgstr ""
"Comente si siat, ecu su prèmiu tuo. Cun abilidades che a sas tuas, de seguru "
"as a agatare àteru traballu de fàghere pro sos amigos nostros de Nor City."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons29:0
msgid "At least I got some gold."
msgstr "A su mancu apo pigadu unu pagu de oro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons28
msgid "Free rein? It bought us time. Even if it looked like a lizardman attack, there's no guarantee the replacement Feygard sends won't be someone more extreme."
msgstr ""
"Lìberos? Nos at dadu petzi tempus. Mancari pàrgiat un'atacu de un'òmine-"
"tziligherta, non b'at peruna garantzia chi su chi at a mandare Feygard a su "
"postu suo non siat unu galu prus estremu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick3
msgid "Someone had to go buy the bread and pull the weeds. And it wasn't going to be us."
msgstr ""
"Calicunu depiat andare a comporare su pane e a bogare sas erbas malas. E de "
"seguru non fìamus nois."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons23
msgid "Dang it, Dynes, don't egg on the kid. Killing is off the list, understood? Just make him less of a problem for us."
msgstr ""
"Malaita siat, Dynes, no ispingas su pitzinnu. Ochìere no est in sa lista, "
"cumpresu? Faghe petzi chi siat de prus pagu fastìgiu pro nois."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons23:0
msgid "Got it, I'll \"persuade\" him to not be a problem, heh. "
msgstr "Cumpresu, l'apo a \"cumbìnchere\" a no èssere unu problema, eh eh. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons23:1
msgid "How else can I deal with him then?"
msgstr "In cale àtera manera mi nde potzo ocupare, tando?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick2
msgid "Yeah, I bet. Crossglen can be pretty boring, but it's also nostalgic."
msgstr ""
"Eja, lu creo. Crossglen podet èssere unu pagu infadosu, ma ponet fintzas "
"nostalgia."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons22
msgid "Yeah you'd have to be more discreet, we don't want things to go in a worse direction. If you can pull it off, we'll reward you handsomely. But if you fail you've got nothing to do with us. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"Eja, dias dèpere èssere prus discretu, non cherimus chi sas cosas andent "
"peus. Si resesses, t'amus a pagare bene. Ma si fallis, tue cun nois non "
"b'intras nudda. Cumpresu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick1
msgid "Long time no see, $playername! What brings you to Brightport? Did Andor finally convince you to enroll, or did you just come to see me? [The boy laughs.]"
msgstr ""
"Dae cantu tempus non nos bidimus, $playername! Ite ti batit a Portu "
"Lughente? Andor t'at cumbintu a s'urtimada a t'iscrìere, o ses bènnidu petzi "
"pro mi bìdere? [Su pitzinnu riet.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick1:0
msgid "Ha, not in a thousand years! You guys were always making me run errands."
msgstr "Ah, mancu in milli annos! Bois mi faghiais semper fàghere incàrrigos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick1:1
msgid "I was getting bored back home with nothing to do!"
msgstr "Fia infadadu in domo, chene nudda de fàghere!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25
msgid "Hey kid, any news on your task?"
msgstr "Ehi, pitzinnu, novas de s'incàrrigu tuo?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:0
msgid "It was a hard fight, but I killed him, They'll probably think a lizardman got him."
msgstr ""
"Est istada una cumbata dura, ma l'apo mortu. De seguru ant a pensare chi "
"l'at mortu un'òmine-tziligherta."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:1
msgid "I think you guys owe me some gold now."
msgstr "Penso chi como mi depides unu pagu de oro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:2
msgid "I tried so hard, and got so far. But in the end, I couldn't find anything."
msgstr ""
"Apo proadu meda, e so arribadu a tesu. Ma a sa fine non so resèssidu a "
"agatare nudda."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:3
msgid "Good news. The commander's going to be turning a blind eye to your deals for a while. [Show him the compromising records.]"
msgstr ""
"Bonas novas. Su cumandante at a serrare un'ogru subra de sos afàrios bostros "
"pro unu pagu de tempus. [Li mustrare sos documentos chi lu cumpromitent.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:4
msgid "No. But I'll see it through."
msgstr "Nono. Ma l'apo a giùghere a fine."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick0
msgid "You see a young boy of about age sixteen sitting on a chair and reading a book."
msgstr ""
"Bides unu pitzinnu de unos sèighi annos, sètzidu in una cadira, chi est "
"leghende unu libru."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons24
msgid "I don't know, you're our sheep culling expert here. But surely Gunfryk has some secrets he wishes to hide. "
msgstr ""
"No isco, s'espertu de ochìere berbeghes inoghe ses tue. Ma de seguru Gunfryk "
"at calicunu segretu chi cheret cuare. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons24:0
msgid "Got it, just watch."
msgstr "Cumpresu, abbàida·mi."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2_reply1
msgid "If those Feygard folk are anything like him, you'd better steer clear."
msgstr ""
"Si sa gente de Feygard est comente a issu, est mègius chi nde istes a tesu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2_reply1:0
msgid "Hmph, another peasant who doesn't understand the glory of Feygard."
msgstr "Hmpf, un'àteru massaju chi non cumprendet sa glòria de Feygard."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2_reply1:1
msgid "Thanks. Shadow be with you."
msgstr "Gràtzias. Chi s'Umbra siat cun tegus."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_direction4
msgid "Sure, that was impressive for someone your age, but what goes down in Umar's turf has little to do with the Guild here in Brightport."
msgstr ""
"Seguru, est istada una cosa de ispantu pro unu de s'edade tua, ma su chi "
"sutzedet in su territòriu de Umar tenet pagu de chi fàghere cun su Grèmiu de "
"inoghe, in Portu Lughente."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_direction4:0
msgid "Must I remind you that the profits from Fallhaven's Guild deals with Sullengard are also reaching the Guild here in Brightport?"
msgstr ""
"Ti depo ammentare chi sos balàngios de sos afàrios de su Grèmiu de Fallhaven "
"cun Sullengard sunt lompende fintzas a su Grèmiu de inoghe, in Portu "
"Lughente?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_direction4:1
msgid "Argh, fine, let's return to the previous conversation."
msgstr "Argh, bene, torremus a su chi fìamus narende."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons30
msgid "Give me that! [Barthold skips through some of the pages with a puzzled expression.]"
msgstr ""
"Dona·mi·lu! [Barthold girat a lestru unas cantas pàginas, cun sa cara "
"ispantada.]"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons32
msgid "And for a job well done here is your reward; rather generous I say. You'll surely find more work to do in Nor City, just tell them Barthold sent you."
msgstr ""
"E pro unu traballu bene fatu, ecu su prèmiu tuo: bastante generosu, naro "
"deo. De seguru as a agatare àteru traballu de fàghere in Nor City: nara·lis "
"petzi chi t'at mandadu Barthold."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons32:0
msgid "It was my pleasure, Bye. "
msgstr "Est istadu unu praghere, adiosu. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons32:1
msgid "If not information about my brother at least some gold."
msgstr "Si no est una nova de frade meu, a su mancu unu pagu de oro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons31
msgid "Ha ha ha ha! That's soo funny, who would have guessed that stern Feygard dog would have such hobbies. And in Nor City nonetheless! Northerners and their pride. He surely wants to avoid his men finding out."
msgstr ""
"Ah ah ah ah! Custa est ispassiosa meda: chie l'aiat a pensare chi cussu cane "
"sèriu de Feygard tenneret passatempos gasi. E pro de prus in Nor City! Sos "
"de su nord e s'orgòlliu issoro. De seguru non cheret chi sos òmines suos lu "
"iscant."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium1
msgid "Yes, an old mine to the east. It was really ingenious of us to use an old mining cave for that purpose, but it's teeming with bugs. And if you're not careful, a lizardman could swim up to the shore and snatch you on the way."
msgstr ""
"Eja, una mina betza a oriente. Est istada un'idea bona meda a impreare una "
"gruta de mina betza pro cussu, ma est prena de babbautzos. E si no istas "
"atentu, un'òmine-tziligherta podet arribare nadende finas a s'oru e ti leare "
"in caminu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium1:0
msgid "That sounds nasty. It's not as if I would be going there. "
msgstr "Paret ischifosu. Mancu male chi deo non bi depo andare. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium2
msgid "Haha, yeah. You've still got that request from us to do, unless you feel like you're not up to the task?"
msgstr ""
"Ah ah, eja. Tenes galu cussa rechesta nostra de fàghere, francu chi non ti "
"sentas a s'artària?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium2:0
msgid "Nope, I'm on my way."
msgstr "Nono, so andende."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_deebo
msgid "You came for naught. The apples were picked up recently. Should be on their way, if not already delivered."
msgstr ""
"Ses bènnidu pro nudda. Sas melas sunt istadas leadas pagu tempus a como. "
"Diant dèpere èssere in caminu, si non sunt giai istadas cunsignadas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_deebo:0
msgid "Well, they were supposed to arrive, but didn't."
msgstr "Bene, diant àere dèpidu arribare, ma non sunt arribadas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons38
msgid "Feygard sent a new guy if you haven't heard already. Seems like your lie has worked. This guy is more of a warrior than a justiciar, so we're optimistic for now."
msgstr ""
"Feygard at mandadu unu nou, si no l'as galu intesu. Paret chi sa fàula tua "
"apat funtzionadu. Custu est prus unu gherreri che unu giùighe, duncas pro "
"como semus otimistas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons38:0
msgid "If you need someone dead you know who to call. The guard buster $playername."
msgstr ""
"Si tenes bisòngiu de bìdere a calicunu mortu, ischis a chie tzerriare. "
"$playername, s'ochidore de guàrdias."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons37
msgid "The old commander's gone but his mutts have kept their pace, though we've managed to sneak in a few more bribes than usual, he he."
msgstr ""
"Su cumandante betzu nch'est andadu, ma sos canes suos sighint a su matessi "
"passu; però semus resèssidos a passare unu pagu prus de dinare a suta de "
"mesa che a su sòlitu, eh eh."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons34
msgid "Argh! Dynes, hand him all of our gold!"
msgstr "Argh! Dynes, dona·li totu s'oro nostru!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons33
msgid "Ha! What gives, or are you making a joke?"
msgstr "Ah! Ite b'at, o ses brullende?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons33:0
msgid "Right, I was joking, sorry."
msgstr "Eja, fia brullende, iscusa."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons33:1
msgid "You don't have the Guild's protection. Either I give this blade I took from your hideout to the guards. Or 2,000 gold. You pick."
msgstr ""
"Bois non tenides sa protetzione de su Grèmiu. O dao a sas guàrdias custa "
"lama chi apo leadu dae su cuadòrgiu bostru, o 2.000 monedas de oro. Seberade "
"bois."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons36
msgid "Curses on that Benbyr for sending a rat like you our way! Now get out breadface, our deal is over!"
msgstr ""
"Malaitu siat cussu Benbyr chi nos at mandadu unu sòrighe che a tie! Como "
"bae·nche, cara de pane: s'acordu nostru est acabbadu!"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons35
msgid "Dynes begrudgingly takes out a bag of gold and throws it your way."
msgstr "Dynes, de mala gana, bogat una bussa de oro e ti la ghetat."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_mayor11
msgid "More recently, strange creatures have begun appearing near the cursed, festering land that was once a green forest. With such threats present we cannot afford to sell our equipment to just any adventurer with a pretty purse."
msgstr ""
"Prus a pagu a como, creaduras istranas ant incumentzadu a aparèssere acanta "
"de sa terra malaita e pùdida chi una borta fiat unu padente birde. Cun "
"custas minetzas, non nos podimus permìtere de bèndere s'atretzadura nostra a "
"su primu ventureri cun una bussa prena."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_mayor11:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes5:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_florencia6:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella8:1
msgid "I see, bye."
msgstr "Cumprendo, adiosu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_mayor10
msgid "Many years ago, when my father was the Doughe, Brightport was attacked by a large group of lizardmen, and many lives were lost. "
msgstr ""
"Annos meda a como, cando babbu meu fiat su Doughe, Portu Lughente est istada "
"atacada dae unu grupu mannu de òmines-tziligherta, e sunt mortas medas "
"persones. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:0
msgid "Here's 1 green pepper and rice."
msgstr "Ecu 1 pibireddu birde e risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:1
msgid "Here are 5 green peppers and rice."
msgstr "Ecu 5 pibireddos birdes e risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:2
msgid "Here's 1 yellow pepper and rice."
msgstr "Ecu 1 pibireddu grogu e risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:3
msgid "Here are 5 yellow peppers and rice."
msgstr "Ecu 5 pibireddos grogos e risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:4
msgid "Here's 1 red pepper and rice."
msgstr "Ecu 1 pibireddu ruju e risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:5
msgid "Here are 5 red peppers and rice."
msgstr "Ecu 5 pibireddos rujos e risu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:6
msgid "I don't have the ingredients now, I'll be back again."
msgstr "Como non tèngio sos ingredientes, apo a torrare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio8
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescnezio_5
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_4
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_3
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_2
msgid "Just a moment..."
msgstr "Unu momentu..."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio5
msgid "Delicious rice stuffed peppers. In Crossglen they'd make it with millet, but here we get rice from Nor City."
msgstr ""
"Pibireddos prenos de risu, bonos meda. In Crossglen los faghent cun su "
"millu, ma inoghe su risu nos lu batint dae Nor City."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio6
msgid "To prepare some for you, I'll need peppers and rice. And an appropriate fee of 20 gold. The peppers come in different colors, and each affects the flavor, so I prefer to cook them separately. "
msgstr ""
"Pro nde preparare pro tene, m'ant a serbire pibireddos e risu. E unu "
"pagamentu adeguadu de 20 monedas de oro. Sos pibireddos sunt de colores "
"diferentes, e cada colore càmbiat su sabore, duncas los prefèrgio còghere a "
"separadu. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio6:0
msgid "I would like you to cook me some."
msgstr "Dia chèrrere chi mi nde coghes unos cantos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma51
msgid "That is the gist of my research, which is mostly a theory. I was preparing to publish and discuss it among the scholars of Feygard before I fled."
msgstr ""
"Custu est su coro de sa chirca mea, chi est prus che àteru una teoria. Mi "
"fia preparende a la publicare e a nde discùtere cun sos istudiosos de "
"Feygard, in antis de fuire."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma51:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma55:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma56:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma12:0
msgid "Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr "Podimus faeddare de un'àtera cosa?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma51:1
msgid "That's a lot to digest, I think I'll leave now. "
msgstr "Est meda de digerire, penso chi como mi nde ando. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma50
msgid "It is good to see you $playername. what brings you around?"
msgstr "Mi faghet praghere de ti bìdere, $playername. Ite ti batit a inoghe?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma50:0
msgid "I wish to talk about something."
msgstr "Dia chèrrere faeddare de una cosa."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro_0
msgid "The creature steps back cautiously, its claws scraping the stone floor."
msgstr ""
"Sa creadura si nche tirat a in segus cun cautela, cun sas ungas chi raspant "
"su pavimentu de pedra."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio9:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio13:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio12:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio11:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio10:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio14:0
msgid "I would like you to cook me more."
msgstr "Dia chèrrere chi mi nde coghes àteros."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma53
msgid "You're right. I can figure the rest out, $playername. I don't have much to offer, except one of my special potions. I have very few, so use it wisely."
msgstr ""
"Tenes resone. Su restu lu potzo cumprèndere deo, $playername. Non tèngio "
"meda de ti dare, francu una de sas potziones ispetziales meas. Nde tèngio "
"pagas meda, duncas imprea·la cun giudu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma52
msgid "If you can pacify those creatures and they're truly capable of reason, see if you can come to an understanding. They could supply me with what I need."
msgstr ""
"Si resesses a apasigare cussas creaduras e si sunt a beru capatzes de "
"resonare, bide si podides lòmpere a un'acordu. Mi diant pòdere dare su chi "
"mi serbit."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma55
msgid "I lived in Feygard among the northerners for several years, and the few who do not follow the Shadow bow down to the goddess Elythara. They take great pride in their past. Yet the light they praise has blinded more than it has illuminated. In truth, the Shadow has shown itself to be the more compassionate."
msgstr ""
"Apo bìvidu in Feygard, in mesu de sos de su nord, pro unos cantos annos, e "
"sos pagos chi non sighint s'Umbra s'inghenugrant a sa dea Elythara. Sunt "
"orgolliosos meda de su passadu issoro. Ma sa lughe chi esaltant at leadu sa "
"vista a prus gente de cantu nd'at illuminadu. A beru, s'Umbra s'est mustrada "
"sa prus piedosa."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma55:1
msgid "This has left me with more questions than answers."
msgstr "Custu m'at lassadu cun prus preguntas che rispostas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma54
msgid "For all of it's shortcomings, the cult and her followers fought against necromancy, and many masters of the dark arts perished under their swords. The statues are likely a seal for some evil that dwelt here in ancient times."
msgstr ""
"Cun totu sos difetos suos, su cultu e sos sighidores suos ant gherradu "
"contra a sa màgia de sos mortos, e medas mastros de sas artes iscuras sunt "
"mortos suta de sas ispadas issoro. Est probàbile chi sas istàtuas siant unu "
"sigillu pro calicunu male chi istaiat inoghe in tempos antigos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma54:0
msgid "Shortcomings?"
msgstr "Difetos?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma54:1
msgid "What's the meaning of that password?"
msgstr "Ite cheret nàrrere cussa paràula segreta?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma56
msgid "The \"Lethgar\" password refers to the Lethgar people who lived over two thousand years ago. Perhaps their name was used by those who constructed the statues in remembrance of something."
msgstr ""
"Sa paràula segreta \"Lethgar\" faghet riferimentu a su pòpulu de sos "
"Lethgar, chi at bìvidu prus de duamìgia annos a como. Forsis su nùmene "
"issoro l'ant impreadu sos chi ant fatu sas istàtuas, in ammentu de calicuna "
"cosa."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma56:1
msgid "Interesting, I'll be on my way."
msgstr "Interessante, mi nde ando."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard2
msgid "We thank you outsider. But not enough to repair our trust."
msgstr ""
"Ti ringratziamus, istràngiu. Ma non bastat pro acontzare sa fide nostra."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard1
msgid "Outsider, have you returned with the bones?"
msgstr "Istràngiu, ses torradu cun sos ossos?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard1:0
msgid "Yes, 13 as promised."
msgstr "Eja, 13, comente apo promìtidu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio0
msgid "Do you not like the menu? Ah, I understand. You wish for a taste of your hometown. Wherever you're from, I'm quite busy now, but if you could come back later, I could do it. Where are you from, child?"
msgstr ""
"Su menù non ti praghet? Ah, cumprendo. Cheres unu sabore de sa bidda tua. De "
"ue si siat chi siat, como so impinnadu meda, ma si podes torrare prus a "
"tardu, lu dia pòdere fàghere. De ue ses, pitzinnu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio0:0
msgid "Crossglen."
msgstr "Crossglen."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard0
msgid "Minion of the witch! From our burial chamber 13 bones of our ancestors were shamelessly stolen. Return them to us or we will return them ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Tzeracu de sa coga! Dae s'aposentu de sepultura nostru ant furadu chene "
"birgòngia 13 ossos de sos antepassados nostros. Torra·nos·los, o nos los "
"amus a torrare nois."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard
msgid "Halt! What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Firma·ti! Ite ses faghende inoghe?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crate_failure13:1
msgid "I'm searching for my brother Andor, have you seen him?"
msgstr "So chirchende a frade meu Andor, l'as bidu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:1
msgid "That's private. Nothing you need to worry about."
msgstr "Est una cosa privada. Non ti nde depes preocupare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:2
msgid "Gentlemen. Has sir Gunfryk not told you to keep your noses out of places they don't belong?"
msgstr ""
"Sennores. Su sennore Gunfryk non bos at naradu de non pònnere su nasu in ue "
"non bos tocat?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:3
msgid "I was patrolling the place to keep it safe from troublemakers, obviously."
msgstr ""
"Fia faghende sa guàrdia in su logu pro lu mantènnere seguru dae sos "
"chircabrigas, est craru."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard6
msgid "Our trust is given, what else do you wish to ask for."
msgstr "Sa fide nostra est dada, ite àteru cheres pedire."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard6:0
msgid "Would you agree to trade Bryma the bones of animals you hunt?"
msgstr ""
"Diais atzetare de cambiare cun Bryma sos ossos de sos animales chi cassades?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard6:1
msgid "Peace is enough."
msgstr "Sa paghe bastat."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio3
msgid "We're still swamped with work, but I haven't forgotten, child from Crossglen."
msgstr ""
"Semus galu afogados de traballu, ma non mi nde so ismentigadu, pitzinnu de "
"Crossglen."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio3:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio2:0
msgid "Got it, bye."
msgstr "Cumpresu, adiosu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard5
msgid "The spirits of our kin see your worth, outsider. Accept this gift from our tribe's great treasures."
msgstr ""
"Sos ispìritos de sos mannos nostros bident su valore tuo, istràngiu. Atzeta "
"custu donu dae sos tesoros mannos de sa tribù nostra."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio4
msgid "Thanks to the delivery you made, we started baking the first batch of apple tarts for the festival. I can cook you a Crossglen recipe while I keep an eye on the oven. "
msgstr ""
"Pro more de sa cunsigna chi as fatu, amus incumentzadu a còghere sa prima "
"tanda de tortas de mela pro sa festa. Ti potzo còghere una retzeta de "
"Crossglen mentras tèngio s'ogru a su forru. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio4:0
msgid "What do you want to cook me?"
msgstr "Ite mi cheres còghere?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard4
msgid "Help the Shadow Chaplain with task, only then our trust be restored."
msgstr ""
"Agiuda su capellanu de s'Umbra cun s'incàrrigu, petzi tando fide nostra "
"torrat."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard4:0
msgid "I helped Dominio with his task."
msgstr "Apo agiudadu a Dominio cun s'incàrrigu suo."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio1
msgid "Do I have? No. Do we have? Yes, quite a lot of both. But no, I will not give you any, if that's what you were about to ask. I have a great deal of work, and you'd do well not to intrude on it."
msgstr ""
"Si nde tèngio deo? Nono. Si nde tenimus nois? Eja, meda de totu e duos. Ma "
"nono, non ti nde dao, si est cussu chi fias pro pedire. Tèngio traballu "
"meda, e dias fàghere bene a non m'istorbare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard3
msgid "Speak with Dominio our Shadow chaplain, he will tell you the task."
msgstr ""
"Faedda cun Dominio, capellanu nostru de s'Umbra, issu t'at a nàrrere "
"s'incàrrigu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio2
msgid "Understood. Now, I wouldn't mind your presence here if we weren't so busy, so please leave."
msgstr ""
"Cumpresu. Como, sa presèntzia tua inoghe non mi diat dare fastìgiu si non "
"fìamus gasi impinnados, duncas, pro praghere, bae·nche."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard9
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard7
msgid "It is agreed. Now go and rest well, we welcome you."
msgstr "Est acordadu. Como bae e pasa bene, inoghe ses benebènnidu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard8
msgid "You are welcome here, outsider. Rest well."
msgstr "Inoghe ses benebènnidu, istràngiu. Pasa bene."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk_help
msgid "It's good to see you around, glory to Feygard. "
msgstr "Mi praghet de ti bìdere in giru, glòria a Feygard. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk_help:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk:3
msgid "Can you tell me more about your job?"
msgstr "Mi podes contare de prus de su traballu tuo?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma29
msgid "Not to mention that the origin of those bones could have very well have been human. There have been stories of such things having been done, especially during plagues..."
msgstr ""
"Pro non nàrrere chi cussos ossos podiant èssere umanos, chene duda. Si "
"contant istòrias de cosas gasi, mescamente in tempus de pestilèntzias..."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma29:0
msgid "I thought we would be talking about your research?"
msgstr "Pensaia chi fìamus pro faeddare de sa chirca tua?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard_arrest3
msgid "I don't think so, we follow the law not the commander. You will be coming with us. We'll interrogate you later about what you were doing here."
msgstr ""
"Non mi paret, nois sighimus sa lege, non su cumandante. As a bènnere cun "
"nois. T'amus a interrogare prus a tardu subra de su chi fias faghende inoghe."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_npc110
msgid "Grandfather? Well yes, but he's outside at the moment."
msgstr "Su giaju? Bene, eja, ma como est in foras."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_npc110:0
msgid "Thanks, that's all I needed to know."
msgstr "Gràtzias, est totu su chi depia ischire."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester1
msgid "Ah, he's always grumpy when he's working. Did you wish to ask something child?"
msgstr ""
"Ah, cando traballat est semper de malumore. Mi cherias preguntare calicuna "
"cosa, pitzinnu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester1:1
msgid "While cleaning at the bakery I found this paper recording the bakery's revenue, wasn't your husband the accountant?"
msgstr ""
"Mentras fia limpiende in sa paneteria, apo agatadu custu pabiru cun sas "
"intradas de sa paneteria: su maridu tuo non fiat su contàbile?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester2
msgid "You are our guest, $playername. Feel free to use our couch to rest while you're here. I will be returning to my work now."
msgstr ""
"Ses s'istràngiu nostru, $playername. Si cheres, imprea su sofà nostru pro "
"pasare mentras ses inoghe. Como torro a su traballu meu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester2:0
msgid "While cleaning at the bakery I found this paper recording the bakery's revenue, weren't you the accountant?"
msgstr ""
"Mentras fia limpiende in sa paneteria, apo agatadu custu pabiru cun sas "
"intradas de sa paneteria: non fias tue su contàbile?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma31
msgid "In my baking research, I discovered that the potion does not merely heal but it facilitates growth. What we perceive as healing is, in fact, simply the acceleration of the body's natural regeneration condensed into a shorter time by the potion."
msgstr ""
"In sas chircas meas de paneteria, apo iscobertu chi sa potzione non sanat "
"petzi, ma agiudat sa crèschida. Su chi nois bidimus comente sanare est, in "
"realidade, petzi su protzessu naturale de su corpus chi si torrat a fàghere, "
"ma prus a lestru, ca sa potzione lu cuntzentrat in unu tempus prus curtzu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma30
msgid "Oh right, my apologies. I got a bit sidetracked. Yes, where do I begin."
msgstr ""
"Ah, est beru, iscusa. Mi so pèrdidu unu pagu in àteras cosas. Eja, dae ue "
"incumentzo."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester0
msgid "Do you need something, or are you just wandering into people's houses?"
msgstr ""
"Ti serbit calicuna cosa, o ses petzi intrende chene motivu in sas domos de "
"sa gente?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma33
msgid "This completely changed my perspective. When I asked for the recipe to identify the ingredient responsible, I was denied. But it was no setback. I soon realized that bones are not unique in their properties. It's common alchemical knowledge that monster parts are prime ingredients for potions, but my discoveries went even further."
msgstr ""
"Custu at cambiadu de su totu sa prospetiva mea. Cando apo pedidu sa retzeta "
"pro identificare s'ingrediente responsàbile, mi l'ant negada. Ma no est "
"istadu un'ostàculu. Luego apo cumpresu chi sos ossos non sunt sos ùnicos cun "
"cussas propiedades. Est connoschèntzia comuna de s'alchimia chi sas partes "
"de sos mostros sunt ingredientes de primu livellu pro sas potziones, ma sas "
"iscobertas meas sunt andadas galu prus a in antis."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma32
msgid "But my experiments revealed something more. The late Headmaster Dervin rewarded me with an advanced bonemeal potion that contained a mysterious ingredient called kazarite, which doubled the potency of a regular potion."
msgstr ""
"Ma sos esperimentos mios ant mustradu galu de prus. Su bonànima de su "
"diretore Dervin m'at premiadu cun una potzione de farina de ossos avantzada "
"chi cunteniat un'ingrediente misteriosu chi si narat kazarite, chi faghiat "
"sa potèntzia de una potzione normale duas bortas prus forte."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma35
msgid "This essence exists within every part of Dhayavar. The soil, the mountains, the creatures, and the people all hold it. The proof lies in the crystals that form inside monsters. These crystals are concentrated forms of essence. Bones are another place where essence gathers most densely. The essence is our world itself. When we take in more of it, we restore what we lose through disease or injury."
msgstr ""
"Custa essèntzia esistit in cada parte de Dhayavar. Sa terra, sos montes, sas "
"creaduras e sa gente: totus la tenent. Sa proa est in sos cristallos chi si "
"formant a intro de sos mostros. Custos cristallos sunt formas cuntzentradas "
"de essèntzia. Sos ossos sunt un'àteru logu in ue s'essèntzia s'ammuntonat de "
"prus. S'essèntzia est su mundu nostru etotu. Cando nde leamus de prus, "
"torramus a otènnere su chi perdimus cun sas maladias o cun sas feridas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6_alt
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6alt
msgid "That is my partner on the lookout, the signal means the guards are coming."
msgstr ""
"Cussu est su sòtziu meu chi faghet de sentinella: su sinnale cheret nàrrere "
"chi sunt arribende sas guàrdias."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6_alt:0
msgid " I have the captain under my thumb, they can't touch me."
msgstr " Su capitanu lu tèngio in manos, non mi podent tocare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma34
msgid "I call this the Theory of Essence. We all know that when the Rift opened, immense magical energy entered our plane along with the monstrous creatures. Before that, what I refer to as the essence already existed, but it was greatly strengthened by the Rift."
msgstr ""
"A custu li naro sa Teoria de s'Essèntzia. Totus ischimus chi, cando s'est "
"aberta s'Isperradura, un'energia màgica immensa est intrada in su mundu "
"nostru, impare a sas creaduras mostruosas. In antis de cussu, su chi deo "
"naro essèntzia esistiat giai, ma s'Isperradura l'at rinfortzada meda."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma37
msgid "Those statues are intriguing. The light one sees in their vicinity is similar to the descriptions of the blinding light of the false goddess Elythara."
msgstr ""
"Cussas istàtuas sunt interessantes meda. Sa lughe chi si bidet a curtzu "
"issoro assimìgiat a sas descritziones de sa lughe chi leat sa vista de sa "
"dea farsa Elythara."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma36
msgid "Not to say it's all the same. Some things, despite containing a high concentration of essence, can be harmful. Such as poisons or diseases that drain our lifeforce. Merely consuming more has no benefit, and indeed there have to be certain attributes or balance. "
msgstr ""
"No est chi siat totu su matessi. Unas cantas cosas, mancari tèngiant una "
"cuntzentratzione arta de essèntzia, podent èssere dannosas. Comente sos "
"velenos o sas maladias chi nos sutzant sa fortza vitale. Consumire de prus, "
"e basta, non dat perunu benefìtziu: bi cherent tzertas caraterìsticas o unu "
"tzertu echilìbriu. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma39
msgid "Lizardmen, again. They've been bothering me for months now. My bread golems can handle a few, but if they all come at once, I'll be in trouble."
msgstr ""
"Òmines-tziligherta, torra. Mi sunt infadende dae meses. Sos golem de pane "
"mios nde podent afrontare unos cantos, ma si benint totus in una borta, apo "
"a èssere in problemas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma39:0
msgid "Maybe I could help with that, what's the story here?"
msgstr "Forsis t'apo a pòdere agiudare: ite est sutzèdidu?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38
msgid "Have you had any success with the creatures?"
msgstr "As tentu calicunu risultadu cun sas creaduras?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:0
msgid "As long as you don't bother them again, things should be good now."
msgstr "Si non los torras a infadare, como sas cosas diant dèpere andare bene."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:2
msgid "I've met with the leader of the lizardman tribe, they demand I return the 13 stolen bones."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu su cabu de sa tribù de sos òmines-tziligherta: pretendent chi "
"lis torre sos 13 ossos furados."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:4
msgid "I've yet to return the bones."
msgstr "Galu non lis apo torradu sos ossos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:5
msgid "I returned the bones but I've got one more task to do."
msgstr "Lis apo torradu sos ossos, ma tèngio galu un'incàrrigu de fàghere."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:6
msgid "Not yet, I wish to ask you about other things."
msgstr "Galu nono, ti dia chèrrere preguntare àteras cosas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit1
msgid "Normally, I'd need the original. Lucky for you kid, I was a student here years ago and made a copy. You can have it for {2000} gold."
msgstr ""
"De sòlitu, dia tènnere bisòngiu de s'originale. Pro fortuna tua, pitzinnu, "
"annos a como fia istudiante inoghe e nd'apo fatu una còpia. Ti la potzo dare "
"pro {2000} monedas de oro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit1:0
msgid "OK, here's the gold."
msgstr "Andat bene, ecu s'oro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_andor5:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_andor2:2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_directions1:3
msgid "I don't have that gold on me."
msgstr "Non tèngio cussu oro cun megus."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit2
msgid "Alright, here you go. Now hush off. I've got work to do."
msgstr "Bene, ecu. Como bae·nche. Tèngio traballu de fàghere."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma40
msgid "One day, I ventured into that decrepit basement to see what was there. Curious, I began exploring and carelessly ventured down into a cave. Days later, I began hearing the scratching of monstrous claws echoing through the tunnels. Like a warning. It continued for some time, until one day I went down to investigate and found the passage blocked with rubble. "
msgstr ""
"Una die, mi so atrividu a intrare in cussa cantina mesu isfata pro bìdere "
"ite b'aiat. Pro curiosidade, apo incumentzadu a esplorare e, chene "
"atentzione, so faladu finas a una gruta. Dies a pustis, apo incumentzadu a "
"intèndere su raspare de ungas mostruosas chi s'intendiat in sas gallerias. "
"Comente un'avisu. Est sighidu pro unu pagu de tempus, finas a cando una die "
"so faladu a indagare e apo agatadu su passàgiu serradu dae pedras rutas. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma40:0
msgid "I'll see what I can do about those creatures."
msgstr "Apo a bìdere ite potzo fàghere cun cussas creaduras."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma42
msgid "Suffice to say, those bones are no longer around, I ground them to dust for my bonemeal research and fertilizer experiments. "
msgstr ""
"Bastat a nàrrere chi cussos ossos non bi sunt prus: los apo mòlidos e nd'apo "
"fatu prùere pro sas chircas meas de farina de ossos e pro sos esperimentos "
"de ingrassu. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma42:0
msgid "Great, and what am I suppossed to return now?"
msgstr "Bellu meda, e como ite dia dèpere torrare?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma41
msgid "I appreciate your enthusiasm. The passage down is blocked but if you go deeper into the forest you'll find another statue. The activation word is \"Light\". Use it, and then find a way to their lair."
msgstr ""
"Mi praghet s'entusiasmu tuo. Su passàgiu chi falat est serradu, ma si intras "
"prus a fundu in su padente as a agatare un'àtera istàtua. Sa paràula de "
"ativatzione est \"Lughe\". Imprea·la, e posca agata una manera pro lòmpere a "
"su cuile issoro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma44
msgid "Red or green, their bones look the same. Just slay those red ones along the shore of the lake until you have enough. Here's a few of what I've got left for starters."
msgstr ""
"Rujos o birdes, sos ossos issoro parent sos matessi. Ochi cussos rujos a "
"longu de s'oru de su lagu finas a cando nd'as a tènnere bastantes. Ecu·nde "
"unos cantos de cussos chi mi sunt abarrados, pro incumentzare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_incident
msgid "Several days ago, I was attending to my duties in the library when Headmaster Oswald came in to access the archive. When he returned, he was in a panic over a missing document. "
msgstr ""
"Unas cantas dies a como, fia faghende su traballu meu in sa biblioteca cando "
"su diretore Oswald est intradu pro andare a s'archìviu. Cando est torradu, "
"fiat in pànicu pro unu documentu chi mancaiat. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma43
msgid "No need to look at me like that, if those bones are gone just find more to replace them with."
msgstr ""
"Non serbit a m'abbaidare gasi: si cussos ossos non bi sunt prus, agata·nde "
"àteros pro los cambiare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma46
msgid "That is no problem. But how am I supposed to get bones now..."
msgstr "Custu no est unu problema. Ma comente dia dèpere agatare ossos como..."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma46:0
msgid "I negotiated with the lizardmen, they agree to trade with you the bones of the animals they hunt."
msgstr ""
"Apo negotziadu cun sos òmines-tziligherta: atzetant de cambiare cun tegus "
"sos ossos de sos animales chi cassant."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma46:1
msgid "I've solved the main problem. That should be the least of your issues now."
msgstr ""
"Apo risòlvidu su problema printzipale. Como cussu diat dèpere èssere su prus "
"pitzinnu de sos problemas tuos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma45
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk10
msgid "I see, good luck with that."
msgstr "Cumprendo, bona fortuna."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma48
msgid "One thing I wish to mention, between Brightport and Charwood, there was a path that travelers would use. When I fled from Feygard, I took that path, but I was stopped by the same phenomenon as in the forest, and had to circle back to the Duleian Road."
msgstr ""
"Una cosa ti chèrgio nàrrere: tra Portu Lughente e Padente Brusiadu b'aiat "
"un'àndala chi impreaiant sos biagiadores. Cando so fuida dae Feygard, apo "
"pigadu cussa àndala, ma m'at firmadu su matessi fenòmenu de su padente, e "
"apo dèpidu torrare in segus finas a s'àndala duleiana."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma47
msgid "You've done a great job, $playername. I have little of value to offer, just these two special potions. I possess very few, so I can't give you more. Use them well."
msgstr ""
"As fatu unu traballu bellu meda, $playername. Tèngio pagu de valore de ti "
"dare, petzi custas duas potziones ispetziales. Nde tèngio pagas meda, duncas "
"non ti nde potzo dare de prus. Imprea·las bene."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma49
msgid "I later investigated and found another statue, the activation word for that specific one is \"Elythara\" I hope this information assists you well."
msgstr ""
"A pustis apo indagadu e apo agatadu un'àtera istàtua: sa paràula de "
"ativatzione pro cussa est \"Elythara\". Ispero chi custa informatzione ti "
"siat ùtile."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_inn
msgid "Welcome! Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "Benebènnidu! Ti potzo agiudare in calicuna cosa?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_inn:0
msgid "Could I rent a place to rest?"
msgstr "Potzo afitare unu logu pro pasare?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_leorio
msgid "Im Leorio, the commander's assistant. If you're looking for the commander he is inside the bakery."
msgstr ""
"Deo so Leorio, s'assistente de su cumandante. Si ses chirchende su "
"cumandante, est in sa paneteria."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald
msgid "Forget it. That is none of your concern. What makes you think you should be involved?"
msgstr ""
"Lassa pèrdere. No est cosa chi ti pertocat. Ite ti faghet pensare chi ti nde "
"depas impitzare?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald:0
msgid "It's unfair that Stanwick, whose name stands to suffer the most from the theft, was told to stay put."
msgstr ""
"No est giustu chi a Stanwick, chi est su chi nde podet patire de prus pro sa "
"fura, li apant naradu de abarrare firmu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald:1
msgid "I made a deal with Stanwick. I scratch his back, and he scratches mine."
msgstr ""
"Apo fatu un'acordu cun Stanwick. Deo agiudo a issu e issu agiudat a mie."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald:2
msgid "Nothing. I wish to help out, from the kindness of my heart."
msgstr "Nudda. Chèrgio agiudare, de bonu coro."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma11
msgid "I tried to refuse him, but that's when his tone shifted. The cheerful charisma he'd shown vanished. As he pulled out that scroll, I heard him mumbling, 'last resort...'"
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de li nàrrere chi nono, ma est in cussu momentu chi su tonu suo "
"at cambiadu. S'incantu allegru chi aiat mustradu est isparèssidu. Mentras "
"nche bogaiat cussa pergamena, l'apo intesu murmutende: 'ùrtimu remèdiu...'"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift0
msgid "For such a large establishment, this flour sure has a lot of black specks in it."
msgstr ""
"Pro un'impresa gasi manna, custa farina tenet a beru meda puntigheddos "
"nieddos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift0:0
msgid "Time to get sifting."
msgstr "Est ora de sedatzare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift0:1
msgid "Why is the flour so bad?"
msgstr "Pro ite sa farina est gasi mala?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_guard1
msgid "Keep yourself safe."
msgstr "Ista atentu."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma10
msgid "We sat down and he started asking me all sorts of questions. I was glad to have someone to talk to. But soon, he pulled out a list of ingredients and asked about how to acquire and use them. Most which were highly poisonous."
msgstr ""
"Nos semus sètzidos e at incumentzadu a mi fàghere preguntas de cada genia. "
"Fia cuntenta de tènnere calicunu cun chie faeddare. Ma luego at bogadu una "
"lista de ingredientes e m'at preguntadu comente los agatare e los impreare. "
"Belle totus fiant velenosos meda."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1_2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1_3
msgid "You take the sift that was inside the sack and use it to take a handful of flour, after a few shakes of the sift you're left with some black specks."
msgstr ""
"Pigas su sedatzu chi fiat a intro de su sacu e l'impreas pro leare una "
"manada de farina; a pustis de l'àere iscutinadu unas cantas bortas, ti nde "
"abarrant unos cantos puntigheddos nieddos."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1:2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1:4
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift3:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift3:2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift3:4
