#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma13
msgid "About half a year ago, I was carefully measuring the ingredients for my baking experiments when I heard the door. I went to look, and a boy who looked a little older than you introduced himself as Andor."
msgstr ""
"Unos ses meses a como, fia medende cun cura sos ingredientes pro sos "
"esperimentos mios de paneteria cando apo intesu sa ghenna. So andada a "
"bìdere, e unu pitzinnu chi pariat unu pagu prus mannu che a tie s'est "
"presentadu: si naraiat Andor."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift2
msgid "I've been taking some of the good stuff home and replacing it with older flour. It's fine, I gave myself permission. Now go and sift it."
msgstr ""
"Mi nch'apo giutu a domo una parte de sa farina bona e l'apo cambiada cun "
"farina prus betza. Andat bene, mi so dadu su permissu deo. Como bae e "
"sedatza·la."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift2:0
msgid "OK, time to get to work. "
msgstr "Andat bene, est ora de traballare. "

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift3
msgid "You place the sift in the bag and begin sifting."
msgstr "Pones su sedatzu in su sacu e incumentzas a sedatzare."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma12
msgid "I had no choice but to accept it. I told him everything he wanted to know, and he left me with the scroll before leaving. It might have been useful to me twenty years ago, but I've already researched and developed my baking methods without the need for it."
msgstr ""
"No aia àteru de fàghere che a atzetare. Li apo naradu totu su chi cheriat "
"ischire, e issu m'at lassadu sa pergamena in antis de si nch'andare. Binti "
"annos a como diat èssere istada ùtile, ma deo apo giai chircadu e isvilupadu "
"sos mètodos mios de paneteria chene bisòngiu de issa."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma12:1
msgid "What are you researching?"
msgstr "Subra de ite ses faghende chircas?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma15
msgid "I discovered this place in my youth while researching Brightport's fauna. After Lord Geomyr's coronation, many alchemists like myself were at risk of being arrested under the new laws. So I returned here to continue my research."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu custu logu in sa giovania mea, mentras istudiaia sa fàuna de "
"Portu Lughente. A pustis chi ant coronadu a Lord Geomyr, medas alchimistas "
"comente a mie fiant in perìgulu de èssere arrestados pro neghe de sas leges "
"noas. E duncas so torrada inoghe pro sighire sas chircas meas."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma15:0
msgid "What kind of research?"
msgstr "Ite genia de chircas?"

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom
msgid "Nonsense, where would this warehouse be without me."
msgstr "Tontesas, ite diat èssere custu magasinu chene de mene."

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom9:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom4:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom0:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sweep_stage0:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sweep_stage2:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sweep_stage1:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sweep_stage3:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom25_selector:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom20:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom26:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom25:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_broom27:0
