#: itemlist_laeroth.json:korhald_book
msgid "Korhald Family Legacy"
msgstr "S'eredade de sa famìlia Korhald"

#: itemlist_laeroth.json:korhald_book:description
msgid ""
"'In the annals of time,' [the text begins], 'there lived a man whose legend burns as brightly as the forge fires he tended. Korhald, master blacksmith and unmatched warrior, emerged from humble beginnings to etch his name upon the tapestry of fate.'\n"
" [With each turn of the page, the tale unfolds before you like a parchment map unfurling across the expanse of memory.]\n"
"'Born of simple stock,' the words continue, 'Korhald inherited not only his father's name but also his legacy of hard work and unwavering resolve.'\n"
" [As you delve deeper into the passages, you learn of Korhald's ascent from apprentice to artisan, his hands shaping steel with the precision of a sculptor and the strength of a titan.]\n"
"'In the heart of the forge,' the tome whispers, 'Korhald found not only his craft but also his calling, for his creations were not merely weapons and armor, but the very embodiment of his spirit.'\n"
" [But Korhald's legacy extends beyond the anvil and the battlefield.] 'A leader among men,' the pages declare, 'Korhald's valor and wisdom guided his people through times of strife and uncertainty, laying the cornerstone upon which the town of Remgard would rise.'\n"
"\n"
"[With each passing paragraph, you bear witness to the indomitable spirit of a man who forged his own destiny, shaping the world around him with the hammer blows of fate. And as you close the tome, the echoes of Korhald's journey linger in your mind, a testament to the enduring power of courage, determination, and the bonds of family that transcend the ages.]"
msgstr ""
"'In sos annales de su tempus,' [cumintzat su testu], 'b'aiat un'òmine chi sa "
"legenda sua brùsiat lughente cantu sos fogos de su forru chi curaiat. "
"Korhald, mastru ferreri e gherreri chene pare, est essidu dae unu cumintzu "
"ùmile pro isculpire su nòmine suo in sa tela de su destinu.'\n"
" [A cada pàgina chi giras, s'istòria si nche isparghet in antis tuo comente "
"una mapa de pergamena chi s'aberit in s'estensione de sa memòria.]\n"
"'Nàschidu dae gente de pòpulu,' sighint sas paràulas, 'Korhald at eredadu "
"non petzi su nòmine de su babbu, ma fintzas s'eredade sua de traballu duru e "
"de determinatzione firma.'\n"
" [Cando intras prus in fundu in sos passàgios, imparas comente Korhald est "
"artziadu dae discìpulu a artesanu, cun sas manos suas chi modellaiant "
"s'atzàrgiu cun sa pretzisione de un'iscultore e sa fortza de unu titanu.]\n"
"'In su coro de su forru,' murmutat su libru, 'Korhald at agatadu non petzi "
"s'arte sua ma fintzas sa vocatzione sua, ca sas creatziones suas non fiant "
"petzi armas e armaduras, ma s'incarnatzione etotu de s'ispìritu suo.'\n"
" [Ma s'eredade de Korhald andat prus a tesu de s'incùdine e de su campu de "
"batalla.] 'Ghia intre sos òmines,' declarant sas pàginas, 'su valore e sa "
"sabiesa de Korhald ant ghiadu su pòpulu suo in tempos de cuntierras e de "
"dudas, ponende sa pedra angulare subra de sa cale si diat èssere pesada sa "
"bidda de Remgard.'\n"
"\n"
"[A cada paràgrafu chi passat, ses testimòngiu de s'ispìritu chi non si "
"pìnnigat de un'òmine chi at fraigadu su destinu suo, modellende su mundu a "
"inghìriu suo cun sos corfos de marteddu de su destinu. E cando serras su "
"libru, s'eco de su caminu de Korhald t'abarrat in sa mente, testimonia de su "
"podere chi durat de su coràgiu, de sa determinatzione e de sos ligàmenes de "
"famìlia chi superant sas èpocas.]"

