#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_key_polyphem
msgid "Tiny grey stone key from Polyphem"
msgstr "Crae minuda de pedra murra de Polifemu"

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_grape_kalypso
msgid "A single grape from Kalypso"
msgstr "Unu granu de ua de Calipso"

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_wine
msgid "Polyphem's favourite wine"
msgstr "Su binu preferidu de Polifemu"

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_wine:description
msgid "Makes even one-eyed people see double."
msgstr "Faghet bìdere dòpiu fintzas a chie at un'ogru solu."

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_necklace
msgid "Circe's Necklace"
msgstr "Collana de Circe"

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_necklace:description
msgid "Circe's necklace featuring a floating stone encased in glass"
msgstr ""
"Sa collana de Circe, cun una pedra chi istat in s'àera, serrada in unu bidru"

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_book
msgid "The $playernameyssey - Adventures of $playername"
msgstr "Sa $playernameissea - Sas aventuras de $playername"

#: itemlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:ll2_book:description
msgid "Tell me, Muse, of $playername, the much-traveled hero, who wandered far in search of his brother Andor and endured many hardships upon the Great Lake..."
msgstr ""
"Nara·mi, o Musa, de $playername, s'eroe chi at biagiadu meda, chi est andadu "
"a tesu meda in chirca de su frade suo Andor e at patidu medas dificultades "
"in su Lagu Mannu..."

#: itemlist_next_release.json:fogbottle
msgid "Fog in a bottle"
msgstr "Nèula in un'ampulla"

#: itemlist_next_release.json:fogbottle:description
msgid "An angry-looking fog contained within a bottle. Though it may be defeated, it always retreats back into the vessel."
msgstr ""
"Una nèula de aspetu arrennegadu serrada in un'ampulla. Mancari si potzat "
"bìnchere, torrat semper a intro de s'ampulla."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:dragon_claw_key
msgid "Dragon claw"
msgstr "Ungra de dragu"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:dragon_claw_key:description
msgid "A single claw gifted by Falkour, warm even in your palm. Its edge carries the memory of the first forge. It hums faintly when brought near ancient seals or relics older than men."
msgstr ""
"Un'ungra sola regalada dae Falkour, caente fintzas in sa parma de sa manu "
"tua. Su filu suo giughet s'ammentu de su primu forru de ferreri. Murmutat "
"pagu pagu cando l'acùrtzias a sigillos antigos o a relìchias prus betzas de "
"sos òmines."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:white_house_deed
msgid "White house deed"
msgstr "Atu de propiedade de sa domo bianca"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:white_house_deed:description
msgid "A legal document proving ownership of the glowing white house south of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Unu documentu legale chi proat sa propiedade de sa domo bianca lughente a "
"sud de Fallhaven."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:ancient_kazaul_ritual
msgid "The Ritual of Five Aspects"
msgstr "Su Ritu de sos Chimbe Aspetos"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:ancient_kazaul_ritual:description
msgid "An ancient ritual written in an extinct dialect of the Kazaul that seems to shift when touched."
msgstr ""
"Unu ritu antigu iscritu in unu dialetu estintu de sos Kazaul chi paret chi "
"si movat cando lu tocas."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartfire_pendant
msgid "Heartfire pendant of Kazaul"
msgstr "Pendente de fogu de coro de Kazaul"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartfire_pendant:description
msgid "A small pendant warm to the touch; it grants a steady warmth and helps steady a hand amid fire and flame."
msgstr ""
"Unu pendente piticu, caente a lu tocare; dat unu calore costante e agiudat a "
"mantènnere firma sa manu in mesu de su fogu e de sas framas."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:elythara_ring_upgraded
#: itemlist_undertell.json:elythara_ring
msgid "Elythara's ring"
msgstr "Aneddu de Elythara"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:elythara_ring_upgraded:description
msgid "Forged in the holy light of Elythara's blessing, this ring gives the True Believer courage to strike down her enemies."
msgstr ""
"Fraigadu in sa lughe santa de sa beneditzione de Elythara, custu aneddu dat "
"a su Credente Beru su coràgiu de fàghere rùere sos inimigos suos."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:ancient_locked_box
msgid "Ancient locked box"
msgstr "Iscàtula antiga serrada a crae"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:ancient_locked_box:description
msgid "A relic from another age, its seal unbroken, its purpose long forgotten."
msgstr ""
"Una relìchia de un'àtera època, cun su sigillu ancora intreu e cun un'iscopu "
"ismentigadu dae tempus meda."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_mace
msgid "Heartsteel mace"
msgstr "Matza de atzàrgiu de coro"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_mace:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_1h_sword:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_2h_sword:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_glaive:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_handaxe:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_greataxe:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_blade_breaker:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_dagger:description
#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartsteel_2h_hammer:description
msgid "Born of Heartstone torn from forgotten depths, this heartsteel was tempered in dragonfire and shaped by a master smith whose craft survives only in silence."
msgstr ""
"Nàschidu dae sa Pedra de coro bogada dae profundidades ismentigadas, custu "
"atzàrgiu de coro est istadu temperadu in su fogu de unu dragu e modelladu "
"dae unu mastru ferreri chi s'arte sua sighit a bìvere petzi in su silèntziu."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_1h_sword
msgid "Heartsteel warblade"
msgstr "Ispada de gherra de atzàrgiu de coro"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:heartstone_2h_sword
