#: itemlist_undertell.json:arschleder:description
msgid "A thick, stiff slab of leather, blackened by soot and worn smooth by a thousand slides down jagged shafts. This smells of old grease and wet earth."
msgstr ""
"Unu bìculu de còrgiu grussu e tostu, innieddadu dae su fumu e allisadu dae "
"milli bortas chi est iscurridu a giosso in sos putzos de mina pedrosos. "
"Tenet fragu de grassu betzu e de terra modde."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:miner_hood
msgid "Miner's hooded tunic"
msgstr "Tùnica de minadore cun cuguddu"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:undertell_emerald
msgid "Emerald"
msgstr "Ismeralda"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:undertell_emerald:description
msgid "A flawless emerald prized by the noble houses of Feygard and Nor City, valued less for its rarity than for what its possession implies."
msgstr ""
"Un'ismeralda chene difetos, istimada dae sas casadas nòbiles de Feygard e de "
"Nor City, apretziada prus pro su chi cheret nàrrere a l'àere chi non pro "
"cantu est rara."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:undertell_shovel
msgid "Undertell shovel"
msgstr "Pala de Undertell"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:lich_purse
msgid "Tattered coin purse"
msgstr "Bussa de monedas istratzada"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:lich_purse:description
msgid "Contains coins fused together by age and necromancy."
msgstr "Cuntenet monedas fùndidas paris dae sa betzesa e dae sa negromantzia."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:lich_dust
msgid "Lich dust"
msgstr "Prùere de lich"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:lich_dust:description
msgid "A fine grey-blue dust left behind by powerful undead, faintly warm to the touch and resistant to decay."
msgstr ""
"Unu prùere fine murru-asulu chi lassant sos non-mortos poderosos, unu pagu "
"caente a lu tocare e chi resistet a sa decadèntzia."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:pot_bm_kazaul
msgid "Kazaul bonemeal"
msgstr "Farina de ossos de Kazaul"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:pot_bm_kazaul:description
msgid "A pale powder prepared using methods attributed to Kazaul, denser and more uniform than common bonemeal."
msgstr ""
"Unu prùere pàllidu preparadu cun mètodos chi s'atribuint a Kazaul, prus "
"ispissu e prus uniforme de sa farina de ossos comuna."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:marshal_sigil
msgid "Marshal sigil"
msgstr "Sigillu de su maresciallu"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:marshal_sigil:description
msgid "A bone token marked with precise, repeated cuts, once used to denote authority among the undead."
msgstr ""
"Unu sinnu de ossu sinnadu cun segaduras pretzisas e repitidas, chi una borta "
"s'impreaiat pro indicare s'autoridade intre sos non-mortos."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:shredded_tunic
msgid "Shredded tunic"
msgstr "Tùnica istratzada"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:shredded_tunic:description
msgid "Cannot be worn, but valuable for its leather."
msgstr "Non si podet pònnere, ma tenet valore pro su còrgiu suo."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:emerald_shard
msgid "Emerald shard"
msgstr "Bìculu de ismeralda"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:undertell_diamond
msgid "Undertell diamond"
msgstr "Diamante de Undertell"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:raw_sapphire
msgid "Raw sapphire"
msgstr "Zafiru cruu"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:vein_ruby
msgid "Vein ruby"
msgstr "Rubinu de vena"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:amethyst
msgid "Amethyst"
msgstr "Ametista"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:rare_coins
msgid "Rare coins"
msgstr "Monedas raras"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:rare_coins:description
msgid "A cache of unfamiliar coins. They show signs of use, but their origin, authenticity and value are unclear."
msgstr ""
"Unu muntone cuadu de monedas disconnotas. Mustrant sinnos de impreu, ma "
"s'orìgine, s'autentitzidade e su valore issoro non sunt craros."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:folded_copper_talisman
msgid "Folded copper talisman"
msgstr "Talismanu de ràmene pinnigadu"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:folded_copper_talisman:description
msgid "A copper coin folded tight by trembling hands, believed to trap evil by denying it breath."
msgstr ""
"Una moneda de ràmene pinnigada bene bene dae manos chi tremiant: si creet "
"chi tèngiat presu su male, ca non li lassat respirare."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:undertell_lgd_headgear
msgid "Crown of studied defiance"
msgstr "Corona de sa rebellia istudiada"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:undertell_lgd_headgear:description
msgid "Once known by another name now lost to time, this crown was taken from those who resisted the Kazaul and preserved for study rather than reverence. Its power remains, not as a symbol of victory, but as a record of defiance carefully examined and never forgotten."
msgstr ""
"Custa corona, connota una borta cun un'àteru nòmine como ismentigadu cun su "
"tempus, est istada leada a sos chi ant resìstidu a sos Kazaul e est istada "
"allogada pro l'istudiare, non pro l'onorare. Su podere suo abarrat, non "
"comente sìmbulu de vitòria, ma comente testimonia de una rebellia esaminada "
"cun cura e mai ismentigada."

#: itemlist_undertell.json:soul_pearl
msgid "Soul pearl"
msgstr "Perla de s'ànima"

#: itemlist_undertell.json:soul_pearl:description
msgid "The pearl glows as if it were calm ocean light, while a shimmering white radiance and drifting runes flow within its depths. Warm in the hand and pulsing like a second heart, it whispers spells from a mage who refuses to die."
msgstr ""
"Sa perla lughet comente chi esseret sa lughe de un'otzèanu chietu, mentras "
"in fundu suo si movent unu lugore biancu chi lampizat e runas lèbias. Caente "
"in manu e batende comente unu segundu coro, murmutat incantos de unu magu "
"chi non cheret mòrrere."

