#: questlist.json:andor
msgid "Search for Andor"
msgstr "In chirca de Andor"

#: questlist.json:andor:1
msgid "My father Mikhail says that Andor has not been home since yesterday. I should go look for him in the village."
msgstr ""
"Babbu meu, Mikhail, narat chi Andor no est torradu a domo dae eris. Lu dia "
"dèpere andare a chircare in bidda."

#: questlist.json:andor:10
msgid "Leonid tells me that he saw Andor talking to Gruil. I should go ask Gruil if he knows more."
msgstr ""
"Leonid mi narat chi at bidu a Andor chi faeddaiat cun Gruil. Dia dèpere "
"andare a preguntare a Gruil si nde ischit de prus."

#: questlist.json:andor:20
msgid "Gruil wants me to bring him a poison gland. Then he might talk more. He tells me that some poisonous snakes have such a gland."
msgstr ""
"Gruil cheret chi li giuga una gràndula de velenu. Tando forsis at a faeddare "
"de prus. Mi narat chi unas cantas coloras velenosas tenent una gràndula gasi."

#: questlist.json:andor:30
msgid "Gruil tells me that Andor was looking for someone called Umar. I should go ask his friend Gaela in Fallhaven to the east."
msgstr ""
"Gruil mi narat chi Andor fiat chirchende a unu chi si narat Umar. Dia dèpere "
"andare a preguntare a s'amigu suo Gaela, in Fallhaven, a oriente."

#: questlist.json:andor:40
msgid "I talked to Gaela in Fallhaven. He tells me to go see Bucus and ask about the Thieves' Guild."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Gaela in Fallhaven. Mi narat de andare a agatare a Bucus e "
"de li preguntare de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros."

#: questlist.json:andor:50
msgid "Bucus has allowed me to enter the hatch in the derelict house in Fallhaven. I should go talk to Umar."
msgstr ""
"Bucus m'at permìtidu de intrare in sa trapa de sa domo abbandonada de "
"Fallhaven. Dia dèpere andare a faeddare cun Umar."

#: questlist.json:andor:51
msgid "Umar in the Fallhaven Thieves' Guild recognized me, but must have me confused with Andor. Apparently, Andor has been to see him."
msgstr ""
"Umar, in su Grèmiu de sos Ladros de Fallhaven, m'at connotu, ma de seguru "
"m'at confusu cun Andor. A su chi paret, Andor est andadu a lu bìdere."

#: questlist.json:andor:55
msgid "Umar told me that Andor went to see a potion maker called Lodar. I should search for his hideaway."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at naradu chi Andor est andadu a bìdere unu fraigadore de potziones "
"chi si narat Lodar. Dia dèpere chircare su cuadòrgiu suo."

#: questlist.json:andor:61
msgid "I heard a story in Loneford, where it seemed like Andor had been in Loneford, and that he might have had something to do with the illness that the people are suffering from there. I am not sure if it actually was Andor. If it was Andor, why would he have made the people of Loneford ill?"
msgstr ""
"In Loneford apo intesu un'istòria in sa cale pariat chi Andor esseret istadu "
"in Loneford, e chi diat pòdere èssere chi tenneret calicuna cosa de bìdere "
"cun sa maladia chi sa gente de cue est patende. Non so seguru chi siat "
"istadu a beru Andor. Si fiat Andor, pro ite diat àere fatu ammalaidare sa "
"gente de Loneford?"

#: questlist.json:andor:62
msgid "Andor might have gone to do some business with a rich man in Brimhaven after he left Loneford."
msgstr ""
"Podet èssere chi Andor siat andadu a fàghere afàrios cun un'òmine ricu de "
"Brimhaven a pustis de èssere andadu dae Loneford."

#: questlist.json:andor:65
msgid "It looks like Andor was involved in the destruction of the Brimhaven dam."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi Andor apat tentu parte in sa distrutzione de sa diga de Brimhaven."

#: questlist.json:andor:70
msgid "I have found the potion-maker Lodar, and heard his story about Andor. Andor went to visit Lodar in his hideaway to get a sample of something called Narwood extract. Lodar happened to notice that there was someone travelling together with Andor, that hid among the trees and did not seem to want Lodar to spot him."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Lodar, su fraigadore de potziones, e apo intesu s'istòria sua "
"subra de Andor. Andor fiat andadu a bìdere a Lodar in su cuadòrgiu suo pro "
"tènnere una mustra de una cosa chi si narat estratu de Narwood. Lodar s'est "
"abbigiadu chi b'aiat una persone chi biagiaiat cun Andor, chi si cuaiat in "
"mesu de sos àrbores e chi pariat chi non cheret èssere bidu dae Lodar."

#: questlist.json:andor:71
msgid "Shortly after Andor and the person he was travelling with had left, strange things started to happen in the woods around Lodar's hideaway, and Lodar himself seemed to be affected by it somehow. Lodar believes that something disturbed the tomb below his cabin, and awoke the Hira'zinn."
msgstr ""
"Pagu a pustis chi Andor e sa persone chi biagiaiat cun issu si nche fiant "
"andados, in su padente a inghìriu de su cuadòrgiu de Lodar ant cumintzadu a "
"sutzèdere cosas istranas, e pariat chi fintzas Lodar etotu nde esseret "
"tocadu in calicuna manera. Lodar creet chi calicuna cosa apat istorbadu sa "
"tumba chi b'at suta de sa barraca sua, e chi apat ischidadu su Hira'zinn."

#: questlist.json:andor:72
msgid "Since I helped Lodar defeat the Hira'zinn, he promised to help me in return. He gave me a piece of paper that should allow me to enter the Valanyr temple of the Shadow in Nor City. He told me to seek out lady Lydalon in the temple for further assistance."
msgstr ""
"Dae chi apo agiudadu a Lodar a bìnchere su Hira'zinn, m'at promìtidu de "
"m'agiudare a s'imbesse. M'at dadu unu bìculu de pabiru chi mi diat dèpere "
"permìtere de intrare in su tèmpiu Valanyr de s'Umbra in Nor City. M'at "
"naradu de chircare sa dama Lydalon in su tèmpiu pro àteru agiudu."

#: questlist.json:andor:80
msgid "All clues so far as to where Andor went point to Nor City. I should travel to Nor City by following the Duleian road to the southeast and look for more clues there."
msgstr ""
"Totu sos inditos chi apo agatadu finas a como subra de ue est andadu Andor "
"mustrant Nor City. Dia dèpere biagiare a Nor City sighende s'àndala duleiana "
"cara a sud-est, e chircare àteros inditos in cue."

#: questlist.json:andor:85
msgid "Andor may have been in Stoutford."
msgstr "Podet èssere chi Andor siat istadu in Stoutford."

#: questlist.json:andor:86
msgid "Andor had something to do with the demon under the church in Stoutford."
msgstr ""
"Andor teniat calicuna cosa de bìdere cun su dimòniu suta de sa crèsia de "
"Stoutford."

#: questlist.json:andor:90
msgid "At Castle Guynmart I learned from Steward Unkorh that some time ago Andor was also there as a guest."
msgstr ""
"In su Casteddu de Guynmart apo ischidu dae s'intendente Unkorh chi, tempus a "
"como, fintzas Andor fiat istadu in cue comente istràngiu."

#: questlist.json:andor:92
msgid "Unkorh gave me the bonemeal potion box that Andor had given him for safekeeping."
msgstr ""
"Unkorh m'at dadu s'iscàtula de potziones de farina de ossos chi Andor l'aiat "
"lassadu in custòdia."

#: questlist.json:andor:100
msgid "While exploring the town of Sullengard, I so happened to stumble upon my mother and my aunt to whom I have never met. Mother has insisted that I go home so we can talk."
msgstr ""
"Mentras esploraia sa bidda de Sullengard, pro casu apo atopadu a mama mea e "
"a sa tzia mea, chi no aia mai connotu. Mama at insìstidu chi torre a domo "
"pro chi potzamus faeddare."

#: questlist.json:andor:110
msgid "After talking with mother back at home, she and I tried to brainstorm about where Andor could be. She reminded me about Andor's friend Stanwick who lives in Brightport. We agreed that going to talk to him might be the next logical thing to do."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere faeddadu cun mama in domo, amus chircadu impare de pensare "
"in ue podiat èssere Andor. M'at ammentadu s'amigu de Andor, Stanwick, chi "
"bivet in Portu Lughente. Amus pensadu chi a andare a faeddare cun issu diat "
"èssere sa cosa prus lògica de fàghere como."

#: questlist.json:andor:120
msgid "In the dungeons of Laeroth manor, Kotheses, the torturer, mentioned that he had taught Andor the basics of torturing."
msgstr ""
"In sas presones de su palatzu de Laeroth, Kotheses, su turmentadore, at "
"naradu chi aiat imparadu a Andor sas bases de sa tortura."

#: questlist.json:andor:125
msgid "Vaelric confirmed that Andor visited him recently. Andor sought to learn Vaelric's skills and left quickly, clutching what he came for. His actions raise more questions about his intentions."
msgstr ""
"Vaelric m'at cunfirmadu chi Andor est andadu a lu bìdere dae pagu. Andor "
"cheriat imparare sas abilesas de Vaelric e si nch'est andadu a lestru, "
"istringhende in manu su chi fiat andadu a chircare. Su chi at fatu faghet "
"nàschere àteras preguntas subra de sas intentziones suas."

#: questlist.json:andor:126
msgid "In Brightport, I was finally able to meet Stanwick, but due to his hazy memory, he was not able to help me learn anything about the whereabouts of Andor."
msgstr ""
"In Portu Lughente so resèssidu a sa fine a atopare a Stanwick, ma ca sa "
"memòria sua est confusa, non m'at pòdidu agiudare a ischire nudda de in ue "
"est Andor."

#: questlist.json:andor:127
msgid "Regaining his peace of mind after I helped him, Stanwick said he'll tell me more about Andor, once he gathers his thoughts."
msgstr ""
"Torradu in sese a pustis chi l'apo agiudadu, Stanwick m'at naradu chi m'at a "
"contare de prus subra de Andor, cando at a àere postu in òrdine sos "
"pensamentos suos."

#: questlist.json:andor:128
msgid "Stanwick gave me a signet ring that I should show to his father. Jorwick, in Nor City."
msgstr ""
"Stanwick m'at dadu un'aneddu de sigillu chi dia dèpere mustrare a su babbu. "
"Jorwick, in Nor City."

#: questlist.json:andor:130
msgid "Andor was trying to find out from Seraphina about terrible monsters in the hideout near the place with the larval burrowers."
msgstr ""
"Andor fiat chirchende de ischire dae Seraphina de mostros terrìbiles in su "
"cuadòrgiu acanta de su logu de sas larvas iscavadoras."

#: questlist.json:andor:131
msgid "Elysa in the Brightport's thieves guild told me that Andor has bought a map to the sewers of Feygard."
msgstr ""
"Elysa, in su grèmiu de sos ladros de Portu Lughente, m'at naradu chi Andor "
"at comporadu una mapa de sas cloacas de Feygard."

#: questlist.json:andor:132
msgid "While investigating the Brightport theft I learned from Bryma that Andor was the one who stole the important document, and brought it to her in exchange for her alchemy knowledge."
msgstr ""
"Mentras investigaia subra de sa fura de Portu Lughente, apo ischidu dae "
"Bryma chi fiat istadu Andor a furare su documentu importante, e chi bi "
"l'aiat giutu in càmbiu de sas connoschèntzias suas de alchimia."

#: questlist.json:andor:140
msgid "I saw Andor in the mountains of Galmore. We were able to exchange a few words before he disappeared again."
msgstr ""
"Apo bidu a Andor in sos montes de Galmore. Amus pòdidu cambiare unas cantas "
"paràulas in antis chi esseret torradu a isparire."

#: questlist.json:andor:145
msgid "I met Andor on the road to Feygard, where he was buying food from Rosmara. He disappeared again."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Andor in s'àndala de Feygard, in ue fiat comporende màndigu "
"dae Rosmara. Est torradu a isparire."

#: questlist.json:andor:147
msgid "I met Andor on the road to Nor City, where he was buying supplies from Alynndir. He disappeared again."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Andor in s'àndala de Nor City, in ue fiat comporende provistas "
"dae Alynndir. Est torradu a isparire."

#: questlist.json:andor:150
#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:225
msgid "#reserved: sutdover_ext"
msgstr "#reserved: sutdover_ext"

#: questlist.json:andor:910
msgid "I decided to settle down on the top of Mt. Galmore. For this I needed to find a rich and discreet man to rebuild the ruins according to my wishes. Andor will now have to go and find himself."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de m'istabilire in sa punta de su Monte Galmore. Pro custu, mi "
"serbiat de agatare un'òmine ricu e discretu chi torraret a fraigare sas "
"ruinas comente cheria deo. Como Andor at a dèpere andare a s'agatare a sa "
"sola."

#: questlist.json:andor:912
msgid "The construction contract for my new home was completed. I was curious to see what it would look like."
msgstr ""
"Su cuntratu pro fraigare sa domo noa mea est istadu cumpletadu. Fia curiosu "
"de bìdere comente diat èssere bènnida."

#: questlist.json:andor:914
msgid "I visited my new residence on the top of Mt. Galmore. There I would help the people of Dhayavar as a hero and protect them from villains. Or would I become a villain myself? We'll see."
msgstr ""
"Apo bisitadu sa domo noa mea in sa punta de su Monte Galmore. In cue dia "
"agiudare sa gente de Dhayavar comente eroe e la dia amparare dae sos "
"malefatores. O mi dia fàghere deo unu malefatore? Amus a bìdere."

#: questlist.json:andor:999
msgid ""
"\n"
"[Quest is not completable at this time.]"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"[Custa missione non si podet cumpletare pro como.]"

#: questlist.json:mikhail_bread
msgid "Breakfast bread"
msgstr "Pane pro s'ismurzu"

#: questlist.json:mikhail_bread:100
msgid "I have brought the bread to Mikhail."
msgstr "Apo batidu su pane a Mikhail."

#: questlist.json:mikhail_bread:10
msgid "Mikhail wants me to go buy a loaf of bread from Mara at the town hall."
msgstr ""
"Mikhail cheret chi ande a comporare unu pane dae Mara, in sa domo comunale."

#: questlist.json:mikhail_rats
msgid "Rats!"
msgstr "Sòrighes!"

#: questlist.json:mikhail_rats:100
msgid "I have killed the two rats in our garden."
msgstr "Apo mortu sos duos sòrighes de s'ortu nostru."

#: questlist.json:mikhail_rats:10
msgid "Mikhail wants me to go check our garden for some rats. I should kill the rats in our garden and return to Mikhail. If I get hurt, I can come back to the bed and rest to regain my health."
msgstr ""
"Mikhail cheret chi ande a controllare si in s'ortu nostru b'at sòrighes. Dia "
"dèpere ochìere sos sòrighes de s'ortu nostru e torrare a Mikhail. Si mi "
"fatzo male, potzo torrare a su letu e mi pasare pro recuperare sa salude."

#: questlist.json:leta
msgid "Missing husband"
msgstr "Su maridu chi mancat"

#: questlist.json:leta:10
msgid "Leta in Crossglen village wants me to look for her husband Oromir."
msgstr "Leta, in sa bidda de Crossglen, cheret chi chirche a su maridu, Oromir."

#: questlist.json:leta:20
msgid "I have found Oromir in Crossglen village, hiding from his wife Leta."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir in sa bidda de Crossglen, cuadu dae sa mugere, Leta."

#: questlist.json:leta:25
msgid "I have found Oromir in Crossglen village, hiding from his wife Leta, but I promised him that I would not tell Leta of his whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir in sa bidda de Crossglen, cuadu dae sa mugere, Leta, ma "
"l'apo promìtidu chi no apo a nàrrere a Leta in ue est."

#: questlist.json:leta:30
#: questlist.json:leta:50
#: questlist.json:leta:70
msgid "Leta asked me to tell Oromir to come home and help her with the housework."
msgstr ""
"Leta m'at pedidu de nàrrere a Oromir de torrare a domo e de l'agiudare in "
"sos traballos de domo."

#: questlist.json:leta:35
msgid "I have found Oromir behind the Crossglen village inn, hiding from his wife Leta, but I promised him that I would not tell Leta of his whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir a palas de sa locanda de sa bidda de Crossglen, cuadu "
"dae sa mugere, Leta, ma l'apo promìtidu chi no apo a nàrrere a Leta in ue "
"est."

#: questlist.json:leta:40
msgid "I have found Oromir behind the Crossglen village inn, hiding from his wife Leta, but I should tell Leta of his whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir a palas de sa locanda de sa bidda de Crossglen, cuadu "
"dae sa mugere, Leta, ma dia dèpere nàrrere a Leta in ue est."

#: questlist.json:leta:45
msgid "I have found Oromir in Crossglen village behind a haystack, hiding from his wife Leta, but I promised him that I would not tell Leta of his whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir in sa bidda de Crossglen a palas de unu muntone de "
"fenu, cuadu dae sa mugere, Leta, ma l'apo promìtidu chi no apo a nàrrere a "
"Leta in ue est."

#: questlist.json:leta:60
msgid "I have found Oromir in Crossglen village behind a haystack, hiding from his wife Leta, I should tell Leta of his whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir in sa bidda de Crossglen a palas de unu muntone de "
"fenu, cuadu dae sa mugere, Leta. Dia dèpere nàrrere a Leta in ue est."

#: questlist.json:leta:80
msgid "I have found Oromir in the basement of his house, hiding from his wife Leta, I should tell Leta of his whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Oromir in sa cantina de sa domo sua, cuadu dae sa mugere, "
"Leta. Dia dèpere nàrrere a Leta in ue est."

#: questlist.json:leta:100
msgid "I have told Leta that Oromir is hiding in their basement."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Leta chi Oromir si cuat in sa cantina issoro."

#: questlist.json:leta:105
msgid "Even after all my help, Oromir was still brought back home to Leta."
msgstr ""
"Fintzas cun totu s'agiudu meu, a Oromir l'ant torradu a domo, a Leta, su "
"matessi."

#: questlist.json:odair
msgid "Rat infestation"
msgstr "Invasione de sòrighes"

#: questlist.json:odair:10
msgid "Odair wants me to clear the supply cave in Crossglen village of rats. In particular, I should kill the large rat and return to Odair."
msgstr ""
"Odair cheret chi lìbere de sos sòrighes sa gruta de sas provistas de sa "
"bidda de Crossglen. In particulare, dia dèpere ochìere su sòrighe mannu e "
"torrare a Odair."

#: questlist.json:odair:100
msgid "I have helped Odair clear out the rats in the supply cave in Crossglen village."
msgstr ""
"Apo agiudadu a Odair a nche bogare sos sòrighes dae sa gruta de sas "
"provistas de sa bidda de Crossglen."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal
msgid "Disallowed substance"
msgstr "Sustàntzia proibida"

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:10
msgid ""
"Leonid in Crossglen town hall tells me that there was a disturbance in the village some weeks ago. Apparently, Lord Geomyr has banned all use of bonemeal as a healing substance.\n"
"\n"
"Tharal, the town priest should know more."
msgstr ""
"Leonid, in sa domo comunale de Crossglen, mi narat chi in bidda b'at àpidu "
"unu disòrdine unas cantas chidas a como. A su chi paret, Lord Geomyr at "
"proibidu cale si siat impreu de sa farina de ossos comente sustàntzia pro "
"curare.\n"
"\n"
"Tharal, su preìderu de sa bidda, nde diat dèpere ischire de prus."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:20
msgid "Tharal does not want to talk about bonemeal. I might be able to persuade him by bringing him 5 insect wings."
msgstr ""
"Tharal non cheret faeddare de sa farina de ossos. Forsis lu potzo "
"cumbìnchere si li giugo 5 alas de babbautzu."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:30
msgid "Tharal tells me that bonemeal is a very potent healing substance, and is quite upset that it is not allowed anymore. I should go see Thoronir in Fallhaven if I want to learn more. I should tell him the password 'Glow of the Shadow'."
msgstr ""
"Tharal mi narat chi sa farina de ossos est una sustàntzia pro curare potente "
"meda, e est bastante airadu ca non si podet prus impreare. Dia dèpere andare "
"a bìdere a Thoronir in Fallhaven si nde chèrgio ischire de prus. Li dia "
"dèpere nàrrere sa paràula segreta 'Lugore de s'Umbra'."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:40
msgid "I have talked to Thoronir in Fallhaven. He might be able to mix me a bonemeal potion if I bring him 5 skeletal bones. There should be some skeletons in an abandoned house north of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Thoronir in Fallhaven. Forsis mi podet preparare una "
"potzione de farina de ossos si li giugo 5 ossos de ischèletru. Bi diat "
"dèpere àere ischèletros in una domo abbandonada a nord de Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:50
msgid "Thoronir in Fallhaven explained to me that bonemeal potions are banned by Lord Geomyr, so I have refused his request to provide him with fresh ingredients for new bonemeal potions. I could do him a favour though to bring him 5 skeletal bones for church matters. There should be some skeletons in an abandoned house north of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Thoronir, in Fallhaven, m'at ispiegadu chi sas potziones de farina de ossos "
"sunt proibidas dae Lord Geomyr, e duncas apo refudadu sa rechesta sua de li "
"dare ingredientes friscos pro potziones de farina de ossos noas. Però li dia "
"pòdere fàghere su praghere de li giùghere 5 ossos de ischèletru pro cosas de "
"crèsia. Bi diat dèpere àere ischèletros in una domo abbandonada a nord de "
"Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:100
msgid ""
"I have brought the bones to Thoronir. He is now able to supply me with bonemeal potions.\n"
"I should be careful when using them though, since Lord Geomyr has banned their use."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sos ossos a Thoronir. Como mi podet dare potziones de farina de "
"ossos.\n"
"Però las dia dèpere impreare cun cura, ca Lord Geomyr at proibidu s'impreu "
"issoro."

#: questlist.json:bonemeal:110
msgid "I have brought the bones to Thoronir. Of course he wouldn't produce any bonemeal potion from them though, since Lord Geomyr has banned their use."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sos ossos a Thoronir. Ma est craru chi non nde diat fàghere "
"peruna potzione de farina de ossos, ca Lord Geomyr at proibidu s'impreu "
"issoro."

#: questlist.json:jan
msgid "Fallen friends"
msgstr "Amigos rutos"

#: questlist.json:jan:10
msgid ""
"Jan tells me his story, where he and his two friends Gandir and Irogotu, went down the hole to dig for a hidden treasure, but they started fighting and Irogotu killed Gandir in his rage.\n"
"I should bring back Gandir's ring from Irogotu, and see Jan when I have it."
msgstr ""
"Jan mi contat s'istòria sua: issu e sos duos amigos suos, Gandir e Irogotu, "
"fiant falados in su fossu pro iscavare in chirca de unu tesoro cuadu, ma ant "
"cumintzadu a brigare e Irogotu, in s'arrennegu suo, at mortu a Gandir.\n"
"Dia dèpere leare s'aneddu de Gandir a Irogotu e andare a bìdere a Jan cando "
"l'apo."

#: questlist.json:jan:100
msgid "Irogotu is dead. I have brought Jan the ring of Gandir, and avenged his friend."
msgstr ""
"Irogotu est mortu. Apo batidu a Jan s'aneddu de Gandir, e apo vindicadu "
"s'amigu suo."

#: questlist.json:bucus:10
msgid "Bucus in Fallhaven might know something about Andor. He wants me to bring him the key of Luthor from the catacombs beneath Fallhaven church."
msgstr ""
"Bucus, in Fallhaven, diat pòdere ischire calicuna cosa de Andor. Cheret chi "
"li giuga sa crae de Luthor dae sas catacumbas chi b'at suta de sa crèsia de "
"Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:bucus:20
msgid "The catacombs beneath Fallhaven church are closed off. Athamyr is the only one with both permission and the bravery to enter them. I should go see him in his house southwest of the church."
msgstr ""
"Sas catacumbas suta de sa crèsia de Fallhaven sunt serradas. Athamyr est "
"s'ùnicu chi tenet siat su permissu siat su coràgiu de bi intrare. Dia dèpere "
"andare a lu bìdere in domo sua, a sud-ovest de sa crèsia."

#: questlist.json:bucus:30
msgid "Athamyr wants me to bring him some cooked meat, then maybe he will want to talk more."
msgstr ""
"Athamyr cheret chi li giuga unu pagu de petza cota; tando forsis at a "
"chèrrere faeddare de prus."

#: questlist.json:bucus:40
msgid "I brought some cooked meat to Athamyr."
msgstr "Apo batidu unu pagu de petza cota a Athamyr."

#: questlist.json:bucus:50
msgid "Athamyr has given me permission to enter the catacombs beneath Fallhaven church."
msgstr ""
"Athamyr m'at dadu su permissu de intrare in sas catacumbas suta de sa crèsia "
"de Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:bucus:100
msgid "I brought Bucus the key of Luthor."
msgstr "Apo batidu a Bucus sa crae de Luthor."

#: questlist.json:fallhavendrunk
msgid "Drunken tale"
msgstr "Su contu de s'imbriagu"

#: questlist.json:fallhavendrunk:10
msgid "A drunk outside Fallhaven tavern began telling me his story, but wants me to bring him some mead. I don't know if his story will lead anywhere though."
msgstr ""
"Un'imbriagu in foras de su tzilleri de Fallhaven at cumintzadu a mi contare "
"s'istòria sua, ma cheret chi li giuga unu pagu de idromele. Però no isco si "
"s'istòria sua at a giùghere a calicuna parte."

#: questlist.json:fallhavendrunk:100
msgid "The drunk told me he used to travel with Unnmir. I should go talk to Unnmir."
msgstr ""
"S'imbriagu m'at naradu chi una borta biagiaiat cun Unnmir. Dia dèpere andare "
"a faeddare cun Unnmir."

#: questlist.json:calomyran:10
msgid "An old man standing outside in Fallhaven has lost his book 'Calomyran Secrets'. I should go look for it. Maybe in Arcir's house to the south?"
msgstr ""
"Unu betzu chi est in pees in foras, in Fallhaven, at pèrdidu su libru suo "
"'Sos segretos de Calomyran'. Lu dia dèpere andare a chircare. Forsis in sa "
"domo de Arcir, a sud?"

#: questlist.json:calomyran:20
msgid "I found a torn page of a book called 'Calomyran Secrets' with the name 'Larcal' written on it."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una pàgina istratzada de unu libru chi si narat 'Sos segretos de "
"Calomyran', cun su nòmine 'Larcal' iscritu subra."

#: questlist.json:calomyran:100
msgid "I gave the book back to the old man."
msgstr "Apo torradu su libru a su betzu."

#: questlist.json:nocmar
msgid "Lost treasures"
msgstr "Tesoros pèrdidos"

#: questlist.json:nocmar:10
msgid "Unnmir told me he used to be an adventurer, and gave me a hint to go see Nocmar. His house is just southwest of the tavern in Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Unnmir m'at naradu chi una borta fiat unu ventureri, e m'at cussigiadu de "
"andare a bìdere a Nocmar. Sa domo sua est pròpiu a sud-ovest de su tzilleri "
"de Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:20
msgid ""
"Nocmar tells me he used to be a smith. But Lord Geomyr has banned the use of heartsteel, so he cannot forge his weapons anymore.\n"
"If I can find a heartstone and bring it to Nocmar, he should be able to forge the heartsteel again."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar mi narat chi una borta fiat ferreri. Ma Lord Geomyr at proibidu "
"s'impreu de s'atzàrgiu de coro, e duncas non podet prus fraigare sas armas "
"suas.\n"
"Si resesso a agatare una pedra de coro e a la giùghere a Nocmar, issu diat "
"dèpere pòdere torrare a fraigare s'atzàrgiu de coro."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:30
msgid "Nocmar, the Fallhaven smith, said that I could find a heartstone in a place called Undertell which is somewhere near Galmore Mountain."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar, su ferreri de Fallhaven, m'at naradu chi dia pòdere agatare una "
"pedra de coro in unu logu chi si narat Undertell, chi est in calicuna parte "
"acanta de su Monte Galmore."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:35
msgid "Myrelis, the ghost artist I met in the Galmore encampment, informed me that the entrance to Undertell is located just southwest of his building."
msgstr ""
"Myrelis, s'artista pantasma chi apo atopadu in su campamentu de Galmore, "
"m'at informadu chi s'intrada de Undertell est pròpiu a sud-ovest de "
"s'edifìtziu suo."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:40
msgid "I discovered the heartstone deep inside Undertell, but it was far too hot to move or even touch. Maybe Unnmir knows what I should do next?"
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu sa pedra de coro in fundu meda in Undertell, ma fiat tropu "
"caente pro la mòvere o mancu pro la tocare. Forsis Unnmir ischit ite dia "
"dèpere fàghere a pustis?"

#: questlist.json:nocmar:45
msgid "I discovered a heartstone deep inside Undertell. It's time to put Nocmar to work."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu una pedra de coro in fundu meda in Undertell. Est ora de "
"pònnere a Nocmar a traballare."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:48
msgid "Nocmar informed me that I must return the unrefined heartstone back to where I found it so it could \"become whole\"."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar m'at informadu chi depo torrare sa pedra de coro non rafinada a su "
"logu in ue l'apo agatada, pro chi potzat \"èssere intrea\"."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:50
msgid "Unnmir told me that the only way to cool the heartstone enough to carry it is to use a block of Galmore ice which he said I could find at the top of Galmore Mountain guarded by the snow beasts. This rare ice does not melt in the lowlands, only when placed against something extremely hot like lava or the heartstone itself."
msgstr ""
"Unnmir m'at naradu chi s'ùnica manera de fàghere frita bastante sa pedra de "
"coro pro la pòdere giùghere est a impreare unu blocu de astru de Galmore, "
"chi, comente m'at naradu, dia pòdere agatare in sa punta de su Monte "
"Galmore, bigiadu dae sas bèstias de su nie. Custu astru raru non si fundet "
"in sas terras bassas, ma petzi cando lu ponent a curtzu de una cosa caente "
"meda, comente sa lava o sa pedra de coro etotu."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:60
msgid "I was spooked by a sound causing me to lose my grip on the unrefined heartstone, causing me to drop it. Thus shattering it into pieces."
msgstr ""
"Unu sonu m'at fatu assustare e apo pèrdidu sa presa de sa pedra de coro non "
"rafinada, chi m'est ruta. Gasi s'est fata a bìculos."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:70
msgid "I placed the Galmore ice on the heartstone. The block hissed and steamed as it melted away, cooling the heartstone until it was safe to touch. I picked it up at last."
msgstr ""
"Apo postu s'astru de Galmore subra de sa pedra de coro. Su blocu at fatu unu "
"frùschiu e at bogadu vapore mentras s'isfaghiat, e at refriscadu sa pedra de "
"coro finas a cando si podiat tocare chene perìgulu. A sa fine l'apo leada."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:80
msgid "I returned to Nocmar with the cooled heartstone. He was eager to begin his work, but... not in his Fallhaven shop."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a Nocmar cun sa pedra de coro frita. Teniat gana de cumintzare su "
"traballu suo, ma... no in sa butega sua de Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:90
msgid "Nocmar told me to meet him at the glowing white house south of Fallhaven. He says the lock will no longer bar my entry, as he must prepare the forge and make sure the place is safe."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar m'at naradu de lu atopare in sa domo bianca lughente a sud de "
"Fallhaven. Narat chi sa serradura non m'at a impedire prus s'intrada, ca "
"issu depet preparare su forru de ferreri e assegurare chi su logu siat "
"seguru."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:100
msgid "I met Nocmar inside the glowing white house, where the ever-burning forge waits. He explained that with the heartstone I recovered, he can forge one heartsteel weapon of my choice."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Nocmar a intro de sa domo bianca lughente, in ue s'agatat su "
"forru de ferreri chi brùsiat semper. M'at ispiegadu chi, cun sa pedra de "
"coro chi apo recuperadu, podet fraigare un'arma de atzàrgiu de coro a "
"issèberu meu."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:110
msgid "As I refused a heartsteel weapon from Nocmar, Falkour, the forge dragon beneath the glowing house, gifted me a pendant."
msgstr ""
"Dae chi apo refudadu un'arma de atzàrgiu de coro dae Nocmar, Falkour, su "
"dragu de su fraile suta de sa domo lughente, m'at regaladu unu pendente."

#: questlist.json:nocmar:200
msgid "Nocmar forged the heartsteel once again and rewarded me with a weapon type of my choice, reforged in the lost art."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar at torradu a fraigare s'atzàrgiu de coro e m'at dadu comente prèmiu "
"un'arma de sa genia chi apo seberadu, fraigada torra cun s'arte pèrdida."

#: questlist.json:flagstone
msgid "Ancient secrets"
msgstr "Segretos antigos"

#: questlist.json:flagstone:5
msgid "Yolgen asked me to have a look at what is wrong with Flagstone prison."
msgstr ""
"Yolgen m'at pedidu de abbaidare ite b'at chi no andat in sa presone de "
"Pedralada."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:10
msgid "I met a guard from Stoutford on sentry duty outside a fortress called Flagstone. He told me that Flagstone used to serve as a prison for house Gorland of Stoutford, but it is now abandoned. Recently, undead have started pouring out of Flagstone. I should investigate the source of the undead monsters. The guard tells me to return to him if I need help."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu una guàrdia de Stoutford de sentinella in foras de una fortalesa "
"chi si narat Pedralada. M'at naradu chi Pedralada fiat istada una presone "
"pro sa casada Gorland de Stoutford, ma chi como est abbandonada. Dae pagu, "
"dae Pedralada ant cumintzadu a nch'essire non-mortos a muntones. Dia dèpere "
"investigare de ue benint sos mostros non-mortos. Sa guàrdia mi narat de "
"torrare a issa si mi bisòngiat agiudu."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:20
msgid "I found a dug out tunnel beneath Flagstone, that seems to lead to a larger cave. The cave is guarded by a demon that I am not even able to approach. Maybe the guard outside Flagstone knows more?"
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu tunnel iscavadu suta de Pedralada, chi paret chi giugat a "
"una gruta prus manna. Sa gruta est bigiada dae unu dimòniu a su cale non "
"resesso mancu a m'acurtziare. Forsis sa guàrdia in foras de Pedralada nde "
"ischit de prus?"

#: questlist.json:flagstone:30
msgid "The guard suggested that the former warden may have something to do with this, and I should go and look for him. If I find him I should return to the guard with any important news."
msgstr ""
"Sa guàrdia m'at naradu chi forsis su diretore de prima de sa presone tenet "
"calicuna cosa de bìdere cun custu, e chi lu dia dèpere andare a chircare. Si "
"l'agato, dia dèpere torrare a sa guàrdia cun cale si siat nova importante."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:31
msgid "I found the former warden of Flagstone on the upper level. Among his remains I found a necklace with some inscriptions. I should return to the guard now."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu su diretore de prima de Pedralada in su pianu de subra. In mesu "
"de sos restos suos apo agatadu una collana cun unas cantas iscritziones. "
"Como dia dèpere torrare a sa guàrdia."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:40
msgid "I have learned the words required to approach the demon beneath Flagstone. 'Daylight Shadow'. It seems like the warden has something to do with the monster invasion."
msgstr ""
"Apo imparadu sas paràulas chi bisòngiant pro m'acurtziare a su dimòniu suta "
"de Pedralada: 'Umbra de sa lughe de die'. Paret chi su diretore de sa "
"presone tèngiat calicuna cosa de bìdere cun s'invasione de sos mostros."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:50
msgid "Deep beneath Flagstone, I found a powerful winged demon. It seems like the warden kept on running the prison and experimented with necromancy."
msgstr ""
"In fundu meda suta de Pedralada, apo agatadu unu dimòniu poderosu cun alas. "
"Paret chi su diretore apat sighidu a guvernare sa presone e chi apat fatu "
"esperimentos de negromantzia."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:60
msgid "I found one prisoner, Narael, alive deep beneath Flagstone. Narael was once a citizen of Nor City. He is too weak to walk by himself, but if I can find his wife in Nor City, I would be handsomely rewarded."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu presoneri, Narael, ancora biu in fundu meda suta de "
"Pedralada. Narael una borta fiat unu tzitadinu de Nor City. Est tropu dèbile "
"pro caminare a sa sola, ma si resesso a agatare sa mugere in Nor City, dia "
"tènnere unu prèmiu bonu meda."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:70
msgid "I approached the sentry again and he was happy to hear the source of the undead is gone. I should talk to Yolgen, the priest of Stoutford, for a reward."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a s'òmine de sentinella, e fiat cuntentu de ischire chi sa fonte "
"de sos non-mortos non b'est prus. Dia dèpere faeddare cun Yolgen, su "
"preìderu de Stoutford, pro unu prèmiu."

#: questlist.json:flagstone:100
msgid "Yolgen rewarded me handsomely for my efforts and is happy that there is one thing less the citizens of Stoutford have to worry about."
msgstr ""
"Yolgen m'at dadu unu prèmiu bonu meda pro sos isfortzos meos, e est cuntentu "
"ca como sos tzitadinos de Stoutford tenent una cosa in mancu de chi si "
"preocupare."

#: questlist.json:vacor
msgid "Missing pieces"
msgstr "Bìculos chi mancant"

#: questlist.json:vacor:10
msgid ""
"A mage called Vacor in southwest Fallhaven has been trying to cast a rift spell.\n"
"There was something not right about him, he seemed very obsessed with his spell. Something about him gaining a power from it."
msgstr ""
"Unu magu chi si narat Vacor, in su sud-ovest de Fallhaven, est chirchende de "
"fàghere un'incantu de s'isperrada.\n"
"B'aiat calicuna cosa chi no andaiat bene in issu: pariat fissadu meda cun "
"s'incantu suo. Calicuna cosa subra de unu podere chi diat balangiare dae "
"issu."

#: questlist.json:vacor:20
msgid "Vacor wants me to bring him the four pieces of the rift spell that he claims was stolen from him. The four bandits should be somewhere south of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Vacor cheret chi li giuga sos bator cantos de s'incantu de s'isperrada chi "
"narat chi li ant furadu. Sos bator bandidos diant dèpere èssere in calicuna "
"parte a sud de Fallhaven."

#: questlist.json:vacor:30
msgid "I have brought the four pieces of the rift spell to Vacor."
msgstr "Apo batidu a Vacor sos bator cantos de s'incantu de s'isperrada."

#: questlist.json:vacor:40
msgid "Vacor tells me about his former apprentice Unzel, who had started to question Vacor. Vacor now wants me to kill Unzel. I should be able to find him to the southwest outside of Fallhaven. I should bring his signet ring to Vacor once I have killed him."
msgstr ""
"Vacor mi contat de s'ex discìpulu suo Unzel, chi aiat cumintzadu a pònnere "
"in dùbbiu a Vacor. Como Vacor cheret chi deo ochia a Unzel. Lu dia dèpere "
"pòdere agatare a sud-ovest, in foras de Fallhaven. Cando l'apo mortu, dia "
"dèpere giùghere a Vacor s'aneddu de sigillu suo."

#: questlist.json:vacor:50
msgid "Unzel gives me a choice to side with either Vacor or him."
msgstr "Unzel mi dat a seberare de istare cun Vacor o cun issu."

#: questlist.json:vacor:51
msgid "I have chosen to side with Unzel. I should go to southwest Fallhaven to talk to Vacor about Unzel and the Shadow."
msgstr ""
"Apo seberadu de istare cun Unzel. Dia dèpere andare a su sud-ovest de "
"Fallhaven pro faeddare cun Vacor de Unzel e de s'Umbra."

#: questlist.json:vacor:53
msgid "I started a fight with Unzel. I should bring his ring to Vacor once he is dead."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu una briga cun Unzel. Cando at a èssere mortu, dia dèpere "
"giùghere s'aneddu suo a Vacor."

#: questlist.json:vacor:54
msgid "I started a fight with Vacor. I should bring his ring to Unzel once he is dead."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu una briga cun Vacor. Cando at a èssere mortu, dia dèpere "
"giùghere s'aneddu suo a Unzel."

#: questlist.json:vacor:60
msgid "I have killed Unzel and told Vacor about the deed."
msgstr "Apo mortu a Unzel e l'apo contadu a Vacor."

#: questlist.json:vacor:61
msgid "I have killed Vacor and told Unzel about the deed."
msgstr "Apo mortu a Vacor e l'apo contadu a Unzel."

#: questlist_nondisplayed.json:base_nondisplay
msgid "base_nondisplay"
msgstr "base_nondisplay"

#: questlist_nondisplayed.json:base_nondisplay:1
msgid "1=Developers Debug Version active"
msgstr "1=Versione de debug pro sos programmadores ativa"

#: questlist_nondisplayed.json:base_nondisplay:2
msgid "2=This stage is never set"
msgstr "2=Custa fase non s'ativat mai"

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik
msgid "Night visit"
msgstr "Visita de note"

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:10
msgid "Farrik in the Fallhaven Thieves' Guild told me of a plan to help a fellow thief escape from the Fallhaven jail."
msgstr ""
"Farrik, in su Grèmiu de sos Ladros de Fallhaven, m'at contadu unu pianu pro "
"agiudare unu cumpàngiu ladru a fuire dae sa presone de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:20
msgid "Farrik in the Fallhaven Thieves' Guild told me the details of the plan, and I accepted the task of helping him. The guard captain apparently has a drinking problem. The plan is that I get a prepared mead from the cook in the Thieves' Guild that will knock out the guard captain in the jail. I might be required to bribe the guard captain."
msgstr ""
"Farrik, in su Grèmiu de sos Ladros de Fallhaven, m'at contadu sos detàllios "
"de su pianu, e apo atzetadu de l'agiudare. A su chi paret, su capitanu de "
"sas guàrdias tenet unu problema cun su bufare. Su pianu est custu: depo "
"leare dae su coghineri de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros un'idromele preparadu chi "
"at a fàghere rùere in sonnu a su capitanu de sas guàrdias de sa presone. "
"Podet èssere chi depa corrùmpere a su capitanu de sas guàrdias."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:25
msgid "I got the prepared mead from the cook in the Thieves' Guild."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu s'idromele preparadu dae su coghineri de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:30
msgid "I told Farrik that I don't fully agree with their plan. I might tell the guard captain about their shady plan."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Farrik chi non so de acordu de su totu cun su pianu issoro. "
"Forsis apo a contare a su capitanu de sas guàrdias custu pianu issoro pagu "
"onestu."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:32
msgid "I have given the prepared mead to the guard captain."
msgstr "Apo dadu s'idromele preparadu a su capitanu de sas guàrdias."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:40
msgid "I have told the guard captain of the plan that the thieves have to release their friend."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a su capitanu de sas guàrdias su pianu chi tenent sos ladros pro "
"liberare a s'amigu issoro."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:50
msgid "The guard captain wants me to tell the thieves that the security will be lowered for tonight. We might be able to catch some of the thieves."
msgstr ""
"Su capitanu de sas guàrdias cheret chi nàrgia a sos ladros chi custa note sa "
"vigilàntzia at a èssere prus pagu. Gasi diamus pòdere aferrare a calicunu de "
"sos ladros."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:60
msgid "I managed to bribe the guard captain into drinking the prepared mead. He should be out during the night allowing the thieves to break their friend free."
msgstr ""
"So resèssidu a corrùmpere a su capitanu de sas guàrdias pro chi bufaret "
"s'idromele preparadu. Diat dèpere abarrare dormidu in su note, e gasi sos "
"ladros ant a pòdere liberare a s'amigu issoro."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:70
msgid "Farrik rewarded me for helping the Thieves' Guild."
msgstr "Farrik m'at premiadu pro àere agiudadu su Grèmiu de sos Ladros."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:80
msgid "I have told Farrik that the security will be lowered tonight."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Farrik chi custa note sa vigilàntzia at a èssere prus pagu."

#: questlist_v068.json:farrik:90
msgid "The guard captain thanked me for helping him plan to catch the thieves. He said he will also tell other guards that I helped him."
msgstr ""
"Su capitanu de sas guàrdias m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo agiudadu a pensare "
"unu pianu pro aferrare sos ladros. At naradu chi at a nàrrere fintzas a sas "
"àteras guàrdias chi l'apo agiudadu."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar
msgid "A lost potion"
msgstr "Una potzione pèrdida"

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:10
msgid "I should find a potion maker called Lodar. Umar in the Fallhaven Thieves' Guild told me that I will need to know the right words to pass a guardian in order to reach Lodar's hideaway."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere agatare unu fraigadore de potziones chi si narat Lodar. Umar, in "
"su Grèmiu de sos Ladros de Fallhaven, m'at naradu chi depo connòschere sas "
"paràulas giustas pro passare unu guardianu e lòmpere a su cuadòrgiu de Lodar."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:15
msgid "Umar told me I should go see someone called Ogam in Vilegard. Ogam can supply me with the right words to reach Lodar's hideaway."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at naradu chi dia dèpere andare a bìdere a unu chi si narat Ogam, in "
"Vilegard. Ogam mi podet dare sas paràulas giustas pro lòmpere a su cuadòrgiu "
"de Lodar."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:20
msgid "I have visited Ogam in southwest Vilegard. He was talking in what seemed like riddles. I could barely make out some details when I asked about Lodar's hideaway. 'Halfway between the Shadow and the light. Rocky formations.' and the words 'Glow of the Shadow.' were among the things he said. I am not sure what they mean."
msgstr ""
"Apo bisitadu a Ogam, in su sud-ovest de Vilegard. Faeddaiat in una manera "
"chi pariant indevìngios. Cando l'apo preguntadu de su cuadòrgiu de Lodar, "
"apo pòdidu cumprèndere a istentu calicunu detàlliu. 'A mesu caminu intre "
"s'Umbra e sa lughe. Formatziones de rocas.' e sas paràulas 'Lugore de "
"s'Umbra.' fiant intre sas cosas chi at naradu. No isco ite cherent nàrrere."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:30
msgid "I have found a formation of rocks on the Duleian Road. It does not look like they were naturally placed, but rather that they are meant to symbolize something."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una formatzione de rocas in s'àndala duleiana. Non paret chi "
"siant istadas postas gasi dae sa natura, ma chi cherent simbolizare calicuna "
"cosa."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:31
msgid "Could this be the 'rocky formation' that the old man Ogam mentioned? If that is the case, then this might be a clue as to where Andor went."
msgstr ""
"Custa diat pòdere èssere sa 'formatzione de rocas' chi at mentovadu su betzu "
"Ogam? Si est gasi, custu diat pòdere èssere un'inditu de ue est andadu Andor."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:40
msgid "In the woods close to the rocky formation, I encountered a creature blocking the way into the forest."
msgstr ""
"In su buscu acanta de sa formatzione de rocas, apo atopadu una creadura chi "
"mi serraiat su caminu pro intrare in su padente."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:45
msgid "By speaking the words that Ogam had mentioned, the creature moved out of the way, and almost seemed to welcome me further into the forest."
msgstr ""
"Narende sas paràulas chi aiat mentovadu Ogam, sa creadura si nch'est tirada "
"a un'ala, e pariat chi fintzas mi esseret dende su benebènnidu prus a intro "
"de su padente."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:50
msgid "I encountered a guard from Feygard in the woods. He told me a tale of a madman that the guards from Feygard are searching for. The madman is wanted for a number of reasons that he would not disclose. He warned me both about the twisty mazes ahead, and about the madman. Apparently, several guards have gone missing after venturing forth, either by getting lost in the maze, or by something that the madman has done to them."
msgstr ""
"In su buscu apo atopadu una guàrdia de Feygard. M'at contadu s'istòria de "
"unu macu chi sas guàrdias de Feygard sunt chirchende. Su macu est chircadu "
"pro unas cantas resones chi non m'at chertu nàrrere. M'at avisadu de sos "
"labirintos tortos chi b'at prus a in antis e fintzas de su macu. A su chi "
"paret, unas cantas guàrdias sunt isparèssidas a pustis de si èssere "
"avantzadas, o ca si sunt pèrdidas in su labirintu o pro calicuna cosa chi "
"lis at fatu su macu."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:51
msgid "Before leaving, the guard warned me both about the twisty mazes ahead, and about the madman. Apparently, several guards have gone missing after venturing forth, either by getting lost in the maze, or by something that the madman has done to them."
msgstr ""
"In antis de si nch'andare, sa guàrdia m'at avisadu de sos labirintos tortos "
"chi b'at prus a in antis e fintzas de su macu. A su chi paret, unas cantas "
"guàrdias sunt isparèssidas a pustis de si èssere avantzadas, o ca si sunt "
"pèrdidas in su labirintu o pro calicuna cosa chi lis at fatu su macu."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:60
msgid "I found another rocky formation that looked out of place."
msgstr "Apo agatadu un'àtera formatzione de rocas chi pariat foras de logu."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:71
msgid "I encountered another guard from Feygard, disoriented and lost. The things he said did not make sense."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu un'àtera guàrdia de Feygard, disorientada e pèrdida. Su chi "
"naraiat non teniat sentidu."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:72
msgid "I encountered another guard from Feygard, that seemed to be affected by something. He attacked me without provocation."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu un'àtera guàrdia de Feygard, chi pariat tocada dae calicuna "
"cosa. M'at atacadu chene provocatzione."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:73
msgid "I encountered another guard from Feygard, that rambled of something that 'lurks underneath'. He attacked me without provocation."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu un'àtera guàrdia de Feygard, chi naraiat cosas chene sentidu "
"subra de una cosa chi 'istat cuada in suta'. M'at atacadu chene "
"provocatzione."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:80
msgid "I found yet another rocky formation that looked out of place."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu galu un'àtera formatzione de rocas chi pariat foras de logu."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:90
msgid "In a well-hidden cave, I encountered yet another rocky formation that looked similar to the other ones that I've already seen. I must be getting close to whatever these formations lead to."
msgstr ""
"In una gruta bene cuada, apo atopadu galu un'àtera formatzione de rocas "
"simigiante a sas àteras chi apo giai bidu. Depo èssere acanta de cale si "
"siat cosa a sa cale giughent custas formatziones."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:100
msgid "In the cave, I reached what looks like a tomb. I was unable to venture further into the tomb because of something that held me back."
msgstr ""
"In sa gruta, so lòmpidu a unu logu chi paret una tumba. No apo pòdidu andare "
"prus a intro de sa tumba ca bi fiat calicuna cosa chi mi trateniat."

#: questlist_v068.json:lodar:110
msgid "After navigating through the immense twisty green maze and the damp cave, I have reached a cabin in a clearing. The cabin is occupied by the potion-maker called Lodar."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere atraessadu su labirintu birde, mannu meda e tortu, e sa "
"gruta ùmida, so lòmpidu a una barraca in una lascura. In sa barraca bi istat "
"su fraigadore de potziones chi si narat Lodar."

#: questlist_v068.json:vilegard
msgid "Trusting an outsider"
msgstr "Tènnere fide in un'istràngiu"

#: questlist_v068.json:vilegard:10
msgid "The people of Vilegard are very suspicious of outsiders. I was told to go see Jolnor in the Vilegard chapel if I want to gain their trust."
msgstr ""
"Sa gente de Vilegard est suspetosa meda cun sos istràngios. M'ant naradu de "
"andare a bìdere a Jolnor in sa cresiedda de Vilegard si chèrgio chi si "
"fident de mene."

#: questlist_v068.json:vilegard:20
msgid "I have talked to Jolnor in the Vilegard chapel. He suggests I help three influential people in order to gain the trust of the people in Vilegard. I should help Kaori, Wrye and Jolnor in Vilegard."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Jolnor in sa cresiedda de Vilegard. Mi cussìgiat de "
"agiudare tres persones de importu pro balangiare sa fide de sa gente de "
"Vilegard. Dia dèpere agiudare a Kaori, a Wrye e a Jolnor, in Vilegard."

#: questlist_v068.json:vilegard:30
msgid "I have helped all three people in Vilegard that Jolnor suggested. Now the people of Vilegard should trust me more."
msgstr ""
"Apo agiudadu totu sas tres persones de Vilegard chi m'aiat cussigiadu "
"Jolnor. Como sa gente de Vilegard diat dèpere tènnere prus fide in mene."

#: questlist_v068.json:kaori
msgid "Kaori's errands"
msgstr "Sos incàrrigos de Kaori"

#: questlist_v068.json:kaori:5
msgid "Jolnor in Vilegard chapel wants me to talk to Kaori in northern Vilegard, to see if she wants any help."
msgstr ""
"Jolnor, in sa cresiedda de Vilegard, cheret chi faedde cun Kaori, in su nord "
"de Vilegard, pro bìdere si cheret agiudu."

#: questlist_v068.json:kaori:10
msgid "Kaori in northern Vilegard wants me to bring her 10 bonemeal potions."
msgstr ""
"Kaori, in su nord de Vilegard, cheret chi li giuga 10 potziones de farina de "
"ossos."

#: questlist_v068.json:kaori:20
msgid "I have brought 10 bonemeal potions to Kaori."
msgstr "Apo batidu 10 potziones de farina de ossos a Kaori."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye
msgid "Uncertain cause"
msgstr "Càusa intzerta"

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:10
msgid "Jolnor in Vilegard chapel wants me to talk to Wrye in northern Vilegard. She has apparently lost her son recently."
msgstr ""
"Jolnor, in sa cresiedda de Vilegard, cheret chi faedde cun Wrye, in su nord "
"de Vilegard. A su chi paret, at pèrdidu su fìgiu dae pagu."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:20
msgid "Wrye in northern Vilegard tells me that her son Rincel has gone missing. She thinks that he has died or gotten critically hurt."
msgstr ""
"Wrye, in su nord de Vilegard, mi narat chi su fìgiu, Rincel, est "
"isparèssidu. Issa pensat chi siat mortu o chi si siat feridu de manera grave."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:30
msgid "Wrye tells me that she thinks the royal guard from Feygard are involved in his disappearance, and that they have recruited him."
msgstr ""
"Wrye mi narat chi pensat chi sa guàrdia reale de Feygard tèngiat calicuna "
"cosa de bìdere cun s'isparèssida sua, e chi l'apant arruoladu."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:40
msgid "Wrye wants me to go search for clues as to what has happened to her son."
msgstr ""
"Wrye cheret chi ande a chircare inditos de su chi est capitadu a su fìgiu."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:41
msgid "I should go look in the Vilegard tavern and the Foaming Flask tavern north of Vilegard."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere andare a chircare in su tzilleri de Vilegard e in su tzilleri de "
"su Fiascu Ispumosu, a nord de Vilegard."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:42
msgid "I heard of a boy being in the Foaming Flask tavern a while ago. Apparently he left to the west of the tavern somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu chi unu pitzocu est istadu in su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu "
"unu pagu de tempus a como. A su chi paret, si nch'est andadu a calicuna "
"parte a otzidente de su tzilleri."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:80
msgid "To the northwest of Vilegard I found a man that had found Rincel fighting some monsters. Rincel had apparently left Vilegard by his own will to go see the city of Feygard. I should go tell Wrye in northern Vilegard what happened to her son."
msgstr ""
"A nord-ovest de Vilegard apo agatadu un'òmine chi aiat bidu a Rincel "
"cumbatende contra a unos cantos mostros. A su chi paret, Rincel si nche fiat "
"andadu dae Vilegard de voluntade sua pro andare a bìdere sa tzitade de "
"Feygard. Dia dèpere andare a contare a Wrye, in su nord de Vilegard, su chi "
"est capitadu a su fìgiu."

#: questlist_v068.json:wrye:90
msgid "I have told Wrye the truth about her son's disappearance."
msgstr "Apo contadu a Wrye sa veridade subra de s'isparèssida de su fìgiu."

#: questlist_v068.json:jolnor
msgid "Spies in the foam"
msgstr "Ispias in s'iscuma"

#: questlist_v068.json:jolnor:10
msgid "Jolnor in Vilegard chapel tells me of a guard outside of the Foaming Flask tavern, that he thinks is a spy for the Feygard royal guard. He wants me to make the guard disappear, in any way that I see fit. The tavern should be just north of Vilegard."
msgstr ""
"Jolnor, in sa cresiedda de Vilegard, mi narat de una guàrdia chi istat in "
"foras de su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu e chi, segundu issu, est un'ispia "
"de sa guàrdia reale de Feygard. Cheret chi fatza isparèssere sa guàrdia, in "
"sa manera chi m'at a pàrrere mègius. Su tzilleri diat dèpere èssere deretu a "
"nord de Vilegard."

#: questlist_v068.json:jolnor:20
msgid "I have convinced the guard outside the Foaming Flask tavern to leave after his shift ends."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumbintu sa guàrdia in foras de su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu a si "
"nch'andare cando acabbat su turnu suo."

#: questlist_v068.json:jolnor:21
msgid "I have started a fight with the guard outside the Foaming Flask tavern. I should bring his Feygard royal guard ring to Jolnor once he is dead to show Jolnor that he has disappeared."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu a cumbàtere cun sa guàrdia in foras de su tzilleri de su "
"Fiascu Ispumosu. Cando at a èssere morta, dia dèpere giùghere a Jolnor "
"s'aneddu suo de sa guàrdia reale de Feygard, pro li mustrare chi est "
"isparèssida."

#: questlist_v068.json:jolnor:30
msgid "I have told Jolnor that the guard is now gone."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Jolnor chi sa guàrdia como non b'est prus."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent
msgid "The agent and the beast"
msgstr "S'agente e sa bèstia"

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:1
msgid "I met a man seeking help for his settlement, the 'Blackwater mountain'. Supposedly, his settlement is being attacked by monsters and bandits, and they need help from the outside."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu un'òmine chi chircaiat agiudu pro s'insediamentu suo, su 'Monte "
"Abbaniedda'. A su chi narat, s'insediamentu suo est atacadu dae mostros e "
"bandidos, e tenent bisòngiu de agiudu de fora."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:5
msgid "I have agreed to help the man and Blackwater mountain in dealing with the problem."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a s'òmine e a su Monte Abbaniedda a afrontare su "
"problema."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:10
msgid "The man told me to meet him on the other side of the collapsed mine. He will crawl through the mine shaft and I will descend into the pitch-black abandoned mine."
msgstr ""
"S'òmine m'at naradu de lu atopare in s'àtera ala de sa miniera derruta. Issu "
"at a passare istrisinende·si in su putzu de sa miniera, e deo apo a falare "
"in sa miniera abbandonada, iscura che pighe."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:20
msgid "I have navigated through the pitch-black abandoned mine, and met the man on the other side. He seemed very anxious about telling me to head straight to the east once I exit the mine. I should meet the man at the bottom of the mountain to the east."
msgstr ""
"Apo atraessadu sa miniera abbandonada, iscura che pighe, e apo atopadu a "
"s'òmine in s'àtera ala. Pariat chi tenneret meda pressa de mi nàrrere de "
"andare deretu a oriente a pustis de èssere essidu dae sa miniera. Dia dèpere "
"atopare a s'òmine a pee de su monte, a oriente."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:25
msgid "I heard a story about Prim and the Blackwater mountain settlement fighting against each other."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu un'istòria subra de Prim e de s'insediamentu de su Monte "
"Abbaniedda, chi sunt in gherra s'unu contra a s'àteru."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:30
msgid "I should follow the mountain path up the mountain to the Blackwater mountain settlement."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere sighire su caminu de monte, artziende finas a s'insediamentu de "
"su Monte Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:40
msgid "I met the man again on my way up to Blackwater mountain. I should proceed further up the mountain."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a atopare a s'òmine mentras artziaia a su Monte Abbaniedda. Dia "
"dèpere sighire a artziare in su monte."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:50
msgid "I have made it up to the snow-filled parts of the Blackwater mountain. The man told me to proceed further up the mountain. Apparently, the Blackwater mountain settlement is close by."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a sas partes de su Monte Abbaniedda prenas de nie. S'òmine m'at "
"naradu de sighire a artziare in su monte. A su chi paret, s'insediamentu de "
"su Monte Abbaniedda est acanta."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:60
msgid "I have reached the Blackwater mountain settlement. I should find and talk to their battle master, Harlenn."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda. Dia dèpere agatare su "
"mastru de armas issoro, Harlenn, e faeddare cun issu."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:65
msgid "I have spoken to Harlenn in the Blackwater mountain settlement. Apparently, the settlement is under attack by a number of monsters, the aulaeth and white wyrms. On top of that, they are being attacked by the people of Prim."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Harlenn in s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda. A su chi "
"paret, s'insediamentu est atacadu dae unos cantos mostros, sos aulaeth e sos "
"wyrm biancos. E in prus, los est atachende sa gente de Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:66
msgid "Harlenn thinks the people of Prim are behind the monster attacks somehow."
msgstr ""
"Harlenn pensat chi, in calicuna manera, a palas de sos atacos de sos mostros "
"bi siat sa gente de Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:70
msgid "Harlenn wants me to give a message to Guthbered of Prim. Either the people of Prim stop their attacks on the Blackwater mountain settlement, or they will have to be dealt with themselves. I should go talk to Guthbered in Prim."
msgstr ""
"Harlenn cheret chi giuga unu messàgiu a Guthbered de Prim: o sa gente de "
"Prim acabbat de atacare s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda, o nd'ant a "
"pagare sas cunseguèntzias. Dia dèpere andare a faeddare cun Guthbered in "
"Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:80
msgid "Guthbered denies that the people of Prim have anything to do with the monster attacks on the Blackwater mountain settlement. I should go talk to Harlenn."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered negat chi sa gente de Prim tèngiat calicuna cosa de bìdere cun sos "
"atacos de sos mostros contra a s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda. Dia "
"dèpere andare a faeddare cun Harlenn."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:90
msgid "Harlenn is sure that the people of Prim are behind the attacks somehow."
msgstr ""
"Harlenn est seguru chi, in calicuna manera, a palas de sos atacos bi siat sa "
"gente de Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:95
msgid "Harlenn wants me to go to Prim and look for signs that they are preparing for an attack on the settlement. I should go look for clues around where Guthbered stays."
msgstr ""
"Harlenn cheret chi ande a Prim e chi chirche inditos chi sunt aprontende "
"un'atacu contra a s'insediamentu. Dia dèpere chircare inditos a inghìriu de "
"su logu in ue istat Guthbered."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:100
msgid "I have found some plans in Prim about recruiting mercenaries and attacking the Blackwater mountain settlement. I should go talk to Harlenn immediately."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu in Prim unos cantos pianos pro arruolare mertzenàrios e atacare "
"s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda. Dia dèpere andare deretu a faeddare "
"cun Harlenn."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:110
msgid "Harlenn thanked me for investigating the attack plans."
msgstr ""
"Harlenn m'at ringratziadu pro àere investigadu subra de sos pianos de atacu."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:120
msgid "To make the attacks on the Blackwater mountain settlement stop, Harlenn wants me to assassinate Guthbered in Prim."
msgstr ""
"Pro fàghere firmare sos atacos contra a s'insediamentu de su Monte "
"Abbaniedda, Harlenn cheret chi assassine a Guthbered in Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:130
msgid "I have started a fight with Guthbered."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu a cumbàtere cun Guthbered."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:131
msgid "I told Guthbered that I was sent to kill him, but I let him live. He thanked me deeply, and left Prim."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Guthbered chi m'aiant mandadu a l'ochìere, ma l'apo lassadu "
"bìvere. M'at ringratziadu dae coro e si nch'est andadu dae Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:149
msgid "I have told Harlenn that Guthbered is gone."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Harlenn chi Guthbered non b'est prus."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:150
msgid "Harlenn thanked me for the help I have provided. Hopefully, the attacks on the Blackwater mountain settlement should stop now."
msgstr ""
"Harlenn m'at ringratziadu pro s'agiudu chi l'apo dadu. Isperamus chi como "
"sos atacos contra a s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda si firment."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:240
msgid "I am now trusted in the Blackwater mountain settlement, and all services should be available for me to use."
msgstr ""
"Como in s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda si fidant de mene, e dia "
"dèpere pòdere impreare totu sos servìtzios."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:250
msgid "I have decided to not help the people of the Blackwater mountain settlement."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de no agiudare sa gente de s'insediamentu de su Monte "
"Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_agent:251
msgid "Since I am helping Prim, Harlenn no longer wants to talk to me."
msgstr ""
"Dae chi so agiudende a Prim, Harlenn non cheret prus faeddare cun megus."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_innquest
msgid "Well rested"
msgstr "Bene pasadu"

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_innquest:10
msgid "I talked to the cook in Prim, at the base of Blackwater mountain. There is a back room available for rent, but it is currently rented out to Arghest. I should go talk to Arghest to see whether he still wants to rent the room. The cook pointed me towards the southwest of Prim."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun su coghineri de Prim, a pee de su Monte Abbaniedda. B'at "
"un'aposentu in segus chi si podet afitare, ma pro como est afitadu a "
"Arghest. Dia dèpere andare a faeddare cun Arghest pro bìdere si lu cheret "
"galu. Su coghineri m'at naradu de andare a su sud-ovest de Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_innquest:20
msgid "I talked to Arghest about the back room at the inn. He is still interested in having it as an option to rest at. But he told me he could probably be persuaded to let me use it if I compensate him sufficiently."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Arghest de s'aposentu in segus de sa locanda. Issu est galu "
"interessadu a lu tènnere pro si bi pòdere pasare. Ma m'at naradu chi forsis "
"lu podia cumbìnchere a mi lu lassare impreare si li daia una cumpensa giusta."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_innquest:30
msgid "Arghest wants me to bring him 5 bottles of milk. I can probably find some milk in any of the larger villages."
msgstr ""
"Arghest cheret chi li giuga 5 ampullas de late. Forsis potzo agatare late in "
"cale si siat de sas biddas prus mannas."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_innquest:40
msgid "I have brought the milk to Arghest. He agreed to let me use the back room at the Prim inn. I should be able to rest there now. I should go talk to the cook at the inn."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu su late a Arghest. At atzetadu de mi lassare impreare s'aposentu "
"in segus de sa locanda de Prim. Como bi dia dèpere pòdere pasare. Dia dèpere "
"andare a faeddare cun su coghineri de sa locanda."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_innquest:50
msgid "I have explained to the cook that I have permission by Arghest to use the back room."
msgstr ""
"Apo ispiegadu a su coghineri chi Arghest m'at dadu su permissu de impreare "
"s'aposentu in segus."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt
msgid "Clouded intent"
msgstr "Intentziones annuadas"

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:10
msgid "Just outside the collapsed mine on the way to Blackwater mountain, I met a man from the village of Prim. He begged me to help them."
msgstr ""
"Pròpiu in foras de sa miniera derruta, in su caminu pro su Monte Abbaniedda, "
"apo atopadu un'òmine de sa bidda de Prim. M'at pregadu de los agiudare."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:11
msgid "The village of Prim needs help from someone from the outside to deal with attacks from some monsters. I should speak to Guthbered in Prim if I want to help them."
msgstr ""
"Sa bidda de Prim tenet bisòngiu de agiudu de calicunu de fora pro afrontare "
"sos atacos de unos cantos mostros. Si los chèrgio agiudare, dia dèpere "
"faeddare cun Guthbered in Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:15
msgid "Guthbered can be found in the main hall of Prim. I should look for a stone house in the center of town."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered est in sa sala printzipale de Prim. Dia dèpere chircare una domo "
"de pedra in su tzentru de sa bidda."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:20
msgid "I talked to Guthbered about the story about Prim. Prim has recently been under constant attack from the Blackwater mountain settlement."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Guthbered de s'istòria de Prim. Dae pagu, Prim est semper "
"atacada dae s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:25
msgid "Guthbered wants me to go up to the settlement atop the Blackwater mountain and ask their battle master Harlenn why (or if) they have summoned the gornaud monsters against Prim."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered cheret chi àrtzie a s'insediamentu in sa punta de su Monte "
"Abbaniedda e chi pregunte a su mastru de armas issoro, Harlenn, pro ite (o "
"si) ant tzerriadu sos mostros gornaud contra a Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:30
msgid "I have talked to Harlenn about the attacks on Prim. He denies that the people of the Blackwater mountain settlement have anything to do with them. I should go talk to Guthbered in Prim again."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Harlenn de sos atacos contra a Prim. Issu negat chi sa "
"gente de s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda tèngiat calicuna cosa de "
"bìdere. Dia dèpere torrare a faeddare cun Guthbered in Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:40
msgid "Guthbered still believes that the people in the Blackwater mountain settlement have something to do with the attacks."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered creet galu chi sa gente de s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda "
"tèngiat calicuna cosa de bìdere cun sos atacos."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:50
msgid "Guthbered wants me to go look for any clues that the people of the Blackwater mountain settlement is preparing for a larger attack on Prim. I should go look for hints near Harlenn's private quarters, but make sure not to be seen."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered cheret chi ande a chircare inditos chi sa gente de s'insediamentu "
"de su Monte Abbaniedda siat aprontende un'atacu prus mannu contra a Prim. "
"Dia dèpere chircare inditos acanta de sos aposentos privados de Harlenn, ma "
"bene atentu chi non mi bidant."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:60
msgid "I have found some papers around Harlenn's private quarters outlining a plan to attack Prim. I should go talk to Guthbered immediately."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unos cantos pabiros a inghìriu de sos aposentos privados de "
"Harlenn chi descrient unu pianu pro atacare a Prim. Dia dèpere andare deretu "
"a faeddare cun Guthbered."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:70
msgid "Guthbered thanked me for helping him find evidence of the plans for an attack."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo agiudadu a agatare proas de sos pianos "
"pro un'atacu."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:80
msgid "In order to make the attacks on Prim stop, Guthbered wants me to kill Harlenn up in the Blackwater mountain settlement."
msgstr ""
"Pro fàghere firmare sos atacos contra a Prim, Guthbered cheret chi ochia a "
"Harlenn, in s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:90
msgid "I have started a fight with Harlenn."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu a cumbàtere cun Harlenn."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:91
msgid "I told Harlenn that I was sent to kill him, but I let him live. He thanked me deeply, and left the settlement."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Harlenn chi m'aiant mandadu a l'ochìere, ma l'apo lassadu "
"bìvere. M'at ringratziadu dae coro e si nch'est andadu dae s'insediamentu."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:99
msgid "I have told Guthbered that Harlenn is gone."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Guthbered chi Harlenn non b'est prus."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:100
msgid "Guthbered thanked me for the help I have provided to Prim. Hopefully, the attacks on Prim should stop now. As thanks, Guthbered gave me some items and a forged permit so that I can enter the inner chamber up in the Blackwater mountain settlement."
msgstr ""
"Guthbered m'at ringratziadu pro s'agiudu chi apo dadu a Prim. Isperamus chi "
"como sos atacos contra a Prim si firment. Pro mi ringratziare, Guthbered "
"m'at dadu unos cantos ogetos e unu permissu farsu pro chi potza intrare in "
"s'aposentu internu, in s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:140
msgid "I have shown the forged permit to the guard and was let through to the inner chamber."
msgstr ""
"Apo mustradu su permissu farsu a sa guàrdia e m'at lassadu passare a "
"s'aposentu internu."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:240
msgid "I am now trusted in Prim, and all services should be available for me to use."
msgstr ""
"Como in Prim si fidant de mene, e dia dèpere pòdere impreare totu sos "
"servìtzios."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:250
msgid "I have decided to not help the people of Prim."
msgstr "Apo detzìdidu de no agiudare sa gente de Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:prim_hunt:251
msgid "Since I am helping the Blackwater mountain settlement, Guthbered no longer wants to talk to me."
msgstr ""
"Dae chi so agiudende s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda, Guthbered non "
"cheret prus faeddare cun megus."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul
msgid "Lights in the dark"
msgstr "Lughes in s'iscuru"

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:8
msgid "I have made my way into the inner chamber in the Blackwater mountain settlement and found a group of mages led by a man named Throdna."
msgstr ""
"So resèssidu a intrare in s'aposentu internu de s'insediamentu de su Monte "
"Abbaniedda e apo agatadu unu grupu de magos ghiados dae un'òmine chi si "
"narat Throdna."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:9
msgid "Throdna seems very interested in someone (or something) called Kazaul, and in particular a ritual performed in its name."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi Throdna siat interessadu meda a unu (o a una cosa) chi si narat "
"Kazaul, e in particulare a unu ritu fatu in nòmine suo."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:10
msgid "I have agreed to help Throdna find out more about the ritual itself, by looking for pieces of the ritual that apparently are scattered across the mountain. I should go look for the parts of the Kazaul ritual on the mountain path down from Blackwater mountain to Prim."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Throdna a nde ischire de prus subra de su ritu "
"etotu, chirchende sos bìculos de su ritu chi, a su chi paret, sunt "
"isparghinados in su monte. Dia dèpere andare a chircare sas partes de su "
"ritu de Kazaul in su caminu de monte chi dae su Monte Abbaniedda falat a "
"Prim."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:11
msgid "I need to find the two parts of the chant and the three pieces describing the ritual itself, and return to Throdna once I have found them all."
msgstr ""
"Depo agatare sas duas partes de su cantu e sos tres bìculos chi descrient su "
"ritu etotu, e torrare a Throdna cando los apo agatados totu."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:21
msgid "I have found the first half of the chant for the Kazaul ritual."
msgstr "Apo agatadu sa prima metade de su cantu pro su ritu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:22
msgid "I have found the second half of the chant for the Kazaul ritual."
msgstr "Apo agatadu sa segunda metade de su cantu pro su ritu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:25
msgid "I have found the first piece of the Kazaul ritual."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su primu bìculu de su ritu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:26
msgid "I have found the second piece of the Kazaul ritual."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su segundu bìculu de su ritu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:27
msgid "I have found the third piece of the Kazaul ritual."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su tertzu bìculu de su ritu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:30
msgid "Throdna thanked me for finding all the pieces of the ritual."
msgstr "Throdna m'at ringratziadu pro àere agatadu totu sos bìculos de su ritu."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:40
msgid "Throdna wants me to put an end to the Kazaul spawn uprising that has taken place near the Blackwater mountain. There is a shrine at the base of the mountain that i should investigate closer."
msgstr ""
"Throdna cheret chi pòngia fine a s'abbolotu de sas crias de Kazaul chi b'est "
"istadu acanta de su Monte Abbaniedda. B'at unu santuàriu a pee de su monte "
"chi dia dèpere abbaidare dae prus a probe."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:41
msgid "I have been given a vial of purifying spirit that Throdna wants me to apply to the shrine of Kazaul. I should return to Throdna when I have found and purified the shrine."
msgstr ""
"M'ant dadu una fiala de ispìritu chi purìficat chi Throdna cheret chi ghete "
"subra de su santuàriu de Kazaul. Dia dèpere torrare a Throdna cando apo a "
"àere agatadu e purificadu su santuàriu."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:50
msgid "In the shrine at the base of Blackwater mountain, I met a guardian of Kazaul. By reciting the verses of the ritual chant, I was able to make the guardian attack me."
msgstr ""
"In su santuàriu a pee de su Monte Abbaniedda, apo atopadu unu guardianu de "
"Kazaul. Retzitende sos versos de su cantu de su ritu, so resèssidu a fàghere "
"chi su guardianu m'atacaret."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:60
msgid "I have purified the shrine of Kazaul."
msgstr "Apo purificadu su santuàriu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v069.json:kazaul:100
msgid "I had expected some form of appreciation from Throdna for helping him learn more about the ritual and for purifying the shrine. But he seemed more occupied with rambling on about Kazaul. I could not make out anything sane from his ramblings."
msgstr ""
"M'isetaia chi Throdna mi esseret ringratziadu in calicuna manera pro l'àere "
"agiudadu a nde ischire de prus subra de su ritu e pro àere purificadu su "
"santuàriu. Ma pariat prus ocupadu a sighire a faeddare chene sentidu de "
"Kazaul. Non so resèssidu a cumprèndere nudda de sàbiu in su chi naraiat."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_wyrms
msgid "No weakness"
msgstr "Peruna debilesa"

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_wyrms:10
msgid "Herec on the second level of the Blackwater mountain settlement is researching the white wyrms outside the settlement. He wants me to bring him 5 white wyrm claws so that he can continue his research. Apparently, only some of the wyrms have these claws. I will have to kill some to find them."
msgstr ""
"Herec, in su segundu pianu de s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda, est "
"istudiende sos wyrm biancos chi sunt in foras de s'insediamentu. Cheret chi "
"li giuga 5 ungras de wyrm biancu pro pòdere sighire sas chircas suas. A su "
"chi paret, petzi unos cantos wyrm tenent custas ungras. Nd'apo a dèpere "
"ochìere unos cantos pro las agatare."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_wyrms:20
msgid "I have given the 5 white wyrm claws to Herec."
msgstr "Apo dadu sas 5 ungras de wyrm biancu a Herec."

#: questlist_v069.json:bwm_wyrms:30
msgid "Herec has finished making a potion of fatigue restoration that will be very useful when fighting against the wyrms in the future."
msgstr ""
"Herec at acabbadu de fàghere una potzione pro s'istrachidùdine chi m'at a "
"èssere ùtile meda cando apo a cumbàtere contra a sos wyrm in su tempus "
"benidore."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave
msgid "Awoken from slumber"
msgstr "Ischidadu dae su sonnu"

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:10
msgid "Bjorgur in Prim at the base of the Blackwater mountain thinks that something has disturbed the grave of his parents, to the southwest of Prim, just outside the Elm mine."
msgstr ""
"Bjorgur, in Prim, a pee de su Monte Abbaniedda, pensat chi calicuna cosa "
"apat istorbadu sa tumba de sos genitores suos, a su sud-ovest de Prim, "
"pròpiu in foras de sa miniera de Elm."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:15
msgid "Bjorgur wants me to go check the grave, and make sure his family's dagger is still secure in the tomb."
msgstr ""
"Bjorgur cheret chi ande a controllare sa tumba e chi mi assegure chi su "
"pugnale de sa famìlia sua siat galu in logu seguru in sa tumba."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:20
msgid "Fulus in Prim is interested in obtaining Bjorgur's family dagger that Bjorgur's grandfather used to possess."
msgstr ""
"Fulus, in Prim, est interessadu a otènnere su pugnale de sa famìlia de "
"Bjorgur, chi una borta fiat de su giaju de Bjorgur."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:30
msgid "I met a man that wielded a strange looking dagger in the lower parts of a tomb to the southwest of Prim. He must have robbed this dagger from the grave."
msgstr ""
"In sas partes bassas de una tumba a su sud-ovest de Prim, apo atopadu "
"un'òmine chi giughiat in manu unu pugnale de aspetu istranu. Depet àere "
"furadu custu pugnale dae sa tumba."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:40
msgid "I placed the dagger back into its place in the tomb. The restless undead seem much less restless now, strangely enough."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a pònnere su pugnale in su logu suo in sa tumba. Est istranu, ma "
"sos non-mortos inchietos como parent meda prus pagu inchietos."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:50
msgid "Bjorgur thanked me for my assistance. He told me I should also seek his relatives in Feygard."
msgstr ""
"Bjorgur m'at ringratziadu pro s'agiudu. M'at naradu chi dia dèpere chircare "
"fintzas sos parentes suos in Feygard."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:51
msgid "I have told Fulus that I helped Bjorgur return his family dagger to its original place."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Fulus chi apo agiudadu a Bjorgur a torrare su pugnale de sa "
"famìlia a su logu suo originale."

#: questlist_v069.json:bjorgur_grave:60
msgid "I have given Bjorgur's family dagger to Fulus. He thanked me for bringing it to him, and rewarded me handsomely."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu su pugnale de sa famìlia de Bjorgur a Fulus. M'at ringratziadu ca "
"bi l'apo batidu, e m'at pagadu bene meda."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith
msgid "Deep wound"
msgstr "Ferida funguda"

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:10
msgid "Just northeast of Crossglen village, I met Erinith that has set up camp. Apparently, he was attacked during the night and lost a book."
msgstr ""
"Pròpiu a nord-est de sa bidda de Crossglen, apo atopadu a Erinith, chi at "
"postu unu campamentu. A su chi paret, l'ant atacadu in su note e at pèrdidu "
"unu libru."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:20
msgid "I have agreed to help Erinith find his book. He told me he threw it among some trees to the north of his camp."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Erinith a agatare su libru suo. M'at naradu chi "
"l'at ghetadu in mesu de unas cantas àrbores a nord de su campamentu suo."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:21
msgid "I have agreed to help Erinith find his book in return for 200 gold. He told me he threw it among some trees to the north of his camp."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Erinith a agatare su libru suo in càmbiu de 200 "
"monedas de oro. M'at naradu chi l'at ghetadu in mesu de unas cantas àrbores "
"a nord de su campamentu suo."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:30
msgid "I have returned the book to Erinith."
msgstr "Apo torradu su libru a Erinith."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:31
msgid "He also needs help with his wound that doesn't seem to be healing. Either I should bring him one potion of major health, or four regular potions of health."
msgstr ""
"Tenet bisòngiu de agiudu fintzas pro sa ferida sua, chi non paret chi siat "
"sanende. Li dia dèpere giùghere una potzione de salude majore, o bator "
"potziones de salude normales."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:40
msgid "I gave Erinith a bonemeal potion to heal his wound. He was a bit scared to use it since they are prohibited by Lord Geomyr."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Erinith una potzione de farina de ossos pro li sanare sa ferida. "
"Teniat unu pagu de timòria de l'impreare, ca sunt proibidas dae Lord Geomyr."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:41
msgid "I gave Erinith a potion of a major health to heal his wound."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Erinith una potzione de salude majore pro li sanare sa ferida."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:42
msgid "I gave Erinith four regular potions of health to heal his wound."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Erinith bator potziones de salude normales pro li sanare sa "
"ferida."

#: questlist_v0610.json:erinith:50
msgid "The wound healed completely and Erinith thanked me for all the help."
msgstr ""
"Sa ferida est sanada de su totu e Erinith m'at ringratziadu pro totu "
"s'agiudu."

#: questlist_v0610.json:hadracor
msgid "Devastated land"
msgstr "Terra devastada"

#: questlist_v0610.json:hadracor:10
msgid "On the road to Carn Tower, west of the Crossroads guardhouse, I met a group of woodcutters led by Hadracor. Hadracor wants me to help him get revenge on some wasps that were attacking them while they were cutting down the forest. To help them get revenge, I should look for giant wasps near their encampment and bring him at least five giant wasp wings."
msgstr ""
"In s'àndala chi andat a sa Turre de Carn, a otzidente de su corpu de guàrdia "
"de sa Rugrada, apo atopadu unu grupu de linnadores ghiados dae Hadracor. "
"Hadracor cheret chi l'agiude a si vindicare de unas cantas bespes chi los "
"atacaiant mentras fiant seghende su padente. Pro los agiudare a si "
"vindicare, dia dèpere chircare bespes gigantes acanta de su campamentu "
"issoro e li giùghere a su mancu chimbe alas de bespe gigante."

#: questlist_v0610.json:hadracor:20
msgid "I have brought five giant wasp wings to Hadracor."
msgstr "Apo batidu chimbe alas de bespe gigante a Hadracor."

#: questlist_v0610.json:hadracor:21
msgid "I have brought six giant wasp wings to Hadracor. For helping him, he gave me a pair of gloves."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu ses alas de bespe gigante a Hadracor. Pro l'àere agiudadu, m'at "
"dadu unu pàgiu de guantes."

#: questlist_v0610.json:hadracor:30
msgid "Hadracor thanked me for helping him and the other woodcutters get revenge on the wasps. In return, he offered me to trade for some of his items."
msgstr ""
"Hadracor m'at ringratziadu pro àere agiudadu a issu e a sos àteros "
"linnadores a si vindicare de sas bespes. In càmbiu, m'at ofertu de fàghere "
"cummèrtziu cun issu pro unos cantos de sos ogetos suos."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn
msgid "Lost sheep"
msgstr "Berbeghes pèrdidas"

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:10
msgid "On the road to Feygard, near the Feygard bridge, I met a shepherd named Tinlyn. Tinlyn told me that four of his sheep have wandered away and that he won't dare leave the remaining sheep to go look for them."
msgstr ""
"In s'àndala pro Feygard, acanta de su ponte de Feygard, apo atopadu unu "
"pastore chi si narat Tinlyn. Tinlyn m'at naradu chi bator berbeghes suas si "
"nche sunt andadas e chi non tenet su coràgiu de lassare sas berbeghes chi li "
"sunt abarradas pro las andare a chircare."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:15
msgid "I have agreed to help Tinlyn find his four lost sheep."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Tinlyn a agatare sas bator berbeghes pèrdidas "
"suas."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:20
#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:21
#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:22
#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:23
msgid "I have found one of Tinlyn's lost sheep."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una de sas berbeghes pèrdidas de Tinlyn."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:25
msgid "I have found all four of Tinlyn's lost sheep."
msgstr "Apo agatadu totu sas bator berbeghes pèrdidas de Tinlyn."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:30
msgid "Tinlyn thanked me for finding his lost sheep."
msgstr "Tinlyn m'at ringratziadu pro àere agatadu sas berbeghes pèrdidas suas."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:31
msgid "Tinlyn thanked me for finding his lost sheep, but he had no reward to give me."
msgstr ""
"Tinlyn m'at ringratziadu pro àere agatadu sas berbeghes pèrdidas suas, ma no "
"aiat perunu prèmiu de mi dare."

#: questlist_v0610.json:tinlyn:60
msgid "I have attacked at least one of Tinlyn's lost sheep and I am therefore unable to return them all to Tinlyn."
msgstr ""
"Apo atacadu a su mancu una de sas berbeghes pèrdidas de Tinlyn e duncas non "
"las potzo torrare totu a Tinlyn."

#: questlist_v0610.json:benbyr
msgid "Cheap cuts"
msgstr "Bìculos a pagu prètziu"

#: questlist_v0610.json:benbyr:10
msgid "I have met Benbyr outside the Crossroads guardhouse. He wants to get revenge on an old 'business partner' of his - Tinlyn. Benbyr wants me to kill all Tinlyn's sheep."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Benbyr in foras de su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada. Si "
"cheret vindicare de unu 'sòtziu de afàrios' suo de unu tempus: Tinlyn. "
"Benbyr cheret chi ochia totu sas berbeghes de Tinlyn."

#: questlist_v0610.json:benbyr:20
msgid "I have agreed to help Benbyr find Tinlyn's sheep and kill all eight of them. I should go look for them in the fields northwest of the Crossroads guardhouse."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Benbyr a agatare sas berbeghes de Tinlyn e a las "
"ochìere totu sas oto. Dia dèpere andare a las chircare in sos campos a nord-"
"ovest de su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada."

#: questlist_v0610.json:benbyr:21
msgid "I have started attacking the sheep. I should return to Benbyr once I have killed all eight of them."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu a atacare sas berbeghes. Dia dèpere torrare a Benbyr cando "
"las apo a àere ochidas totu sas oto."

#: questlist_v0610.json:benbyr:30
msgid "Benbyr was thrilled to hear that all of Tinlyn's sheep are dead."
msgstr ""
"Benbyr fiat cuntentu meda de ischire chi totu sas berbeghes de Tinlyn sunt "
"mortas."

#: questlist_v0610.json:benbyr:60
msgid "I declined to help Benbyr kill the sheep."
msgstr "Apo refudadu de agiudare a Benbyr a ochìere sas berbeghes."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn
msgid "The path is clear to me"
msgstr "Su caminu est craru pro mene"

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:10
msgid "Minarra up in the tower at the Crossroads guardhouse has seen a band of rogues heading west from the guardhouse, towards Carn Tower. Minarra was sure they matched the description of some men whose heads have a bounty on them from the Feygard patrol. If these are the men that Minarra thinks, they are supposedly led by particularly ruthless savage named Rogorn."
msgstr ""
"Minarra, in sa turre de su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada, at bidu una banda "
"de malandrinos andende a otzidente dae su corpu de guàrdia, cara a sa Turre "
"de Carn. Minarra fiat segura chi currispondiant a sa descritzione de unos "
"cantos òmines chi sa patrùllia de Feygard at postu unu prètziu a sa conca "
"issoro. Si sunt sos òmines chi pensat Minarra, a su chi narant los ghiat unu "
"bandidu chi non tenet piedade peruna, chi si narat Rogorn."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:20
msgid "I am helping Minarra find the band of rogues. I should travel the road west from the Crossroads guardhouse towards Carn Tower and look for them. They have supposedly stolen three pieces of a valuable painting and are wanted dead for their crimes."
msgstr ""
"So agiudende a Minarra a agatare sa banda de malandrinos. Dia dèpere "
"biagiare in s'àndala chi andat a otzidente dae su corpu de guàrdia de sa "
"Rugrada, cara a sa Turre de Carn, e los chircare. A su chi narant, ant "
"furadu tres cantos de una pintura de valore e los cherent mortos pro sos "
"crìmines issoro."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:21
msgid "Minarra also tells me that I should not trust anything I hear from them. In particular, anything from Rogorn should be viewed with great suspicion."
msgstr ""
"Minarra mi narat fintzas chi non mi dia dèpere fidare de nudda de su chi apo "
"a intèndere dae issos. In particulare, cale si siat cosa chi narat Rogorn la "
"depo cunsiderare cun meda suspetu."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:30
msgid "I have found the band of rogues on the road west towards Carn Tower, led by Rogorn."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sa banda de malandrinos, ghiada dae Rogorn, in s'àndala chi "
"andat a otzidente cara a sa Turre de Carn."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:35
msgid "Rogorn tells me that they are wrongly accused of murder and theft in Feygard, while they themselves have never even been to Feygard."
msgstr ""
"Rogorn mi narat chi los acusant a tortu de àere mortu e furadu in Feygard, "
"mentras issos non sunt mancu mai istados in Feygard."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:40
msgid "I have decided to attack Rogorn and his band of rogues. I should return to Minarra with the three pieces of the painting once they are dead."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de atacare a Rogorn e a sa banda sua de malandrinos. Cando ant "
"a èssere mortos, dia dèpere torrare a Minarra cun sos tres cantos de sa "
"pintura."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:45
msgid "I have decided not to attack Rogorn and his band of rogues, but instead report back to Minarra that she must have mistaken the men she saw for someone else."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de no atacare a Rogorn e a sa banda sua de malandrinos, ma de "
"torrare a nàrrere a Minarra chi depet àere confusu sos òmines chi at bidu "
"cun àtera gente."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:50
msgid "Minarra thanked me for dealing with the thieves, and told me that my services to Feygard will be appreciated."
msgstr ""
"Minarra m'at ringratziadu pro m'èssere ocupadu de sos ladros, e m'at naradu "
"chi Feygard at a apretziare sos servìtzios mios."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:55
msgid "After telling Minarra that she must have mistaken the men for someone else, she seemed a bit suspicious, but thanked me for helping her look into the matter."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo naradu a Minarra chi depet àere confusu sos òmines cun "
"àtera gente, pariat unu pagu suspetosa, ma m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere "
"agiudada a investigare sa chistione."

#: questlist_v0610.json:rogorn:60
msgid "I have helped Minarra with her task."
msgstr "Apo agiudadu a Minarra in s'incàrrigu suo."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment
msgid "Feygard errands"
msgstr "Incàrrigos pro Feygard"

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:10
msgid "I met Gandoren, the guard captain at the Crossroads guardhouse. He told me about some trouble up in Loneford, that have forced the guards to be even more alert than usual. Because of this, they can't do their regular errands themselves but need help with some basic things."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Gandoren, su capitanu de sas guàrdias de su corpu de guàrdia "
"de sa Rugrada. M'at contadu de unos problemas in Loneford chi ant obligadu "
"sas guàrdias a èssere galu prus atentas de su sòlitu. Pro custu, non podent "
"fàghere sos incàrrigos ordinàrios issoro e tenent bisòngiu de agiudu pro "
"unas cantas cosas de base."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:20
msgid "Gandoren wants me to help him transport a shipment of 10 iron swords to another guard post to the south."
msgstr ""
"Gandoren cheret chi l'agiude a trasportare una cunsigna de 10 ispadas de "
"ferru a un'àteru postu de guàrdia a su sud."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:21
msgid "I have agreed to help Gandoren transport the shipment, as a service for Feygard."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Gandoren a trasportare sa cunsigna, comente "
"servìtziu pro Feygard."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:22
msgid "I have grudgingly agreed to help Gandoren transport the shipment."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu, de mala gana, de agiudare a Gandoren a trasportare sa cunsigna."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:25
msgid "I should deliver the shipment to the Feygard patrol captain stationed in the Foaming Flask tavern."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere giùghere sa cunsigna a su capitanu de sa patrùllia de Feygard, "
"chi est in su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:26
msgid "Gandoren tells me that Ailshara has expressed some interest in the Feygard shipments, and urges me to stay away from her."
msgstr ""
"Gandoren mi narat chi Ailshara at mustradu unu tzertu interessu pro sas "
"cunsignas de Feygard, e mi pregat de abarrare a tesu dae issa."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:30
msgid "Ailshara is indeed interested in the shipment, and wants me to help Nor City with the supplies instead."
msgstr ""
"Ailshara est a beru interessada a sa cunsigna, e cheret chi imbetzes agiude "
"a Nor City cun sas provistas."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:35
msgid "If I want to help Ailshara and Nor City, I should deliver the shipment to the smith in Vilegard instead."
msgstr ""
"Si chèrgio agiudare a Ailshara e a Nor City, imbetzes dia dèpere giùghere sa "
"cunsigna a su ferreri de Vilegard."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:50
msgid "I have delivered the shipment to the Feygard patrol captain in the Foaming Flask tavern. I should go tell Gandoren in the Crossroads guardhouse that the shipment is delivered."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sa cunsigna a su capitanu de sa patrùllia de Feygard in su "
"tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu. Dia dèpere andare a nàrrere a Gandoren, in "
"su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada, chi sa cunsigna est arribada."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:55
msgid "I have delivered the shipment to the smith in Vilegard."
msgstr "Apo batidu sa cunsigna a su ferreri de Vilegard."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:56
msgid "The Vilegard smith gave me a shipment of degraded items that I should deliver to the Feygard patrol captain in the Foaming Flask tavern instead of the normal ones."
msgstr ""
"Su ferreri de Vilegard m'at dadu una cunsigna de ogetos gastados chi dia "
"dèpere giùghere a su capitanu de sa patrùllia de Feygard, in su tzilleri de "
"su Fiascu Ispumosu, in logu de sos normales."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:60
msgid "I have delivered the shipment of degraded items to the Feygard patrol captain in the Foaming Flask tavern. I should go tell Gandoren in the Crossroads guardhouse that the shipment is delivered."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sa cunsigna de ogetos gastados a su capitanu de sa patrùllia de "
"Feygard in su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu. Dia dèpere andare a nàrrere a "
"Gandoren, in su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada, chi sa cunsigna est arribada."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:80
msgid "Gandoren thanked me for helping him deliver the shipment."
msgstr "Gandoren m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo agiudadu a giùghere sa cunsigna."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:81
msgid "Gandoren thanked me for helping him deliver the shipment. He never suspected anything. I should also report back to Ailshara."
msgstr ""
"Gandoren m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo agiudadu a giùghere sa cunsigna. No at "
"mai suspetadu nudda. Dia dèpere andare a contare totu fintzas a Ailshara."

#: questlist_v0610.json:feygard_shipment:82
msgid "I have reported back to Ailshara."
msgstr "Apo contadu totu a Ailshara."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford
msgid "Flows through the veins"
msgstr "Curret in sas venas"

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:10
msgid "I heard a story about Loneford. Apparently, a lot of people have become ill there recently, and some have even died. The cause is still unknown."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu un'istòria subra de Loneford. A su chi paret, in cue dae pagu "
"meda gente s'est ammalaidada, e unos cantos sunt fintzas mortos. Sa càusa no "
"est galu connota."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:11
msgid "I should investigate what could have caused the people of Loneford to become ill. To gather clues, I should ask the citizens of Loneford and the surrounding areas about what they think is the cause."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere investigare subra de ite podet àere fatu ammalaidare sa gente de "
"Loneford. Pro regòllere inditos, dia dèpere preguntare a sos tzitadinos de "
"Loneford e de sas àreas a inghìriu ite pensant chi siat sa càusa."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:21
msgid "The guards in the Crossroads guardhouse are certain that the illness in Loneford is caused by some sabotage done by the priests or people from Nor City."
msgstr ""
"Sas guàrdias de su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada sunt seguras chi sa "
"maladia de Loneford siat causada dae unu sabotàgiu fatu dae sos preìderos o "
"dae gente de Nor City."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:22
msgid "Some villagers in Loneford believe that the illness is caused by the guards from Feygard, in some scheme to make the people suffer even more than they already have."
msgstr ""
"Unos cantos biddajos de Loneford creent chi sa maladia l'ant causada sas "
"guàrdias de Feygard, cun calicunu pianu pro fàghere patire sa gente galu de "
"prus de cantu at giai patidu."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:23
msgid "Talion, the chapel priest in Loneford, thinks that the illness is the work of the Shadow, as punishment for Loneford's lack of devotion to the Shadow."
msgstr ""
"Talion, su preìderu de sa cresiedda de Loneford, pensat chi sa maladia siat "
"òpera de s'Umbra, comente punitzione pro sa pagu devotzione de Loneford a "
"s'Umbra."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:24
msgid "Taevinn in Loneford is certain that Sienn in the southeast barn has something to do with the illness. Apparently, Sienn keeps a pet around that has approached Taevinn in a threatening manner several times."
msgstr ""
"Taevinn, in Loneford, est seguru chi Sienn, in s'istalla de su sud-est, "
"tèngiat calicuna cosa de bìdere cun sa maladia. A su chi paret, Sienn tenet "
"un'animale chi s'est acurtziadu a Taevinn in manera minetzosa prus de una "
"borta."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:25
msgid "I should go see Landa in the Loneford tavern. Rumor has it that he saw something that he doesn't dare tell anyone."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere andare a bìdere a Landa in su tzilleri de Loneford. Si narat chi "
"at bidu una cosa chi no at su coràgiu de contare a nemos."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:30
msgid "Landa confused me with someone else at first. He apparently saw a boy doing something around the town well during the night before the illness started. He was scared to talk to me at first since he thought I looked like the boy he had seen. Could it have been Andor that he saw?"
msgstr ""
"A su cumintzu Landa m'at confusu cun un'àtera persone. A su chi paret, at "
"bidu unu pitzocu chi fiat faghende calicuna cosa a inghìriu de su putzu de "
"sa bidda su note in antis chi cumintzaret sa maladia. A su cumintzu teniat "
"timòria de faeddare cun megus ca pensaiat chi assimigiaia a su pitzocu chi "
"aiat bidu. Diat pòdere èssere istadu Andor su chi at bidu?"

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:31
msgid "Also, the night after he saw the boy at the well, he saw Buceth taking samples of the water in the well. Strangely enough, Buceth has not gotten ill like the others in the village."
msgstr ""
"E in prus, su note a pustis de àere bidu su pitzocu acanta de su putzu, at "
"bidu a Buceth leende mustras de s'abba de su putzu. Est istranu, ma Buceth "
"non s'est ammalaidadu comente sos àteros de sa bidda."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:35
msgid "I should go question Buceth at the Loneford chapel about what he was doing at the well, and about whether he knows anything about Andor."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere andare a preguntare a Buceth, in sa cresiedda de Loneford, ite "
"fiat faghende acanta de su putzu, e si ischit calicuna cosa de Andor."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:41
msgid "I have bribed Buceth into talking to me."
msgstr "Apo corrùmpidu a Buceth pro chi faeddaret cun megus."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:42
msgid "I have told Buceth that I am ready to follow the Shadow."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Buceth chi so prontu a sighire s'Umbra."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:45
msgid "Buceth tells me that he is assigned by the priests in Nor City to make sure the Shadow casts its glow over Loneford. Apparently, the priests had sent a boy to do some business in Loneford, and Buceth was tasked with gathering some samples from the water well."
msgstr ""
"Buceth mi narat chi sos preìderos de Nor City l'ant incarrigadu de fàghere "
"in modu chi s'Umbra ghetet su lugore suo subra de Loneford. A su chi paret, "
"sos preìderos aiant mandadu unu pitzocu a fàghere unos cantos afàrios in "
"Loneford, e a Buceth l'aiant incarrigadu de regòllere unas cantas mustras de "
"s'abba de su putzu."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:50
msgid "I have attacked Buceth. I should bring any evidence that Buceth has on him to Kuldan, the guard captain in the longhouse in Loneford."
msgstr ""
"Apo atacadu a Buceth. Dia dèpere giùghere cale si siat proa chi Buceth "
"giughet in subra a Kuldan, su capitanu de sas guàrdias, in sa domo longa de "
"Loneford."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:54
msgid "I have given the vial that Buceth had on him to Kuldan, the guard captain in Loneford."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Kuldan, su capitanu de sas guàrdias de Loneford, sa fiala chi "
"Buceth giughiat in subra."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:55
msgid "Kuldan thanked me for solving the mystery of the illness in Loneford. They will start bringing in water with help from Feygard instead of drinking from the well from now on. Kuldan also told me to visit the castle steward in Feygard if I want to help further."
msgstr ""
"Kuldan m'at ringratziadu pro àere iscobertu su misteru de sa maladia de "
"Loneford. Dae como in antis ant a cumintzare a giùghere abba cun s'agiudu de "
"Feygard, imbetzes de bufare dae su putzu. Kuldan m'at naradu fintzas de "
"andare a bìdere a s'intendente de su casteddu de Feygard si chèrgio agiudare "
"galu."

#: questlist_v0610.json:loneford:60
msgid "I have promised to keep Buceth's story a secret. If Andor was indeed here, he must have had a good reason for doing what he did. Buceth also told me to visit the chapel custodian in Nor City if I want to learn more about the Shadow."
msgstr ""
"Apo promìtidu de mantènnere segreta s'istòria de Buceth. Si Andor est istadu "
"a beru inoghe, depet àere àpidu una bona resone pro fàghere su chi at fatu. "
"Buceth m'at naradu fintzas de andare a bìdere su custode de sa cresiedda de "
"Nor City si chèrgio ischire de prus subra de s'Umbra."

#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin
msgid "Bits and pieces"
msgstr "Bìculos e biculeddos"

#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:20
msgid "In a cave to the east, I found a man called Thorin, that wants me to help him find the remains of his former travelling companions. I should find the remains of all six of them and return them to him."
msgstr ""
"In una gruta a oriente, apo agatadu un'òmine chi si narat Thorin, chi cheret "
"chi l'agiude a agatare sos restos de sos chi biagiaiant cun issu una borta. "
"Dia dèpere agatare sos restos de totu sos ses e bi los torrare."

#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:31
#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:32
#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:33
#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:34
#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:35
#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:36
msgid "I have found some skeletal remains in the same cave that I met Thorin in."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unos cantos restos de ischèletros in sa matessi gruta in ue apo "
"atopadu a Thorin."

#: questlist_v0611.json:thorin:40
msgid "Thorin thanked me for helping him. In return, he has allowed me to use his bed to rest, and is willing to sell me some of his potions."
msgstr ""
"Thorin m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere agiudadu. In càmbiu, m'at permìtidu de "
"impreare su letu suo pro mi pasare, e est dispostu a mi bèndere unas cantas "
"de sas potziones suas."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror
msgid "Of mice and men"
msgstr "De sòrighes e de òmines"

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:10
msgid "In a lonely house on a peninsula at the northern shore of lake Laeroth up in the mountains to the north-east, I met a woman called Algangror."
msgstr ""
"In una domo isolada subra de una penìsula, in s'oru nord de su Lagu Laeroth, "
"in sos montes a nord-est, apo atopadu una fèmina chi si narat Algangror."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:11
msgid "She has a rodent problem and needs help dealing with some of them that she has trapped in her basement."
msgstr ""
"Tenet unu problema de sòrighes e tenet bisòngiu de agiudu pro si nde "
"liberare de unos cantos chi at serradu in sa cantina sua."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:15
msgid "I have agreed to help Algangror deal with her rodent problem. I should return to her when I have killed all six rodents in her basement."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Algangror a risòlvere su problema suo de "
"sòrighes. Dia dèpere torrare a issa cando apo a àere ochidu totu sos ses "
"sòrighes de sa cantina sua."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:20
msgid "Algangror thanked me for helping her with her problem."
msgstr "Algangror m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere agiudada cun su problema suo."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:21
msgid "She also told me not to talk to anyone in Remgard about her whereabouts. Apparently, they are looking for her for some reason that she would not say. Under no circumstances should I tell anyone where she is."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu fintzas de non faeddare cun nemos in Remgard de ue est issa. A "
"su chi paret, la sunt chirchende pro una resone chi no at chertu nàrrere. "
"Non depo nàrrere a nemos in ue est, in perunu casu."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:100
msgid "I will not help Algangror with her task."
msgstr "No apo a agiudare a Algangror in s'incàrrigu suo."

#: questlist_v0611.json:algangror:101
msgid "Algangror won't talk to me, and I will be unable to help her with her task."
msgstr ""
"Algangror non cheret faeddare cun megus, e no l'apo a pòdere agiudare in "
"s'incàrrigu suo."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae
msgid "An involuntary carrier"
msgstr "Unu portadore chene lu chèrrere"

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:10
msgid "On the road between Loneford and Brimhaven, I found a dried up lake-bed with a major cavern below. Deep inside the cavern, I met Ulirfendor - a priest of the Shadow from Brimhaven. Ulirfendor is trying to translate the inscriptions on a shrine of Kazaul, and has determined that it speaks of the 'Dark protector', but he is unsure what that refers to. Whatever it means, he is determined that it must be stopped."
msgstr ""
"In s'àndala intre Loneford e Brimhaven, apo agatadu su letu sicu de unu lagu "
"cun una gruta manna in suta. In fundu a sa gruta, apo atopadu a Ulirfendor, "
"unu preìderu de s'Umbra de Brimhaven. Ulirfendor est chirchende de tradùere "
"sas iscritziones de unu santuàriu de Kazaul, e at cumprèndidu chi faeddant "
"de su 'Protetore iscuru', ma no est seguru de a ite si referint. Cale si "
"siat cosa chi siat, est detzìdidu: depet èssere firmadu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:11
msgid "Ulirfendor needs help with figuring out what some of the missing parts on the shrine says. The inscription reads 'Kulauil hamar urum Kazaul'te', but the next parts have been completely eroded from the rock."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor tenet bisòngiu de agiudu pro cumprèndere ite narant unas cantas "
"de sas partes chi mancant in su santuàriu. S'iscritzione narat 'Kulauil "
"hamar urum Kazaul'te', ma sas partes chi sighint sunt istadas cantzelladas "
"de su totu dae sa roca."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:15
msgid "I have agreed to help Ulirfendor find out what the missing parts of the inscription might be. Ulirfendor believes the shrine speaks of a powerful creature that lives deeper inside the dungeon. Maybe that could provide some clue as to what the missing parts are."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Ulirfendor a ischire ite podent èssere sas partes "
"chi mancant in s'iscritzione. Ulirfendor creet chi su santuàriu faeddet de "
"una creadura poderosa chi bivet prus a fundu in sas grutas. Forsis custu "
"podet dare calicunu inditu subra de sas partes chi mancant."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:20
msgid "Deep inside the dungeon, I encountered a radiant guardian, guarding some other being. The guardian uttered the phrases 'Kulauil hamar urum Kazaul'te. Kazaul hamat urul'. This must be what Ulirfendor was looking for. I should return to him at once."
msgstr ""
"In fundu a sas grutas, apo atopadu unu guardianu lughente, chi amparaiat "
"un'àteru èssere. Su guardianu at naradu sas frases 'Kulauil hamar urum "
"Kazaul'te. Kazaul hamat urul'. Custu depet èssere su chi fiat chirchende "
"Ulirfendor. Dia dèpere torrare deretu a issu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:21
msgid "I tried to attack the guardian, but was unable to even reach it. Some powerful force held me back. Maybe Ulirfendor knows more."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de atacare su guardianu, ma no apo mancu pòdidu lòmpere a issu. "
"Una fortza poderosa mi trateniat. Forsis Ulirfendor nde ischit de prus."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:30
msgid "Ulirfendor was very pleased to hear that I uncovered the missing parts of the inscription."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor fiat cuntentu meda de ischire chi apo iscobertu sas partes chi "
"mancaiant in s'iscritzione."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:32
msgid "He also told me the continuation of the inscription, but did not know what it means. I should go back to the guardian and speak the words that Ulirfendor told me."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu fintzas comente sighit s'iscritzione, ma no ischiat ite cheret "
"nàrrere. Dia dèpere torrare a su guardianu e li nàrrere sas paràulas chi "
"m'at naradu Ulirfendor."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:42
msgid "I have spoken the words to the guardian."
msgstr "Apo naradu sas paràulas a su guardianu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:45
msgid "The guardian gave off a chilling laughter, and started attacking me."
msgstr ""
"Su guardianu at fatu unu risu chi faghiat ghelare su sàmbene, e at "
"cumintzadu a m'atacare."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:50
msgid "I defeated the guardian and reached the lich 'Toszylae'. The lich managed to infect me with something. I must kill the lich and return to Ulirfendor."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu su guardianu e so lòmpidu a su lich 'Toszylae'. Su lich est "
"resèssidu a m'infetare cun calicuna cosa. Depo ochìere su lich e torrare a "
"Ulirfendor."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:60
msgid "Ulirfendor told me that he had managed to translate the parts of the inscription that I told the guardian. Apparently, what I told the guardian roughly means 'My body for Kazaul'. Ulirfendor was very concerned about what this means for me, and was very regretful that he had made me speak the words."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor m'at naradu chi fiat resèssidu a tradùere sas partes de "
"s'iscritzione chi apo naradu a su guardianu. A su chi paret, su chi apo "
"naradu a su guardianu cheret nàrrere, prus o mancu, 'Su corpus meu pro "
"Kazaul'. Ulirfendor fiat preocupadu meda pro su chi custu podet significare "
"pro mene, e fiat pentidu meda de m'àere fatu nàrrere cussas paràulas."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:toszylae:70
msgid "Ulirfendor was very happy to hear that I managed to defeat the lich. With the lich defeated, the people in the surrounding areas should be safe now."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor fiat cuntentu meda de ischire chi so resèssidu a bìnchere su "
"lich. Como chi su lich est bintu, sa gente de sas àreas a inghìriu diat "
"dèpere èssere segura."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector
msgid "The dark protector"
msgstr "Su protetore iscuru"

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:10
msgid "I have found a strange looking helmet from the lich 'Toszylae' that I defeated. I should go ask Ulirfendor if he knows anything about it."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu un'elmu de aspetu istranu in su lich 'Toszylae' chi apo bintu. "
"Dia dèpere andare a preguntare a Ulirfendor si nde ischit calicuna cosa."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:15
msgid "Ulirfendor in the same dungeon thinks this artifact is what the shrine speaks of, and that it will bring misery to the surroundings of whoever carries it. He wants me to help him destroy it immediately."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor, in sas matessi grutas, pensat chi custu artefatu siat su chi "
"narat su santuàriu, e chi at a batire disgràtzia a inghìriu de chie si siat "
"chi lu giughet. Cheret chi l'agiude a lu distrùere deretu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:26
msgid "To destroy the artifact, I would need give the helmet and the heart of the lich to Ulirfendor."
msgstr ""
"Pro distrùere s'artefatu, dia dèpere dare s'elmu e su coro de su lich a "
"Ulirfendor."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:30
msgid "I have given the helmet to Ulirfendor."
msgstr "Apo dadu s'elmu a Ulirfendor."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:31
msgid "I have given the heart of the lich to Ulirfendor."
msgstr "Apo dadu su coro de su lich a Ulirfendor."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:35
msgid "Ulirfendor has destroyed the artifact. The people of the surrounding towns are safe from whatever misery the helmet would have brought."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor at distrutu s'artefatu. Sa gente de sas biddas a inghìriu est a "
"s'amparu de cale si siat disgràtzia chi diat àere giutu s'elmu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:40
msgid "For helping with both the lich and the helmet, Ulirfendor has given me the dark blessing of the Shadow."
msgstr ""
"Pro l'àere agiudadu siat cun su lich siat cun s'elmu, Ulirfendor m'at dadu "
"sa beneditzione iscura de s'Umbra."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:41
msgid "For helping with both the lich and the helmet, Ulirfendor wanted to give me the dark blessing of the Shadow, but I declined."
msgstr ""
"Pro l'àere agiudadu siat cun su lich siat cun s'elmu, Ulirfendor mi cheriat "
"dare sa beneditzione iscura de s'Umbra, ma deo l'apo refudada."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:50
msgid "I have decided to keep the helmet for myself. Who knows what power I could gain from it."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de mi tènnere s'elmu. Chie ischit cale podere nde dia pòdere "
"otènnere."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:51
msgid "Ulirfendor attacked me for keeping the helmet."
msgstr "Ulirfendor m'at atacadu ca mi so tentu s'elmu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:55
msgid "I found a book by the shrine where Ulirfendor was. The book talks of a ritual that would restore the helmet to its true power. I should complete the ritual by the shrine if I want to use the helmet."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu libru acanta de su santuàriu in ue fiat Ulirfendor. Su libru "
"faeddat de unu ritu chi diat torrare a s'elmu su podere suo beru. Si chèrgio "
"impreare s'elmu, dia dèpere cumpletare su ritu acanta de su santuàriu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:60
msgid "I have started the Kazaul ritual."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu su ritu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:65
msgid "I have placed the helmet in front of the Kazaul shrine."
msgstr "Apo postu s'elmu in antis de su santuàriu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:66
msgid "I have placed the lich's heart in front of the Kazaul shrine."
msgstr "Apo postu su coro de su lich in antis de su santuàriu de Kazaul."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:darkprotector:70
msgid "The ritual is complete, and I have restored the power of the helmet to its former glory."
msgstr ""
"Su ritu est cumpletu, e apo torradu a s'elmu su podere e sa glòria chi "
"teniat in antis."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots
msgid "I have it in me"
msgstr "Lu tèngio in intro"

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:10
msgid "Deep inside a cavern, I encountered a lich of Kazaul. Somehow the lich managed to infect me with things that crawl around in my stomach! I must find some way to get rid of these things inside of me. I should go talk to Ulirfendor, or seek help in one of the chapels."
msgstr ""
"In fundu a una gruta, apo atopadu unu lich de Kazaul. In calicuna manera, su "
"lich est resèssidu a m'infetare cun cosas chi si movent in sa bentre mea! "
"Depo agatare una manera pro mi nde liberare de custas cosas chi tèngio in "
"intro. Dia dèpere andare a faeddare cun Ulirfendor, o chircare agiudu in una "
"de sas cresieddas."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:20
msgid "Ulirfendor tells me that he read something long ago about rotworms that feed upon living tissue. They can have what he called 'unusual' effects on whoever carries them, and their eggs can slowly kill a person from the inside. I should seek help immediately, before it is too late."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor mi narat chi tempus meda a como at lèghidu calicuna cosa subra de "
"bermes de pudesciura chi si nutrint de tèssidos bios. Podent tènnere efetos "
"chi issu at mutidu 'pagu normales' in chie los giughet, e sos oos issoro "
"podent ochìere a pagu a pagu una persone dae intro. Dia dèpere chircare "
"agiudu deretu, in antis chi siat tropu tardu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:21
msgid "Ulirfendor says that one of the priests of the Shadow should be able help me. I should go visit Talion at the chapel in Loneford at once."
msgstr ""
"Ulirfendor narat chi unu de sos preìderos de s'Umbra mi diat dèpere pòdere "
"agiudare. Dia dèpere andare deretu a bìdere a Talion, in sa cresiedda de "
"Loneford."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:30
msgid "Talion in Loneford told me that in order to be cured of my affliction, I will need to bring four parts to him. The parts that I will need are five bones, two pieces of animal hair, one irdegh poison gland and one empty vial. Bones and fur can probably be found on some animal in the wilderness, and the poison gland can be found on one of the irdeghs that have been spotted to the east."
msgstr ""
"Talion, in Loneford, m'at naradu chi pro mi curare de custu male, li depo "
"giùghere bator cosas. Sas cosas chi mi serbint sunt chimbe ossos, duos "
"bìculos de pilu de animale, una gràndula de velenu de irdegh e una fiala "
"bòida. Ossos e pilu si podent agatare de seguru in calicunu animale in "
"campagna, e sa gràndula de velenu si podet agatare in unu de sos irdegh chi "
"sunt istados bidos a oriente."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:40
msgid "I have brought the five bones to Talion."
msgstr "Apo batidu sos chimbe ossos a Talion."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:41
msgid "I have brought the two pieces of animal hair to Talion."
msgstr "Apo batidu sos duos bìculos de pilu de animale a Talion."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:42
msgid "I have brought one irdegh poison gland to Talion."
msgstr "Apo batidu una gràndula de velenu de irdegh a Talion."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:43
msgid "I have brought an empty vial to Talion."
msgstr "Apo batidu una fiala bòida a Talion."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:45
msgid "I have now brought all pieces that Talion needs in order to cure me of these things."
msgstr ""
"Como apo batidu a Talion totu sas cosas chi li serbint pro mi curare de "
"custas cosas."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:50
msgid "Talion has cured me of the Kazaul rotworms. I managed to get one of the rotworms into an empty vial, and Talion told me that it would be very valuable. I cannot imagine for what."
msgstr ""
"Talion m'at curadu de sos bermes de pudesciura de Kazaul. So resèssidu a "
"pònnere unu de sos bermes de pudesciura in una fiala bòida, e Talion m'at "
"naradu chi diat bàlere meda. Non resesso a immaginare a ite diat pòdere "
"serbire."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:maggots:51
msgid "Because of my former affliction, Talion has agreed to help me by placing blessings of the Shadow upon me whenever I wish, for a fee."
msgstr ""
"Pro more de su male chi apo tentu, Talion at atzetadu de m'agiudare "
"ponende·mi in subra sas beneditziones de s'Umbra cando chèrgio, a pagamentu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight
msgid "A difference of opinion"
msgstr "Una diferèntzia de opinione"

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:10
msgid "I heard a story about two squabbling sisters in Remgard, Elwel and Elwyl. Apparently they have kept people awake at night with the way they are shouting at each other. I should go visit them in their house on the southern shore of the city of Remgard."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu un'istòria subra de duas sorres de Remgard chi si brigant semper, "
"Elwel e Elwyl. A su chi paret, non lassant dormire sa gente de note pro "
"comente si tzèrriant a pare. Dia dèpere andare a las bìdere in sa domo "
"issoro, in s'oru sud de sa tzitade de Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:20
msgid "I have talked to Elwyl, one of the Elwille sisters in Remgard. She is furious at her sister for not agreeing on even the most simple of facts. Apparently, they have had their disagreements with each other for several years."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Elwyl, una de sas sorres Elwille de Remgard. Est "
"arrennegada meda cun sa sorre ca no est de acordu mancu in sos fatos prus "
"sèmplitzes. A su chi paret, est dae unos cantos annos chi non sunt de acordu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:21
msgid "Elwel will not speak to me."
msgstr "Elwel non cheret faeddare cun megus."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:30
msgid "One matter that the sisters disagree on currently is the color of a certain potion that the town potion-maker Hjaldar used to make. Elwyl says that the potion of accuracy focus that Hjaldar used to make was a blue potion, but Elwel insists that the potion was a green substance."
msgstr ""
"Una de sas chistiones in sas cales sas sorres non sunt de acordu como est su "
"colore de una tzerta potzione chi faghiat Hjaldar, su fraigadore de "
"potziones de sa tzitade. Elwyl narat chi sa potzione de pretzisione "
"cuntzentrada chi faghiat Hjaldar fiat asula, ma Elwel insistet chi sa "
"potzione fiat una sustàntzia birde."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:31
msgid "Elwyl wants me to get a potion of accuracy focus from Hjaldar here in Remgard so that she can finally prove to Elwel that she is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Elwyl cheret chi li giuga una potzione de pretzisione cuntzentrada de "
"Hjaldar, inoghe in Remgard, pro chi a sa fine potzat dimustrare a Elwel chi "
"s'est isballiende."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:40
msgid "I have talked to Hjaldar in Remgard. Hjaldar no longer makes potions since his supply of Lyson marrow extract has gone dry."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Hjaldar in Remgard. Hjaldar non faghet prus potziones dae "
"cando s'est acabbadu s'estratu de meuddu de Lyson chi teniat."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:41
msgid "Apparently, Hjaldar's old friend Mazeg would surely have some Lyson marrow extract to sell. Unfortunately, he does not know where Mazeg currently lives. He only knows that Mazeg traveled far to the west last time they met."
msgstr ""
"A su chi paret, s'amigu betzu de Hjaldar, Mazeg, diat tènnere de seguru unu "
"pagu de estratu de meuddu de Lyson de bèndere. A dolu mannu, no ischit in ue "
"bivet Mazeg como. Ischit petzi chi s'ùrtima borta chi si sunt bidos, Mazeg "
"fiat partidu a tesu meda, a otzidente."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:45
msgid "I should find Mazeg and get some Lyson marrow extract so that Hjaldar can start making potions again."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere agatare a Mazeg e leare unu pagu de estratu de meuddu de Lyson "
"pro chi Hjaldar potzat torrare a fàghere potziones."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:50
msgid "I have talked to Mazeg in the Blackwater mountain settlement. Since I helped the people of the Blackwater mountain before, he is willing to sell me a vial of Lyson marrow extract for only 400 gold."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Mazeg in s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda. Dae chi in "
"antis apo agiudadu sa gente de su Monte Abbaniedda, est dispostu a mi "
"bèndere una fiala de estratu de meuddu de Lyson pro petzi 400 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:51
msgid "I have talked to Mazeg in the Blackwater mountain settlement. He is willing to sell me Lyson marrow extract for 800 gold."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Mazeg in s'insediamentu de su Monte Abbaniedda. Est "
"dispostu a mi bèndere estratu de meuddu de Lyson pro 800 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:55
msgid "I have bought some Lyson marrow extract from Mazeg. I should return to Remgard and give it to Hjaldar."
msgstr ""
"Apo comporadu unu pagu de estratu de meuddu de Lyson dae Mazeg. Dia dèpere "
"torrare a Remgard e lu dare a Hjaldar."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:60
msgid "Hjaldar thanked me for bringing him the marrow extract."
msgstr "Hjaldar m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo batidu s'estratu de meuddu."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:61
msgid "Hjaldar can now create potions again, and is willing to trade with me. He even gave me some of the first potions that he made. I should go visit the Elwille sisters here in Remgard again, and show them a potion of accuracy focus."
msgstr ""
"Como Hjaldar podet torrare a fàghere potziones, e est dispostu a fàghere "
"cummèrtziu cun megus. M'at dadu fintzas unas cantas de sas primas potziones "
"chi at fatu. Dia dèpere torrare a bìdere sas sorres Elwille, inoghe in "
"Remgard, e lis mustrare una potzione de pretzisione cuntzentrada."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:70
msgid "I have given a potion of accuracy focus to Elwyl."
msgstr "Apo dadu una potzione de pretzisione cuntzentrada a Elwyl."

#: questlist_v0611_2.json:sisterfight:71
msgid "Unfortunately, it did not cause their squabbling to diminish. On the contrary, they seem to be even more angry at each other now, since both of them had the color wrong."
msgstr ""
"A dolu mannu, sas brigas issoro non sunt minimadas. A s'imbesse, como parent "
"galu prus arrennegadas s'una cun s'àtera, ca totu e duas si fiant "
"isballiadas de colore."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard
msgid "Everything in order"
msgstr "Totu in òrdine"

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:10
msgid "I have reached the bridge to enter the town of Remgard. According to the bridge guard, the town is closed for outsiders to enter, and no-one is currently allowed to leave. They are investigating some disappearances of some of the townspeople."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a su ponte pro intrare in sa bidda de Remgard. Segundu sa guàrdia "
"de su ponte, sa bidda est serrada pro sos istràngios, e pro como a nemos est "
"permìtidu de nch'essire. Sunt investighende subra de s'isparèssida de unos "
"cantos abitantes de sa bidda."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:15
msgid "I have offered my assistance in helping the people of Remgard investigate what has happened to the townspeople that have disappeared."
msgstr ""
"Apo ofertu s'agiudu meu pro agiudare sa gente de Remgard a investigare su "
"chi est capitadu a sos abitantes chi sunt isparèssidos."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:20
msgid "The bridge guard has asked me to investigate an abandoned house to the east along the northern shore of the lake. I should be wary of any inhabitants that may be there."
msgstr ""
"Sa guàrdia de su ponte m'at pedidu de investigare una domo abbandonada a "
"oriente, in s'oru nord de su lagu. Dia dèpere èssere atentu a cale si siat "
"abitante chi b'apat."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:30
msgid "I have reported back to the bridge guard that I met Algangror in the abandoned house."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a sa guàrdia de su ponte chi in sa domo abbandonada apo atopadu a "
"Algangror."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:31
msgid "I have reported back to the bridge guard that the abandoned house was empty."
msgstr "Apo naradu a sa guàrdia de su ponte chi sa domo abbandonada fiat bòida."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:35
msgid "I have been granted entrance into Remgard. I should go visit Jhaeld, the town elder, to talk about what the next step should be. Jhaeld can probably be found in the tavern to the southeast."
msgstr ""
"M'ant permìtidu de intrare in Remgard. Dia dèpere andare a bìdere a Jhaeld, "
"s'antzianu de sa bidda, pro faeddare de su chi si depet fàghere a pustis. "
"Jhaeld est de seguru in su tzilleri a su sud-est."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:40
msgid "Jhaeld was rather arrogant, but told me that they have had a problem with people disappearing for a while now. They have no clue what could be causing it."
msgstr ""
"Jhaeld fiat unu pagu superbu, ma m'at naradu chi dae unu tempus tenent unu "
"problema cun gente chi isparit. Non tenent idea de ite lu podet causare."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:50
msgid "I should visit four people in Remgard, and ask them about any clues on what might have happened to the missing people."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere andare a bìdere bator persones de Remgard, e lis preguntare si "
"tenent inditos de su chi podet èssere capitadu a sa gente chi mancat."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:51
msgid "First is Norath, whose wife Bethir has disappeared. Norath can be found in the south-westernmost farmhouse."
msgstr ""
"Su primu est Norath: sa mugere, Bethir, est isparèssida. Norath est in sa "
"domo de campagna prus a su sud-ovest."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:52
msgid "Second, I should go talk to the Knights of Elythom, here in the tavern."
msgstr ""
"In segundu logu, dia dèpere andare a faeddare cun sos Cavalieris de Elythom, "
"inoghe in su tzilleri."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:53
msgid "Third, I should go talk to the old woman Duaina in her house to the south."
msgstr ""
"In tertzu logu, dia dèpere andare a faeddare cun sa betza Duaina in sa domo "
"sua, a su sud."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:54
msgid "Lastly, I should talk to Rothses, the armorer. He lives on the west side of town."
msgstr ""
"A s'urtimada, dia dèpere faeddare cun Rothses, s'armajolu. Bivet in sa parte "
"de otzidente de sa bidda."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:59
msgid "I tried to tell Jhaeld about Algangror, but he dismissed me as he had not heard me."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de faeddare a Jhaeld de Algangror, ma non m'at dadu cara, "
"comente si non m'aeret intesu."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:61
msgid "I have talked to Norath. He and his wife had been fighting recently, but he has no idea on what may have happened to her."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Norath. Issu e sa mugere si fiant brigados dae pagu, ma no "
"at idea de su chi li podet èssere capitadu."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:62
msgid "The Knights of Elythom in the Remgard tavern have had one of their knights disappearing recently. No one noticed anything when she disappeared, however."
msgstr ""
"Una de sos Cavalieris de Elythom, in su tzilleri de Remgard, est isparèssida "
"dae pagu. Ma nemos at notadu nudda cando est isparèssida."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:63
msgid "Duaina has seen me in her visions. I did not understand all that she spoke of, but the parts that were clear were that me and Andor were parts of a larger plot. I wonder what this means? She did not speak of any disappearing people however, not that I could understand anyway."
msgstr ""
"Duaina m'at bidu in sas visiones suas. No apo cumpresu totu su chi at "
"naradu, ma sas partes craras fiant chi deo e Andor semus parte de unu pianu "
"prus mannu. Ite at a chèrrere nàrrere? Però no at faeddadu de gente "
"isparèssida, a su mancu no in una manera chi deo apa pòdidu cumprèndere."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:64
msgid "Rothses told me that Bethir visited him the night before she disappeared, to sell some equipment. He did not see where she went after that."
msgstr ""
"Rothses m'at naradu chi Bethir fiat andada a lu bìdere su note in antis de "
"isparèssere, pro bèndere unos cantos ogetos de s'atretzadura sua. No at bidu "
"in ue est andada a pustis."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:70
msgid "I have talked to all of the people that Jhaeld wanted me to talk to, but did not get any information from any of them about what may have happened to the missing people. I should go back to Jhaeld and ask what his plans are next."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun totu sas persones chi m'aiat indicadu Jhaeld, ma non nd'apo "
"tentu peruna informatzione subra de su chi podet èssere capitadu a sa gente "
"chi mancat. Dia dèpere torrare a Jhaeld e li preguntare ite pianos tenet "
"como."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:75
msgid "Jhaeld was really upset that I did not find out anything from the people that I was sent to talk to."
msgstr ""
"Jhaeld fiat arrennegadu meda ca no apo iscobertu nudda dae sa gente cun sa "
"cale m'aiat mandadu a faeddare."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:80
msgid "If I still want to help Jhaeld and the people of Remgard, I should look for clues in other places."
msgstr ""
"Si chèrgio galu agiudare a Jhaeld e a sa gente de Remgard, dia dèpere "
"chircare inditos in àteros logos."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard:110
msgid "Jhaeld does not want to talk to me. I will not help them find out what happened to the missing people of Remgard."
msgstr ""
"Jhaeld non cheret faeddare cun megus. Non los apo a agiudare a ischire su "
"chi est capitadu a sa gente isparèssida de Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2
msgid "What is that stench?"
msgstr "Ite est custu fragu?"

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:10
msgid "I have told Jhaeld, the village elder in Remgard, about the woman named Algangror that lives in the abandoned house to the east along the northern shore of the lake outside Remgard."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Jhaeld, s'antzianu de sa bidda de Remgard, de sa fèmina chi si "
"narat Algangror, chi bivet in sa domo abbandonada a oriente, in s'oru nord "
"de su lagu, in foras de Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:20
msgid "Jhaeld told me that he would rather not deal with her, since he believes she is very dangerous. For the sake of his guards, he will not risk going against her since he is afraid of what might happen to all of them."
msgstr ""
"Jhaeld m'at naradu chi preferit de non tènnere de ite fàghere cun issa, ca "
"creet chi siat perigulosa meda. Pro su bene de sas guàrdias suas, non cheret "
"arriscare de andare contra a issa, ca timet su chi lis diat pòdere capitare "
"a totus."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:21
msgid "If I want to help Jhaeld and the people of Remgard, I should find a way to make Algangror disappear. He also warns me to be extremely careful."
msgstr ""
"Si chèrgio agiudare a Jhaeld e a sa gente de Remgard, dia dèpere agatare una "
"manera pro fàghere isparèssere a Algangror. Mi narat fintzas de èssere "
"atentu meda."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:30
msgid "Algangror admitted to me that she had made some people disappear from Remgard. She would not tell me what happened to them though."
msgstr ""
"Algangror m'at cunfessadu chi at fatu isparèssere a unas cantas persones de "
"Remgard. Però non m'at chertu nàrrere ite lis est capitadu."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:35
msgid "I have started attacking Algangror. I should return to Jhaeld with proof of defeating her when she is dead."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu a atacare a Algangror. Cando at a èssere morta, dia dèpere "
"torrare a Jhaeld cun una proa chi l'apo binta."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:40
msgid "I have told Jhaeld that I defeated Algangror."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Jhaeld chi apo bintu a Algangror."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:41
msgid "Jhaeld was very pleased to hear the good news. The people of Remgard should now be safe, and the town can be opened to outsiders again."
msgstr ""
"Jhaeld fiat cuntentu meda de intèndere sa nova bona. Como sa gente de "
"Remgard diat dèpere èssere segura, e sa bidda si podet torrare a abèrrere a "
"sos istràngios."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:45
msgid "For helping the people of Remgard find the cause of the disappearing people, Jhaeld told me to talk to Rothses. He might be able to improve some of my equipment."
msgstr ""
"Pro àere agiudadu sa gente de Remgard a agatare sa càusa de sas "
"isparèssidas, Jhaeld m'at naradu de faeddare cun Rothses. Forsis issu podet "
"megiorare unas cantas cosas de s'atretzadura mea."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:remgard2:46
msgid "Ervelyn, the Remgard tailor, gave me a feathered hat as thanks for helping the people of Remgard find out what happened to the missing people."
msgstr ""
"Ervelyn, su draperi de Remgard, m'at dadu unu capeddu cun pinnas pro mi "
"ringratziare de àere agiudadu sa gente de Remgard a ischire su chi est "
"capitadu a sa gente isparèssida."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols
msgid "The five idols"
msgstr "Sos chimbe ìdolos"

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:10
msgid "Algangror wants me to help her with a task. She cannot describe the nature of the task, or the reasoning behind it. If I help her, she has promised to give me her enchanted necklace, that apparently is worth a lot."
msgstr ""
"Algangror cheret chi l'agiude in un'incàrrigu. Non podet descrìere de ite si "
"tratat, nen pro ite lu cheret fàghere. Si l'agiudo, m'at promìtidu de mi "
"dare sa collana incantada sua, chi a su chi paret balet meda."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:20
msgid "I have agreed to help Algangror with her task."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Algangror in s'incàrrigu suo."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:30
msgid "Algangror wants me to place five idols near five different people in Remgard. The idols should be placed near the beds of these five people, and must be hidden so that they are not found easily."
msgstr ""
"Algangror cheret chi pòngia chimbe ìdolos acanta de chimbe persones "
"diferentes de Remgard. Sos ìdolos depent èssere postos acanta de sos letos "
"de custas chimbe persones, e depent èssere cuados bene pro chi non los "
"agatent fàtzile."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:31
msgid "The first person is Jhaeld, the village elder that can be found in the Remgard tavern."
msgstr ""
"Sa prima persone est Jhaeld, s'antzianu de sa bidda, chi est in su tzilleri "
"de Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:32
msgid "Second, I should place an idol by the bed of Larni the farmer, that lives in one of the northern cabins in Remgard."
msgstr ""
"In segundu logu, dia dèpere pònnere un'ìdolu acanta de su letu de Larni su "
"massaju, chi bivet in una de sas barracas de su nord de Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:34
msgid "Fourth is Emerei, that can be found to the southeast of Remgard."
msgstr "Sa de bator persone est Emerei, chi s'agatat a su sud-est de Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:35
msgid "The fifth person is Carthe. Carthe lives on the eastern shore of Remgard, near the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Sa de chimbe persone est Carthe. Carthe bivet in s'oru de oriente de "
"Remgard, acanta de su tzilleri."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:37
msgid "I must not tell anyone of my task, or of the placement of the idols."
msgstr ""
"Non depo nàrrere a nemos de s'incàrrigu meu, nen de ue apo postu sos ìdolos."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:41
msgid "I have placed an idol by Jhaeld's bed."
msgstr "Apo postu un'ìdolu acanta de su letu de Jhaeld."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:42
msgid "I have placed an idol by Larni the farmer's bed."
msgstr "Apo postu un'ìdolu acanta de su letu de Larni su massaju."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:43
msgid "I have placed an idol by Arnal's bed."
msgstr "Apo postu un'ìdolu acanta de su letu de Arnal."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:44
msgid "I have placed an idol by Emerei's bed."
msgstr "Apo postu un'ìdolu acanta de su letu de Emerei."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:45
msgid "I have placed an idol by Carthe's bed."
msgstr "Apo postu un'ìdolu acanta de su letu de Carthe."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:50
msgid "All the idols have been placed by the beds of the people that Algangror told me to visit. I should return to Algangror."
msgstr ""
"Apo postu totu sos ìdolos acanta de sos letos de sas persones chi m'at "
"naradu Algangror. Dia dèpere torrare a Algangror."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:51
msgid "Algangror thanked me for helping her."
msgstr "Algangror m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere agiudada."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:60
msgid "She told me her story, with how she used to live in the city, but was persecuted for her beliefs. According to her, the persecution was totally unjustified since she does no harm to people."
msgstr ""
"M'at contadu s'istòria sua: comente biviat in sa tzitade, ma fiat istada "
"persighida pro su chi creiat. Segundu issa, sa persecutzione non fiat "
"giustificada pro nudda, ca issa non faghet male a sa gente."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:61
msgid "To take revenge on the city of Remgard, she managed to lure some people into her cabin and turn them into rats."
msgstr ""
"Pro si vindicare de sa tzitade de Remgard, est resèssida a atirare unas "
"cantas persones in sa barraca sua e a las trasformare in sòrighes."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:70
msgid "For helping her with the tasks that she could not perform herself, Algangror gave me her enchanted necklace, 'Marrowtaint'."
msgstr ""
"Pro l'àere agiudada in sos incàrrigos chi non podiat fàghere issa etotu, "
"Algangror m'at dadu sa collana incantada sua, 'Marrowtaint'."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:fiveidols:100
msgid "I have decided not to help Algangror with her task."
msgstr "Apo detzìdidu de no agiudare a Algangror in s'incàrrigu suo."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin
msgid "Old friends?"
msgstr "Amigos betzos?"

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:10
msgid "I met Kaverin in Remgard, that apparently is an old acquaintance of Unzel, who lives outside of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"In Remgard apo atopadu a Kaverin, chi a su chi paret est unu connoschente "
"betzu de Unzel, chi bivet in foras de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:20
msgid "Kaverin wants me to deliver a message to Unzel."
msgstr "Kaverin cheret chi giuga unu messàgiu a Unzel."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:21
msgid "I have declined to help Kaverin."
msgstr "Apo refudadu de agiudare a Kaverin."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:22
msgid "I have agreed to deliver the message."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu de giùghere su messàgiu."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:25
msgid "Kaverin has given me the message that he wants me to deliver to Unzel."
msgstr "Kaverin m'at dadu su messàgiu chi cheret chi giuga a Unzel."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:30
msgid "I have delivered the message to Unzel. I should return to Kaverin in Remgard."
msgstr ""
"Apo giutu su messàgiu a Unzel. Dia dèpere torrare a Kaverin, in Remgard."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:40
msgid "Kaverin thanked me for delivering the message to Unzel."
msgstr "Kaverin m'at ringratziadu ca apo giutu su messàgiu a Unzel."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:45
msgid "In return, Kaverin gave me an old map that he had acquired. Apparently, it leads to Vacor's old hideout."
msgstr ""
"In càmbiu, Kaverin m'at dadu una mapa betza chi aiat otentu. A su chi paret, "
"giughet a su cuadòrgiu betzu de Vacor."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:60
msgid "Kaverin was furious over the fact that I killed Unzel, and that I helped Vacor. He started attacking me. I should return to Vacor once Kaverin is dead."
msgstr ""
"Kaverin fiat arrennegadu meda ca apo ochidu a Unzel e apo agiudadu a Vacor. "
"At cumintzadu a m'atacare. Cando Kaverin at a èssere mortu, dia dèpere "
"torrare a Vacor."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:70
msgid "Kaverin was carrying a sealed message. Vacor immediately recognized the seal, and seemed very interested in it."
msgstr ""
"Kaverin giughiat unu messàgiu sigilladu. Vacor at connotu deretu su sigillu, "
"e pariat interessadu meda."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:75
msgid "I have given Vacor the message that Kaverin was carrying. In return, Vacor gave me an old map, leading to his old hideout."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Vacor su messàgiu chi giughiat Kaverin. In càmbiu, Vacor m'at "
"dadu una mapa betza chi giughet a su cuadòrgiu suo betzu."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:90
msgid "I should try to find Vacor's old hideout, on the road to the west of the former prison of Flagstone, southwest of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere chircare de agatare su cuadòrgiu betzu de Vacor, in s'àndala a "
"otzidente de sa presone de Pedralada de una borta, a su sud-ovest de "
"Fallhaven."

#: questlist_v0611_3.json:kaverin:100
msgid "I have found Vacor's old hideout."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su cuadòrgiu betzu de Vacor."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1
msgid "Destined for great things"
msgstr "Destinadu a cosas mannas"

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:10
msgid "I heard a rumor that some mining town in the Charwood forest, northwest of the Foaming Flask tavern, has had some troubles recently. I should try to find the Charwood cabin and find out what has happened."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu chi una bidda de minadores in su Padente Brusiadu, a nord-ovest "
"de su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu, at tentu unos cantos problemas dae "
"pagu. Dia dèpere chircare de agatare sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu e de "
"ischire ite est capitadu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:11
msgid "I heard someone mention that the mining town of Charwood heights has had some troubles recently. I should search for the Charwood cabin in the forest northwest of the Foaming Flask tavern."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu a unu narende chi sa bidda de minadores de sas Arturas de Padente "
"Brusiadu at tentu unos cantos problemas dae pagu. Dia dèpere chircare sa "
"barraca de Padente Brusiadu in su padente a nord-ovest de su tzilleri de su "
"Fiascu Ispumosu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:19
msgid "I have found the Charwood cabin in the forest northwest of the Foaming Flask tavern."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu in su padente a nord-ovest de su "
"tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:20
msgid "Maevalia in the Charwood cabin told me a story about how their mining settlement was attacked by some monsters, forcing them to flee down the mountain. They are still missing several of their friends and relatives from the Charwood heights, either killed or captured by the monsters."
msgstr ""
"Maevalia, in sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu, m'at contadu comente unos "
"cantos mostros ant atacadu s'insediamentu issoro de minadores, e los ant "
"obligados a fuire falende dae su monte. Lis mancant galu medas amigos e "
"parentes de sas Arturas de Padente Brusiadu, o mortos o leados presoneris "
"dae sos mostros."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:21
msgid "In particular, Maevalia mentions four people that are greatly missed; their former leader Morenavia, their weapons trainer Falothen, the healer Ayell and their armorer Fayvara."
msgstr ""
"In particulare, Maevalia mentovat bator persones chi lis mancant meda: su "
"cabu issoro de una borta, Morenavia, s'istrutore de armas issoro, Falothen, "
"Ayell, chi curaiat sos malàidos, e s'armajola issoro, Fayvara."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:30
msgid "I have agreed to help the people of Charwood find their missing people."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare sa gente de Padente Brusiadu a agatare sas persones "
"issoro chi mancant."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:35
msgid "The guard outside the Charwood cabin allowed me to enter the hills ahead. I should keep to the east and then head north."
msgstr ""
"Sa guàrdia in foras de sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu m'at permìtidu de "
"intrare in sos montigros chi b'at prus a in antis. Dia dèpere andare semper "
"a oriente e a pustis girare a nord."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:40
msgid "I encountered one of the monsters that Maevalia spoke of. The monster spoke of someone or something called 'The Thukuzun'."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu unu de sos mostros chi aiat mentovadu Maevalia. Su mostru at "
"faeddadu de unu o de una cosa chi si narat 'Su Thukuzun'."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:41
msgid "I have found Falothen, the weapons trainer of the Charwood heights, and freed him from the restraints that held him. He will try to make his way back to the Charwood cabin himself."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Falothen, s'istrutore de armas de sas Arturas de Padente "
"Brusiadu, e l'apo liberadu dae sos ligàmenes chi lu trateniant. At a "
"chircare de torrare a sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu a sa sola."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:42
msgid "I have found some skeletal remains, containing a ring with the insignia 'Morenavia'. This must be the former leader of the Charwood hills."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unos cantos restos de ischèletru cun un'aneddu cun s'iscritzione "
"'Morenavia'. Depet èssere su cabu de una borta de sos Montigros de Padente "
"Brusiadu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:43
msgid "I have found the armorer Fayvara, and freed her from the restraints that held her. She will try to make her way back to the Charwood cabin herself."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a s'armajola Fayvara, e l'apo liberada dae sos ligàmenes chi la "
"trateniant. At a chircare de torrare a sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu a sa "
"sola."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:44
msgid "I have found some skeletal remains, containing a ring with the insignia 'Ayell'. This must be the remains of the Charwood hills healer that Maevalia mentioned."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unos cantos restos de ischèletru cun un'aneddu cun s'iscritzione "
"'Ayell'. Depent èssere sos restos de Ayell, chi curaiat sos malàidos de sos "
"Montigros de Padente Brusiadu, chi aiat mentovadu Maevalia."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:50
msgid "Maevalia thanked me for finding out what happened to the four people that she told me about, but was really sad to hear about the fate of Morenavia and Ayell. Both the weapons trainer Falothen and the armorer Fayvara made it back to the Charwood cabin safely."
msgstr ""
"Maevalia m'at ringratziadu pro àere iscobertu su chi est capitadu a sas "
"bator persones chi m'aiat naradu, ma est abarrada trista meda a intèndere sa "
"sorte de Morenavia e de Ayell. Siat s'istrutore de armas Falothen siat "
"s'armajola Fayvara sunt torrados a sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu sanos e "
"sarvos."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:60
msgid "She told me that both Falothen and Fayvara are anxious to see me, in the basement of the Charwood cabin. I should go see them at once."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu chi siat Falothen siat Fayvara tenent gana de mi bìdere, in sa "
"cantina de sa barraca de Padente Brusiadu. Dia dèpere andare deretu a los "
"bìdere."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:65
msgid "Falothen was happy to see me again, and in return offered to train me in better handling of one weapon type. He can teach me better handling of one or two handed swords, daggers, blunt weapons, axes, or unarmed combat. I'll have to chose my preference and let him know."
msgstr ""
"Falothen fiat cuntentu de mi torrare a bìdere, e in càmbiu m'at ofertu de "
"m'imparare a manigiare mègius una genia de arma. Mi podet imparare a "
"manigiare mègius sas ispadas a una o a duas manos, sos pugnales, sas armas "
"contundentes, sos istrales, o a cumbàtere chene armas. Apo a dèpere seberare "
"su chi prefèrgio e bi lu nàrrere."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:70
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to better handle one handed swords."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sas ispadas a una manu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:71
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to better handle two handed swords."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sas ispadas a duas manos."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:72
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to better handle daggers."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sos pugnales."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:73
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to better handle blunt weapons."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sas armas contundentes."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:74
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to better handle axes."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sos istrales."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:75
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to be better at fighting unarmed, without weapons."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a cumbàtere mègius a manos nudas, chene armas."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:76
msgid "Falothen has taught me how to better handle polearms."
msgstr "Falothen m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sas armas de asta."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:80
msgid "Falothen offered me the chance to learn about the other weapon types, but to teach me, he needs 5000 gold and two Oegyth crystals for each skill that I want to get better at."
msgstr ""
"Falothen m'at ofertu sa possibilidade de imparare a manigiare sas àteras "
"genias de armas, ma pro mi las imparare, li serbint 5000 monedas de oro e "
"duos cristallos de oegyth pro cada abilidade chi chèrgio megiorare."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:90
msgid "Fayvara thanked me for rescuing her, and in return offered to train me in better handling of one type of armor. She can teach me better handling of shields, light armor, heavy armor or or unarmored combat. I'll have to chose my preference and let her know."
msgstr ""
"Fayvara m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere sarvada, e in càmbiu m'at ofertu de "
"m'imparare a manigiare mègius una genia de armadura. Mi podet imparare a "
"manigiare mègius sos iscudos, s'armadura lèbia, s'armadura grae o a "
"cumbàtere chene armadura. Apo a dèpere seberare su chi prefèrgio e bi lu "
"nàrrere."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:91
msgid "Fayvara has taught me how to better handle shields."
msgstr "Fayvara m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius sos iscudos."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:92
msgid "Fayvara has taught me how to better handle light armor."
msgstr "Fayvara m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius s'armadura lèbia."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:93
msgid "Fayvara has taught me how to better handle heavy armor."
msgstr "Fayvara m'at imparadu a manigiare mègius s'armadura grae."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:94
msgid "Fayvara has taught me how to better fighting unarmored, without wearing any armor."
msgstr ""
"Fayvara m'at imparadu a cumbàtere mègius chene armadura, chene giùghere "
"peruna armadura."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:100
msgid "Fayvara offered me the chance to learn about the other armor types, but to teach me, she needs 6000 gold and two Oegyth crystals for each skill that I want to get better at."
msgstr ""
"Fayvara m'at ofertu sa possibilidade de imparare a manigiare sas àteras "
"genias de armadura, ma pro mi las imparare, li serbint 6000 monedas de oro e "
"duos cristallos de oegyth pro cada abilidade chi chèrgio megiorare."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:110
msgid "I have been taught one weapon type skill and one armor type skill from Falothen and Fayvara. I should go see Maevalia again."
msgstr ""
"Falothen e Fayvara m'ant imparadu un'abilidade pro una genia de arma e "
"un'abilidade pro una genia de armadura. Dia dèpere torrare a bìdere a "
"Maevalia."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood1:115
msgid "Maevalia thanked me for helping the people of Charwood."
msgstr ""
"Maevalia m'at ringratziadu pro àere agiudadu sa gente de Padente Brusiadu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2
msgid "Trial by fire"
msgstr "Proa de su fogu"

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2:10
msgid "I've heard a story that the whole reason for the Charwood hills being invaded by the monsters in the first place was that something had been awoken deep in the Charwood mine. The people in the Charwood cabin say that the miners uncovered some sort of marking on the ground in a cave, with strange noises coming from below it. When they finally broke through the ground around the markings, all the troubles started. I should talk to Maevalia again."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu un'istòria: sa resone pro sa cale sos mostros ant invàdidu sos "
"Montigros de Padente Brusiadu est chi in fundu a sa miniera de Padente "
"Brusiadu si fiat ischidada una cosa. Sa gente de sa barraca de Padente "
"Brusiadu narat chi sos minadores ant iscobertu una genia de sinnu in su "
"terrinu de una gruta, cun sonos istranos chi beniant dae suta. Cando a sa "
"fine ant isfundadu su terrinu a inghìriu de sos sinnos, ant cumintzadu totu "
"sos problemas. Dia dèpere torrare a faeddare cun Maevalia."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2:15
msgid "I've promised Maevalia to investigate the deeper parts of the Charwood mine. I should be on the lookout for the dangerous monsters that inhabit the mine."
msgstr ""
"Apo promìtidu a Maevalia de investigare sas partes prus fundas de sa miniera "
"de Padente Brusiadu. Dia dèpere istare atentu a sos mostros perigulosos chi "
"bivent in sa miniera."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2:20
msgid "I've reached the part of the mine that was broken into. The air around here seems to get hotter as I get deeper into the mine."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a sa parte de sa miniera in ue ant isfundadu su terrinu. Paret "
"chi s'àera a inghìriu si faghet semper prus calda a cantu prus mi nche intro "
"in sa miniera."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2:30
msgid "Among the fires in the lower parts of the mine, I've encountered some type of dragon-like creature. I guess this is the source of all the chaos in the mine. I should attempt to kill it and then venture back to Maevalia to tell her about it once I'm victorious."
msgstr ""
"In mesu de sos fogos de sas partes prus bassas de sa miniera, apo atopadu "
"una genia de creadura simigiante a unu dragu. Penso chi custa siat s'orìgine "
"de totu su caos de sa miniera. Dia dèpere chircare de l'ochìere e a pustis "
"torrare a Maevalia pro li contare totu, cando apo a àere bintu."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2:40
msgid "I have presented one of the bones from the corpse of the Thukuzun to Maevalia."
msgstr "Apo mustradu a Maevalia unu de sos ossos de su corpus de su Thukuzun."

#: questlist_v070_charwood.json:charwood2:50
msgid "Maevalia was happy to hear that I killed the source of the monster invasion."
msgstr ""
"Maevalia fiat cuntenta de ischire chi apo ochidu sa càusa de s'invasione de "
"sos mostros."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2
msgid "Searching for madness"
msgstr "In chirca de su machine"

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:10
msgid "The potion-maker Lodar seems to be obsessed with something called the Hira'zinn."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi su fraigadore de potziones Lodar siat fissadu cun una cosa chi si "
"narat su Hira'zinn."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:15
msgid "Apparently, it relates to something that has started to happen recently."
msgstr ""
"A su chi paret, tenet ite bìdere cun una cosa chi at cumintzadu a sutzèdere "
"dae pagu."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:20
msgid "Lodar gave me a glowing stone, that he said would allow me to enter some sort of tomb. He did not say which tomb, where the tomb is located, or how to reach it - only that it's somewhere 'below'. Below what, I wonder?"
msgstr ""
"Lodar m'at dadu una pedra lughente, e m'at naradu chi m'at a permìtere de "
"intrare in una genia de tumba. No at naradu cale tumba, in ue s'agatat sa "
"tumba, o comente si bi lompet: petzi chi est in calicuna parte 'in suta'. In "
"suta de ite, mi pregunto?"

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:30
msgid "In the cave leading to Lodar's Hideaway, I reached what looks like a tomb. Could this be the one Lodar was referring to?"
msgstr ""
"In sa gruta chi giughet a su cuadòrgiu de Lodar, so lòmpidu a unu logu chi "
"paret una tumba. Diat pòdere èssere sa chi naraiat Lodar?"

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:35
msgid "The glowing stone that Lodar gave me, crumbled to dust as I got near the tomb. However, it seems that I am now able to enter."
msgstr ""
"Sa pedra lughente chi m'aiat dadu Lodar s'est fata prùere cando mi so "
"acurtziadu a sa tumba. Però paret chi como potza intrare."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:40
msgid "I have encountered a foul creature inside the tomb. I assume this is the Hira'zinn that Lodar was referring to. I should kill it and then tell Lodar."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu una creadura lègia in intro de sa tumba. Penso chi custu siat su "
"Hira'zinn chi naraiat Lodar. Dia dèpere l'ochìere e a pustis lu nàrrere a "
"Lodar."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:50
msgid "I have presented the heart of the Hira'zinn to Lodar."
msgstr "Apo mustradu su coro de su Hira'zinn a Lodar."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:51
msgid "As soon as I presented the heart of the Hira'zinn to Lodar, he seemed to snap out of his previous state of mind."
msgstr ""
"Comente apo mustradu su coro de su Hira'zinn a Lodar, pariat chi esseret "
"torradu in sese."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar2:60
msgid "Lodar thanked me for defeating the Hira'zinn. In return, he promised to help me in any way he can. He has a large selection of potent potions available for me to purchase at a discount."
msgstr ""
"Lodar m'at ringratziadu pro àere bintu su Hira'zinn. In càmbiu, m'at "
"promìtidu de m'agiudare in totu sas maneras chi podet. Tenet una seletzione "
"manna de potziones fortes chi potzo comporare cun iscontu."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots
msgid "Lodar's potions"
msgstr "Sas potziones de Lodar"

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:10
msgid "Lodar says that he can make potions from some animal remains, if I first bring him some Spotted Hornbeam fungus. Apparently, the potion-maker in Fallhaven has a stock of it, if you know enough to ask."
msgstr ""
"Lodar narat chi podet fàghere potziones cun unos cantos restos de animales, "
"si in antis li giugo unu pagu de fungu pintu de Hornbeam. A su chi paret, su "
"fraigadore de potziones de Fallhaven nd'at una riserva, si nde ischis "
"bastante pro lu preguntare."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:20
msgid "I have retrieved some Spotted Hornbeam fungus from the potion-maker in Fallhaven. I should return to Lodar with it as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu unu pagu de fungu pintu de Hornbeam dae su fraigadore de potziones "
"de Fallhaven. Lu dia dèpere giùghere a Lodar cantu prus a lestru potzo."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:30
msgid "I have given the Spotted Hornbeam fungus to Lodar."
msgstr "Apo dadu su fungu pintu de Hornbeam a Lodar."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:40
msgid "Lodar thanked me for bringing him the fungus. In return, he can now create his special potions for me."
msgstr ""
"Lodar m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo batidu su fungu. In càmbiu, como mi podet "
"fàghere sas potziones ispetziales suas."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:41
msgid "Lodar can create a defensive potion if I bring him two White wyrm claws and a Ruby gem."
msgstr ""
"Lodar mi podet fàghere una potzione de defensa si li giugo duas ungras de "
"wyrm biancu e una gemma de rubinu."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:42
msgid "Lodar can create a potion of strength if I bring him a dead spider and the wings of an insect."
msgstr ""
"Lodar mi podet fàghere una potzione de fortza si li giugo un'arangiolu mortu "
"e sas alas de unu babbautzu."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar_pots:43
msgid "Lodar can create a potent defensive potion if I bring him two arulir skins and a claw from some monster. The arulir beasts can be found somewhere up in the north, and the claws can apparently be found from creatures that dwell underground and in caves somewhere outside Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Lodar mi podet fàghere una potzione de defensa forte si li giugo duas peddes "
"de arulir e un'ungra de calicunu mostru. Sas bèstias arulir si podent "
"agatare in calicuna parte a nord, e a su chi paret sas ungras si podent "
"agatare in creaduras chi bivent suta de terra e in grutas, in calicuna parte "
"in foras de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:xulviir
msgid "A creeping fear"
msgstr "Una timòria chi s'istrisinat"

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:xulviir:10
msgid "I was told that the broken sword that I found on the body of the Hira'zinn should be taken to the smith in Vilegard."
msgstr ""
"M'ant naradu chi s'ispada truncada chi apo agatadu in su corpus de su "
"Hira'zinn la dia dèpere giùghere a su ferreri de Vilegard."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:xulviir:20
msgid "I have restored the Xul'viir. I had to threaten the smith in Vilegard to get it restored."
msgstr ""
"Apo acontzadu su Xul'viir. Apo dèpidu minetzare su ferreri de Vilegard pro "
"chi l'acontzaret."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:xulviir:30
msgid "I have destroyed the Xul'viir."
msgstr "Apo distrutu su Xul'viir."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest
msgid "No rest for the guilty"
msgstr "Perunu pasu pro sos culpàbiles"

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:10
msgid "In the maze of green vines east of the Duleian road, I met a guard named Aulowenn from Feygard, guarding some crates. She told me that she was part of a larger group of guards searching for a madman that supposedly hides somewhere in the nearby hills, but that the other guards are now dead or missing."
msgstr ""
"In su labirintu de prantas rampicantes birdes a oriente de s'àndala "
"duleiana, apo atopadu una guàrdia de Feygard chi si narat Aulowenn, chi "
"amparaiat unas cantas càssias. M'at naradu chi faghiat parte de unu grupu "
"prus mannu de guàrdias chi chircaiant unu macu chi, a su chi narant, s'est "
"cuende in calicuna parte in sos montigros de acanta, ma chi sas àteras "
"guàrdias como sunt mortas o isparèssidas."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:11
msgid "Aulowenn requested my help in defeating a monster that haunts the grave of her fellow guards to the east. She warned me that the foul beast will most likely try to trick me into listening to its story."
msgstr ""
"Aulowenn m'at pedidu agiudu pro bìnchere unu mostru chi istat a inghìriu de "
"sa tumba de sos cumpàngios suos, a oriente. M'at avisadu chi sa bèstia lègia "
"at a chircare de seguru de m'ingannare pro mi fàghere ascurtare s'istòria "
"sua."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:20
msgid "I have met the creature that Aulowenn spoke of."
msgstr "Apo atopadu sa creadura chi aiat mentovadu Aulowenn."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:22
msgid "I listened to the creature's story. Its name is Tiqui, and he is the head of his clan. Apparently, the guards have been ruthlessly killing off his kin. He asked me to kill the guard for him, as revenge for what they have done."
msgstr ""
"Apo ascurtadu s'istòria de sa creadura. Si narat Tiqui, e est su cabu de sa "
"tribù sua. A su chi paret, sas guàrdias sunt istadas ochiende sos parentes "
"suos chene piedade. M'at pedidu de ochìere sa guàrdia pro issu, pro si "
"vindicare de su chi ant fatu."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:24
msgid "The creature tried to trick me into listening to its story."
msgstr ""
"Sa creadura at chircadu de m'ingannare pro mi fàghere ascurtare s'istòria "
"sua."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:30
msgid "I attacked the creature before it could spew out more of its foul lies."
msgstr ""
"Apo atacadu sa creadura in antis chi poderet nàrrere àteras fàulas lègias."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:31
msgid "I attacked Aulowenn."
msgstr "Apo atacadu a Aulowenn."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:40
msgid "Aulowenn thanked me for bringing peace to the grave of her fallen companions by killing the creature."
msgstr ""
"Aulowenn m'at ringratziadu pro àere torradu sa paghe a sa tumba de sos "
"cumpàngios suos mortos, ochiende sa creadura."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:41
msgid "Tiqui was overjoyed that I helped him kill the guard for him. He promised that if we ever run into each other again, he'd help me somehow."
msgstr ""
"Tiqui fiat cuntentu a beru meda ca l'apo agiudadu a ochìere sa guàrdia. M'at "
"promìtidu chi, si nos amus a torrare a atopare, m'at a agiudare in calicuna "
"manera."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:60
msgid "I am now able to use Aulowenn's bed whenever I wish to rest."
msgstr "Como potzo impreare su letu de Aulowenn cando chèrgio pro mi pasare."

#: questlist_v070_lodar.json:lodar13_rest:65
msgid "I will not be able to resolve the conflict between Aulowenn and her attacker."
msgstr ""
"No apo a pòdere risòlvere su cunflitu intre Aulowenn e chie l'at atacada."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lowyna
msgid "Sweet sweet rat poison"
msgstr "Velenu pro sòrighes, durche durche"

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lowyna:10
msgid "Among some huts to the west of the Duleian road, I met a man called two-teeth. He wants me to go get him something called Rat poison from Lowyna. I can find her in one of the other huts."
msgstr ""
"In mesu de unas cantas barracas a otzidente de s'àndala duleiana, apo "
"atopadu un'òmine chi li narant Duos-dentes. Cheret chi li ande a leare una "
"cosa chi si narat Velenu pro sòrighes dae Lowyna. La potzo agatare in una de "
"sas àteras barracas."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lowyna:20
msgid "Lowyna will now allow me to trade with her."
msgstr "Como Lowyna mi permitit de fàghere cummèrtziu cun issa."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lowyna:40
msgid "I have given some rat poison to two-teeth."
msgstr "Apo dadu unu pagu de velenu pro sòrighes a Duos-dentes."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lleglaris
msgid "Long lost memories"
msgstr "Ammentos pèrdidos dae meda"

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lleglaris:10
msgid "In a cabin just off the Duleian road northwest of the Foaming Flask tavern, I met a man called Lleglaris. He wants me to retrieve an amulet that he has lost."
msgstr ""
"In una barraca pròpiu a foras de s'àndala duleiana, a nord-ovest de su "
"tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu, apo atopadu un'òmine chi si narat Lleglaris. "
"Cheret chi li agate un'amuletu chi at pèrdidu."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lleglaris:15
msgid "The amulet can be found in a cave infested with undead to the east of his cabin. He said something about the ground having been corrupted around that cave. I don't know what he meant."
msgstr ""
"S'amuletu est in una gruta prena de non-mortos, a oriente de sa barraca sua. "
"At naradu calicuna cosa subra de su terrinu, chi est istadu corrùmpidu a "
"inghìriu de cussa gruta. No isco ite cheriat nàrrere."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lleglaris:30
msgid "I have given the amulet back to Lleglaris."
msgstr "Apo torradu s'amuletu a Lleglaris."

#: questlist_v070_lowyna.json:lleglaris:40
msgid "As thanks, Lleglaris offered to trade some of his items with me."
msgstr ""
"Pro mi ringratziare, Lleglaris m'at ofertu de fàghere cummèrtziu cun megus "
"pro unos cantos de sos ogetos suos."

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp
msgid "Taste is everything"
msgstr "Su gustu est totu"

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp:10
msgid "I should visit the potion-maker in Fallhaven and ask for something to help against food poisoning."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere andare a bìdere su fraigadore de potziones de Fallhaven e li "
"pedire calicuna cosa chi agiudet contra a s'intossicatzione alimentare."

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp:15
msgid "The potion-maker in Fallhaven can create potions that help against food-poisoning."
msgstr ""
"Su fraigadore de potziones de Fallhaven podet fàghere potziones chi agiudant "
"contra a s'intossicatzione alimentare."

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp:20
msgid "I should bring him a poison gland, two pieces of animal hair and 50 gold pieces, and he'll create a potion for me."
msgstr ""
"Li dia dèpere giùghere una gràndula de velenu, duos bìculos de pilu de "
"animale e 50 monedas de oro, e issu m'at a fàghere una potzione."

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp:30
msgid "I have brought the ingredients for the potion."
msgstr "Apo batidu sos ingredientes pro sa potzione."

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp:35
msgid "I received a potion of antidote, that should help me if I get food-poisoning."
msgstr ""
"Apo retzidu una potzione de contravelenu, chi m'at a agiudare si mi avelenat "
"su màndigu."

#: questlist_v070_misc.json:antifoodp:40
msgid "I can bring him more ingredients if I want him to create more antidote potions in the future."
msgstr ""
"Si chèrgio chi mi fatzat àteras potziones de contravelenu in su tempus "
"benidore, li potzo giùghere àteros ingredientes."

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar
msgid "The way out is through"
msgstr "Pro nde essire, depes passare in mesu"

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:10
msgid "I talked with Lodar about a possible shortcut to the outside world. He said I should check the cave under the former cave of the Hira'zinn."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Lodar de un'incurtzadòrgiu possìbile pro su mundu de fora. "
"M'at naradu de controllare sa gruta chi est suta de sa chi fiat sa gruta de "
"su Hira'zinn."

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:20
msgid "I've found the cave but the way is blocked by rocks and water. Why can't I swim?"
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sa gruta, ma su caminu est serradu dae rocas e abba. Pro ite non "
"potzo nadare?"

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:22
msgid "The rock formations are not the only thing that changed here. There is now a path through the water."
msgstr ""
"Sas formatziones de rocas non sunt s'ùnica cosa chi est cambiada inoghe. "
"Como b'at unu caminu in mesu de s'abba."

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:26
msgid "I notice a torch burning with a strange purple hue. It's definitely a magical item. I should ask Lodar about this torch."
msgstr ""
"Noto una tortza chi brùsiat cun unu colore de pùrpura istranu. Est de seguru "
"un'ogetu màgicu. Dia dèpere preguntare a Lodar de custa tortza."

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:30
msgid "Upon telling Lodar about the purple fire he gave me a green vial, and told me to pour it over the torch to see what happens."
msgstr ""
"Cando apo contadu a Lodar de su fogu de pùrpura, m'at dadu una fiala birde, "
"e m'at naradu de la ghetare subra de sa tortza pro bìdere ite càpitat."

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:40
msgid "I poured the vial over the purple fire and then it turned green. When approaching it I was teleported into another room of the cave with more purple torches. I was able to activate them as well. Finally, I have got my shortcut and can travel to Lodar a lot faster!"
msgstr ""
"Apo ghetadu sa fiala subra de su fogu de pùrpura e su fogu s'est fatu birde. "
"Cando mi nche so acurtziadu, so istadu trasportadu in un'àteru aposentu de "
"sa gruta, cun àteras tortzas de pùrpura. Las apo pòdidas ativare fintzas "
"cussas. A sa fine, apo s'incurtzadòrgiu meu e potzo andare a bìdere a Lodar "
"meda prus a lestru!"

#: questlist_shortcut_lodar.json:shortcut_lodar:50
msgid "I told Lodar about the new shortcut. He asked me to keep it a secret."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Lodar de s'incurtzadòrgiu nou. M'at pedidu de lu mantènnere "
"segretu."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven
msgid "A path to the Duleian Road"
msgstr "Unu caminu pro s'àndala duleiana"

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:10
msgid "I talked to a guard in the east of Fallhaven. He watches over the old passage to the Duleian Road, which is now blocked by fallen trees. If I want to help opening the path I should talk to his superior, the guard captain in the Fallhaven prison."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun una guàrdia in s'oriente de Fallhaven. Abbàidat su passàgiu "
"betzu pro s'àndala duleiana, chi como est serradu dae àrbores rutas. Si "
"chèrgio agiudare a abèrrere su caminu, dia dèpere faeddare cun su superiore "
"suo, su capitanu de sas guàrdias in sa presone de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:20
msgid "I talked to the guard captain. I wasn't able to convince him, but he advised me to talk to the woodcutter Jakrar, who lives just south of Fallhaven's prison."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun su capitanu de sas guàrdias. No l'apo pòdidu cumbìnchere, "
"ma m'at cussigiadu de faeddare cun su linnadore Jakrar, chi bivet pròpiu a "
"sud de sa presone de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:30
msgid "I talked to Jakrar the woodcutter. He will only clear the trees away if I do him a favor. I should search for his favorite axe east of the Crossroads Guardhouse, located to the north of Fallhaven. I should keep my eyes open for an evil wolf pack."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Jakrar su linnadore. Nche at a bogare sas àrbores petzi si "
"li fatzo unu favore. Dia dèpere chircare s'istrale preferidu suo a oriente "
"de su Corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada, chi est a nord de Fallhaven. Dia "
"dèpere istare atentu a una truma de lupos malos."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:40
msgid "I have found a wolf pack and slain their leader. Beneath its remains I found Jakrar's axe. I should take it back to him."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una truma de lupos e apo ochidu su cabu issoro. Suta de sos "
"restos suos apo agatadu s'istrale de Jakrar. Bi lu dia dèpere torrare."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:40
msgid "I showed Jakrar the axe I found and he recognized it immediately."
msgstr "Apo mustradu a Jakrar s'istrale chi apo agatadu e l'at connotu deretu."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:50
msgid "Jakrar was very happy to see his good old axe again. He expressed his gratitude, and started to clear away the trees immediately."
msgstr ""
"Jakrar fiat cuntentu meda de torrare a bìdere s'istrale suo bonu e betzu. "
"M'at ringratziadu e at cumintzadu deretu a nche bogare sas àrbores."

#: questlist_pathway_fallhaven.json:pathway_fallhaven:60
msgid "Now the woodcutter has cleared away all the trees that blocked the path. Finally, the townsfolk have got back their shortcut to the Duleian Road!"
msgstr ""
"Como su linnadore nch'at bogadu totu sas àrbores chi serraiant su caminu. A "
"sa fine, sa gente de sa bidda at torradu a tènnere s'incurtzadòrgiu suo pro "
"s'àndala duleiana!"

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise
msgid "Surprise?"
msgstr "Sorpresa?"

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:10
msgid "Halvor asked me to bring him 5 insect wings."
msgstr "Halvor m'at pedidu de li giùghere 5 alas de babbautzu."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:15
msgid "I gave Halvor the 5 insect wings he wanted."
msgstr "Apo dadu a Halvor sas 5 alas de babbautzu chi cheriat."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:20
msgid "Halvor asked me to bring him 5 rat tails."
msgstr "Halvor m'at pedidu de li giùghere 5 coas de sòrighe."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:25
msgid "I gave Halvor 5 rat tails."
msgstr "Apo dadu 5 coas de sòrighe a Halvor."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:30
msgid "My rat tails weren't good enough for him. He needs more. How many does he really want?"
msgstr ""
"Sas coas de sòrighe meas non fiant bonas bastante pro issu. Nde cheret "
"àteras. Cantas nde cheret a beru?"

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:40
msgid "I refused to bring more rat tails to Halvor. He left Crossglen."
msgstr ""
"Apo refudadu de giùghere àteras coas de sòrighe a Halvor. Si nch'est andadu "
"dae Crossglen."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:50
msgid "I met Halvor at the foot of a mountain."
msgstr "Apo atopadu a Halvor a pee de unu monte."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:60
msgid "Halvor told me he is still looking for 5 rat tails. I agreed to help again."
msgstr ""
"Halvor m'at naradu chi est galu chirchende 5 coas de sòrighe. Apo atzetadu "
"de l'agiudare torra."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:65
msgid "The 5 rat tails I gave him were good enough this time."
msgstr "Custa borta sas 5 coas de sòrighe chi l'apo dadu fiant bonas bastante."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:70
msgid "Halvor asked for 4 handfuls of animal hair."
msgstr "Halvor m'at pedidu 4 manadas de pilu de animale."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:75
msgid "I gave him 4 handfuls of animal hair."
msgstr "L'apo dadu 4 manadas de pilu de animale."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:80
msgid "Halvor liked only one of my handfuls of animal hair. He asked me to bring him 3 more."
msgstr ""
"A Halvor l'est pràghida petzi una de sas manadas de pilu de animale chi "
"l'apo dadu. M'at pedidu de nde li giùghere àteras 3."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:90
msgid "I gave up on finding handfuls of animal hair that suit Halvor's taste. He has left."
msgstr ""
"Apo lassadu pèrdere de chircare manadas de pilu de animale chi andent bene "
"pro su gustu de Halvor. Si nch'est andadu."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:100
msgid "I met Halvor again. He was standing by the lakeside, near an old house, in the north."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a atopare a Halvor. Fiat in s'oru de su lagu, acanta de una domo "
"betza, in su nord."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:110
msgid "Halvor was in bad shape. He asked me to give him a healing potion."
msgstr "Halvor istaiat male. M'at pedidu de li dare una potzione de salude."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:111
msgid "I gave Halvor a small healing potion."
msgstr "Apo dadu a Halvor una potzione de salude pitica."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:112
msgid "I gave Halvor a healing potion."
msgstr "Apo dadu a Halvor una potzione de salude."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:113
msgid "I gave Halvor a powerful healing potion."
msgstr "Apo dadu a Halvor una potzione de salude potente."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:114
msgid "I gave Halvor a potion made by Lodar."
msgstr "Apo dadu a Halvor una potzione fata dae Lodar."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:115
msgid "He was healed by the potion I gave him."
msgstr "Sa potzione chi l'apo dadu l'at curadu."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:120
msgid "Halvor told me he is still looking for 3 tufts of animal hair."
msgstr ""
"Halvor m'at naradu chi est galu chirchende 3 manadas de pilu de animale."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:125
msgid "This time, the handfuls of animal hair I gave him were soft enough."
msgstr ""
"Custa borta, sas manadas de pilu de animale chi l'apo dadu fiant moddes "
"bastante."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:130
msgid "Halvor wants to find two bones. He wants long ones. I'll try to find some."
msgstr ""
"Halvor cheret agatare duos ossos. Los cheret longos. Apo a chircare de nde "
"agatare."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:135
msgid "I gave Halvor two bones, but they weren't long enough. Should I really bring him more bones?"
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu duos ossos a Halvor, ma non fiant longos bastante. Li depo giùghere "
"a beru àteros ossos?"

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:140
msgid "Halvor left the lakeside when I refused to get him more bones."
msgstr ""
"Halvor si nch'est andadu dae s'oru de su lagu cando apo refudadu de li "
"agatare àteros ossos."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:150
msgid "Exploring the ruins of Charwood, I stumbled upon Halvor."
msgstr ""
"Mentras esploraia sas ruinas de Padente Brusiadu, pro casu apo atopadu a "
"Halvor."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:160
msgid "Since I last met him, he found one bone that was long enough, but he's still looking for one."
msgstr ""
"Dae s'ùrtima borta chi l'apo bidu, at agatadu un'ossu longu bastante, ma nde "
"est galu chirchende un'àteru."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:165
msgid "I found a bone that was long enough, and gave it to Halvor."
msgstr "Apo agatadu un'ossu longu bastante, e l'apo dadu a Halvor."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:170
msgid "Halvor asked me to find 10 scales from venomscale snakes."
msgstr "Halvor m'at pedidu de agatare 10 iscatas de iscatavelenu."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:175
msgid "I brought Halvor the 10 venomscale scales."
msgstr "Apo batidu a Halvor sas 10 iscatas de iscatavelenu."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:180
msgid "Halvor left, asking me to pay a visit to his friend Kayla if I ever go to Stoutford."
msgstr ""
"Halvor si nch'est andadu, e m'at pedidu de andare a bìdere a s'amiga sua "
"Kayla si mai apo a andare a Stoutford."

#: questlist_halvor_surprise.json:halvor_surprise:190
msgid "I met Kayla in Stoutford. She offered me a pair of the boots she made with Halvor's items."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Kayla in Stoutford. M'at ofertu unu pàgiu de sas botas chi at "
"fatu cun sos ogetos de Halvor."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings
msgid "Rumblings"
msgstr "Tronos de suta terra"

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:10
msgid "The priest in Stoutford looks scared of me and of what I did, but we never met before. Can this have something to do with Andor?"
msgstr ""
"Su preìderu de Stoutford paret chi tèngiat timòria de mene e de su chi apo "
"fatu, ma non nos semus mai bidos in antis. Diat pòdere èssere chi custu "
"tèngiat ite bìdere cun Andor?"

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:20
msgid "The priest's acolyte, Yolgen, told me that Andor was here a while ago, and since then, scary noises resonate in the church, seemingly coming from underground."
msgstr ""
"S'acòlitu de su preìderu, Yolgen, m'at naradu chi Andor est istadu inoghe "
"unu pagu de tempus a como, e chi dae tando in sa crèsia resonant sonos chi "
"faghent timòria, e chi parent bènnere dae suta de terra."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:25
msgid "A member of the Thieve's Guild in the tavern of Stoutford told me that the tavern owner dealt with Andor."
msgstr ""
"Unu membru de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros in su tzilleri de Stoutford m'at "
"naradu chi su mere de su tzilleri at fatu afàrios cun Andor."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:30
msgid "Glasforn, the owner of the tavern of Stoutford, admits to knowing Andor, but evades all my questions by boasting about his beds' quality."
msgstr ""
"Glasforn, su mere de su tzilleri de Stoutford, ammitet chi connoschet a "
"Andor, ma fuit a totu sas preguntas meas bantende sa calidade de sos letos "
"suos."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:50
msgid "After sleeping in Glasforn's bed, I woke up in a cave, and was attacked by a monster. I killed it, but I should go see Glasforn again."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere dormidu in su letu de Glasforn, mi so ischidadu in una "
"gruta, e unu mostru m'at atacadu. L'apo ochidu, ma dia dèpere torrare a "
"bìdere a Glasforn."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:60
msgid "When Glasforn saw me, he was really scared. Hopefully I'll get some information from him."
msgstr ""
"Cando Glasforn m'at bidu, teniat timòria meda. Isperamus chi nde potza "
"tènnere calicuna informatzione."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:70
msgid "I confronted Glasforn. He admited everything, but blamed Andor for it. How can Andor be involved in this?"
msgstr ""
"Apo afrontadu a Glasforn. At ammìtidu totu, ma at dadu sa culpa a Andor. "
"Comente podet èssere chi Andor tèngiat ite bìdere cun custu?"

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:80
msgid "Yolgen told me the rumbles have stopped. I should talk to the priest."
msgstr ""
"Yolgen m'at naradu chi sos sonos sunt acabbados. Dia dèpere faeddare cun su "
"preìderu."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:85
msgid "The priest told me the monster was a lich. I should keep its heart safe."
msgstr ""
"Su preìderu m'at naradu chi su mostru fiat unu lich. Dia dèpere mantènnere "
"su coro suo in logu seguru."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:90
msgid "The priest thanked me for saving his church and asked who the culprit was."
msgstr ""
"Su preìderu m'at ringratziadu pro àere sarvadu sa crèsia sua e m'at "
"preguntadu chie fiat su culpàbile."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:100
msgid "I told him I do not know who was responsible."
msgstr "L'apo naradu chi no isco chie est su responsàbile."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:103
msgid "I told him Glasforn was responsible."
msgstr "L'apo naradu chi su responsàbile fiat Glasforn."

#: questlist_stoutford.json:rumblings:106
msgid "I told him Andor was responsible."
msgstr "L'apo naradu chi su responsàbile fiat Andor."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest
msgid "Mine for the taking"
msgstr "Meu, petzi de lu leare"

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:10
msgid "I stumbled across a treasure chest in a clearing south of the Waterway house but the chest is protected by some form of magic and cannot be opened."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu pro casu una càscia de tesoro in una lascura a sud de sa domo de "
"su Caminu de abba, ma sa càscia est amparada dae una genia de màgia e non si "
"podet abèrrere."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:20
msgid "I encountered a traveler a short distance from the treasure chest. He told me there is a legend that the key to the chest is held by one of the undead that roam the cemetery to the south of the chest. However, the entrance to the cemetery is sealed by a magical force."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu unu biagiante a pagu distàntzia dae sa càscia. M'at naradu chi "
"b'at una legenda segundu sa cale sa crae de sa càscia la tenet unu de sos "
"non-mortos chi andant a giru in su campusantu a sud de sa càscia. Ma "
"s'intrada de su campusantu est sigillada dae una fortza màgica."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:30
msgid "The traveler told me that Hagale in the Wood settlement might know how to enter the cemetery."
msgstr ""
"Su biagiante m'at naradu chi Hagale, in s'insediamentu de Wood, diat pòdere "
"ischire comente si intrat in su campusantu."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:35
msgid "I went to the Wood settlement and found Hagale. He was a drunk mess and would not speak to me unless I brought him two Lowyna's special brew."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a s'insediamentu de Wood e apo agatadu a Hagale. Fiat imbriagu a "
"mortu e non mi diat faeddare si non li giughia duas Bèvidas ispetziales de "
"Lowyna."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:40
msgid "Hagale said that the entrance to the cemetery was also sealed with magic to safeguard the key to the chest. The seal can only be broken by defeating the undead monster. However, Hagale found an ancient text that allows the holder to temporarily enter the cemetery. Hagale gave me the text."
msgstr ""
"Hagale at naradu chi s'intrada de su campusantu fiat sigillada fintzas issa "
"cun sa màgia pro amparare sa crae de sa càscia. Su sigillu si podet truncare "
"petzi ochiende su mostru non-mortu. Però Hagale at agatadu unu testu antigu "
"chi permitit a chie lu tenet de intrare pro unu pagu de tempus in su "
"campusantu. Hagale m'at dadu su testu."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:50
msgid "I returned to the cemetery and was able to enter it using the ancient text just as Hagale had claimed."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a su campusantu e apo pòdidu intrare impreende su testu antigu, "
"pròpiu comente aiat naradu Hagale."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:60
msgid "I hacked through a horde of undead until I encountered one wearing a key."
msgstr ""
"Mi so abertu su caminu in mesu de una truma de non-mortos finas a cando "
"nd'apo atopadu unu chi giughiat una crae."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:70
msgid "I killed the undead and took the key."
msgstr "Apo ochidu su non-mortu e apo leadu sa crae."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:80
msgid "I opened the chest, which contained a powerful sword. Next time I'm in the Wood settlement I should see if Hagale is still around."
msgstr ""
"Apo abertu sa càscia, chi cunteniat un'ispada poderosa. Sa borta chi apo a "
"èssere in s'insediamentu de Wood dia dèpere bìdere si Hagale est galu in "
"giru."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:90
msgid "Hagale tried to rob me and take the sword, but I killed him and took it back."
msgstr ""
"Hagale at chircadu de mi furare s'ispada, ma l'apo ochidu e mi l'apo torrada "
"a leare."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:95
msgid "Hagale tried to rob me and take the sword. He lost his wife and daughter and wasn't thinking straight. I gave him the sword without a fight."
msgstr ""
"Hagale at chircadu de mi furare s'ispada. Aiat pèrdidu sa mugere e sa fìgia "
"e non teniat sa conca a postu. L'apo dadu s'ispada chene cumbàtere."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:100
msgid "Hagale wanted some of the gold I got from selling the sword. It seemed fair to give him a share."
msgstr ""
"Hagale cheriat una parte de s'oro chi apo leadu bendende s'ispada. Mi pariat "
"giustu de bi nde dare una parte."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:graveyard_quest:105
msgid "Hagale tried to rob me of the gold I got from selling the sword. I had no choice but to kill him."
msgstr ""
"Hagale at chircadu de mi furare s'oro chi apo leadu bendende s'ispada. No "
"aia àteru remèdiu: l'apo dèpidu ochìere."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave
msgid "Just the beginning"
msgstr "Petzi su cumintzu"

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:10
msgid "In a lonely house east of Loneford, I met an old man named Cithurn."
msgstr ""
"In una domo isolada a oriente de Loneford, apo atopadu un'òmine betzu chi si "
"narat Cithurn."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:12
msgid "Cithurn told me he needs an experienced fighter to help with his problem."
msgstr ""
"Cithurn m'at naradu chi li serbit unu gherreri espertu pro l'agiudare cun "
"unu problema suo."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:15
msgid "Cithurn told me that the surrounding forest has been under invasion by monsters for several weeks."
msgstr ""
"Cithurn m'at naradu chi su padente a inghìriu est invàdidu dae mostros dae "
"unas cantas chidas."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:20
msgid "Cithurn heard something similar was occurring in Charwood until a young adventurer killed a vile beast in the mine beneath the city."
msgstr ""
"Cithurn at intesu chi una cosa simigiante fiat sutzedende in Padente "
"Brusiadu finas a cando unu ventureri giòvanu at ochidu una bèstia lègia in "
"sa miniera suta de sa tzitade."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:25
msgid "I told Cithurn about my role in Charwood and of my battle with Thukuzun."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Cithurn de su chi apo fatu in Padente Brusiadu e de sa batalla "
"mea cun su Thukuzun."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:30
msgid "Cithurn did not remember if the forest invasion began before the events in Charwood or after. However, based on my experiences in Charwood, Cithurn believes there is a connection between the two."
msgstr ""
"Cithurn non s'ammentaiat si s'invasione de su padente fiat cumintzada in "
"antis o a pustis de sos fatos de Padente Brusiadu. Però, a pustis de àere "
"intesu su chi apo bìvidu in Padente Brusiadu, Cithurn creet chi b'apat unu "
"ligàmene intre sas duas cosas."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:35
msgid "I promised Cithurn I would investigate the source of the monster invasion in the forest. I will have to pass through the forest to access an entrance to a cave east of Cithurn's home."
msgstr ""
"Apo promìtidu a Cithurn chi apo a investigare s'orìgine de s'invasione de "
"mostros in su padente. Apo a dèpere passare in mesu de su padente pro "
"lòmpere a s'intrada de una gruta a oriente de sa domo de Cithurn."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:40
msgid "I found the entrance to the cave."
msgstr "Apo agatadu s'intrada de sa gruta."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:45
msgid "I reached the end of the cave system. The air became damper the deeper I went."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a sa fine de su sistema de grutas. S'àera fiat semper prus ùmida "
"a cantu prus andaia a fundu."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:50
msgid "Among the cold and damp lower parts of the cave, I encountered another dragon-like creature. This must be the source of all the chaos in the forest above. I should attempt to kill it."
msgstr ""
"In mesu de sas partes bassas de sa gruta, fritas e ùmidas, apo atopadu "
"un'àtera creadura simigiante a unu dragu. Custa depet èssere s'orìgine de "
"totu su caos de su padente de subra. Dia dèpere chircare de l'ochìere."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:55
msgid "I killed the monster called Tesrekan and took one of its bones as proof. I should venture back to Cithurn to tell him about it."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu su mostru chi si narat Tesrekan e nd'apo leadu un'ossu comente "
"proa. Dia dèpere torrare a Cithurn pro bi lu contare."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:60
msgid "I presented one of the bones from the corpse of Tesrekan to Cithurn. He was happy to hear that I killed the source of the monster invasion. As we agreed, I returned his talisman."
msgstr ""
"Apo mustradu a Cithurn unu de sos ossos de su corpus de Tesrekan. Fiat "
"cuntentu de ischire chi apo ochidu s'orìgine de s'invasione de mostros. "
"Comente aìamus cuncordadu, l'apo torradu su talismanu suo."

#: questlist_graveyard1.json:waterwayacave:70
msgid "I presented one of the bones from the corpse of Tesrekan to Cithurn. He was happy to hear that I killed the source of the monster invasion. I decided to keep his talisman as payment for my hard work."
msgstr ""
"Apo mustradu a Cithurn unu de sos ossos de su corpus de Tesrekan. Fiat "
"cuntentu de ischire chi apo ochidu s'orìgine de s'invasione de mostros. Apo "
"detzìdidu de mi tènnere su talismanu suo comente pagamentu pro totu su "
"traballu chi apo fatu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart
msgid "Roses"
msgstr "Rosas"

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:10
msgid "On a farm I heard of Guynmart Castle nearby. The farmer Rhodita is worried about young Lady Hannah of Guynmart, who used to visit often but has not been seen for a week now. Rhodita asked me to check on her."
msgstr ""
"In una massaria apo intesu faeddare de su Casteddu de Guynmart, inoghe "
"acanta. Sa massaja Rhodita est preocupada pro sa giòvana dama Hannah de "
"Guynmart, chi andaiat a la bìdere a s'ispissu ma chi como non si bidet dae "
"una chida. Rhodita m'at pedidu de andare a bìdere comente istat."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:16
#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:18
msgid "I got to the castle, but the main gate was shut."
msgstr "So lòmpidu a su casteddu, ma su portale printzipale fiat serradu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:20
msgid "I found the way into the castle garden."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su caminu pro intrare in su giardinu de su casteddu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:30
msgid "The guard at the back door is corrupt. He agreed to let me through for some gold."
msgstr ""
"Sa guàrdia de sa ghenna de segus est corrùmpida. At atzetadu de mi lassare "
"passare pro unu pagu de oro."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:32
msgid "He told me who is living at the castle: Guynmart himself, and his children Hannah and Robalyrius."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu chie bivet in su casteddu: Guynmart etotu, e sos fìgios Hannah e "
"Robalyrius."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:40
msgid "In the main hall I met Unkorh the steward. He expected Guynmart to return the following morning. He says I should go to the kitchen for some bread and then leave."
msgstr ""
"In sa sala printzipale apo atopadu a s'intendente Unkorh. Isetaiat chi "
"Guynmart torraret su mangianu a pustis. Narat chi dia dèpere andare a sa "
"coghina pro unu pagu de pane e a pustis mi nch'andare."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:45
msgid "I met Lady Hannah's little brother, Rob."
msgstr "Apo atopadu a su frade piticu de sa dama Hannah, Rob."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:50
msgid "The maid told me that Hannah is missing her betrothed. I should talk to Hannah; she is on the tower top. To get to her, I should offer the cook to take Hannah her lunch."
msgstr ""
"Sa tzeraca m'at naradu chi a Hannah li mancat su fidantzadu. Dia dèpere "
"faeddare cun Hannah; est in sa punta de sa turre. Pro lòmpere a issa, dia "
"dèpere ofèrrere a su coghineri de giùghere su màndigu de mesudie a Hannah."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:60
msgid "I overheard Unkorh the steward talking to himself. He plans for Guynmart to die in the castle dungeon, and after ursuping the throne he would marry Lady Hannah."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu pro casu a s'intendente Unkorh faeddende a sa sola. Tenet in "
"mente de fàghere mòrrere a Guynmart in sas presones de su casteddu, e a "
"pustis de àere leadu su tronu cheret cojuare cun sa dama Hannah."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:62
msgid "I suggested to Hofala the cook that I could take some lunch to Lady Hannah. He had no more of his special herb selection for the lunch and asked me to get some fresh herbs from Nuik in the garden."
msgstr ""
"Apo propostu a Hofala, su coghineri, chi podia giùghere deo su màndigu de "
"mesudie a sa dama Hannah. No aiat prus de sa seletzione sua ispetziale de "
"erbas pro su màndigu de mesudie e m'at pedidu de leare unas cantas erbas "
"friscas dae Nuik, in su giardinu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:63
msgid "Nuik gave some herbs to me."
msgstr "Nuik m'at dadu unas cantas erbas."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:64
msgid "I should take lunch to Lady Hannah on the tower top."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere giùghere su màndigu de mesudie a sa dama Hannah, in sa punta de "
"sa turre."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:70
msgid "Hannah is filled with grief, she cannot think clearly without the smell of a rose. Before she can tell me her whole story, she needs a fresh, fragrant rose."
msgstr ""
"Hannah est prena de dolore, e non podet pensare cun craresa chene su fragu "
"de una rosa. In antis de mi pòdere contare totu s'istòria sua, tenet "
"bisòngiu de una rosa frisca e nuscosa."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:80
msgid "Unkorh saw me talking to Hannah. He was very jealous and asked guard Olav to show me the special guest exit."
msgstr ""
"Unkorh m'at bidu faeddende cun Hannah. Fiat gelosu meda e at pedidu a sa "
"guàrdia Olav de mi mustrare s'essida ispetziale pro sos istràngios."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:81
msgid "I met Norgothla, the chief of Guynmart's personal guard. He was troubled about my news from the castle, and asked me to get evidence for it."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Norgothla, su cabu de sa guàrdia personale de Guynmart. Fiat "
"preocupadu pro sas novas meas de su casteddu, e m'at pedidu de agatare proas."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:82
msgid "I got the rose from the guard at the garden door at last."
msgstr ""
"A sa fine apo otentu sa rosa dae sa guàrdia de sa ghenna de su giardinu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:90
msgid "I gave the rose to Hannah. She told me that Lovis has vanished. In the deepenst depths of her darkest dreams she hears Lovis' voice calling out."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu sa rosa a Hannah. M'at contadu chi Lovis est isparèssidu. In su "
"prus fundu de sos sònnios suos prus iscuros intendet sa boghe de Lovis chi "
"la tzèrriat."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:100
msgid "Hannah gave Lovis' flute to me, so that I might prove that I was sent by Hannah."
msgstr ""
"Hannah m'at dadu su flàutu de Lovis, gasi chi potza dimustrare chi m'at "
"mandadu Hannah."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:110
msgid "I met Rob in a room above the watch chamber. Rob promised to distract the guards so that I could pass by."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Rob in un'aposentu subra de s'aposentu de sa guàrdia. Rob m'at "
"promìtidu de distràere sas guàrdias pro chi potza passare."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:120
msgid "120 obsolete - The guards were distracted and would not see anybody climbing downstairs."
msgstr ""
"120 non s'impreat prus - Sas guàrdias fiant distratas e non diant àere bidu "
"a nemos falende sas iscalas."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:130
msgid "130 obsolete - I jumped into the dark dungeon below the tower."
msgstr ""
"130 non s'impreat prus - So brincadu in sa presone iscura suta de sa turre."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:132
msgid "I jumped into the dark dungeon below the tower where I found Lovis. He was overjoyed to get back his flute."
msgstr ""
"So brincadu in sa presone iscura suta de sa turre, in ue apo agatadu a "
"Lovis. Fiat cuntentu a beru meda de torrare a tènnere su flàutu suo."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:134
msgid "The dungeon door flew open. The torturer entered and demanded that we stop the noise."
msgstr ""
"Sa ghenna de sa presone s'est aberta de botu. Est intradu su turmentadore e "
"at ordinadu de acabbare cun su remore."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:136
msgid "After the torturer's death the door was open."
msgstr "A pustis de sa morte de su turmentadore, sa ghenna fiat aberta."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:140
msgid "Lovis left and went into the woods to get Guynmart's personal guards."
msgstr ""
"Lovis si nch'est andadu a su padente a chircare sa guàrdia personale de "
"Guynmart."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:160
msgid "Guynmart was laying half dead in a cell. He asked me to open the castle gate so that his personal guard may come in. After that I should run and hide, because there would be a dangerous battle. I should not return before the following morning."
msgstr ""
"Guynmart fiat corcadu, mesu mortu, in una tzella. M'at pedidu de abèrrere su "
"portale de su casteddu pro chi sa guàrdia personale sua potzat intrare. A "
"pustis dia dèpere fuire e mi cuare, ca b'at a àere una batalla perigulosa. "
"Non dia dèpere torrare in antis de su mangianu a pustis."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:161
msgid "Unkorh appeared and explained many things. Then Unkorh saw that Guynmart tried to kill me from behind, but stumbled and fell onto his own knife. I should still open the gate, and then go to the farm in the south until the morning."
msgstr ""
"Est aparèssidu Unkorh e at ispiegadu medas cosas. Tando Unkorh at bidu chi "
"Guynmart at chircadu de m'ochìere a palas, ma at trabucadu e est rutu subra "
"de su gurteddu suo etotu. Dia dèpere abèrrere su portale su matessi, e a "
"pustis andare a sa massaria de su sud finas a su mangianu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:162
msgid "Unkorh appeared and killed Guynmart. Then he fled like a coward."
msgstr ""
"Est aparèssidu Unkorh e at ochidu a Guynmart. A pustis est fuidu comente unu "
"vile."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:163
msgid "The guards let me through to the wall."
msgstr "Sas guàrdias m'ant lassadu passare finas a su muru."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:164
msgid "I got the main gate open."
msgstr "So resèssidu a abèrrere su portale printzipale."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:170
msgid "I went to Rhodita the farmer and stayed there for the night."
msgstr "So andadu dae Rhodita, sa massaja, e bi so abarradu pro su note."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:180
msgid "When I got to the castle on the next day, I saw Hannah and Lovis in the throne room. The castle was decorated for a wedding and there had been a merry feast."
msgstr ""
"Cando so lòmpidu a su casteddu sa die a pustis, apo bidu a Hannah e a Lovis "
"in sa sala de su tronu. Su casteddu fiat decoradu pro una coja e b'aiat "
"àpidu una festa allegra."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:181
msgid "When I got to the castle on the next day, I saw Unkorh the steward in the throne room. The castle was decorated for a wedding and there had been a merry feast."
msgstr ""
"Cando so lòmpidu a su casteddu sa die a pustis, apo bidu a s'intendente "
"Unkorh in sa sala de su tronu. Su casteddu fiat decoradu pro una coja e "
"b'aiat àpidu una festa allegra."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:190
msgid "Hannah gave me an everlasting fragrant rose as a present."
msgstr "Hannah m'at regaladu una rosa nuscosa chi durat pro semper."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:200
msgid "I was allowed to choose something from the treasury."
msgstr "M'ant permìtidu de seberare una cosa dae su tesoro."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:201
msgid "I took the money."
msgstr "Apo leadu su dinare."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:202
msgid "I took the scroll of wisdom."
msgstr "Apo leadu sa pergamena de sa sabiesa."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:203
msgid "I took the shield."
msgstr "Apo leadu s'iscudu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:210
msgid "Lovis prepared a surprise for me east of the castle."
msgstr "Lovis m'at aprontadu una sorpresa a oriente de su casteddu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart:211
msgid "Then I took my leave of Unkorh."
msgstr "Tando apo saludadu a Unkorh e mi nche so andadu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles
msgid "Marble hunting"
msgstr "Chirca de sas bìllias"

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:10
msgid "Little Stuephant was crying because he lost his marbles. You told him you would find them for him."
msgstr ""
"Su piticu Stuephant fiat pranghende ca aiat pèrdidu sas bìllias suas. L'as "
"promìtidu chi las dias agatare tue pro issu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:21
msgid "I found a green marble."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una bìllia birde."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:22
msgid "I found a red marble."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una bìllia ruja."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:23
msgid "I found a pink marble."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una bìllia rosa."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:24
msgid "I found a golden marble."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una bìllia dorada."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:25
msgid "I found a pearl white marble."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una bìllia bianca che perla."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:30
msgid "That was all of them. I should give them to Stuephant now."
msgstr "Las apo agatadas totu. Como las dia dèpere dare a Stuephant."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_marbles:90
msgid "Stuephant was happy again."
msgstr "Stuephant fiat torra cuntentu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_wise
msgid "Rare delicacies"
msgstr "Delìtzias raras"

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_wise:10
msgid "I met an old man living in seclusion on a hill top. He yearned for a meal of bread and cheese, together with wine."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu un'òmine betzu chi bivet a sa sola in sa punta de unu montigru. "
"Disigiaiat unu pastu de pane e casu, cun binu."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_wise:20
msgid "I brought him bread, cheese and wine. He is very happy."
msgstr "L'apo batidu pane, casu e binu. Est cuntentu meda."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_wise:30
msgid ""
"He would be even happier if the cheese was cheddar from Charwood.\n"
"You can only get the cheddar there if you explicitly ask for it."
msgstr ""
"Diat èssere galu prus cuntentu si su casu esseret cheddar de Padente "
"Brusiadu.\n"
"Su cheddar si podet tènnere in cue petzi si lu pedis in manera crara."

#: questlist_guynmart.json:guynmart_wise:90
msgid "I got bread, cheddar and wine for him. He started feasting happily."
msgstr ""
"L'apo leadu pane, cheddar e binu. At cumintzadu a mandigare cuntentu, "
"comente chi esseret in festa."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:roots_love
msgid "The roots of love"
msgstr "Sas raighinas de s'amore"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:roots_love:10
msgid "Aryfora, a woman grieving in Stoutford's graveyard asked me to bring her some damerilias from Remgard for the grave of Noraed, her husband."
msgstr ""
"Aryfora, una fèmina chi fiat in dolu in su campusantu de Stoutford, m'at "
"pedidu de li giùghere unas cantas damerilias dae Remgard pro sa tumba de "
"Noraed, su maridu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:roots_love:20
msgid "Noraed's sister, Caeda, gave me some damerilias. I should bring them back to Stoutford."
msgstr ""
"Sa sorre de Noraed, Caeda, m'at dadu unas cantas damerilias. Las dia dèpere "
"giùghere a Stoutford."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:roots_love:30
msgid "I have brought the damerilias back to Aryfora. She thanked me with a potion she made."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sas damerilias a Aryfora. M'at ringratziadu cun una potzione chi "
"at fatu issa."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:roots_love:40
msgid "I told her the flowers were from Noraed's sister, Caeda."
msgstr "L'apo naradu chi sos frores fiant de sa sorre de Noraed, Caeda."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:roots_love:45
msgid "I told her I found the flowers around Remgard, in the wild."
msgstr ""
"L'apo naradu chi apo agatadu sos frores a inghìriu de Remgard, in campagna."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden
msgid "A secret garden"
msgstr "Unu giardinu segretu"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:10
msgid ""
"Caeda in Remgard told me I can find fresh damerilias in her family's glade, but the key was taken by monsters.\n"
"If I can find the key in the cave north of Remgard, I can access that glade, but I have to return the key to Caeda."
msgstr ""
"Caeda, in Remgard, m'at naradu chi potzo agatare damerilias friscas in sa "
"lascura de sa famìlia sua, ma sa crae l'ant leada sos mostros.\n"
"Si potzo agatare sa crae in sa gruta a nord de Remgard, potzo intrare in "
"cussa lascura, ma depo torrare sa crae a Caeda."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:20
msgid "Finding the key was not worth the trouble. The wilted damerilias Caeda gave me will be just fine."
msgstr ""
"Agatare sa crae non baliat su traballu. Sas damerilias sicadas chi m'at dadu "
"Caeda ant a andare bene su matessi."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:30
msgid "I killed some monsters and found the key to the glade."
msgstr "Apo ochidu unos cantos mostros e apo agatadu sa crae de sa lascura."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:40
msgid "I returned the key right away to Caeda."
msgstr "Apo torradu deretu sa crae a Caeda."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:45
msgid "I kept the key for a while, but finally returned it to Caeda."
msgstr ""
"Apo tentu sa crae pro unu pagu de tempus, ma a sa fine l'apo torrada a Caeda."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:50
msgid "Caeda asked for my help to clear out the monsters in the caves so that she can go back there and attend to the flowers."
msgstr ""
"Caeda m'at pedidu agiudu pro nche bogare sos mostros dae sas grutas, gasi "
"chi issa potzat torrare in cue a si curare de sos frores."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:55
msgid "Many monsters are dead now. The rest will no longer dare to approach the statue."
msgstr ""
"Medas mostros como sunt mortos. Sos àteros non s'ant a acurtziare prus a "
"s'istàtua."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:secret_garden:60
msgid "I told Caeda, so that she can attend to the glade."
msgstr ""
"L'apo naradu a Caeda, gasi chi potzat torrare a si curare de sa lascura."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance
msgid "The thorns of vengeance"
msgstr "Sas ispinas de sa vindita"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:10
msgid "Aryfora in Stoutford needs my help to prove her uncle, Blornvale, Stoutford's alchemist, killed her father."
msgstr ""
"Aryfora, in Stoutford, tenet bisòngiu de s'agiudu meu pro dimustrare chi su "
"tziu, Blornvale, s'alchimista de Stoutford, at ochidu a su babbu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:20
msgid "She needs me to purchase three potions of the brave from Blornvale and return to her."
msgstr ""
"Cheret chi còmpore tres potziones de su balente dae Blornvale e chi torre a "
"issa."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:30
msgid "I have returned with the three potions, and gave them to her."
msgstr "So torradu cun sas tres potziones, e bi las apo dadas."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:32
msgid "I decided not to help Aryfora any further."
msgstr "Apo detzìdidu de no agiudare prus a Aryfora."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:40
msgid "She gave me a potion of truth."
msgstr "M'at dadu una potzione de sa veridade."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:50
msgid "She wants me to give that potion to Blornvale, and make him confess his crimes. I should have Tahalendor as a witness."
msgstr ""
"Cheret chi dia custa potzione a Blornvale, e chi lu fatza cunfessare sos "
"crìmines suos. Dia dèpere tènnere a Tahalendor comente testimòngiu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:60
msgid "I agreed to make Blornvale drink that potion."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu de fàghere bufare cussa potzione a Blornvale."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:65
msgid "Tahalendor agreed to go with me to the alchemist's house to hear Blornvale's confession."
msgstr ""
"Tahalendor at atzetadu de bènnere cun megus a sa domo de s'alchimista pro "
"intèndere sa cunfessione de Blornvale."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:70
msgid "Blornvale drank the potion."
msgstr "Blornvale at bufadu sa potzione."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:71
msgid "Tahalendor came to hear Blornvale's confession."
msgstr "Tahalendor est bènnidu a intèndere sa cunfessione de Blornvale."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:72
msgid "Blornvale confessed to killing Aryfora's father. Unfortunately there is no witness."
msgstr ""
"Blornvale at cunfessadu de àere ochidu su babbu de Aryfora. A dolu mannu, "
"non b'at perunu testimòngiu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:74
msgid "Blornvale now understands what I was trying to do. I will no longer be able to help Aryfora get back her shop."
msgstr ""
"Como Blornvale cumprendet su chi fia chirchende de fàghere. No apo a pòdere "
"prus agiudare a Aryfora a torrare a tènnere sa butega sua."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:75
msgid "Tahalendor wouldn't believe my story. I will no longer be able to help Aryfora get back her shop."
msgstr ""
"Tahalendor no at chertu crèere a s'istòria mea. No apo a pòdere prus "
"agiudare a Aryfora a torrare a tènnere sa butega sua."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:76
msgid "It's all my fault that Aryfora is crying now."
msgstr "Est totu culpa mea si como Aryfora est pranghende."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:80
msgid "Blornvale confessed to killing Aryfora's father in the presence of Tahalendor."
msgstr ""
"Blornvale at cunfessadu de àere ochidu su babbu de Aryfora in presèntzia de "
"Tahalendor."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:thorns_vengeance:90
msgid "Aryfora regained her father's shop."
msgstr "Aryfora at torradu a tènnere sa butega de su babbu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:10
msgid "I talked to Colonel Lutarc. He proposed a competition with five of his best fighters."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun su Coronellu Lutarc. M'at propostu una gara cun chimbe de "
"sos gherreris suos mègius."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:20
msgid "I accepted. The fight will be at the foot of the hill."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu. Sa cumbata at a èssere a pee de su montigru."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:111
msgid "A lizard came towards me."
msgstr "Una tziligherta est bènnida cara a mie."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:112
msgid "I won easily."
msgstr "Apo bintu fàtzile."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:113
msgid "I lost the fight."
msgstr "Apo pèrdidu sa cumbata."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:121
msgid "The second opponent was a skeleton warrior."
msgstr "Su segundu aversàriu fiat unu gherreri ischèletru."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:122
msgid "He was no match for me."
msgstr "Pro mene non fiat unu problema."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:123
msgid "I lost against a pile of bones!"
msgstr "Apo pèrdidu contra a unu muntone de ossos!"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:131
msgid "Mikhail came and asked me to come home."
msgstr "Est bènnidu Mikhail e m'at pedidu de torrare a domo."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:132
msgid "But no, it wasn't Mikhail - it was a poser. Not a strong enough one though."
msgstr ""
"Ma no, non fiat Mikhail: fiat unu chi si faghiat passare pro issu. Però non "
"fiat forte bastante."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:133
msgid "My own father attacked me? I lost this fight."
msgstr "Babbu meu etotu m'at atacadu? Apo pèrdidu custa cumbata."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:141
msgid "Then a little dragon came forth."
msgstr "Tando est essidu unu dragu piticu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:142
#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:152
msgid "I won."
msgstr "Apo bintu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:143
msgid "It won."
msgstr "At bintu su dragu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:151
msgid "The fifth and last opponent came towards me: Bully."
msgstr "Su de chimbe e ùrtimu aversàriu est bènnidu cara a mie: Prepotente."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:153
msgid "I lost this last fight."
msgstr "Apo pèrdidu custa ùrtima cumbata."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:160
msgid "I have finished all the fights. I should climb back up to Colonel Lutarc."
msgstr ""
"Apo acabbadu totu sas cumbatas. Dia dèpere torrare a artziare finas a su "
"Coronellu Lutarc."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:170
msgid "He was pretty disappointed with my poor score."
msgstr "Fiat delusu meda pro su risultadu meu pagu bonu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:171
msgid "He was pretty impressed with my excellent result."
msgstr "Fiat impressionadu meda de su risultadu meu bonu meda."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:172
msgid "My result confirmed his relatively low expectations."
msgstr "Su risultadu meu at cunfirmadu sas isetas suas, chi fiant pagu artas."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_colonel:190
msgid "Lutarc gave me a medallion as a present. There is a tiny little lizard on it, that looks completely real."
msgstr ""
"Lutarc m'at regaladu una medàllia. B'at una tziligherta minuda minuda in "
"subra, chi paret bia a beru."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra
msgid "Lost girl looking for lost things"
msgstr "Una pitzinna pèrdida chi chircat cosas pèrdidas"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:5
msgid "The mechanism of the south gate seemed to be broken. Maybe someone in Stoutford could repair it?"
msgstr ""
"Su mecanismu de su portale de su sud pariat segadu. Forsis calicunu in "
"Stoutford lu diat pòdere acontzare?"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:10
msgid "The little daughter of Odirath the armorer has been missing for several days now. You offered to help search for her."
msgstr ""
"Sa fìgia minore de Odirath s'armajolu est isparèssida dae unas cantas dies. "
"As ofertu de agiudare a la chircare."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:20
msgid ""
"Odirath's daughter Gyra was hidden in the storeroom of the main house of the castle. She was surprised by the raid on the castle and no longer dared to leave her hiding place.\n"
"She was looking for Lord Berbane's helmet, which he had forgotten somewhere in the castle."
msgstr ""
"Sa fìgia de Odirath, Gyra, fiat cuada in su magasinu de sa domo printzipale "
"de su casteddu. S'assaltu a su casteddu l'aiat leada de sorpresa e non "
"teniat prus su coràgiu de essire dae su cuadòrgiu suo.\n"
"Fiat chirchende s'elmu de Lord Berbane, chi issu aiat ismentigadu in "
"calicuna parte de su casteddu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:30
msgid "You offered Gyra to lead her back home safely."
msgstr "As ofertu a Gyra de la torrare a domo, sana e sarva."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:40
msgid "Gyra has the feeling that the helmet is very close."
msgstr "Gyra intendet chi s'elmu est acanta meda."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:50
msgid "You found the helmet."
msgstr "As agatadu s'elmu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:60
msgid "Once back in Stoutford Gyra knew the way and ran to her father Odirath."
msgstr ""
"Una borta torrada in Stoutford, Gyra ischiat su caminu e est andada a "
"currere dae su babbu, Odirath."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:70
msgid "Odirath thanks you many thousand times."
msgstr "Odirath ti ringratziat milli bortas."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:80
msgid "Odirath had repaired the mechanism of the southern castle gate."
msgstr ""
"Odirath at acontzadu su mecanismu de su portale de su sud de su casteddu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:90
msgid "Lord Berbane slowly took his helmet. Nevertheless, he remained sitting at the table. He probably needs a few more hours without drinks before he can get back to work. If ever."
msgstr ""
"Lord Berbane at leadu s'elmu suo a bellu a bellu. Ma est abarradu sètzidu a "
"sa mesa. Est probàbile chi li serbant galu unas cantas oras chene bufare in "
"antis de pòdere torrare a traballare. Si mai at a torrare."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:92
msgid "Lord Berbane took his helmet. But somehow that does not really satisfy you."
msgstr ""
"Lord Berbane at leadu s'elmu suo. Ma in calicuna manera custu non "
"t'acuntentat a beru."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:99
#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:199
msgid "Lord Berbane is singing merrily about his pretended heroic deeds. What a boaster."
msgstr ""
"Lord Berbane est cantende cuntentu sas faghinas eròicas chi narat de àere "
"fatu. Ite bantadore."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stn_quest_gyra:170
msgid "Odirath thanked you many thousands of times."
msgstr "Odirath t'at ringratziadu milli e milli bortas."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle
msgid "Stoutford's old castle"
msgstr "Su casteddu betzu de Stoutford"

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:5
msgid "I tried to free this castle from the undead Lord Erwyn. But whenever I kill him, he reappears. I should seek help..."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de liberare custu casteddu dae su non-mortu Lord Erwyn. Ma cada "
"borta chi l'ochio, torrat a aparèssere. Dia dèpere chircare agiudu..."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:10
msgid "I talked to Yolgen, the Shadow priest of Stoutford, and he told me that the mighty Lord Erwyn used to reside here, but Lord Erwyn and his army were crushed during a war, the castle was sacked and the house extinguished. But recently Erwyn's knights have risen from the dead. Yolgen asked me to rid Stoutford of these undead once and for all."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Yolgen, su preìderu de s'Umbra de Stoutford, e m'at naradu "
"chi su poderosu Lord Erwyn biviat inoghe, ma chi Lord Erwyn e s'esèrtzitu "
"suo fiant istados distrutos in una gherra, su casteddu fiat istadu ispogiadu "
"e sa famìlia sua si fiat estinta. Ma dae pagu sos cavalieris de Erwyn sunt "
"torrados dae sa morte. Yolgen m'at pedidu de liberare Stoutford dae custos "
"non-mortos una borta pro semper."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:12
msgid "I should ask Tahalendor for some special artifact that I can use to defeat powerful undead."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere pedire a Tahalendor calicunu artefatu ispetziale chi potza "
"impreare pro bìnchere sos non-mortos poderosos."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:14
msgid "Tahalendor gave me a pair of special coins that I can use to defeat powerful undead."
msgstr ""
"Tahalendor m'at dadu unu pàgiu de monedas ispetziales chi potzo impreare pro "
"bìnchere sos non-mortos poderosos."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:16
msgid "I slew Lord Erwyn himself and ensured that he remains dead now."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu a Lord Erwyn etotu e apo fatu in modu chi como abarret mortu."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:20
msgid "I slew all the undead knights."
msgstr "Apo ochidu totu sos cavalieris non-mortos."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:30
msgid "I slew Lord Erwyn's commander."
msgstr "Apo ochidu su cumandante de Lord Erwyn."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:42
msgid "Among his remains I found a strange ring. I should show it to Yolgen."
msgstr ""
"In mesu de sos restos suos apo agatadu un'aneddu istranu. Lu dia dèpere "
"mustrare a Yolgen."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:50
msgid "Yolgen examined the ring thoroughly. He suspects it has somehow come from Mt. Galmore and reanimated the long dead soldiers. I should be wary of the evil grasp of Mt. Galmore and whatever lurks there..."
msgstr ""
"Yolgen at esaminadu bene meda s'aneddu. Suspetat chi in calicuna manera siat "
"bènnidu dae su Monte Galmore e chi apat torradu a dare vida a sos sordados "
"mortos dae meda. Dia dèpere istare atentu a sa manu mala de su Monte Galmore "
"e a cale si siat cosa chi b'istat cuada..."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:60
msgid "I kept the ring for myself, which upset Yolgen. I should keep looking for its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"Mi so tentu s'aneddu, e custu at fatu arrennegare a Yolgen. Dia dèpere "
"sighire a chircare a su mere de prima."

#: questlist_stoutford_combined.json:stoutford_castle:70
msgid "I kept the ring for myself and didn't tell Yolgen about it. He was suspicious but couldn't do anything about it. I should keep looking for its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"Mi so tentu s'aneddu e no l'apo naradu nudda a Yolgen. Fiat suspetosu, ma "
"non nde podiat fàghere nudda. Dia dèpere sighire a chircare a su mere de "
"prima."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01
msgid "Thief apprentice"
msgstr "Ladru de primu"

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:5
msgid ""
"After giving him the key of Luthor and talking with Umar about Andor, I needed to ask him about Thieves' Guild itself.\n"
"I want to join them to see what kind of jobs they do."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de li àere dadu sa crae de Luthor e de àere faeddadu cun Umar de "
"Andor, li depia preguntare de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros etotu.\n"
"Chèrgio intrare in su grèmiu pro bìdere ite genia de traballos faghent."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:10
msgid "Umar told me to talk with Troublemaker regarding my first task for the Guild."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at naradu de faeddare cun Chircabrigas pro su primu incàrrigu meu pro "
"su Grèmiu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:15
msgid "Troublemaker told me to bring him three journals from spies of the guild. First I have to talk with Leta in my village, then with Dunla in Vilegard's tavern, and finally with Fanamor somewhere around Crossroads guardhouse."
msgstr ""
"Chircabrigas m'at naradu de li giùghere tres diàrios de ispias de su grèmiu. "
"In antis depo faeddare cun Leta in sa bidda mea, a pustis cun Dunla in su "
"tzilleri de Vilegard, e a s'urtimada cun Fanamor, in calicuna parte a "
"inghìriu de su Corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:20
msgid "I have to remember to tell them the password \"You are no one. No one knows you. No one has seen you.\""
msgstr ""
"Mi depo ammentare de lis nàrrere sa paràula segreta \"Tue non ses nemos. "
"Nemos ti connoschet. Nemos t'at bidu.\""

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:25
msgid "Leta gave me her journal and advised me to not raise suspicion."
msgstr ""
"Leta m'at dadu su diàriu suo e m'at cussigiadu de non fàghere nàschere "
"suspetos."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:30
msgid "I got Dunla's journal without any problem. I have set out to get the last journal."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu su diàriu de Dunla chene perunu problema. Mi so postu in caminu "
"pro leare s'ùrtimu diàriu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:35
msgid "Fanamor gave me her journal."
msgstr "Fanamor m'at dadu su diàriu suo."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:40
msgid "Fanamor has been gravely wounded, and the Feygard Scout grabbed the journal."
msgstr ""
"Fanamor est istada ferida de manera grave, e s'esploradore de Feygard at "
"aferradu su diàriu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:45
msgid "After I had killed the Feygard scout I talked again with Fanamor. She's losing blood quickly, so I have to bring her a bandage. I need to find a trustworthy priest."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere ochidu s'esploradore de Feygard, apo torradu a faeddare cun "
"Fanamor. Est perdende sàmbene a lestru, e duncas li depo giùghere una benda. "
"Depo agatare unu preìderu de fide."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:50
msgid "Thoronir gave me a bandage. I have to return to Fanamor as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Thoronir m'at dadu una benda. Depo torrare a Fanamor cantu prus a lestru "
"potzo."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:51
msgid "Unfortunately, I was not able to save Fanamor's life. However, I did get her journal."
msgstr ""
"A dolu mannu, non so resèssidu a sarvare sa vida de Fanamor. Però apo leadu "
"su diàriu suo."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:55
msgid "Fanamor is alive and will find her own way to return."
msgstr "Fanamor est bia e at a agatare sa manera de torrare a sa sola."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves01:60
msgid "I returned to Troublemaker and gave him the journals. He told me to talk with Umar, maybe he has another task for me."
msgstr ""
"So torradu dae Chircabrigas e l'apo dadu sos diàrios. M'at naradu de "
"faeddare cun Umar: forsis tenet un'àteru incàrrigu pro mene."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02
msgid "Immaculate kidnapping"
msgstr "Unu secuestru perfetu"

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:2
msgid "After completing my first task I'm considered a member of Thieves' Guild. Now I have to perform a very risky task. Umar sent me to kidnap a noble woman from Feygard, without being discovered."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere cumpletadu su primu incàrrigu meu, como mi cunsìderant unu "
"membru de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros. Como depo fàghere un'incàrrigu arriscosu "
"meda. Umar m'at mandadu a secuestrare una fèmina nòbile de Feygard, chene "
"chi mi iscobèrgiant."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:4
msgid "She was recently seen in the Foaming Flask tavern."
msgstr "L'ant bida dae pagu in su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:6
msgid "Umar gave me some advice. My strength is not always the solution. I must \"use my tongue\" to avoid raising suspicion in the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at dadu unos cantos cussìgios. Sa fortza mea no est semper sa "
"solutzione. Depo \"impreare sa limba\" pro non fàghere nàschere suspetos in "
"su tzilleri."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:10
msgid "Ambelie Laumwill doesn't want to come with me peacefully. I cannot make a scene, or the guards will alert other patrols. Maybe talking with them would solve the situation."
msgstr ""
"Ambelie Laumwill non cheret bènnere cun megus in paghe. Non potzo fàghere "
"iscàndalu, ca si nono sas guàrdias ant a avisare àteras patrùllias. Forsis "
"faeddende cun issas si diat pòdere risòlvere sa situatzione."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:15
msgid "I have \"used my tongue\" with the main Feygard soldier in the Foaming Flask tavern. He gave me permission to \"escort back\" Ambelie."
msgstr ""
"Apo \"impreadu sa limba\" cun su sordadu printzipale de Feygard in su "
"tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu. M'at dadu su permissu de \"acumpangiare a "
"domo\" a Ambelie."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:20
msgid "I knocked out Ambelie. I will take her back to the Guild."
msgstr "Apo fatu pèrdere sos sentidos a Ambelie. La depo giùghere a su Grèmiu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:21
msgid "I have decided not to kidnap Ambelie. I must think of another solution."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de non secuestrare a Ambelie. Depo pensare a un'àtera "
"solutzione."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:24
msgid "Ambelie gave me a very valuable necklace. I must talk with Umar and persuade him to no longer pursue her."
msgstr ""
"Ambelie m'at dadu una collana de valore meda. Depo faeddare cun Umar e lu "
"cumbìnchere a no la persighire prus."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:30
msgid "I safely brought Ambelie to the basement. However, keeping her here could be dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu a Ambelie, sana e sarva, a sa cantina. Però a la tènnere inoghe "
"diat pòdere èssere perigulosu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:35
msgid "Umar believes there is a secure room for these types of \"visitors\". I should talk to Troublemaker."
msgstr ""
"Umar creet chi b'apat un'aposentu seguru pro custa genia de \"bisitadores\". "
"Dia dèpere faeddare cun Chircabrigas."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:40
msgid "I have talked to Troublemaker about the place Umar believes it's okay to safely keep the hostage."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Chircabrigas de su logu chi, segundu Umar, andat bene pro "
"tènnere s'ostàgiu a s'amparu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:45
msgid "Troublemaker has given me the key to the Guild brig. I should take Ambelie there and leave her to wake up."
msgstr ""
"Chircabrigas m'at dadu sa crae de sa presone de su Grèmiu. Dia dèpere "
"giùghere a Ambelie in cue e la lassare in cue finas a cando s'ischidat."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:50
msgid "I've inserted the key and moved the lever. A hatchway has opened in the room."
msgstr ""
"Apo postu sa crae e apo mòidu sa leva. In s'aposentu s'est aberta una trapa."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:55
msgid "I left Ambelie in that ugly, dark, and cold place. I should go back."
msgstr ""
"Apo lassadu a Ambelie in cussu logu lègiu, iscuru e fritu. Dia dèpere "
"torrare."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:60
msgid "Troublemaker gave me some bread for Ambelie. The guild doesn't want her to starve to death. Indeed, they want her to be as comfortable as possible. I must go to the brig again."
msgstr ""
"Chircabrigas m'at dadu unu pagu de pane pro Ambelie. Su grèmiu non cheret "
"chi mòrgiat de fàmene. A s'imbesse, cherent chi siat su prus còmoda "
"possìbile. Depo torrare a sa presone."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:65
msgid "I gave the bread to Ambelie. I should report Troublemaker that I completed the job."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu su pane a Ambelie. Dia dèpere nàrrere a Chircabrigas chi apo "
"cumpletadu su traballu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:70
msgid "The job finally seems to be finished. I just have to talk with Umar again. However, I do not feel good about this. Kidnappings are definitely not my kind of job."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi su traballu siat a sa fine acabbadu. Depo petzi torrare a faeddare "
"cun Umar. Però non mi sento bene pro custu. Sos secuestros non sunt de "
"seguru sa genia de traballu mea."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:75
msgid "I completed this task successfully. Umar told me they have sent couriers to Feygard, and the ransom is almost guaranteed. He paid me for my work."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumpletadu custu incàrrigu cun bonu èsitu. Umar m'at naradu chi ant "
"mandadu messàgios a Feygard, e chi su riscatu est giai seguru. M'at pagadu "
"pro su traballu meu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves02:76
msgid "Umar took the necklace as compensation for my errors. Everything is fine again."
msgstr ""
"Umar s'est leadu sa collana comente cumpensa pro sos errores mios. Como est "
"totu a postu torra."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03
msgid "The ruthless Crackshot"
msgstr "Crackshot su chene piedade"

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:1
msgid "Time to rest and prepare myself to start the next job. I should go to the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Est ora de mi pasare e de m'aprontare pro cumintzare su traballu chi benit. "
"Dia dèpere andare a su tzilleri."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:2
msgid "I really need to take a break ...."
msgstr "Tèngio bisòngiu a beru de una pàusa ...."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:3
msgid "I am now fully rested, so I should go back to Umar."
msgstr "Como so pasadu de su totu, e duncas dia dèpere torrare dae Umar."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:4
msgid "Umar told me about a group of traitors led by a veteran of the Guild. It seems he stole the Key of Luthor."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at contadu de unu grupu de traitores ghiados dae unu veteranu de su "
"Grèmiu. Paret chi apat furadu sa Crae de Luthor."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:5
msgid "Umar went on to say that this team leader  was known as \"Crackshot\". He is probably also the responsible for a murder on the Duleian road."
msgstr ""
"Umar at sighidu narende chi custu cabu de banda fiat connotu comente "
"\"Crackshot\". Est probàbile chi siat fintzas su responsàbile de unu delitu "
"in s'àndala duleiana."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:10
msgid "Crackshot and his henchmen are probably hiding somewhere near the Duleian road. I must ask people there whether they have seen them."
msgstr ""
"Est probàbile chi Crackshot e sos òmines suos siant cuados in calicuna parte "
"acanta de s'àndala duleiana. Depo preguntare a sa gente de cue si los ant "
"bidos."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:11
msgid "It seems that Benbyr, a suspicious man outside Crossroads Guardhouse, doesn't know what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi Benbyr, un'òmine suspetosu in foras de su Corpu de guàrdia de sa "
"Rugrada, no ischit de ite so faeddende."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:15
msgid "A Crossroads guard told me that Feygard has sent more soldiers to the south, to try and find the criminals' hideout."
msgstr ""
"Una guàrdia de sa Rugrada m'at naradu chi Feygard at mandadu àteros sordados "
"a su sud, pro chircare de agatare su cuadòrgiu de sos criminales."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:20
msgid "The barricade guard has a big mouth, and told me all I needed to know. The hideout is near a place full of larval burrowers. I need to move faster than the patrols to reach the hideout before them."
msgstr ""
"Sa guàrdia de sa barricada tenet sa limba longa, e m'at naradu totu su chi "
"depia ischire. Su cuadòrgiu est acanta de unu logu prenu de larvas "
"iscavadoras. Depo andare prus a lestru de sas patrùllias pro lòmpere a su "
"cuadòrgiu in antis de issas."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:21
msgid "I found a small hole which seems to lead to a cave. Crackshot and his henchmen are probably hiding there."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu un'istampu piticu chi paret chi giugat a una gruta. Est "
"probàbile chi Crackshot e sos òmines suos siant cuados in cue."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:22
msgid "I reached the hideout and saw some recent blood stains. Maybe there was a fight there."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a su cuadòrgiu e apo bidu unas cantas mantzas de sàmbene friscas. "
"Forsis b'est istada una briga."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:23
msgid "The blood trail goes further ...."
msgstr "Su rastru de sàmbene sighit prus a in antis ...."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:24
msgid "I heard screams and sword clashes nearby. I should take a look."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu gridos e corfos de ispada inoghe acanta. Dia dèpere andare a "
"abbaidare."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:25
msgid "There was a massacre. The Feygard patrol reached this place, but they seem to have all been killed. I must continue."
msgstr ""
"B'est istadu unu massacru. Sa patrùllia de Feygard est lòmpida a custu logu, "
"ma paret chi los apant ochidos a totus. Depo sighire."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:26
msgid "As I progressed down the corridor the air became thicker. The blood smell was stronger, and I found another dying soldier. He said something about his sergeant and some other guy."
msgstr ""
"A cantu prus andaia a in antis in su corridòriu, s'àera si faghiat prus "
"ispissa. Su fragu de sàmbene fiat prus forte, e apo agatadu un'àteru sordadu "
"chi fiat morende. At naradu calicuna cosa de su sergente suo e de un'àteru "
"òmine."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:27
msgid "As I progressed down the corridor the air became thicker. The blood smell was stronger, and I found a dying soldier. He said something about his sergeant and some other guy."
msgstr ""
"A cantu prus andaia a in antis in su corridòriu, s'àera si faghiat prus "
"ispissa. Su fragu de sàmbene fiat prus forte, e apo agatadu unu sordadu chi "
"fiat morende. At naradu calicuna cosa de su sergente suo e de un'àteru òmine."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:28
msgid "I found another dying soldier. There was a massacre. The Feygard patrol reached this place, but they seem to have all been killed. I must continue."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu un'àteru sordadu chi fiat morende. B'est istadu unu massacru. Sa "
"patrùllia de Feygard est lòmpida a custu logu, ma paret chi los apant "
"ochidos a totus. Depo sighire."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:30
msgid "I've found the patrol sergeant. He advised me to leave this dangerous place."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu su sergente de sa patrùllia. M'at cussigiadu de lassare custu "
"logu perigulosu."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:31
msgid "The patrol sergeant told me about what happened before. He's tired and wounded, so I willl avenge his fellows. "
msgstr ""
"Su sergente de sa patrùllia m'at contadu su chi est capitadu in antis. Est "
"istracu e feridu, e duncas apo a vindicare deo sos cumpàngios suos. "

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:32
msgid "The patrol sergeant has left to call for backup. Now I'm alone again. Time to defeat Crackshot."
msgstr ""
"Su sergente de sa patrùllia est andadu a chircare rinfortzos. Como so a sa "
"sola torra. Est ora de bìnchere a Crackshot."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:35
msgid "I killed Crackshot and he had the key of Luthor with him. I have to go back and report to Umar."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu a Crackshot, e giughiat cun issu sa crae de Luthor. Depo torrare "
"e contare totu a Umar."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:36
msgid "I tried to open the door behind Crackshot, but for some reason I cannot get the key into the lock."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de abèrrere sa ghenna a palas de Crackshot, ma pro calicuna "
"resone non resesso a pònnere sa crae in sa serradura."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:40
msgid "The dying Crackshot said something about the key. If he told the truth, it could be cursed."
msgstr ""
"Crackshot, morende, at naradu calicuna cosa subra de sa crae. Si at naradu "
"sa veridade, diat pòdere èssere malaita."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:41
msgid "I tried to open the door behind Crackshot, but for some reason I could not get the key turned in the lock."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de abèrrere sa ghenna a palas de Crackshot, ma pro calicuna "
"resone non so resèssidu a girare sa crae in sa serradura."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:45
msgid "I reported about the situation to Umar, and gave him the key. He did not seem to want to tell me more about the key - yet."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu sa situatzione a Umar, e l'apo dadu sa crae. Non pariat chi mi "
"cheriat nàrrere de prus subra de sa crae... pro como."

#: questlist_omicronrg9.json:Thieves03:50
msgid "Finally, this job is done. Now I should take a rest and regain my strength."
msgstr ""
"A sa fine, custu traballu est acabbadu. Como dia dèpere pasare e torrare a "
"leare fortzas."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale
msgid "The silver scale"
msgstr "S'iscata de prata"

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:10
msgid "In a clearing, you met Tjure, who desperately asked for your help. He had once found a mermaid asleep on the beach at the river. The colorful tail attracted him so much that he pulled out a dazzling scale and ran away."
msgstr ""
"In una lascura, as atopadu a Tjure, chi t'at pedidu agiudu disisperadu. Una "
"borta aiat agatadu una sirena dormida in s'arena de su riu. Sa coa de milli "
"colores l'aiat atiradu gasi meda chi l'aiat bogadu un'iscata lughente e si "
"nche fiat fuidu."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:20
msgid "Crying and mourning, the mermaid called after him. Finally she cursed him. Since then, Tjure has never been happy. He just wanted to get rid of the scale. Nevertheless, he never ventured back to the vicinity of the river."
msgstr ""
"Pranghende e lamentende·si, sa sirena l'aiat tzerriadu in fatu. A sa fine "
"l'aiat malaitu. Dae tando, Tjure no est mai istadu cuntentu. Cheriat petzi "
"si nde liberare de s'iscata. Però, no at mai tentu su coràgiu de torrare "
"acanta de su riu."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:30
msgid "A wise woman told Tjure that he could neither throw away nor destroy the scale. His only salvation would be to give it back or to have someone buy it from him. But who would ever want to incur the wrath of a mermaid?"
msgstr ""
"Una fèmina sàbia at naradu a Tjure chi non podiat nen ghetare nen distrùere "
"s'iscata. S'ùnica sarvesa sua fiat de la torrare o de fàghere in modu chi "
"calicunu bi la comporaret. Ma chie mai diat chèrrere atirare s'ira de una "
"sirena?"

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:90
msgid "You decided not to help Tjure."
msgstr "As detzìdidu de no agiudare a Tjure."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:100
msgid "As soon as you held the scale in your hands, a great sluggishness and dispair came over you."
msgstr ""
"Comente as tentu s'iscata in manos, t'est bènnida subra una mandronia e unu "
"disisperu mannu."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:200
msgid "You put the scale on the mark on the ground."
msgstr "As postu s'iscata subra de su sinnu in su terrinu."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:210
msgid "There rang out a beautiful song of gratitude."
msgstr "S'est intesu unu cantu bellu de ringratziamentu."

#: questlist_arulir_mountain.json:mermaid_scale:220
msgid "You found a heavy bag of gold."
msgstr "As agatadu una bussa grae prena de oro."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd
msgid "Young merchant"
msgstr "Unu mercante giòvanu"

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:10
msgid "You met Burhczyd afgz Dtaloumiye, a likable young man, in a tavern. He wanted to see the world and followed your advice to travel as a trader from city to city."
msgstr ""
"As atopadu a Burhczyd afgz Dtaloumiye, unu giòvanu simpàticu, in unu "
"tzilleri. Cheriat bìdere su mundu e at sighidu su cussìgiu tuo de biagiare "
"comente mercante dae tzitade a tzitade."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:20
msgid "In another tavern you met Burhczyd again. He never got any customers, because he had named his company 'Burhczyd afgz Dtaloumiye - Transports'. You told him to find an easier name."
msgstr ""
"In un'àteru tzilleri as torradu a atopare a Burhczyd. No aiat mai tentu "
"clientes, ca aiat postu a s'impresa sua su nòmine de 'Burhczyd afgz "
"Dtaloumiye - Trasportos'. L'as naradu de agatare unu nòmine prus fàtzile."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:30
msgid "You saw Burhczyd in a tavern, but he still did not have any customers. You told him that 'B.A.D. Transports' was not a good idea either."
msgstr ""
"As bidu a Burhczyd in unu tzilleri, ma galu no aiat clientes. L'as naradu "
"chi mancu 'B.A.D. Trasportos' fiat una bona idea."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:40
msgid "Another place, another tavern, Burhczyd again sitting there. He did get a shipment from Remgard of almost fresh fish, but nobody wanted to buy it. You bought the entire cargo and got it disposed of."
msgstr ""
"Un'àteru logu, un'àteru tzilleri, e Burhczyd torra sètzidu in cue. Aiat "
"retzidu dae Remgard una cunsigna de pische belle friscu, ma nemos lu cheriat "
"comporare. As comporadu totu su càrrigu e nche l'as fatu ghetare."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:50
msgid "What a surprise - you met Burhczyd again in a tavern. He told you that he finally sold something successfully - his cart. The fool, how will he earn money now?"
msgstr ""
"Ite sorpresa: as torradu a atopare a Burhczyd in unu tzilleri. T'at naradu "
"chi a sa fine fiat resèssidu a bèndere calicuna cosa: su carru suo. Su "
"tontu, comente at a balangiare dinare como?"

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:60
msgid "In a tavern a bard sang in a high, shrill voice. It's an old acquaintance - Burhczyd. His singing was incredibly bad. Maybe he should just play his instrument without singing?"
msgstr ""
"In unu tzilleri unu bardu cantaiat cun una boghe arta, chi pariat unu "
"tzìrriu. Est unu connoschente betzu: Burhczyd. Cantaiat male de non si "
"crèere. Forsis diat dèpere sonare s'istrumentu suo chene cantare?"

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:70
msgid "You found Burhczyd collapsed at a table in the tavern, his lute lying in front of him. The landlord forbade him to play his lovely music, because then all the guests forgot to drink."
msgstr ""
"As agatadu a Burhczyd isfatu subra de una mesa de su tzilleri, cun su liutu "
"in antis suo. Su mere de su tzilleri l'aiat proibidu de sonare sa mùsica sua "
"bella, ca tando totu sos clientes s'ismentigaiant de bufare."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:80
msgid "Again you met Burhczyd in a tavern. He told you that he had become a master thief."
msgstr ""
"As torradu a atopare a Burhczyd in unu tzilleri. T'at naradu chi como fiat "
"unu mastru ladru."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:90
msgid "When you met Burhczyd again, he gave you some of your things back."
msgstr ""
"Cando as torradu a atopare a Burhczyd, t'at torradu unas cantas de sas cosas "
"tuas."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:100
msgid "You've talked with a Knight of Elythom who happened to be an old acquaintance - Burhczyd. He had to hide from the Elythom, because he had 'borrowed' something of value from their leader."
msgstr ""
"As faeddadu cun unu Cavalieri de Elythom chi fiat unu connoschente betzu: "
"Burhczyd. Si depiat cuare dae sos Elythom, ca aiat 'leadu in prèstidu' una "
"cosa de valore dae su cabu issoro."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:110
msgid "Burhczyd was no longer dressed like a knight of the Elythom. He said he's going to marry the prettiest girl in the world - she just doesn't know yet..."
msgstr ""
"Burhczyd non fiat prus bestidu che cavalieri de sos Elythom. At naradu chi "
"at a cojuare cun sa pitzoca prus bella de su mundu: est chi issa no l'ischit "
"galu..."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:120
msgid "You've met a very depressed Burhczyd. His love was going to marry a baker! Therefore, he bought an oven to outdo his rival."
msgstr ""
"As atopadu a unu Burhczyd tristu meda. S'amore suo fiat pro cojuare cun unu "
"paneteri! Pro custu, at comporadu unu forru pro bìnchere su rivale."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:130
msgid "Burhczyd planned to bake larger and more beautiful loaves of bread in the tavern than the baker whom his love is going to marry. Yet he still had to learn how to bake."
msgstr ""
"Burhczyd teniat in mente de còghere in su tzilleri panes prus mannos e prus "
"bellos de sos de su paneteri chi s'amore suo at a cojuare. Ma depiat galu "
"imparare a còghere su pane."

#: questlist_burhczyd.json:quest_burhczyd:140
msgid ""
"Burhczyd has begun the life of a monk. Fasting was not at all easy for him.\n"
"\n"
"[Quest is not completable at this time.]"
msgstr ""
"Burhczyd at cumintzadu sa vida de su mòngiu. Su geunu non fiat fàtzile pro "
"nudda pro issu.\n"
"\n"
"[Custa missione non si podet cumpletare pro como.]"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood
msgid "Much water"
msgstr "Abba meda"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:10
msgid "I found two not very bright brothers in a cellar of their house. They seemed to be talking about some sinister plan."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu duos frades non tropu abbistos in sa cantina de sa domo issoro. "
"Pariat chi esserent faeddende de unu pianu iscuru."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:20
msgid "They were planning to destroy the great dam of Brimhaven. They just could not agree how they would do it."
msgstr ""
"Fiant aprontende de distrùere sa diga manna de Brimhaven. Ma non resessiant "
"a si pònnere de acordu subra de comente lu fàghere."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:30
msgid "They asked me to help them."
msgstr "M'ant pedidu de los agiudare."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:50
msgid "I have agreed to destroy the dam for them."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu de distrùere sa diga pro issos."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:52
msgid "The brothers gave me a hand axe that could weaken the dam in a vulnerable place."
msgstr ""
"Sos frades m'ant dadu un'istrale de manu chi diat pòdere debilitare sa diga "
"in unu puntu dèbile."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:53
msgid "I took another hand axe. This time I shouldn't lose it."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu un'àteru istrale de manu. Custa borta no lu dia dèpere pèrdere."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:54
msgid "I found the weak spot in the dam and started hacking at the wood."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu su puntu dèbile de sa diga e apo cumintzadu a corfire sa linna."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:56
msgid "Water came pouring through the hole in the dam. A lot of water!"
msgstr "S'abba est essida a fortza dae s'istampu de sa diga. Abba meda!"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:70
msgid "I refused to destroy the dam for the brothers."
msgstr "Apo refudadu de distrùere sa diga pro sos frades."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:72
msgid "Given what I overheard, I was not allowed to leave. The two brothers attacked me."
msgstr ""
"Pro su chi aia intesu, non mi podiant lassare andare. Sos duos frades m'ant "
"atacadu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:80
msgid "Someone else destroyed the dam and water came pouring through a hole in the dam. A lot of water!"
msgstr ""
"Calicunu àteru at distrutu sa diga e s'abba est essida a undas dae "
"un'istampu de sa diga. Abba meda!"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:100
msgid "The Brimhaven guards have informed me that I may not leave the town until they have investigated who destroyed the dam."
msgstr ""
"Sas guàrdias de Brimhaven m'ant naradu chi non potzo lassare sa bidda finas "
"a cando no ant investigadu chie at distrutu sa diga."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:110
msgid "I have promised to track down the real perpetrators. However, I still cannot leave the town."
msgstr ""
"Apo promìtidu de agatare sos culpàbiles beros. Però, galu non potzo lassare "
"sa bidda."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:120
msgid "The two brothers did not know their boss's name, but he seemed to have a lot of gold."
msgstr ""
"Sos duos frades no ischiant su nòmine de su mere issoro, ma pariat chi "
"tenneret meda oro."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:130
msgid "The rich man living up on the hill of Brimhaven seemed to know more than he admitted."
msgstr ""
"S'òmine ricu chi bivet in su montigru de Brimhaven pariat chi ischiret prus "
"de su chi ammitiat."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:150
msgid "The rich man boasted that he had been bribed by an important man in Loneford to sabotage the dam."
msgstr ""
"S'òmine ricu s'est bantadu chi un'òmine importante de Loneford l'aiat "
"corrùmpidu pro sabotare sa diga."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_flood:200
msgid "I gave the letters as a piece of evidence to the captain of the guard. Now it is up to them to deal with the rich man."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu sas lìteras comente proa a su capitanu de sa guàrdia. Como tocat a "
"issos a si nde ocupare de s'òmine ricu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee
msgid "Work for debts"
msgstr "Traballu pro sos dèpidos"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:1
msgid "The dam is very important to Brimhaven. It should be repaired."
msgstr ""
"Sa diga est importante meda pro Brimhaven. Diat dèpere èssere acontzada."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:10
msgid ""
"Stebbarik was ill at home in bed. He could not work and feared that he would lose his job. Because of his high debts, he feared that Gnossath would then take his house away.\n"
"I have offered to do the work for Stebbarik."
msgstr ""
"Stebbarik fiat malàidu in domo, in su letu. Non podiat traballare e timiat "
"de pèrdere su traballu. Pro more de sos dèpidos mannos chi teniat, timiat "
"chi tando Gnossath li diat leare sa domo.\n"
"Apo ofertu de fàghere su traballu pro Stebbarik."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:30
msgid "Gnossath has asked me to carry 25 heavy boulders from the stock to the dam."
msgstr ""
"Gnossath m'at pedidu de giùghere 25 rocas graes dae su depòsitu a sa diga."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:40
msgid "I have carried the first boulder to the dam."
msgstr "Apo batidu sa prima roca a sa diga."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:41
msgid "I have carried 5 boulders to the dam."
msgstr "Apo batidu 5 rocas a sa diga."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:42
msgid "I have moved 10 boulders."
msgstr "Apo mòidu 10 rocas."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:43
msgid "I have moved 15 boulders. This work is exhausting!"
msgstr "Apo mòidu 15 rocas. Custu traballu istracat meda!"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:44
msgid "Only a few to go..."
msgstr "Nde mancant petzi unas cantas..."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_employee:90
msgid "Finally - that was the last boulder! Gnossath was very pleased with my work."
msgstr ""
"A sa fine: cussa fiat s'ùrtima roca! Gnossath fiat cuntentu meda de su "
"traballu meu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance
msgid "A quick glance"
msgstr "Un'ograda lestra"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:10
msgid "I talked to Anakis. He told me that his sister, Juttarka, went into the cave and did not come out again."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Anakis. M'at naradu chi sa sorre, Juttarka, est intrada in "
"sa gruta e no est prus essida."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:15
msgid "I denied to help Anakis to find his sister, Juttarka."
msgstr "Apo refudadu de agiudare a Anakis a agatare sa sorre, Juttarka."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:20
msgid "I agreed to help Anakis find his sister, Juttarka."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Anakis a agatare sa sorre, Juttarka."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:40
msgid "I found a stone statue that looked almost like a real woman."
msgstr "Apo agatadu un'istàtua de pedra chi pariat belle una fèmina vera."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:50
msgid "I told Anakis about the statue. He thinks that it is his sister, Juttarka, and thanked me for helping him."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Anakis de s'istàtua. Pensat chi siat sa sorre, Juttarka, e "
"m'at ringratziadu pro l'àere agiudadu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:60
msgid "Anakis asked me if I could avenge his sister."
msgstr "Anakis m'at preguntadu si podia vindicare sa sorre."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:70
msgid "I agreed to avenge Anakis' sister, Juttarka, and kill the Basilisk."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de vindicare sa sorre de Anakis, Juttarka, e de ochìere su "
"Basiliscu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:75
msgid "I should talk to Fangwurm, the priest of west Brimhaven, to see if he has some information about how it may be possible to help Anakis' sister."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere faeddare cun Fangwurm, su preìderu de Brimhaven otzidentale, pro "
"bìdere si tenet calicuna informatzione subra de comente si podet agiudare sa "
"sorre de Anakis."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:77
msgid "Fangwurm told me that the Basilisk's blood has special properties. It can protect against damage if applied to the skin. Fresh, warm, Basilisk's blood might even be able to heal a person that has been turned to stone."
msgstr ""
"Fangwurm m'at naradu chi su sàmbene de su Basiliscu tenet propiedades "
"ispetziales. Podet amparare dae su dannu si si ponet in sa pedde. Su sàmbene "
"de Basiliscu, friscu e caente, diat pòdere fintzas sanare una persone chi "
"est istada trasformada in pedra."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:78
msgid "The priest Fangwurm told me that the potion maker in Fallhaven sells special crystal vials that are resistent to the blood of a Basilisk, and I will need one to handle it."
msgstr ""
"Su preìderu Fangwurm m'at naradu chi su fraigadore de potziones de Fallhaven "
"bendet fialas de cristallu ispetziales chi resistent a su sàmbene de unu "
"Basiliscu, e chi nde apo a dèpere tènnere una pro lu manigiare."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:79
msgid "I should search the other rooms in this cave for a mirror that I can use to protect me from the glance of the Basilisk."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere chircare in sos àteros aposentos de custa gruta un'ispigru chi "
"potza impreare pro m'amparare dae s'ograda de su Basiliscu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:80
msgid "I killed the Basilisk."
msgstr "Apo ochidu su Basiliscu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:85
msgid "I saved the life of Anakis' sister Juttarka."
msgstr "Apo sarvadu sa vida de sa sorre de Anakis, Juttarka."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:quick_glance:90
msgid "I told Anakis that I killed the Basilisk."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Anakis chi apo ochidu su Basiliscu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack
msgid "Fair play?"
msgstr "Giogu lìmpiu?"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:10
msgid "I heard noices from the back room but I was not allowed to enter because I didn't know the password."
msgstr ""
"Apo intesu sonos dae s'aposentu in segus, ma non m'ant permìtidu de intrare "
"ca no ischia sa paràula segreta."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:20
msgid "Zimsko told me about gambling in the back room and that he lost a lot of money. He thinks that they are cheating."
msgstr ""
"Zimsko m'at contadu de sos giogos de dinare in s'aposentu in segus, e chi at "
"pèrdidu meda dinare. Pensat chi sunt faghende trampas."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:30
msgid "I told Zimsko that I want to find out more about the gambling and he told me the password to access the back room."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Zimsko chi chèrgio ischire de prus de sos giogos de dinare, e "
"m'at naradu sa paràula segreta pro intrare in s'aposentu in segus."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:31
msgid "I have to win and lose a few times until they trust me and play for higher amounts. Then they start cheating."
msgstr ""
"Depo bìnchere e pèrdere unas cantas bortas finas a cando si fident de mene e "
"giogant pro cantidades prus artas. Tando cumintzant a fàghere trampas."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:40
msgid "With the password, I was allowed to enter the back room."
msgstr ""
"Cun sa paràula segreta, m'ant permìtidu de intrare in s'aposentu in segus."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:45
msgid "They trust me and now and are playing for higher amounts."
msgstr "Si fident de mene e como sunt gioghende pro cantidades prus artas."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:50
msgid "After I accused the dealer of cheating, a tavern brawl started."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo acusadu su bancheri de fàghere trampas, est cumintzada una "
"briga in su tzilleri."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:60
msgid "All the people involved in the tavern brawl survived, but I am no longer allowed to enter the back room."
msgstr ""
"Totu sas persones chi ant tentu parte in sa briga de su tzilleri sunt "
"abarradas bias, ma como non mi permitint prus de intrare in s'aposentu in "
"segus."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:70
msgid "I told Zimsko that I believe the gamblers are cheating."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Zimsko chi creo chi sos giogadores sunt faghende trampas."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_blackjack:80
msgid "I told Zimsko that I believe the gamblers are not cheating."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Zimsko chi creo chi sos giogadores non sunt faghende trampas."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:10
msgid "I asked Edrin about the strange-looking dagger I purchased. He told me he recognizes it because he made it many years ago, and it used to have a gem mounted in the pommel. If I can find the gem he can remount it in the dagger, and the dagger will have special properties. Apparently it used to belong to someone named Lawellyn."
msgstr ""
"Apo preguntadu a Edrin de su pugnale de aspetu istranu chi apo comporadu. "
"M'at naradu chi lu connoschet ca l'at fatu issu medas annos a como, e chi "
"una borta teniat una gemma in su pomu. Si potzo agatare sa gemma, issu la "
"podet torrare a pònnere in su pugnale, e su pugnale at a tènnere propiedades "
"ispetziales. A su chi paret, una borta fiat de unu chi si naraiat Lawellyn."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:20
msgid "I asked Edrin about the strange-looking gem I purchased, and whether he has any idea what it might have been mounted in. He told me he recognizes it, and it used to be mounted in the pommel of a dagger that he made many years ago. If I can find the dagger he can remount the gem, and the dagger will have special properties. Apparently it used to belong to someone named Lawellyn."
msgstr ""
"Apo preguntadu a Edrin de sa gemma de aspetu istranu chi apo comporadu, e si "
"tenet idea de a ue podiat èssere posta. M'at naradu chi la connoschet, e chi "
"una borta fiat posta in su pomu de unu pugnale chi issu at fatu medas annos "
"a como. Si potzo agatare su pugnale, issu podet torrare a pònnere sa gemma, "
"e su pugnale at a tènnere propiedades ispetziales. A su chi paret, una borta "
"fiat de unu chi si naraiat Lawellyn."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:25
msgid "I asked Edrin about the strange-looking dagger and the strange-looking gem I purchased. He told me he recognizes them because he made the dagger many years ago. The gem was originally mounted in the pommel, giving the dagger special properties. He offered to repair it for me. Apparently it used to belong to someone named Lawellyn."
msgstr ""
"Apo preguntadu a Edrin de su pugnale de aspetu istranu e de sa gemma de "
"aspetu istranu chi apo comporadu. M'at naradu chi los connoschet ca su "
"pugnale l'at fatu issu medas annos a como. In orìgine sa gemma fiat posta in "
"su pomu, e daiat a su pugnale propiedades ispetziales. M'at ofertu de mi "
"l'acontzare. A su chi paret, una borta fiat de unu chi si naraiat Lawellyn."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:30
msgid "I asked the thief if the dagger he has originally had the gem I purchased in the pommel. His reply was 'maybe', and that the dagger was no longer available except at a 'special' price."
msgstr ""
"Apo preguntadu a su ladru si su pugnale chi tenet issu teniat in orìgine in "
"su pomu sa gemma chi apo comporadu. Sa risposta sua est istada 'forsis', e "
"chi su pugnale non fiat prus disponìbile si no a unu prètziu 'ispetziale'."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:40
msgid "I asked the thief if the gem he has was originally in the pommel of the dagger I purchased. His reply was 'maybe', and that the gem was no longer available except at a 'special' price."
msgstr ""
"Apo preguntadu a su ladru si sa gemma chi tenet issu fiat in orìgine in su "
"pomu de su pugnale chi apo comporadu. Sa risposta sua est istada 'forsis', e "
"chi sa gemma non fiat prus disponìbile si no a unu prètziu 'ispetziale'."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:50
msgid "I showed the strange-looking dagger and the strange-looking gem to Edrin. He said they match, and he can repair the dagger by mounting the gem in the pommel again."
msgstr ""
"Apo mustradu a Edrin su pugnale de aspetu istranu e sa gemma de aspetu "
"istranu. At naradu chi andant impare, e chi podet acontzare su pugnale "
"ponende torra sa gemma in su pomu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:60
msgid "Edrin wants 800 gold to repair the dagger. I told him I will think about it."
msgstr ""
"Edrin cheret 800 monedas de oro pro acontzare su pugnale. L'apo naradu chi "
"bi depo pensare."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:70
msgid "Edrin wants 800 gold to repair the dagger. I told him that was too expensive. I will keep the strange-looking dagger and the strange-looking gem."
msgstr ""
"Edrin cheret 800 monedas de oro pro acontzare su pugnale. L'apo naradu chi "
"fiat tropu caru. M'apo a tènnere su pugnale de aspetu istranu e sa gemma de "
"aspetu istranu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:80
msgid "Edrin wants 800 gold to repair the dagger. I agreed. Edrin took the dagger and the gem and told me to come back later."
msgstr ""
"Edrin cheret 800 monedas de oro pro acontzare su pugnale. Apo atzetadu. "
"Edrin at leadu su pugnale e sa gemma e m'at naradu de torrare a pustis."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:90
#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:100
msgid "I collected the repaired dagger from Edrin. Apparently there was something mysterious about Lawellyn's death. I should ask people in town to find out more."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu dae Edrin su pugnale acontzadu. A su chi paret, b'aiat calicuna "
"cosa de misteriosu in sa morte de Lawellyn. Dia dèpere preguntare a sa gente "
"de sa bidda pro nde ischire de prus."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:105
msgid "Zorvan told me Lawellyn is dead and buried, but could tell me little more other than that his death was suspicious."
msgstr ""
"Zorvan m'at naradu chi Lawellyn est mortu e interradu, ma non m'at pòdidu "
"nàrrere meda àteru, a parte chi sa morte sua fiat istada suspeta."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:110
msgid "I've found a gravestone that told me that Lawellyn was related to Arlish. I should try to find her."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una pedra de tumba chi naraiat chi Lawellyn fiat parente de "
"Arlish. Dia dèpere chircare de l'agatare."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:115
msgid "Arlish couldn't tell me anything about the dagger because I no longer have it."
msgstr ""
"Arlish non m'at pòdidu nàrrere nudda de su pugnale ca no lu tèngio prus."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:120
msgid "I decided to not help Arlish by investigating Lawellyn's disappearance."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de no agiudare a Arlish a investigare s'isparèssida de "
"Lawellyn."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:130
msgid "I decided to help Arlish by investigating Lawellyn's disappearance."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de agiudare a Arlish a investigare s'isparèssida de Lawellyn."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:140
msgid "In Brimhaven's eastern tavern, I met a man named Forlin who recommended that I speak to Kizzo in the Loneford tavern."
msgstr ""
"In su tzilleri de oriente de Brimhaven, apo atopadu un'òmine chi si narat "
"Forlin, chi m'at cussigiadu de faeddare cun Kizzo in su tzilleri de Loneford."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:150
msgid "Kizzo suggested that I look for the scene of the murder in the woods between Loneford and Brimhaven."
msgstr ""
"Kizzo m'at cussigiadu de chircare su logu de su delitu in su padente intre "
"Loneford e Brimhaven."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:160
msgid "I should take the evidence to Kizzo."
msgstr "Dia dèpere giùghere sa proa a Kizzo."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:170
msgid "Kizzo recommended that I ask Venanra in Brimhaven about the glove."
msgstr ""
"Kizzo m'at cussigiadu de preguntare a Venanra, in Brimhaven, de su guante."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:180
msgid "After speaking with Venanra, I learned that the glove belonged to Ogea."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere faeddadu cun Venanra, apo ischidu chi su guante fiat de "
"Ogea."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:190
msgid "I accepted Ogea's side of the story."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu sa versione de Ogea."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:200
msgid "I was not able to help Arlish find out more about the death of her father."
msgstr ""
"No apo pòdidu agiudare a Arlish a ischire de prus subra de sa morte de su "
"babbu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:210
msgid "I decided that Ogea should be punished."
msgstr "Apo detzìdidu chi Ogea depet èssere punidu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:220
msgid "I informed the authorities of the results of my investigation."
msgstr ""
"Apo informadu sas autoridades de sos risultados de s'investigatzione mea."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_dagger:230
msgid "Arlish thanked me for finding her father's murderer, and gave me his dagger as a gift."
msgstr ""
"Arlish m'at ringratziadu pro àere agatadu chie at mortu a su babbu, e m'at "
"regaladu su pugnale suo."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present
msgid "Honor your parents"
msgstr "Onora sos genitores tuos"

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present:10
msgid "I have decided to give a necklace to my father Mikhail, in our family colors of red, green, and white."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de regalare una collana a babbu meu, Mikhail, cun sos colores "
"de sa famìlia nostra: ruju, birde e biancu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present:20
msgid "I have purchased a necklace."
msgstr "Apo comporadu una collana."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present:30
msgid "Mikhail didn't want to take the necklace. He was angry because I didn't focus on finding Andor."
msgstr ""
"Mikhail no at chertu leare sa collana. Fiat arrennegadu ca non mi so "
"cuntzentradu in s'agatare a Andor."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present:40
msgid "My father didn't seem very happy with the cheap necklace."
msgstr "Babbu meu non pariat cuntentu meda de sa collana de pagu prètziu."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present:50
msgid "My father was very happy with the nice necklace."
msgstr "Babbu meu fiat cuntentu meda de sa collana bella."

#: questlist_brimhaven.json:brv_present:60
msgid "My father was disappointed with the pretentious necklace I bought."
msgstr "Babbu meu fiat delusu de sa collana tropu isfartzosa chi apo comporadu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2
msgid "Lessons learned"
msgstr "Letziones imparadas"

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:10
msgid "I entered a classroom in Brimhaven's school. The teacher told me to sit down."
msgstr ""
"So intradu in un'àula de s'iscola de Brimhaven. Sa maistra m'at naradu de mi "
"sètzere."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:12
msgid "I noticed an evil-looking statue in a corner. Who on earth puts such an ugly, hideous thing in a school?"
msgstr ""
"Apo notadu un'istàtua de aspetu malu in un'àngulu. Chie mai ponet una cosa "
"gasi lègia e orrorosa in un'iscola?"

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:20
msgid "I found a free place next to a student named Golin."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu logu lìberu acanta de un'iscolanu chi si narat Golin."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:30
msgid "The teacher was droning endlessly about Brimhaven history."
msgstr ""
"Sa maistra faeddaiat chene firmare mai, semper cun sa matessi boghe, de "
"s'istòria de Brimhaven."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:40
msgid "Then a practice lesson started."
msgstr "Tando est cumintzada una letzione pràtica."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:50
msgid "Everyone should take a set of practice weapons from the chest and sit down again."
msgstr ""
"Totus depiant leare dae sa càscia unu grupu de armas de esertzìtziu e si "
"torrare a sètzere."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:60
msgid "I should look for a dueling partner."
msgstr "Dia dèpere chircare unu cumpàngiu pro su duellu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:100
msgid "I started a fight with Golin."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu una cumbata cun Golin."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:102
msgid "I started a fight with Golin and killed him."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu una cumbata cun Golin e l'apo ochidu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:104
msgid "I started a fight with Golin, but I broke off the duel. Very good."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu una cumbata cun Golin, ma apo firmadu su duellu. Bene meda."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:110
msgid "I tried to fight a pupil, but they all ran away screaming."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de cumbàtere cun un'iscolanu, ma si nche sunt fuidos totus "
"gridende."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:120
msgid "I started a fight with the teacher."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu una cumbata cun sa maistra."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:122
msgid "I started a fight with the teacher and killed her."
msgstr "Apo cumintzadu una cumbata cun sa maistra e l'apo ochida."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:124
msgid "I started a fight with the teacher, but I broke off the duel. Very good."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu una cumbata cun sa maistra, ma apo firmadu su duellu. Bene "
"meda."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:130
msgid "I feel the evil stare of the statue."
msgstr "Intendo s'ograda mala de s'istàtua."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:150
msgid "The evil grinning statue suddenly grew to an incredible size and attacked me!"
msgstr ""
"S'istàtua mala, cun cussu risu malignu, est crèschida totu in una finas a "
"una mannària incredìbile e m'at atacadu!"

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:152
msgid "I killed the evil statue."
msgstr "Apo ochidu s'istàtua mala."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:200
msgid "The teacher thanked me for saving her. School is over for me. I can go to the general store and get a cake for good performance."
msgstr ""
"Sa maistra m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo sarvada. Pro mene s'iscola est "
"acabbada. Potzo andare a sa butega generale a leare una torta pro su bonu "
"rendimentu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:210
msgid "I cheated during the duel. The teacher noticed it and banned me from the school."
msgstr ""
"Apo fatu trampas in su duellu. Sa maistra si nd'est abbigiada e m'at bogadu "
"dae s'iscola."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:220
msgid "The teacher was very satisfied with my performance in the duel. School is over for me. I can go to the general store and get a cake for good performance."
msgstr ""
"Sa maistra fiat cuntenta meda de comente apo fatu in su duellu. Pro mene "
"s'iscola est acabbada. Potzo andare a sa butega generale a leare una torta "
"pro su bonu rendimentu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:230
msgid "The teacher sent me away, because I killed Golin in the duel."
msgstr "Sa maistra m'at mandadu a foras, ca apo ochidu a Golin in su duellu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_school2:240
msgid "Golin was horrified by my murder of the teacher and attacked me to avenge her."
msgstr ""
"Golin, ispramadu ca apo ochidu sa maistra, m'at atacadu pro la vindicare."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh
msgid "Inventory"
msgstr "Inventàriu"

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:10
msgid "Facutloni asked me to help him check the storage. I should check if there is a pair of every item."
msgstr ""
"Facutloni m'at pedidu de l'agiudare a controllare su magasinu. Dia dèpere "
"controllare si b'at unu pàgiu de cada ogetu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:100
msgid "I have found a pair of crystal globes."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de globos de cristallu."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:101
msgid "I have found a pair of plush pillows."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de cabitzales moddes."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:102
msgid "I have found a pair of lyras."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de liras."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:103
msgid "I have found a pair of boots."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de botas."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:104
msgid "I have found a pair of chandeliers."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de lampadàrios."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:105
msgid "I have found a pair of mysterious green somethings."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de cosas birdes e misteriosas."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:106
msgid "I have found a pair of old, worn capes."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de capas betzas e gastadas."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:107
msgid "I have found a pair of pretty porcelain figures."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de figuras galanas de portzellana."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:108
msgid "I have found a pair of striped hammers."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de marteddos a listas."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:109
msgid "I have found a pair of dusty old books."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu pàgiu de libros betzos prenos de prùere."

#: questlist_brimhaven2.json:brv_wh:900
msgid "I found all the 10 pairs. Facutloni is very happy."
msgstr "Apo agatadu totu sos 10 pàgios. Facutloni est cuntentu meda."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:new_snake_master
msgid "Perception is not reality"
msgstr "Su chi paret no est semper su chi est"

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:new_snake_master:25
msgid "I must stop Ewmondold from getting stronger."
msgstr "Depo impedire chi Ewmondold si fatzat prus forte."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:new_snake_master:5
msgid "A traveler named Ewmondold had asked me to venture into the Snake Cave to retrieve his map."
msgstr ""
"Unu biagiante chi si narat Ewmondold m'aiat pedidu de intrare in sa Gruta de "
"sas Coloras pro torrare a leare sa mapa sua."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:new_snake_master:10
msgid "Ewmondold had thanked me for killing the Snake master, and that his way to rule would be free. I should find him."
msgstr ""
"Ewmondold m'aiat ringratziadu pro àere ochidu su Mere de sas coloras, e "
"naraiat chi como su caminu suo pro cumandare fiat lìberu. Lu dia dèpere "
"agatare."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:new_snake_master:30
msgid "I've destroyed Ewmondold and eliminated his threat to Crossglen and the surrounding area."
msgstr ""
"Apo distrutu a Ewmondold e apo eliminadu sa minetza sua contra a Crossglen e "
"a sas àreas a inghìriu."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:new_snake_master:20
msgid "I've returned Ewmondold's map to him."
msgstr "Apo torradu a Ewmondold sa mapa sua."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse
msgid "A cat and mouse game"
msgstr "Unu giogu de gatu e de sòrighe"

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:10
msgid "I agreed to help Seviron trap the mouse that the cat cannot catch. I need to get some cheese, a large empty bottle, and three rocks."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Seviron a pònnere una trampa pro su sòrighe chi "
"su gatu non resesset a aferrare. Mi serbint unu pagu de casu, un'ampulla "
"bòida manna e tres pedras."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:20
msgid "I have given Seviron the rocks."
msgstr "Apo dadu sas pedras a Seviron."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:30
msgid "I have given Seviron the cheese."
msgstr "Apo dadu su casu a Seviron."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:40
msgid "I obtained a suitable bottle from Arlish."
msgstr "Apo otentu dae Arlish un'ampulla chi andat bene."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:50
msgid "I have given Seviron the bottle. Seviron will set the trap, but it may take some time to catch the mouse. I should come back later."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu s'ampulla a Seviron. Seviron at a pònnere sa trampa, ma podet "
"bisongiare tempus pro aferrare su sòrighe. Dia dèpere torrare a pustis."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:60
msgid "The mouse has been caught! Seviron gave it to me in the bottle. He said I can decide what to do with it."
msgstr ""
"Ant aferradu su sòrighe! Seviron mi l'at dadu in s'ampulla. At naradu chi "
"potzo detzìdere deo ite nde fàghere."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:70
msgid "I decided to give the mouse to the cat. The cat would have eventually killed it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de dare su sòrighe a su gatu. Su gatu l'aiat a ochìere su "
"matessi, prima o pustis."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:80
msgid "I decided to release the mouse outside. Seviron told me to do that outside the town."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de lassare lìberu su sòrighe in foras. Seviron m'at naradu de "
"lu fàghere in foras de sa bidda."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2.json:cat_and_mouse:90
msgid "I released the mouse."
msgstr "Apo lassadu lìberu su sòrighe."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog
msgid "Where is Norry?"
msgstr "Ue est Norry?"

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:10
msgid "I found Hettar, a tough boy about my age, on top of Blackwater mountain. He kept calling for a certain Norry."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Hettar, unu pitzocu forte de s'edade mea, in sa punta de su "
"Monte Abbaniedda. Sighiat a tzerriare a unu tzertu Norry."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:20
msgid "Hettar's little dog Norry has run away. He was very anxious to find him. I promised to get Norry back."
msgstr ""
"Su canigheddu de Hettar, Norry, si nch'est fuidu. Teniat meda ànsia de "
"l'agatare. Apo promìtidu de li torrare a Norry."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:30
msgid "Hettar has given me a piece of Norry's favorite food."
msgstr "Hettar m'at dadu unu bìculu de su màndigu preferidu de Norry."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:40
msgid "I have offered Hettar's piece of Wyrm meat to Norry, who took it eagerly."
msgstr ""
"Apo ofertu a Norry su bìculu de petza de wyrm de Hettar, e l'at leadu cun "
"gana."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:50
msgid "Norry ran off to reunite with Hettar."
msgstr "Norry si nch'est andadu currende a torrare cun Hettar."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:80
msgid "Hettar thanked me a thousand times for my help in finding Norry."
msgstr ""
"Hettar m'at ringratziadu milli bortas pro s'agiudu meu a agatare a Norry."

#: questlist_brimhaven_2b.json:hettar_dog:90
msgid "I explained to Hettar that I killed Norry. Hettar broke down on the floor in agony."
msgstr ""
"Apo ispiegadu a Hettar chi apo ochidu a Norry. Hettar est rutu a terra "
"disisperadu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic
msgid "Fungi panic"
msgstr "Pànicu de fungos"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:10
msgid "I met old man Bogsten in his cabin. He was sick after encountering a giant mushroom and wanted me to go see the potion merchant in Fallhaven to get a cure."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a su betzu Bogsten in sa barraca sua. Fiat malàidu a pustis de "
"àere atopadu unu fungu gigante e m'at pedidu de andare a bìdere su bendidore "
"de potziones de Fallhaven pro tènnere una cura."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:20
msgid "The potion merchant needed four spore samples to prepare the cure. I should go back to see Bogsten."
msgstr ""
"Su bendidore de potziones teniat bisòngiu de bator mustras de isporas pro "
"aprontare sa cura. Dia dèpere torrare a bìdere a Bogsten."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:30
msgid "Bogsten gave me the key to his backyard. I should go to the mushroom cave from there and collect the spore samples."
msgstr ""
"Bogsten m'at dadu sa crae de su pàtiu suo. Dia dèpere andare dae cue a sa "
"gruta de sos fungos e regòllere sas mustras de isporas."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:35
msgid "I opened Bogsten's backyard door."
msgstr "Apo abertu sa ghenna de su pàtiu de Bogsten."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:40
msgid "I showed Bogsten the spores. Now I should go back to see the potion merchant."
msgstr ""
"Apo mustradu sas isporas a Bogsten. Como dia dèpere torrare a bìdere su "
"bendidore de potziones."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:50
msgid "The potion merchant gave me the cure. I should give it to Bogsten now."
msgstr ""
"Su bendidore de potziones m'at dadu sa cura. Como la dia dèpere dare a "
"Bogsten."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:52
msgid "Bogsten was cured."
msgstr "Bogsten s'est curadu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:60
msgid "Bogsten said evil forces in his cave were preventing him from working. He asked me to check his cave and gave me his necklace."
msgstr ""
"Bogsten at naradu chi unas fortzas malas in sa gruta sua no lu lassaiant "
"traballare. M'at pedidu de controllare sa gruta sua e m'at dadu sa collana "
"sua."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:70
msgid "I met an old sorcerer named Zuul'khan in the cave. He told me Bogsten's family imprisoned him using an ancient petrifying spell, but thanks to Bogsten's laxity, he was now free."
msgstr ""
"In sa gruta apo atopadu unu magu betzu chi si narat Zuul'khan. M'at naradu "
"chi sa famìlia de Bogsten l'aiat serradu presoneri cun un'incantu antigu chi "
"trasformat in pedra, ma chi, pro neghe de sa trascuràntzia de Bogsten, como "
"fiat lìberu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:72
msgid "He wanted me to kill Bogsten and bring him Bogsten's staff."
msgstr "M'at pedidu de ochìere a Bogsten e de li giùghere su bàculu de Bogsten."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:80
msgid "I decided to slay Zuul'khan."
msgstr "Apo seberadu de ochìere a Zuul'khan."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:90
#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:145
msgid "I defeated Zuul'khan, but he was not dead. He disappeared into the ground."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu a Zuul'khan, ma non fiat mortu. Est isparèssidu suta de terra."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:92
msgid "I told Bogsten about what happened."
msgstr "Apo contadu a Bogsten su chi est capitadu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:100
msgid "Bogsten remembered the petrifying spell. This time he would make sure that Zuul'khan cannot come back. He gave me a bag of mushrooms and told me I should take them to the potion merchant."
msgstr ""
"Bogsten s'est ammentadu de s'incantu chi trasformat in pedra. Custa borta at "
"a fàghere in modu chi Zuul'khan non potzat torrare. M'at dadu una bussa de "
"fungos e m'at naradu de la giùghere a su bendidore de potziones."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:102
msgid "Zuul'khan seems to have moved away from Bogsten's caves to another hiding place."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi Zuul'khan si nche siat andadu dae sas grutas de Bogsten a un'àteru "
"cuadòrgiu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:110
msgid "The potion merchant said that these were very rare mushrooms. He prepared two \"Underground Fighter\" potions for me. He would sell me some more if I came back."
msgstr ""
"Su bendidore de potziones at naradu chi custos fungos fiant raros meda. M'at "
"aprontadu duas potziones \"Gherradore de suta terra\". Si torraia, mi nde "
"diat bèndere àteras."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:115
msgid "Zuul'khan's offer seemed interesting. I have to go kill Bogsten."
msgstr ""
"S'oferta de Zuul'khan pariat interessante. Depo andare a ochìere a Bogsten."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:135
msgid "I decided to keep Bogsten's staff for myself, so I had to kill Zuul'khan."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de mi tènnere su bàculu de Bogsten, e duncas apo dèpidu "
"ochìere a Zuul'khan."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:150
msgid "I gave Bogsten's staff to Zuul'khan."
msgstr "Apo dadu su bàculu de Bogsten a Zuul'khan."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:155
msgid "He rewarded me with permanent immunity to Spore Infection."
msgstr ""
"M'at premiadu: como su Contàgiu de isporas non mi podet tocare mai prus."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:161
msgid "I got through the black fog."
msgstr "So passadu in mesu de sa nèula niedda."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:162
msgid "I got through the black fog again after a fight with Zuul'khan."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a passare in mesu de sa nèula niedda a pustis de una cumbata cun "
"Zuul'khan."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:163
msgid "And a third time."
msgstr "E una tertza borta."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:164
msgid "After another fight with Zuul'khan I got through the black fog again."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de un'àtera cumbata cun Zuul'khan, so torradu a passare in mesu de "
"sa nèula niedda."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:169
msgid "I overpowered Zuul'khan one more time, but this time the black fog wouldn't go away. Obviously I can't get past the fog that way."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu a Zuul'khan un'àtera borta, ma custa borta sa nèula niedda non si "
"nch'est andada. Est craru chi in custa manera non potzo passare sa nèula."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:170
msgid "I defeated Zuul'khan one last time and the black fog was gone for good. I must find and destroy the fungi leader."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu a Zuul'khan pro s'ùrtima borta e sa nèula niedda si nch'est andada "
"pro semper. Depo agatare e distrùere su cabu de sos fungos."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:200
msgid "I defeated the giant mushroom, Zuul'khan's fungi leader."
msgstr "Apo bintu su fungu gigante, su cabu de sos fungos de Zuul'khan."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:210
msgid "A young girl named Lediofa emerged after my battle with the mushroom. She told me how Zuul'khan captured her as food for the mushroom. She seemed to have been poisoned just like Bogsten, so I directed her to see the Fallhaven potioner."
msgstr ""
"Una pitzinna giòvana chi si narat Lediofa est essida a campu a pustis de sa "
"batalla mea cun su fungu. M'at contadu comente Zuul'khan l'aiat leada "
"presonera pro la dare a su fungu comente màndigu. Pariat avelenada comente a "
"Bogsten, e duncas l'apo mandada a bìdere su fraigadore de potziones de "
"Fallhaven."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:fungi_panic:220
msgid "I met Lediofa at the potions shop in Fallhaven. She couldn't afford to pay the potioner for a mushroom poison cure, so I gave her the gold she needed. In return, she offered her family's hospitality if I ever come to visit in Nor City."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Lediofa in sa butega de potziones de Fallhaven. Non teniat "
"dinare pro pagare a su fraigadore de potziones una cura pro su velenu de "
"fungu, e duncas l'apo dadu s'oro chi li serbiat. In càmbiu, m'at ofertu "
"s'ospitalidade de sa famìlia sua si mai apo a andare a Nor City."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:bela_gsnake
msgid "A giant snake"
msgstr "Una colora gigante"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:bela_gsnake:10
msgid "I heard rumours of a giant snake to the south of Fallhaven."
msgstr "Apo intesu narende chi b'at una colora gigante a su sud de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:bela_gsnake:90
msgid "Bela was happy that I freed Fallhaven from the threat of this monstrous snake."
msgstr ""
"Bela fiat cuntenta ca apo liberadu Fallhaven dae sa minetza de custa colora "
"mostruosa."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements
msgid "Unusual experiences and achievements"
msgstr "Esperièntzias e impresas foras de su normale"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:1
msgid "Mikhail gave me a book in which I could put down my most unusual experiences and achievements."
msgstr ""
"Mikhail m'at dadu unu libru in ue potzo iscrìere sas esperièntzias e sas "
"impresas meas prus foras de su normale."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:10
msgid "On the road: My first glimpse of the great Duleian Road!"
msgstr "In caminu: sa prima ograda mea a s'àndala duleiana manna!"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:20
msgid "Community cleanup: I killed 20 highwaymen."
msgstr "Bidda lìmpia: apo ochidu 20 bandidos de caminu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:30
msgid "Prospector: I collected at least 100000 gold."
msgstr "Chircadore de oro: apo regortu a su mancu 100000 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:40
msgid "Birdwatching: I spotted a falcon high above the Lake Laeroth watchtower."
msgstr ""
"Abbaidende sos pugiones: apo bidu un'astore artu artu subra de sa turre de "
"vigilàntzia de su Lagu Laeroth."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:50
msgid "Lazy day: I spent a while watching a beetle fight."
msgstr ""
"Die de mandronia: apo passadu unu pagu de tempus a abbaidare una gherra de "
"carrabusos."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:60
msgid "The secret garden: Near Guynmart Castle, I found Rob's secret clearing."
msgstr ""
"Su giardinu segretu: acanta de su Casteddu de Guynmart, apo agatadu sa "
"lascura segreta de Rob."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:70
msgid "Hole in the wall: I discovered a secret room deep in a cave."
msgstr ""
"Istampu in su muru: apo iscobertu un'aposentu segretu in fundu a una gruta."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:80
msgid "Tough luck: I must have fallen for every trap in the Arulir mountain. Ouch ..."
msgstr ""
"Mala sorte: depo èssere rutu in totu sas trampas de su monte Arulir. Ai ..."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:100
msgid "Swimming lessons: I swam along a raging river - and lived!"
msgstr ""
"Letziones de nadare: apo nadadu in unu riu infuriadu, e so abarradu biu!"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:110
msgid "Overcoming fears: I braved the elements and my fear of heights and walked out onto the very edge of the Sullengard ravine and looked straight down to the ravine's bottom."
msgstr ""
"Bìnchere sas timòrias: apo afrontadu sos elementos e sa timòria mea de "
"s'artària, so caminadu finas a s'oru de sa gula de Sullengard e apo "
"abbaidadu deretu a su fundu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:120
msgid "Thrown out of my first tavern: I was told to leave the Sullengard tavern and at such a young age too. Am I starting down the wrong path?"
msgstr ""
"Bogadu dae su primu tzilleri meu: m'ant naradu de lassare su tzilleri de "
"Sullengard, e a un'edade gasi giòvana. Est chi so cumintzende a pigare su "
"caminu isballiadu?"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:125
msgid "Uniform blue lighting: I solved a difficult logic riddle."
msgstr "Lughe asula uniforme: apo risoltu un'indevìngiu de lògica difìtzile."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:130
msgid "Nightmare Survived: I survived the most intense nightmares ever"
msgstr ""
"Malos sònnios superados: nde so essidu biu dae sos malos sònnios prus fortes "
"de semper"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:135
msgid "Innocent barnyard animal dies: Even after the pig told me to stop feeding it rotten meat as it was making it sick, I continued to do so and it resulted in its death."
msgstr ""
"Morit un'animale innotzente de sa corte: mancari su porcu m'esseret naradu "
"de acabbare de li dare petza pudida ca lu faghiat ammalaidare, apo sighidu a "
"lu fàghere, e est mortu."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:150
msgid "Exotic animal killed: On top of the hills south of Stoutford, I killed an exotic one-of-a-kind bird."
msgstr ""
"Animale esòticu mortu: in sa punta de sos montigros a sud de Stoutford, apo "
"ochidu unu pugione esòticu, ùnicu in sa genia sua."

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:160
msgid "#reserved: nor_city"
msgstr "#reserved: nor_city"

#: questlist_fungi_panic.json:achievements:200
msgid "Sheep in wolf's clothing: I finally found a use for the Wolfpack's hide."
msgstr ""
"Berbeghe in pedde de lupu: a sa fine apo agatadu una manera de impreare sa "
"pedde de sa truma de lupos."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup
msgid "Delicious soup"
msgstr "Minestra delitziosa"

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:10
msgid ""
"In a hut southwest from Fallhaven I met Alaun.\n"
"He asked me to bring him some of the delicious soup made by Gison with forest mushrooms.\n"
"Gison's house lies to the south."
msgstr ""
"In una barraca a sud-ovest de Fallhaven apo atopadu a Alaun.\n"
"M'at pedidu de li giùghere unu pagu de sa minestra delitziosa chi faghet "
"Gison cun sos fungos de su padente.\n"
"Sa domo de Gison est a su sud."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:20
msgid "I found Gison's house and should deliver the soup to Alaun while it is hot."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sa domo de Gison e dia dèpere giùghere sa minestra a Alaun "
"mentras est galu caente."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:22
msgid "Gison gave me a new soup for 5 gold."
msgstr "Gison m'at dadu una minestra noa pro 5 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:24
msgid "Gison gave me a new soup for 50 gold."
msgstr "Gison m'at dadu una minestra noa pro 50 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:26
msgid "Gison gave me a new soup for 500 gold."
msgstr "Gison m'at dadu una minestra noa pro 500 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:28
msgid "Gison gave me a new soup for 5000 gold. I should really go to Alaun now."
msgstr ""
"Gison m'at dadu una minestra noa pro 5000 monedas de oro. Como dia dèpere "
"andare a beru dae Alaun."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:30
msgid ""
"Alaun received the soup.\n"
"I should take the empty bottle back to Gison."
msgstr ""
"Alaun at retzidu sa minestra.\n"
"Dia dèpere torrare s'ampulla bòida a Gison."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:35
msgid "Alaun told me that Nimael also makes soup."
msgstr "Alaun m'at naradu chi fintzas Nimael faghet sa minestra."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:40
msgid "Gison thanked me for bringing the empty bottle back to him."
msgstr "Gison m'at ringratziadu ca l'apo torradu s'ampulla bòida."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:50
msgid ""
"I spent 5555 gold on buying mushroom soup! Am I crazy? \n"
"There is no soup left for Alaun now."
msgstr ""
"Apo gastadu 5555 monedas de oro pro comporare minestra de fungos! So macu? \n"
"Como pro Alaun non b'at prus minestra."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:60
msgid "Gison insisted his soup is better than Nimael's."
msgstr "Gison insistiat chi sa minestra sua est mègius de sa de Nimael."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:70
msgid "Nimael insisted her soup is better than Gison's."
msgstr "Nimael insistiat chi sa minestra sua est mègius de sa de Gison."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:80
msgid "Gison gave me a taste of both soups."
msgstr "Gison m'at fatu tastare totu e duas sas minestras."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:90
msgid "Nimael gave me a taste of both soups."
msgstr "Nimael m'at fatu tastare totu e duas sas minestras."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:100
msgid "Gison said he would talk to Nimael about selling both soups in Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Gison at naradu chi at a faeddare cun Nimael pro bèndere totu e duas sas "
"minestras in Fallhaven."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:110
msgid "Nimael said she would talk to Gison about selling both soups in Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Nimael at naradu chi at a faeddare cun Gison pro bèndere totu e duas sas "
"minestras in Fallhaven."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_soup:120
msgid "Nimael and Gison have been successful in selling more soup in Fallhaven by cooperating and creating more recipes."
msgstr ""
"Nimael e Gison sunt resèssidos a bèndere prus minestra in Fallhaven "
"traballende impare e creende retzetas noas."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook
msgid "A raid for a cookbook"
msgstr "Un'assaltu pro unu libru de retzetas"

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:10
msgid "Gison, the man with the mushroom soup in the forest south of Fallhaven, got raided. Only his cookbook was stolen and he asked me to bring it back to him."
msgstr ""
"A Gison, s'òmine de sa minestra de fungos in su padente a sud de Fallhaven, "
"l'ant atacadu. L'ant furadu petzi su libru de retzetas e m'at pedidu de bi "
"lu torrare."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:15
msgid "I agreed to help him."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu de l'agiudare."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:20
msgid "Gison said the thieves came from the south. I should begin my search there."
msgstr ""
"Gison at naradu chi sos ladros sunt bènnidos dae su sud. Dia dèpere "
"cumintzare a chircare dae cue."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:30
msgid "I discovered a hidden cave. The thieves may be hiding there."
msgstr "Apo iscobertu una gruta cuada. Forsis sos ladros si sunt cuende in cue."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:40
msgid "I found the thieves. Their leader was performing some kind of ritual when I came into the cave."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sos ladros. Cando so intradu in sa gruta, su cabu issoro fiat "
"faghende una genia de ritu."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:60
msgid "I brought the cookbook back to Gison. The thieves were working for Zuul'khan, the fungi sorcerer. They made a second copy of the book without the strange writing, which Gison gladly accepted. Gison can now cook his mushroom soup again."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu su libru de retzetas a Gison. Sos ladros traballaiant pro "
"Zuul'khan, su magu de sos fungos. Aiant fatu una segunda còpia de su libru "
"chene s'iscritura istrana, e Gison l'at atzetada cuntentu. Como Gison podet "
"torrare a fàghere sa minestra sua de fungos."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:62
msgid "I told Gison that I found the thieves, but that they had destroyed the cookbook."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Gison chi apo agatadu sos ladros, ma chi aiant distrutu su "
"libru de retzetas."

#: questlist_gison.json:gison_cookbook:70
msgid "Gison will give me mushroom soup in thanks if I bring him 50 gold, 2 of Bogsten's mushrooms and an empty bottle."
msgstr ""
"Gison m'at a dare minestra de fungos pro mi ringratziare si li giugo 50 "
"monedas de oro, 2 de sos fungos de Bogsten e un'ampulla bòida."

#: questlist_gorwath.json:postman
msgid "You're the postman"
msgstr "Faghes de postinu"

#: questlist_gorwath.json:postman:10
msgid "Gorwath would like me to give a letter to Arensia, in Fallhaven."
msgstr "Gorwath diat chèrrere chi dia una lìtera a Arensia, in Fallhaven."

#: questlist_gorwath.json:postman:12
msgid "But I decided not to help him with that."
msgstr "Ma apo detzìdidu de no l'agiudare in custu."

#: questlist_gorwath.json:postman:15
msgid "He gave me the letter."
msgstr "M'at dadu sa lìtera."

#: questlist_gorwath.json:postman:20
msgid "I gave the letter to Arensia, who was visibly happy about it. Gorwath needs to hear that."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu sa lìtera a Arensia, e si bidiat chi nde fiat cuntenta. Gorwath "
"depet ischire custu."

#: questlist_gorwath.json:postman:30
msgid "I told Gorwath that I gave the letter to Arensia. He's happy too."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Gorwath chi apo dadu sa lìtera a Arensia. Est cuntentu fintzas "
"issu."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04
msgid "Another ruthless Crackshot"
msgstr "Un'àteru Crackshot chene piedade"

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:10
msgid "Umar told me to visit Defy in Sullengard to instruct him to give the villagers their share."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at naradu de andare a bìdere a Defy in Sullengard pro li ordinare de "
"dare a sos biddajos sa parte issoro."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:20
msgid "Defy told me that there will be a delay in giving the villagers of Sullengard their fair share for some unknown reason. I must report this to Umar at once."
msgstr ""
"Defy m'at naradu chi, pro una resone chi non si connoschet, sos biddajos de "
"Sullengard ant a retzire in ritardu sa parte giusta issoro. Lu depo contare "
"deretu a Umar."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:30
msgid "Umar instructed me to talk to Defy once more."
msgstr "Umar m'at ordinadu de torrare a faeddare cun Defy."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:35
msgid "Defy and his friends have vanished! Back to Umar ..."
msgstr "Defy e sos amigos suos sunt isparèssidos! Torra dae Umar ..."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:40
msgid "I told Umar about the disappearance of Defy and his men. But Umar didn't believe me and he even sent me back to find them. I better ask the villagers there."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Umar s'isparèssida de Defy e de sos òmines suos. Ma Umar non "
"m'at crèidu e m'at fintzas mandadu torra a los agatare. Est mègius chi "
"pregunte a sos biddajos de cue."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:50
msgid "There was a distressed man, whom just had his first child, who hinted to me of wherabouts of Defy and his men. I must report this to Umar once more."
msgstr ""
"B'aiat un'òmine angustiadu, chi pagu in antis aiat tentu su primu fìgiu, chi "
"m'at dadu calicunu inditu de ue fiant Defy e sos òmines suos. Lu depo "
"contare torra a Umar."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:60
msgid "With Sullengard running into financial trouble, Umar is enraged by Defy's traitorous way."
msgstr ""
"Como chi Sullengard est in problemas de dinare, Umar est arrennegadu a mortu "
"pro sa traitoria de Defy."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:70
msgid "Umar gave me a task to give the mayor at least 50000 gold coins as the promised share for their living. After that, I'm instructed to report back to him."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at dadu s'incàrrigu de dare a su sìndigu a su mancu 50000 monedas de "
"oro, comente sa parte promìtida pro sa vida issoro. A pustis, depo torrare a "
"issu a li contare totu."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:75
msgid "Sullengard has been given their share of the gold and now it's time to revisit Umar."
msgstr ""
"A Sullengard l'ant dadu sa parte sua de oro e como est ora de torrare dae "
"Umar."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Thieves04:80
msgid "At last, Sullengard can now sleep calmly and eat sufficiently with their finances restored."
msgstr ""
"A sa fine, Sullengard como podet dormire trancuillu e mandigare bastante, "
"cun sos dinares suos torrados a postu."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1
msgid "Climbing up is forbidden"
msgstr "Est proibidu a artziare"

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:5
msgid "Down in a hole, in the mountain side near Prim, I found signs of a heinous torture. At least three corpses were there. I felt the urge to get out of there as fast as I could and immediately report what I found to someone in the village."
msgstr ""
"In fundu a un'istampu, in su costadu de su monte acanta de Prim, apo agatadu "
"sinnos de una tortura orrorosa. B'aiat a su mancu tres corpos mortos. Apo "
"intesu sa netzessidade de nde essire cantu prus a lestru e de contare deretu "
"su chi apo agatadu a calicunu de sa bidda."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:6
msgid "A mysterious looking guy suddenly appeared in my way when I was headed to report to the guards. He has recommended that I should not tell them anything."
msgstr ""
"Un'òmine de aspetu misteriosu est aparèssidu totu in una in caminu meu, "
"mentras andaia a nàrrere totu a sas guàrdias. M'at cussigiadu de non lis "
"nàrrere nudda."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:7
msgid "I ignored the advice of the strange guy that I almost stumbled over. I must see some guards."
msgstr ""
"No apo fatu cara a su cussìgiu de s'òmine istranu chi aia atopadu pro casu. "
"Depo bìdere a calicuna guàrdia."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:8
msgid "Somehow, a Feygard general and his men reached Prim. They are kind of extorting the people in charge to get full control of Elm mine."
msgstr ""
"In calicuna manera, unu generale de Feygard e sos òmines suos sunt lòmpidos "
"a Prim. Sunt belle ricatende a sos chi cumandant pro tènnere su controllu "
"totale de sa miniera de Elm."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:9
msgid "The man in charge is not willing to listen to me. He says he has more important things to deal with. Maybe the guy I met earlier was right."
msgstr ""
"S'òmine chi cumandat non cheret ascurtare. Narat chi tenet cosas prus "
"importantes de fàghere. Forsis s'òmine chi apo atopadu prima teniat resone."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:10
msgid "A Feygard general and two of his henchmen appeared. What are they up to?"
msgstr ""
"Est aparèssidu unu generale de Feygard cun duos de sos òmines suos. Ite sunt "
"aprontende?"

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:11
msgid "Ehrenfest is uneasy. He said we must meet in Elm mine, west of prim. We should talk no more about this inside the village."
msgstr ""
"Ehrenfest est inchietu. At naradu chi nos depimus atopare in sa miniera de "
"Elm, a otzidente de Prim. Non depimus faeddare prus de custu in intro de sa "
"bidda."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:15
msgid "Ehrenfest told me his story, and why he knew about what I saw on the mountain side, but he didn't dare to go down the hole."
msgstr ""
"Ehrenfest m'at contadu s'istòria sua, e pro ite ischiat su chi aia bidu in "
"su costadu de su monte, ma no aiat tentu su coràgiu de falare in s'istampu."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:16
msgid "I explained to Ehrenfest the horrible scene, and showed him proof of the torture. Poor guys..."
msgstr ""
"Apo ispiegadu a Ehrenfest s'iscena orrorosa, e l'apo mustradu sas proas de "
"sa tortura. Pòberos..."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:20
msgid "I must ask the villagers about Lorn and his partners, maybe I can gather some useful information from the common gossip."
msgstr ""
"Depo preguntare a sos biddajos de Lorn e de sos sòtzios suos: forsis potzo "
"regòllere calicuna informatzione ùtile dae sas tzarras de sa gente."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:21
msgid "It seems Lorn was a regular client of the tavern. I should ask there."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi Lorn esseret unu cliente abituale de su tzilleri. Dia dèpere "
"preguntare in cue."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:22
msgid "One of the tavern regulars, possibly Lorn's old partner Jern, does not believe that Lorn's death was an accident, maintaining Lorn had been climbing the mountains for longer than he could remember. However, he does not feel comfortable to continue the conversation."
msgstr ""
"Unu de sos clientes abituales de su tzilleri, forsis s'antigu sòtziu de "
"Lorn, Jern, non creet chi sa morte de Lorn siat istada un'atzidente, e narat "
"chi Lorn artziaiat a sos montes dae prus tempus de cantu issu etotu si "
"podiat ammentare. Però non si sentit a s'àsiu a nde sighire a faeddare."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:23
msgid "Lorn's old partner asked me to bring a large bottle of cool water from the streams that are down the hole east of Prim. I bet it is the same hole I've been down earlier."
msgstr ""
"S'antigu sòtziu de Lorn m'at pedidu de li giùghere un'ampulla manna de abba "
"frisca dae sos rios chi sunt in fundu a s'istampu a oriente de Prim. So "
"seguru chi est su matessi istampu in ue so faladu prima."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:24
msgid "I've collected enough water. Time to leave this dark place."
msgstr "Apo regortu abba bastante. Est ora de lassare custu logu iscuru."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:25
msgid "I brought the cold water to Lorn's old partner. He seems to be better, and is less intoxicated."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu s'abba frisca a s'antigu sòtziu de Lorn. Paret chi istet mègius, "
"e est prus pagu imbriagu."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:30
msgid "Jern doesn't know anything about a missing couple. How can a member of Lorn's crew ignore the mission of his group? Again, something does not fit. I should visit Ehrenfest again."
msgstr ""
"Jern no ischit nudda de una còpia isparèssida. Comente podet unu membru de "
"s'iscuadra de Lorn no ischire sa missione de su grupu suo? Torra, b'at "
"calicuna cosa chi non torrat. Dia dèpere torrare a bìdere a Ehrenfest."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:31
msgid "I decided to solve this situation myself, as Ehrenfest proved not to be trustworthy enough."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de risòlvere custa situatzione a sa sola, ca Ehrenfest at "
"dimustradu de no èssere de fide bastante."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:32
msgid "Despite Ehrenfest's ostensible lies, I decided to give him a second chance."
msgstr ""
"Mancari sas fàulas craras de Ehrenfest, apo detzìdidu de li dare una segunda "
"possibilidade."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:33
msgid "It's settled. Ehrenfest and I will reach Blackwater Settlement and stop General Ortholion's evil plan."
msgstr ""
"Est detzìdidu. Ehrenfest e deo amus a lòmpere a s'insediamentu de Abbaniedda "
"e amus a firmare su pianu malu de su Generale Ortholion."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:34
msgid "I've found a severely wounded woman inside a mountain cabin. She claims to have been suddenly attacked by a group of wyrms. Ortholion and the other scout left her resting and departed to Blackwater Settlement."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una fèmina ferida a mala manera in intro de una barraca de "
"monte. Narat chi l'at atacada a s'ispessada unu grupu de wyrm. Ortholion e "
"s'àteru esploradore l'ant lassada a si pasare e sunt partidos pro "
"s'insediamentu de Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:35
msgid "I killed the mountain scout that was taking refuge in the old cabin up in the mountain."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu s'esploradore de monte chi si fiat cuadu in sa barraca betza in "
"su monte."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:36
msgid "I talked again with Jern. Maybe the guards will be more reasonable if he leads the conversation instead of me."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a faeddare cun Jern. Forsis sas guàrdias ant a èssere prus "
"dispostas a ascurtare si su chi faeddat est issu e non deo."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:40
msgid "It seems Ehrenfest lied to me more than once. He's probably connected with the missing people and Lorn's death. I must find General Ortholion and warn him about Ehrenfest."
msgstr ""
"Paret chi Ehrenfest m'apat naradu fàulas prus de una borta. Est probàbile "
"chi tèngiat ite bìdere cun sa gente isparèssida e cun sa morte de Lorn. Depo "
"agatare su Generale Ortholion e l'avisare de Ehrenfest."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:41
msgid "One of the general's henchmen attacked me without provocation. There was something wrong with her. Better hurry up and meet with the Feygard general."
msgstr ""
"Una de sas persones de su generale m'at atacadu chene provocatzione. B'aiat "
"calicuna cosa chi no andaiat in issa. Est mègius a mi pressare e a m'atopare "
"cun su generale de Feygard."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:45
msgid "Ehrenfest revealed his true intentions, but fled before getting surrounded. He told me he will be waiting for General Ortholion in the Elm mine."
msgstr ""
"Ehrenfest at mustradu sas intentziones suas beras, ma est fuidu in antis de "
"èssere inghiriadu. M'at naradu chi at a isetare a su Generale Ortholion in "
"sa miniera de Elm."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:46
msgid "After a brief conversation with the general, he left Blackwater settlement in a rush to reach Elm mine. He seemed really worried about the mine, so he asked me to warn his soldiers, settled south of Prim."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere faeddadu pagu tempus cun su generale, issu at lassadu "
"s'insediamentu de Abbaniedda a sa lestra pro lòmpere a sa miniera de Elm. "
"Pariat preocupadu a beru pro sa miniera, e duncas m'at pedidu de avisare sos "
"sordados suos, chi istant a sud de Prim."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:47
msgid "I reported to the general's henchmen about his plans. Now, I should hurry to the Elm mine."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a sos òmines de su generale sos pianos suos. Como depo andare a "
"lestru a sa miniera de Elm."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:48
msgid "Once in the mine I saw corpses and collapsed tunnels. I tried to go another way and reached some more tunnels. Fortunately, they were not collapsed, but there was something strange there that scared even the venomfangs. Something evil."
msgstr ""
"Una borta in sa miniera, apo bidu corpos mortos e gallerias derrutas. Apo "
"chircadu de andare in un'àtera manera e so lòmpidu a àteras gallerias. Pro "
"fortuna, non fiant derrutas, ma b'aiat una cosa istrana chi faghiat timòria "
"fintzas a sos dentevelenu. Una cosa mala."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:49
msgid "One of the unexploited areas of the mine had a walled up passage and lots of those strange glowing gems. They seem to consume living beings to grow and bring life to inanimated things or corpses. I must be very careful."
msgstr ""
"Una de sas àreas no isfrutadas de sa miniera teniat unu passàgiu muradu e "
"medas de cussas gemmas lughentes istranas. Parent chi consumant èsseres bios "
"pro crèschere e chi dant vida a cosas chene ànima o a corpos mortos. Depo "
"èssere atentu meda."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:50
msgid "It was true! That strange glowing material is alive. I should be extremely cautious; it seems to be able to engulf living beings. I found the last of Ortholion's henchman alive. He has gone back to search for reinforcements. I hope they are better than those who dared to enter here."
msgstr ""
"Fiat beru! Cussu materiale istranu e lughente est biu. Depo èssere atentu "
"meda meda; paret chi siat capatze de ingùllere èsseres bios. Apo agatadu "
"s'ùrtimu de sos òmines de Ortholion galu biu. Est torradu a chircare "
"rinfortzos. Ispero chi siant mègius de cussos chi ant tentu su coràgiu de "
"intrare inoghe."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:51
msgid "I ended up trapped on a one-way path deep in a cavern below the Elm mine. General Ortholion is blocking the only way to escape for Ehrenfest. This is his end."
msgstr ""
"So abarradu serradu in unu caminu chene essida in fundu a una gruta suta de "
"sa miniera de Elm. Su Generale Ortholion est blochende s'ùnica essida pro "
"Ehrenfest. Custa est sa fine sua."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:52
msgid "Ehrenfest reversed the situation using some kind of magic, seemingly unknown even to himself."
msgstr ""
"Ehrenfest at furriadu sa situatzione impreende una genia de màgia, chi "
"pariat disconnota fintzas a issu etotu."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:53
msgid "Ehrenfest escaped again! General Ortholion is unconscious and the reinforcements haven't shown up yet..."
msgstr ""
"Ehrenfest est fuidu torra! Su Generale Ortholion est chene sentidos e sos "
"rinfortzos non sunt galu arribados..."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:54
msgid "Kamelio, who was no longer a human being, tried to kill both the general and me, but we survived. Better get out of this cavern as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Kamelio, chi non fiat prus un'èssere umanu, at chircadu de ochìere siat su "
"generale siat a mie, ma nde semus essidos bios. Est mègius a essire dae "
"custa gruta cantu prus a lestru."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:55
msgid "I got back to the Elm mine dining room. Despite saving the general's life he's not eager to reward me. Maybe I should try again later when we are both more settled."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a sa sala de pràndere de sa miniera de Elm. Mancari apo sarvadu "
"sa vida de su generale, non tenet gana de mi premiare. Forsis dia dèpere "
"torrare a proare a pustis, cando amus a èssere prus calmos totu e duos."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:56
msgid "After arriving back at a safer place, General Ortholion asked me a question. \"What is most important to you?\" I need to think about it before giving him my reply."
msgstr ""
"Cando semus lòmpidos a unu logu prus seguru, su Generale Ortholion m'at fatu "
"una pregunta: \"Ite est su prus importante pro tene?\" Bi depo pensare in "
"antis de li dare sa risposta mea."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:59
msgid "For my bravery, General Ortholion rewarded me with a lot of gold and told me to meet him in a couple of days."
msgstr ""
"Pro su coràgiu meu, su Generale Ortholion m'at premiadu cun meda oro e m'at "
"naradu de l'atopare in unas cantas dies."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:60
msgid "For my bravery (and my greediness), General Ortholion rewarded me with a lot of...junk. He might pay me better next time if I meet him in some days."
msgstr ""
"Pro su coràgiu meu (e pro sa gana mea de dinare), su Generale Ortholion m'at "
"premiadu cun meda... arga. Forsis m'at a pagare mègius sa borta chi benit si "
"l'atopo in unas cantas dies."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:61
msgid "For my bravery (and my lack of honor), General Ortholion rewarded me with a small bag of gold. He may have some news for me in a couple of days."
msgstr ""
"Pro su coràgiu meu (e pro sa mancàntzia mea de onore), su Generale Ortholion "
"m'at premiadu cun una bussighedda de oro. Forsis at a tènnere novas pro mene "
"in unas cantas dies."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:62
msgid "For my bravery and sense of honor, General Ortholion gave me a beautiful necklace, a symbol of his gratitude towards me. He also told me to come back in a few days, when I should ask him about all the events that have happened."
msgstr ""
"Pro su coràgiu e pro su sentidu de onore meu, su Generale Ortholion m'at "
"dadu una collana bella, sìmbulu de su ringratziamentu suo. M'at naradu "
"fintzas de torrare in unas cantas dies, cando li dia dèpere preguntare de "
"totu sos fatos chi sunt sutzèdidos."

#: questlist_omi2.json:Omi2_bwm1:63
msgid "For my bravery and... ignorance?, General Ortholion gave me a few days to rest and urged me to come back soon after that."
msgstr ""
"Pro su coràgiu meu e... s'ignoràntzia?, su Generale Ortholion m'at dadu unas "
"cantas dies pro mi pasare e m'at pregadu de torrare luego a pustis."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery
msgid "Delivery"
msgstr "Cunsigna"

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:10
msgid "Facutloni asked me to help him deliver all of the items ordered by his customers a long time ago. He even gave me an old document with the names and items written on it."
msgstr ""
"Facutloni m'at pedidu de l'agiudare a cunsignare totu sos ogetos chi sos "
"clientes suos aiant ordinadu tempus meda a como. M'at dadu fintzas unu "
"documentu betzu cun sos nòmines e sos ogetos iscritos."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:20
msgid "Arcir the Fallhaven book-lover ordered a 'Dusty Old book'."
msgstr ""
"Arcir, s'amante de sos libros de Fallhaven, at ordinadu unu 'Libru betzu "
"prenu de prùere'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:30
msgid "Edrin the Brimhaven metalsmith ordered a 'Striped Hammer'."
msgstr ""
"Edrin, su mastru de metallos de Brimhaven, at ordinadu unu 'Marteddu a "
"listas'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:40
msgid "Odirath the Stoutford armorer ordered a 'Pretty Porcelain Figure'."
msgstr ""
"Odirath, su fraigadore de armaduras de Stoutford, at ordinadu una 'Figura "
"galana de portzellana'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:50
msgid "Venanra the Brimhaven laundress ordered an 'Old, worn cape'."
msgstr ""
"Venanra, sa lavandera de Brimhaven, at ordinadu una 'Capa betza e gastada'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:60
msgid "Tjure the unlucky Brimhaven merchant ordered a 'Mysterious green something'."
msgstr ""
"Tjure, su mercante disgratziadu de Brimhaven, at ordinadu una 'Cosa birde e "
"misteriosa'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:70
msgid "Servant the Guynmart servant ordered a 'Chandelier'."
msgstr "Servant, su tzeracu de Guynmart, at ordinadu unu 'Lampadàriu'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:80
msgid "Arghes at Remgard tavern ordered 'Yellow boots'."
msgstr "Arghes, de su tzilleri de Remgard, at ordinadu 'Botas grogas'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:90
msgid "Wyre the mournful Vilegard woman ordered a 'Lyre'."
msgstr "Wyre, sa fèmina trista de Vilegard, at ordinadu una 'Lira'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:100
msgid "Mikhail ordered a 'Plush Pillow'."
msgstr "Mikhail at ordinadu unu 'Cabitzale modde'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:110
msgid "Pangitain the Brimhaven fortune teller ordered a 'Crystal Globe'."
msgstr ""
"Pangitain, s'indovinu de Brimhaven, at ordinadu unu 'Globu de cristallu'."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:120
msgid "Facutloni wants me to report back after the deliveries are complete."
msgstr ""
"Facutloni cheret chi torre a li contare totu cando apo a àere acabbadu sas "
"cunsignas."

#: questlist_delivery.json:brv_wh_delivery:130
msgid "I reported back to Facutloni. He is very happy."
msgstr "Apo torradu a contare totu a Facutloni. Est cuntentu meda."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_hth
msgid "Hunting the hunter"
msgstr "Cassende su cassadore"

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_hth:0
msgid "Deebo, the apple orchard farmer northeast of Sullengard informed me of a Golden jackal that is wreaking havoc in his orchard."
msgstr ""
"Deebo, su massaju de s'ortu de mela a nord-est de Sullengard, m'at contadu "
"de un'Isciacallu doradu chi est faghende dannos mannos in s'ortu suo."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_hth:10
msgid "I accepted the challenge of tracking down the Golden jackal and bringing back proof to Deebo that I have killed it."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu s'isfida de agatare s'Isciacallu doradu e de giùghere a Deebo "
"sa proa chi l'apo ochidu."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_hth:40
msgid "I killed the Golden jackal. I need to return to Deebo with the Golden jackal's fur as proof that I've killed it."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu s'Isciacallu doradu. Depo torrare dae Deebo cun su pilu de "
"s'Isciacallu doradu comente proa chi l'apo ochidu."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_hth:50
msgid "I returned to Deebo with the killed the Golden jackal's fur as proof that I had killed it. He was now willing to trade with me."
msgstr ""
"So torradu dae Deebo cun su pilu de s'Isciacallu doradu comente proa chi "
"l'aia ochidu. Como fiat dispostu a fàghere cummèrtziu cun megus."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght
msgid "Getting home on time"
msgstr "Torrare a domo in tempus"

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:10
msgid "Hadena needed my help to get her husband Ainsley home on time."
msgstr ""
"Hadena teniat bisòngiu de s'agiudu meu pro fàghere torrare su maridu, "
"Ainsley, a domo in tempus."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:20
msgid "I agreed to help Hadena with getting her husband Ainsley home on time. He was working at Deebo's Orchard located southwest of their cabin."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Hadena a fàghere torrare su maridu, Ainsley, a "
"domo in tempus. Fiat traballende in s'Ortu de Deebo, a su sud-ovest de sa "
"barraca issoro."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:25
msgid "Due to the vast distance to Loneford and the monsters that he would encounter along the way, Ainsley has asked me to go to Loneford and get him a new pitchfork."
msgstr ""
"Pro more de sa distàntzia manna finas a Loneford e de sos mostros chi diat "
"atopare in caminu, Ainsley m'at pedidu de andare a Loneford e de li leare "
"unu furcone nou."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:30
msgid "Throthaus wanted me to pull out his pitchfork from the haystack to prove that I'm a son of a farmer."
msgstr ""
"Throthaus m'at pedidu de tirare su furcone suo dae su muntone de fenu pro "
"dimustrare chi so fìgiu de unu massaju."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:40
msgid "I successfully pulled out the pitchfork. It's time to visit Ainsley again who's working on Deebo's Orchard."
msgstr ""
"So resèssidu a tirare su furcone. Est ora de torrare a bìdere a Ainsley, chi "
"est traballende in s'Ortu de Deebo."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:50
msgid "I gave Ainsley the new pitchfork. I should tell Hadena about this."
msgstr "Apo dadu su furcone nou a Ainsley. Lu dia dèpere nàrrere a Hadena."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:deebo_orchard_ght:60
msgid "Hadena was so grateful to me for helping them."
msgstr "Hadena m'at ringratziadu meda ca los apo agiudados."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_pond_safety
msgid "Pond safety"
msgstr "Seguresa in su pischinale"

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_pond_safety:10
msgid "Nanette was troubled that her pond is unsafe because of the monsters that emerged in the pond. "
msgstr ""
"Nanette fiat preocupada ca su pischinale suo no est seguru pro more de sos "
"mostros chi sunt essidos in su pischinale. "

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_pond_safety:20
msgid "I accepted her request to clear out the monsters in her pond area so that she could enjoy the pond again."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu sa rechesta sua de nche bogare sos mostros dae s'àrea de su "
"pischinale suo pro chi potzat torrare a si godire su pischinale."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_pond_safety:30
msgid "I have now cleared the pond area. Nanette told me that I should talk to Kaelwea, the priest of Sullengard, to see if he has some information about the cause of the monster's appearance in the pond area."
msgstr ""
"Como apo limpiadu s'àrea de su pischinale. Nanette m'at naradu chi dia "
"dèpere faeddare cun Kaelwea, su preìderu de Sullengard, pro bìdere si tenet "
"calicuna informatzione subra de sa càusa de s'aparitzione de sos mostros in "
"s'àrea de su pischinale."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_pond_safety:40
msgid "The priest Kaelwea told me a story about his strange experience same as Nanette's experience in the pond area. I should better tell her the moral of the story."
msgstr ""
"Su preìderu Kaelwea m'at contadu un'istòria subra de una esperièntzia "
"istrana sua, sa matessi de s'esperièntzia de Nanette in s'àrea de su "
"pischinale. Est mègius chi li conte sa morale de s'istòria."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_pond_safety:50
msgid "I told Nanette the moral of the story. She had already learned from her mistake and she promised never to do it again just to release her anger issue against the unfair taxes of Feygard."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Nanette sa morale de s'istòria. Issa aiat giai imparadu dae "
"s'errore suo e at promìtidu de no lu torrare a fàghere mai prus petzi pro "
"isfogare s'arrennegu chi tenet contra a sas tassas ingiustas de Feygard."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items
msgid "Recovering stolen property"
msgstr "Recuperare sas cosas furadas"

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:10
msgid "I've agreed to help the armour shop owner, Zaccheria investigate the theft of his shop's entire inventory."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare su mere de sa butega de armaduras, Zaccheria, a "
"investigare comente l'ant furadu totu sa mercantzia de sa butega sua."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:20
msgid "Zaccheria suggested that I should start my investigation by speaking with Gaelian from the Briwerra family."
msgstr ""
"Zaccheria m'at cussigiadu de cumintzare s'investigatzione mea faeddende cun "
"Gaelian de sa famìlia Briwerra."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:30
msgid "I spoke with Gaelian from the Briwerra family and I suspect that he had nothing to do with this crime."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Gaelian de sa famìlia Briwerra e apo s'impressione chi no "
"at nudda de bìdere cun custu crìmine."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:40
msgid ""
"I spoke with Prowling Arantxa, a thief in the Sullengard tavern basement and she informed me that the 'lost traveler' recently tried to sell her some items that she recgonized as belonging to Zaccheria.\n"
"I should speak with the 'lost traveler'."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Arantxa chi girat a sa muda, una ladra in sa cantina de su "
"tzilleri de Sullengard, e m'at naradu chi su 'biagiante pèrdidu' dae pagu at "
"chircadu de li bèndere unos cantos ogetos chi issa at connotu comente de "
"Zaccheria.\n"
"Dia dèpere faeddare cun su 'biagiante pèrdidu'."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:50
msgid "I had paid the 'lost traveler' in exchange for the location of Zaccheria's stolen items. He told me that he had hidden them on the eastern boundaries of town."
msgstr ""
"Apo pagadu su 'biagiante pèrdidu' in càmbiu de su logu in ue fiant sos "
"ogetos furados de Zaccheria. M'at naradu chi los aiat cuados in sas làcanas "
"de oriente de sa bidda."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:60
msgid "I found the stolen items and should return to Zaccheria with them."
msgstr "Apo agatadu sos ogetos furados e los dia dèpere torrare a Zaccheria."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:sullengard_recover_items:70
msgid "Zaccheria was very happy that I was able to return his items to him. He paid me a very nice reward in gold."
msgstr ""
"Zaccheria fiat cuntentu meda ca so resèssidu a li torrare sos ogetos suos. "
"M'at dadu unu prèmiu bellu de oro."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging
msgid "Beer Bootlegging"
msgstr "Contrabbandu de birra"

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:10
msgid "I've agreed to help the Feygard patrol captain investigate why there is so much beer on the Foaming flask tavern property."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare su capitanu de sa patrùllia de Feygard a "
"investigare pro ite b'at tanta birra in su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:20
msgid "After bribing Torilo, the owner of the Foaming flask, he stated that he and other tavern owners had a 'business agreement' with a group of 'distributors'. He suggested that I ask other tavern owners for more information."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo corrùmpidu a Torilo, su mere de su Fiascu Ispumosu, at "
"naradu chi issu e àteros meres de tzilleris teniant unu 'acordu de afàrios' "
"cun unu grupu de 'distribudores'. M'at cussigiadu de preguntare a àteros "
"meres de tzilleris pro tènnere prus informatziones."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:30
msgid "After bribing Tharwyn, the owner of the Vilegard tavern, he stated as part of his 'business agreement', Dunla, the local thief, is one of his 'distributors'. He suggested that I talk to him."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo corrùmpidu a Tharwyn, su mere de su tzilleri de Vilegard, "
"at naradu chi, comente parte de su 'acordu de afàrios' suo, Dunla, su ladru "
"de su logu, est unu de sos 'distribudores' suos. M'at cussigiadu de faeddare "
"cun issu."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:40
msgid "Dunla, the thief in Vilegard instructed me to speak with Farrick if I want to learn more about the tavern owner's 'business agreement' with their 'distributors'."
msgstr ""
"Dunla, su ladru de Vilegard, m'at naradu de faeddare cun Farrik si chèrgio "
"ischire de prus subra de su 'acordu de afàrios' de sos meres de tzilleri cun "
"sos 'distribudores' issoro."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:50
msgid "Farrik told me that the beer is coming from Sullengard. I really should go there next."
msgstr ""
"Farrik m'at naradu chi sa birra benit dae Sullengard. A pustis depo andare a "
"beru in cue."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:60
msgid "To earn his trust, Mayor Ale has asked that I deliver his letter to Kealwea, the Sullengard priest."
msgstr ""
"Pro balangiare sa fide sua, su Sìndigu Ale m'at pedidu de giùghere sa lìtera "
"sua a Kealwea, su preìderu de Sullengard."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:70
msgid "I have done what Mayor Ale has asked of me as I have delivered his letter. I should now return to him."
msgstr ""
"Apo fatu su chi m'at pedidu su Sìndigu Ale: apo giutu sa lìtera sua. Como "
"dia dèpere torrare dae issu."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:80
msgid "Mayor Ale has explained everything to me about the 'business agreement' with the Thieves guild. I should head back to the Foaming flask tavern and speak with the captain."
msgstr ""
"Su Sìndigu Ale m'at ispiegadu totu subra de su 'acordu de afàrios' cun su "
"Grèmiu de sos Ladros. Dia dèpere torrare a su tzilleri de su Fiascu Ispumosu "
"e faeddare cun su capitanu."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:90
msgid "I informed the guard captain at the Foaming flask tavern all about the beer bootlegging operation."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a su capitanu de sas guàrdias de su tzilleri de su Fiascu "
"Ispumosu totu subra de s'operatzione de contrabbandu de birra."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:100
msgid "I informed the guard captain at the Foaming flask tavern that the beer was being distributed by the Thieves guild."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a su capitanu de sas guàrdias de su tzilleri de su Fiascu "
"Ispumosu chi sa birra la distribuiat su Grèmiu de sos Ladros."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:110
msgid "I informed the guard captain at the Foaming flask tavern that Sullengard was responsible for brewing the beer."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a su capitanu de sas guàrdias de su tzilleri de su Fiascu "
"Ispumosu chi su responsàbile de sa produtzione de sa birra fiat Sullengard."

#: questlist_sullengard.json:beer_bootlegging:120
msgid "I lied to the guard captain at the Foaming flask tavern and told him nothing about the beer bootlegging operation."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu fàulas a su capitanu de sas guàrdias de su tzilleri de su Fiascu "
"Ispumosu e no l'apo naradu nudda subra de s'operatzione de contrabbandu de "
"birra."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking
msgid "The Dead are Walking"
msgstr "Sos mortos sunt caminende"

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:0
msgid "Gabriel, the acolyte in Vilegard has asked me to investigate the sounds that only he is hearing."
msgstr ""
"Gabriel, s'acòlitu de Vilegard, m'at pedidu de investigare subra de sos "
"sonos chi intendet petzi issu."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:10
msgid "Off of the Duleian road, just east of Vilegard, I noticed that the moaning sounds seem just a little bit louder."
msgstr ""
"A foras de s'àndala duleiana, pròpiu a oriente de Vilegard, apo notadu chi "
"sos lamentos parent unu pagu prus fortes."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:20
msgid "Off of the Duleian road, just south of Alynndir's cabin, I noticed that the moaning sounds seem just a little bit louder."
msgstr ""
"A foras de s'àndala duleiana, pròpiu a sud de sa barraca de Alynndir, apo "
"notadu chi sos lamentos parent unu pagu prus fortes."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:40
msgid "I discovered the 'Haunted forest' and suspect that this may be the source of the sounds heard by Gabriel in Vilegard."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu su 'Padente de sos pantasmas' e suspeto chi custu potzat "
"èssere s'orìgine de sos sonos chi intendet Gabriel in Vilegard."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:50
msgid "In the haunted house's basement, I discovered Benzimos (and he discovered me) while chanting some kind of ritual. He must be stopped."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de sa domo de sos pantasmas, apo iscobertu a Benzimos (e issu "
"at iscobertu a mie) mentras cantaiat una genia de ritu. Depet èssere firmadu."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:60
msgid "Now that Benzimos is \"dead\" again, I should return to Vilegard and speak with Gabriel."
msgstr ""
"Como chi Benzimos est torra \"mortu\", dia dèpere torrare a Vilegard e "
"faeddare cun Gabriel."

#: questlist_haunted_forest.json:dead_walking:70
msgid "Gabriel was eternally grateful that I was able to prevent Benzimos' pack of undead from their potential attack on Vilegard."
msgstr ""
"Gabriel m'at ringratziadu pro semper ca so resèssidu a impedire chi sa truma "
"de non-mortos de Benzimos atacaret a Vilegard."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail
msgid "More rats!"
msgstr "Àteros sòrighes!"

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:10
msgid "A huge rat called Gruiik told me that they drove all the people out of this village."
msgstr ""
"Unu sòrighe mannu meda chi si narat Gruiik m'at naradu chi ant bogadu totu "
"sa gente dae custa bidda."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:20
msgid "Some two-legs were running around in the garden again. I should kill them."
msgstr ""
"Unos cantos duos-pees fiant currende torra in s'ortu. Los dia dèpere ochìere."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:30
msgid "I have killed Mara."
msgstr "Apo ochidu a Mara."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:32
msgid "I have killed Tharal."
msgstr "Apo ochidu a Tharal."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:52
msgid "I told Gruiik that I have killed Mara and Tharal."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Gruiik chi apo ochidu a Mara e a Tharal."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:54
msgid "I lied to Gruiik that I have killed Mara and Tharal."
msgstr "Apo naradu una fàula a Gruiik: chi apo ochidu a Mara e a Tharal."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:70
msgid "Gruiik was hungry and asked to bring him bread."
msgstr "Gruiik teniat fàmene e m'at pedidu de li giùghere pane."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:72
msgid "I found a bread in a bag hanging at the door of the Crossglen town hall."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu pane in una bussa apicada a sa ghenna de sa domo comunale de "
"Crossglen."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:74
msgid "I gave a bread to Gruiik."
msgstr "Apo dadu unu pane a Gruiik."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_mikhail:90
msgid "The huge rat ignored me after he had got the bread."
msgstr "Su sòrighe mannu non m'at prus dadu cara a pustis chi at tentu su pane."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest
msgid "Yellow is it"
msgstr "Grogu est"

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:10
msgid "I woke up when I felt that something had bitten my toe. Apparently I had a nightmare - there were rats everywhere! Anyway, I wasn't even slightly recovered."
msgstr ""
"Mi so ischidadu cando apo intesu chi calicuna cosa m'aiat mossigadu unu "
"pòddighe de su pee. A su chi paret aia fatu unu sònniu malu: b'aiat sòrighes "
"in totue! Comente si siat, non fia mancu unu pagu recuperadu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:30
msgid "An ancient meditating man rewarded me with a rat skull for a wise discussion."
msgstr ""
"Un'òmine antigu meda chi fiat meditende m'at premiadu cun una calavera de "
"sòrighe pro unu faeddu sàbiu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:31
msgid "I took a leg bone of a rat from a gold hunter."
msgstr "Apo leadu un'ossu de s'anca de unu sòrighe dae unu chircadore de oro."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:32
msgid "I stole a leg bone of a rat from the instrument maker."
msgstr ""
"Apo furadu un'ossu de s'anca de unu sòrighe dae su fabricante de istrumentos."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:33
msgid "In the center of a labyrinth I found a leg bone of a rat."
msgstr ""
"In su tzentru de unu labirintu apo agatadu un'ossu de s'anca de unu sòrighe."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:34
msgid "I took a leg bone of a rat from the dancing but vengeful and unforgiving skeletons."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu un'ossu de s'anca de unu sòrighe dae sos ischèletros chi "
"ballaiant, ma chi fiant vindicativos e chene perdonu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:35
msgid "I found the tail bones of a dead rat on a platform in a lake."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sos ossos de sa coa de unu sòrighe mortu subra de unu palcu in "
"mesu de unu lagu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:36
msgid "In a library I found the back bone of a big rat."
msgstr ""
"In una biblioteca apo agatadu sos ossos de s'ischina de unu sòrighe mannu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:37
msgid "I got some rib bones of a rat from the skeleton leader."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu unos cantos ossos de sas costas de unu sòrighe dae su cabu de sos "
"ischèletros."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:50
msgid "A small, naughty rat called Clevred claimed that he could help me get out of here. In return, he required of me to help to find a yellow, round artifact."
msgstr ""
"Unu sòrighe piticu e malandrinu chi si narat Clevred at naradu chi mi podiat "
"agiudare a nde essire dae inoghe. In càmbiu, m'at pedidu de l'agiudare a "
"agatare un'artefatu grogu e tundu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:52
msgid "I should look around in the rat cave. Clevred probably meant the Crossglen's supply cave."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere chircare in sa gruta de sos sòrighes. Clevred forsis cheriat "
"nàrrere sa gruta de sas provistas de Crossglen."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:60
msgid "In the depth of the supply cave I found a new statue, that resembles to my brother Andor."
msgstr ""
"In fundu a sa gruta de sas provistas apo agatadu un'istàtua noa, chi "
"assimìgiat a frade meu Andor."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:70
msgid "The rats had erected the statue in honor of Andor for never killing rats. I should begin your search behind this statue."
msgstr ""
"Sos sòrighes aiant artziadu s'istàtua in onore de Andor, ca no aiat mai "
"mortu sòrighes. Dia dèpere cumintzare sa chirca mea a palas de custa istàtua."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:80
msgid "I would need a pickaxe to tear down the statue."
msgstr "Mi diat serbire unu picu pro nche fàghere rùere s'istàtua."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:82
msgid "Audir, the smith of Crossglen, sold me an old, sturdy pickaxe."
msgstr "Audir, su ferreri de Crossglen, m'at bèndidu unu picu betzu e forte."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:90
msgid "I tore down the statue of Andor. Behind it in the wall I found a hole in the shape of a bone."
msgstr ""
"Apo fatu rùere s'istàtua de Andor. A palas, in su muru, apo agatadu "
"un'istampu a forma de ossu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:100
msgid "I have put a bone into the hole, and the wall crumbled to dust."
msgstr "Apo postu un'ossu in s'istampu, e su muru s'est fatu prùere."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:110
msgid "A torch could help to see in the dark. Unfortunately, the torch is so heavy, that I would have to lift it with both hands."
msgstr ""
"Una tortza diat pòdere agiudare a bìdere in s'iscuru. A dolu mannu, sa "
"tortza est gasi grae chi l'apo a dèpere artziare cun totu e duas sas manos."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:120
msgid "I found a platform with a good view over Crossglen. Andor seemed to have been here many times."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu logu artu cun una bella vista subra de Crossglen. Paret chi "
"Andor bi siat istadu medas bortas."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:130
msgid "I found Andor's hideout."
msgstr "Apo agatadu su cuadòrgiu de Andor."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:200
msgid ""
"I found an exit from the caves to the surface. Cold icy wind was swirling up here on the Black Water mountain top. \n"
"Astonishingly I wasn't alone here - Whootibarfag, a very old hermit seemed to have been waiting for me."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu un'essida dae sas grutas a sa superfìtzie. Inoghe in sa punta de "
"su Monte Abbaniedda b'aiat unu bentu de astra fritu chi giraiat. \n"
"A s'ispantu meu, non fia solu: Whootibarfag, un'eremita betzu meda, pariat "
"chi m'esseret isetende."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:210
msgid "Whootibarfag was delighted with my help in rescuing Rat King Rah's skeleton. As a thank you, he let me in on the secret of the rat escape. This increased my ability to flee."
msgstr ""
"Whootibarfag fiat cuntentu meda de s'agiudu meu pro sarvare s'ischèletru de "
"su Re de sos Sòrighes Rah. Pro mi ringratziare, m'at fatu connòschere su "
"segretu de comente fuint sos sòrighes. Custu at megioradu s'abilidade mea de "
"fuire."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:310
msgid "Wart, the warden to the halls of memory told me, that the access would be closed, until the rat memorial is restored. I should seek the bones of King Rah's skeleton."
msgstr ""
"Wart, su guardianu de sas salas de s'ammentu, m'at naradu chi s'intrada at a "
"abarrare serrada finas a cando su monumentu de sos sòrighes no at a èssere "
"torradu a postu. Dia dèpere chircare sos ossos de s'ischèletru de su Re Rah."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:320
msgid "Wart told me that he needed the head, the ribs and the back bone, 4 legs and the tail."
msgstr ""
"Wart m'at naradu chi li serbiant sa conca, sas costas e s'ischina, 4 ancas e "
"sa coa."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:321
msgid "Wart said that I just have to find the skull."
msgstr "Wart at naradu chi depo agatare petzi sa calavera."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:322
msgid "Wart said that I just have to find the back bone."
msgstr "Wart at naradu chi depo agatare petzi s'ischina."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:323
msgid "Wart said that I have to find the rib bones."
msgstr "Wart at naradu chi depo agatare sas costas."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:324
msgid "Wart said that I just have to find the tail."
msgstr "Wart at naradu chi depo agatare petzi sa coa."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:325
msgid "Wart said that I just have to find the fourth leg."
msgstr "Wart at naradu chi depo agatare petzi s'anca chi mancat, sa de bator."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:380
msgid "I donated King Rah's sword to the memory hall."
msgstr "Apo donadu s'ispada de su Re Rah a sa sala de s'ammentu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:381
msgid "I sold King Rah's sword to the memory hall."
msgstr "Apo bèndidu s'ispada de su Re Rah a sa sala de s'ammentu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:390
msgid "Wart was glad to have his rat memorial restored. He granted access to the memory hall now."
msgstr ""
"Wart fiat cuntentu ca su monumentu de sos sòrighes est istadu torradu a "
"postu. Como m'at permìtidu de intrare in sa sala de s'ammentu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:392
msgid "Wart told me that Fraedro was captured."
msgstr "Wart m'at naradu chi Fraedro est istadu leadu presoneri."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:395
msgid "Wart allowed me to go deeper into the cave and have a word with Fraedro."
msgstr ""
"Wart m'at permìtidu de andare prus a fundu in sa gruta e de faeddare unu "
"pagu cun Fraedro."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:398
msgid "I believed in Fraedro's innocence and released him."
msgstr "Apo crèidu chi Fraedro esseret innotzente e l'apo liberadu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:399
msgid "I attacked Fraedro to avenge the theft of King Rah."
msgstr "Apo atacadu a Fraedro pro vindicare sa fura de su Re Rah."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:400
msgid "I tried Fraedro's tiny golden key in a hole of the cavewall near to his prison. Immediatly the wall gave way to another passage."
msgstr ""
"Apo proadu sa crae de oro minuda de Fraedro in un'istampu de su muru de sa "
"gruta acanta de sa presone sua. Deretu su muru at lassadu logu a un'àteru "
"passàgiu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:900
msgid "I finally found the yellow artifact: It was a big round and smelly cheese! Golden yellow and so large that it would provide almost unlimited food. Clevred was overjoyed!"
msgstr ""
"A sa fine apo agatadu s'artefatu grogu: fiat unu casu mannu, tundu e cun unu "
"fragu forte! Grogu che oro e gasi mannu chi diat dare màndigu belle chene "
"lìmite. Clevred fiat cuntentu a beru meda!"

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:940
msgid "I told Clevred that I you couldn't help him further with the search. He then left me to search on his own."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Clevred chi no lu podia agiudare prus in sa chirca. Tando si "
"nch'est andadu a chircare a sa sola."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:942
msgid "Although I had told Clevred that I couldn't help him further with the search and he then left me, I met him in the caves again. I have decided to start the search again."
msgstr ""
"Mancari aia naradu a Clevred chi no lu podia agiudare prus in sa chirca e "
"issu si nche fiat andadu, l'apo torradu a atopare in sas grutas. Apo "
"detzìdidu de torrare a cumintzare sa chirca."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:948
msgid "The big yellow cheese now weighs heavily in my bag. Small consolation for the loss of a friend, though."
msgstr ""
"Su casu mannu e grogu como pesat meda in sa bussa mea. Ma est unu cunfortu "
"minore pro sa pèrdida de un'amigu."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:950
msgid ""
"I fought my way through the roundlings. But Clevred was seriously wounded in the fight. He was just able to give me his beloved artifact. \n"
"With a last breath he thanked me for my company and died in my arms."
msgstr ""
"Mi so abertu su caminu in mesu de sos tundeddos. Ma Clevred est istadu "
"feridu de manera grave in sa cumbata. Est resèssidu petzi a mi dare "
"s'artefatu suo istimadu. \n"
"Cun s'ùrtimu respiru m'at ringratziadu de sa cumpangia mea e est mortu in "
"bratzos mios."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:960
msgid "I persuaded Clevred to leave the artifact behind. Clevred obeyed disappointedly, but he left me on the spot."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumbintu a Clevred a lassare s'artefatu. Clevred at fatu su chi l'apo "
"naradu, delusu, ma m'at lassadu in cue matessi."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_quest:999
msgid "I fell asleep just in front of my bed. After long hours of deep and dreamless sleep I woke up - all the rats were gone! Was it only a dream?"
msgstr ""
"Mi so dormidu pròpiu in antis de su letu meu. A pustis de oras longas de unu "
"sonnu fungudu e chene sònnios mi so ischidadu: totu sos sòrighes si nche "
"fiant andados! Fiat petzi unu sònniu?"

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton
msgid "Skeleton brothers"
msgstr "Frades ischèletros"

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:41
msgid "Roskelt, the leader of a gang of skeletons, claimed to be king of the caves. He demanded that I would seek out his brother and bring him a message: if he came and surrendered, then he would have the grace of a quick, almost painless death."
msgstr ""
"Roskelt, su cabu de una banda de ischèletros, naraiat de èssere su re de sas "
"grutas. M'at pedidu de chircare a su frade e de li giùghere unu messàgiu: si "
"beniat e si rendiat, diat àere sa gràtzia de una morte lestra e belle chene "
"dolore."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:42
msgid "Bloskelt, the leader of a gang of skeletons, claimed to be king of the caves. He demanded that I would seek out his brother and bring him a message: if he came and surrendered, then he would have the grace of a quick, almost painless death."
msgstr ""
"Bloskelt, su cabu de una banda de ischèletros, naraiat de èssere su re de "
"sas grutas. M'at pedidu de chircare a su frade e de li giùghere unu "
"messàgiu: si beniat e si rendiat, diat àere sa gràtzia de una morte lestra e "
"belle chene dolore."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:51
msgid "Bloskelt, a leader of another gang of skeletons, also had claimed to be king of the caves. I delivered Roskelt's message, but earned nothing but laughter."
msgstr ""
"Bloskelt, su cabu de un'àtera banda de ischèletros, naraiat issu puru de "
"èssere su re de sas grutas. Apo giutu su messàgiu de Roskelt, ma non nd'apo "
"tentu àteru che risos."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:52
msgid "Roskelt, a leader of another gang of skeletons, also had claimed to be king of the caves. I delivered Bloskelt's message, but earned nothing but laughter."
msgstr ""
"Roskelt, su cabu de un'àtera banda de ischèletros, naraiat issu puru de "
"èssere su re de sas grutas. Apo giutu su messàgiu de Bloskelt, ma non nd'apo "
"tentu àteru che risos."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:61
msgid "Roskelt asked me to kill his brother."
msgstr "Roskelt m'at pedidu de ochìere a su frade."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:62
msgid "Bloskelt asked me to kill his brother."
msgstr "Bloskelt m'at pedidu de ochìere a su frade."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:71
msgid "I have killed Bloskelt."
msgstr "Apo ochidu a Bloskelt."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:72
msgid "I have killed Roskelt."
msgstr "Apo ochidu a Roskelt."

#: questlist_ratdom.json:ratdom_skeleton:90
msgid "For all my efforts, I've got a pretty poor reward."
msgstr "Pro totu sos isfortzos mios, apo tentu unu prèmiu pagu bonu meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men
msgid "Wanted men"
msgstr "Òmines chircados"

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:10
msgid "Off the main road, southeast of Deebo's Orchard, I've stumbled across a group of sketchy looking men with familiar voices."
msgstr ""
"A foras de s'àndala printzipale, a sud-est de s'Ortu de Deebo, apo atopadu "
"pro casu unu grupu de òmines de aspetu suspetosu cun boghes connotas."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:15
msgid "The sketchy looking men with familiar voices turned out to be the Aidem thieves from Sullengard. They were hiding-out in the woods."
msgstr ""
"Sos òmines de aspetu suspetosu cun boghes connotas fiant sos ladros de Aidem "
"de Sullengard. Si fiant cuende in su padente."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:20
msgid "While speaking with Defy, I've learned the he and his men have a grudge against the Thieves' Guild and they want to \"hit them where it really hurts\". Whatever that means."
msgstr ""
"Faeddende cun Defy, apo ischidu chi issu e sos òmines suos tenent rancore "
"contra a su Grèmiu de sos Ladros e chi los cherent \"corfire in ue lis "
"faghet prus male\". Chie ischit ite cheret nàrrere."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:25
msgid "Defy has revealed the location of the Thieves' Guild's vault of treasure - an underground storage unit accessible from the vacant house south of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Defy m'at naradu ue est sa càmera blindada de sos tesoros de su Grèmiu de "
"sos Ladros: unu depòsitu suta de terra a su cale si podet intrare dae sa "
"domo bòida a sud de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:30
msgid "Defy has asked me to convince Troublemaker to let me borrow the key long enough that I can bring it back to Defy."
msgstr ""
"Defy m'at pedidu de cumbìnchere a Chircabrigas a mi dare in prèstidu sa crae "
"pro su tempus chi bastat pro la giùghere a Defy."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:35
msgid "Defy has agreed to pay me 20 percent of the looted Thieves' Guild treasure if I get the key from Troublemaker and hand it over to him."
msgstr ""
"Defy at atzetadu de mi pagare su 20 pro chentu de su tesoro furadu a su "
"Grèmiu de sos Ladros si leo sa crae dae Chircabrigas e bi la dao."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:40
msgid "Defy has instructed me to bring Troublemaker's key to him at their new hideout located west of the Sutdover River, where the rail tracks end."
msgstr ""
"Defy m'at naradu de li giùghere sa crae de Chircabrigas a su cuadòrgiu nou "
"issoro, a otzidente de su Riu Sutdover, in ue acabbant sos binàrios."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:45
msgid "I have talked my way into acquiring the Thieves' Guild's vault key from Troublemaker, but I must return it to him quickly after I am done with it."
msgstr ""
"Faeddende bene, so resèssidu a otènnere dae Chircabrigas sa crae de sa "
"càmera blindada de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros, ma bi la depo torrare luego "
"cando apo a àere acabbadu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:50
msgid "I told Troublemaker all that I knew about Defy, his men, and the \"Lost Traveler\", Alaric and how they hired me to help rob the Thieves' Guild."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Chircabrigas totu su chi ischia de Defy, de sos òmines suos e "
"de su \"Biagiante pèrdidu\", Alaric, e de comente m'aiant pagadu pro los "
"agiudare a furare a su Grèmiu de sos Ladros."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:55
msgid "Troublemaker has asked me to help him trap Defy by providing Defy with a fake key. When Defy arrives at the secret vault, the Guild members will be waiting for him."
msgstr ""
"Chircabrigas m'at pedidu de l'agiudare a pònnere una trampa a Defy dende·li "
"una crae farsa. Cando Defy at a arribare a sa càmera blindada segreta, sos "
"membros de su Grèmiu l'ant a èssere isetende."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:56
msgid ""
"I gave Defy the fake version of the vault key that Troublemaker gave me. In return, Defy has given me a fake version of Troublemaker's vault key and has instructed me to return it to Troublemaker.\n"
"Defy then told me to report back to the vault in order to collect my share of the gold. He has no idea that the key I gave him is a fake."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Defy sa versione farsa de sa crae de sa càmera blindada chi m'at "
"dadu Chircabrigas. In càmbiu, Defy m'at dadu una versione farsa de sa crae "
"de Chircabrigas e m'at naradu de la torrare a Chircabrigas.\n"
"A pustis Defy m'at naradu de torrare a sa càmera blindada pro leare sa parte "
"mea de s'oro. No ischit chi sa crae chi l'apo dadu est farsa."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:57
msgid "I have reported back to the vacant house and I met Rennik there. He informed me that the Thieves' Guild has apprehended all five men and that they are now in the Guild jail."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a sa domo bòida e in cue apo atopadu a Rennik. M'at naradu chi su "
"Grèmiu de sos Ladros at arrestadu totu sos chimbe òmines e chi como sunt in "
"sa presone de su Grèmiu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:60
msgid "Defy has given me a fake version of Troublemaker's vault key and has instructed me to return it to Troublemaker. Then I should report back to the vault in order to collect my share of the gold."
msgstr ""
"Defy m'at dadu una versione farsa de sa crae de Chircabrigas e m'at naradu "
"de la torrare a Chircabrigas. A pustis dia dèpere torrare a sa càmera "
"blindada pro leare sa parte mea de s'oro."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:65
msgid "I have given the fake Aidem key to Troublemaker as a replacement for the real vault key."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Chircabrigas sa crae farsa de Aidem in logu de sa crae bera de sa "
"càmera blindada."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:70
msgid "I reported back to Defy and he rewarded me with 25000 gold."
msgstr "So torradu dae Defy e m'at premiadu cun 25000 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:75
msgid "I told Defy that I was keeping the key for myself and plan to loot the Thieves' Guild's vault myself. A fight ensued."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Defy chi mi tenia sa crae e chi tenia in mente de isboidare deo "
"sa càmera blindada de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros. Est cumintzada una cumbata."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:76
msgid "I have killed Defy, his three henchmen and Alaric. I really should go back to Fallhaven and talk to Troublemaker again."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu a Defy, a sos tres òmines suos e a Alaric. Dia dèpere a beru "
"torrare a Fallhaven e torrare a faeddare cun Chircabrigas."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:77
msgid "I've unlocked the hatch leading to the vault. It's time to head down."
msgstr ""
"Apo abertu sa trapa chi giughet a sa càmera blindada. Est ora de falare."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wanted_men:80
msgid "I informed Troublemaker that Defy and his men are now dead."
msgstr "Apo naradu a Chircabrigas chi Defy e sos òmines suos como sunt mortos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch
msgid "A Wicked witch"
msgstr "Una coga mala"

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:10
msgid "Bela, the Fallhaven tavern keeper heard from a customer about a possible kidnapping of a girl. I should ask around town if anyone knows more."
msgstr ""
"Bela, sa mere de su tzilleri de Fallhaven, at intesu dae unu cliente chi "
"forsis ant secuestradu una pitzinna. Dia dèpere preguntare in sa bidda si "
"calicunu nde ischit de prus."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:20
msgid "The \"busy farmer\", in the southeastern part of Fallhaven knows something about the witch."
msgstr ""
"Su \"massaju ocupadu\", in sa parte sud-est de Fallhaven, ischit calicuna "
"cosa de sa coga."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:30
msgid "The \"busy farmer\" and his best friend, Addie, were kept captive by the witch a very long time ago when they were just kids. He never saw Addie again."
msgstr ""
"Su \"massaju ocupadu\" e s'amiga sua prus istimada, Addie, fiant istados "
"presoneris de sa coga tempus meda a como, cando fiant petzi pitzinnos. No at "
"mai prus bidu a Addie."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:40
msgid "The \"busy farmer\" told me that the witch's house is just south of Fallhaven. Covered in beautiful flowers."
msgstr ""
"Su \"massaju ocupadu\" m'at naradu chi sa domo de sa coga est pròpiu a sud "
"de Fallhaven. Totu coberta de frores bellos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:50
msgid "After meeting Bonicksa, the wicked witch, I decided to let her live and she did likewise, but not before leaving me with a very cryptic response. Saying I was \"confident in my path\" and that \"we shall see\". I wonder what that meant?"
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere atopadu a Bonicksa, sa coga mala, apo detzìdidu de la "
"lassare bìvere e issa at fatu su matessi, ma no in antis de mi lassare una "
"risposta misteriosa meda. M'at naradu chi fia \"seguru de su caminu meu\" e "
"chi \"amus a bìdere\". Ite at a chèrrere nàrrere?"

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:55
msgid "I have attacked Bonicksa."
msgstr "Apo atacadu a Bonicksa."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:60
msgid "I killed what I thought was Bonicksa, but I quickly realized that I killed an innocent girl."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu cussa chi pensaia chi fiat Bonicksa, ma luego mi nde so abbigiadu "
"chi aia ochidu una pitzinna innotzente."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:65
msgid "I \"killed\" Bonicksa again, only for her to reappear."
msgstr "Apo \"ochidu\" torra a Bonicksa, ma est torrada a aparèssere."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:70
msgid "Bonicksa lives and could not be defeated. But I learned a huge life lesson."
msgstr ""
"Bonicksa est bia e no la podia bìnchere. Ma apo imparadu una letzione de "
"vida manna."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:80
msgid "I discovered a young girl named Emmeline just behind the 'wicked witch's' house. The witch was really Emmeline under a spell from Bonicksa."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu una pitzinna giòvana chi si narat Emmeline pròpiu a palas de "
"sa domo de sa 'coga mala'. Sa coga fiat in realidade Emmeline, suta de "
"un'incantu de Bonicksa."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:85
msgid "Emmeline asked me to get her \"a lot\" of those \"Tonics of Blood\"."
msgstr ""
"Emmeline m'at pedidu de li giùghere \"meda\" de cussos \"Tònicos de "
"sàmbene\"."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:90
msgid "Emmeline told me to head east of the witch's house to find the undead that know about the 'Tonic of Blood'."
msgstr ""
"Emmeline m'at naradu de andare a oriente de sa domo de sa coga pro agatare "
"sos non-mortos chi ischint calicuna cosa de su 'Tònicu de sàmbene'."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:95
msgid "I gave Emmeline 25 of the \"Tonics of Blood\" that she asked for and she was then able to leave that terrible place."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Emmeline 25 de sos \"Tònicos de sàmbene\" chi m'aiat pedidu e "
"gasi at pòdidu lassare cussu logu terrìbile."

#: questlist_mt_galmore.json:wicked_witch:96
msgid "I gave Emmeline 20 of the 25 \"Tonics of Blood\" that she asked for and she was then able to leave that terrible place."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Emmeline 20 de sos 25 \"Tònicos de sàmbene\" chi m'aiat pedidu e "
"gasi at pòdidu lassare cussu logu terrìbile."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence
msgid "It makes no fence"
msgstr "Cresuras chene sentidu"

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:10
msgid "I found Tunlon, a sheep farmer, on the hill next to Crossglen. He asked me to help him get some wood for new fences. Since Crossglen doesn't have a lumberjack, I should go to Fallhaven and ask there."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu a Tunlon, unu pastore de berbeghes, in su montigru acanta de "
"Crossglen. M'at pedidu de l'agiudare a agatare unu pagu de linna pro "
"cresuras noas. Dae chi in Crossglen non b'at linnadores, dia dèpere andare a "
"Fallhaven e preguntare in cue."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:12
msgid "Tunlon got furious when he saw that I killed his sheep."
msgstr ""
"Tunlon s'est arrennegadu a mortu cando at bidu chi apo ochidu sas berbeghes "
"suas."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:20
msgid "I talked to Fallhaven's woodcutter. He told me that he had done a lot of work lately and therefore can't get any more wood for me. However, I should ask the woodcutters near Crossroads Guardhouse if they can help me."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun su linnadore de Fallhaven. M'at naradu chi dae pagu at "
"traballadu meda e duncas non podet agatare àtera linna pro mene. Però, dia "
"dèpere preguntare a sos linnadores acanta de su Corpu de guàrdia de sa "
"Rugrada si mi podent agiudare."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:30
msgid "The woodcutters told me that they have a lot of wood after clearing out the field around them, however all they have is firewood. Apparently this is not suitable for making fences. I should explain this to Tunlon."
msgstr ""
"Sos linnadores m'ant naradu chi tenent meda linna a pustis de àere limpiadu "
"su campu a inghìriu issoro, ma totu su chi tenent est linna de fogu. A su "
"chi paret custa no andat bene pro fàghere cresuras. Lu dia dèpere ispiegare "
"a Tunlon."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:32
msgid "Hadracor opened up a passage to the south, so I wouldn't have to take the long way up to Tunlon any more."
msgstr ""
"Hadracor at abertu unu passàgiu cara a su sud, gasi no apo a dèpere prus "
"fàghere su caminu longu pro artziare finas a Tunlon."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:40
msgid "I talked to Tunlon again and he told me to talk to his brother Tinlyn if he knew any person who could help me out."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a faeddare cun Tunlon e m'at naradu de faeddare cun su frade "
"Tinlyn, pro ischire si connoschet a calicunu chi mi potzat agiudare."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:100
msgid "Tinlyn was glad to meet me. He said that Loneford had a woodcutter who could maybe help me out."
msgstr ""
"Tinlyn fiat cuntentu de mi connòschere. At naradu chi in Loneford b'aiat unu "
"linnadore chi forsis mi podiat agiudare."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:110
msgid "Tinlyn wasn't really happy to see me. However, he told me to go to Loneford."
msgstr ""
"Tinlyn non fiat pròpiu cuntentu de mi bìdere. Però, m'at naradu de andare a "
"Loneford."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:150
msgid "In Loneford, I met a villager who told me he had some spare fences made. I should bring them to Tunlon."
msgstr ""
"In Loneford, apo atopadu unu biddaju chi m'at naradu chi teniat unas cantas "
"cresuras fatas de prus. Las dia dèpere giùghere a Tunlon."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:200
msgid "Tunlon took a close look at the fences I brought him, but he didn't like them a lot. The fence posts were too short he said. I should go back and ask for taller ones."
msgstr ""
"Tunlon at abbaidadu bene sas cresuras chi l'apo batidu, ma non li sunt "
"pràghidas meda. Sos palos de sa cresura fiant tropu curtzos, at naradu. Dia "
"dèpere torrare e pedire cresuras prus artas."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:210
msgid "The woodcutter in Loneford however said he couldn't make any fences, as he just cuts the wood. He recommended giving Brimhaven's woodcutter a visit, as he thinks that he can do some basic woodwork."
msgstr ""
"Però su linnadore de Loneford at naradu chi non podiat fàghere cresuras, ca "
"issu segat petzi sa linna. M'at cussigiadu de andare a bìdere su linnadore "
"de Brimhaven, ca pensat chi podet fàghere traballos de linna sèmplitzes."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:220
msgid "I gave the woodcutter in Brimhaven a visit and he told me to bring some wood, so the craftsman can make fences out of it. Loneford's woodcutter should have plenty, so I should go back and ask him for wood."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a bìdere su linnadore de Brimhaven e m'at naradu de giùghere unu "
"pagu de linna, gasi su maistru de linna nde podet fàghere cresuras. Su "
"linnadore de Loneford nde diat dèpere tènnere meda, e duncas dia dèpere "
"torrare e li pedire linna."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:230
msgid "I got a pile of wood for the fences."
msgstr "Apo leadu unu muntone de linna pro sas cresuras."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:235
msgid "I gave the wood to the woodcraftsman in Brimhaven."
msgstr "Apo dadu sa linna a su maistru de linna de Brimhaven."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:240
msgid "Brimhaven's wood craftsman sold me some nice looking fences."
msgstr ""
"Su maistru de linna de Brimhaven m'at bèndidu unas cantas cresuras de bellu "
"aspetu."

#: questlist_bwmfill.json:tunlon_fence:250
msgid "Tunlon was happy to see the fences I brought him. These should be just fine, he said."
msgstr ""
"Tunlon fiat cuntentu de bìdere sas cresuras chi l'apo batidu. Custas andant "
"bene, at naradu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector
msgid "The odd coin collector"
msgstr "Su colletzionista istranu de monedas"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:10
msgid "I traded 5 of my 'mermaid coins' to Gylew for 500 gold."
msgstr ""
"Apo cambiadu 5 de sas 'monedas de sirena' meas cun Gylew pro 500 monedas de "
"oro."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:11
msgid "I foolishly gave 5 of my 'mermaid coins' to Gylew."
msgstr "Comente unu tontu, apo dadu a Gylew 5 de sas 'monedas de sirena' meas."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:20
msgid "I have agreed to set off to Laeroth Manor in pursuit of the Korhald coins and to bring them back to Gylew."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de partire pro su palatzu de Laeroth in chirca de sas monedas "
"de Korhald e de las giùghere a Gylew."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:12
msgid "I sold the 10 coins that I looted from the Arulir secret room to Gylew."
msgstr ""
"Apo bèndidu a Gylew sas 10 monedas chi apo leadu dae s'aposentu segretu de "
"Arulir."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:13
msgid "I gave Gylew the 10 coins that I looted from the Arulir secret room."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Gylew sas 10 monedas chi apo leadu dae s'aposentu segretu de "
"Arulir."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:30
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I noticed a sign on the wall that i could not read in its entirety, but I was able make out the name 'Korhald'. This makes me wonder if this is a clue?"
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, apo notadu unu cartellu in su muru chi no apo "
"pòdidu lèghere totu, ma so resèssidu a cumprèndere su nòmine 'Korhald'. "
"Custu mi faghet pensare: est un'inditu?"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:40
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I discovered and looted the chest containing the 'Korhald coins'."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, apo iscobertu sa càscia cun sas 'monedas de "
"Korhald' e l'apo isboidada."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:41
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I encountered an injured man named Forenza."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, apo atopadu un'òmine feridu chi si narat Forenza."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:42
msgid "I aided Forenza with an ointment for bleeding wounds."
msgstr "Apo agiudadu a Forenza cun un'untura pro feridas sambenosas."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:43
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I was able to help out Forenza by giving him a bonemeal potion."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, so resèssidu a agiudare a Forenza dende·li una "
"potzione de farina de ossos."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:44
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I was able to help out Forenza by giving him a major health potion."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, so resèssidu a agiudare a Forenza dende·li una "
"potzione de salude majore."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:46
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I was able to help out Forenza by giving him a potion of health from Lodar."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, so resèssidu a agiudare a Forenza dende·li una "
"potzione de salude de Lodar."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:47
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I was able to help out Forenza by giving him a regular health potion."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, so resèssidu a agiudare a Forenza dende·li una "
"potzione de salude normale."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:48
msgid "In the Laeroth basement, I was able to help out Forenza by giving him a minor health potion."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de Laeroth, so resèssidu a agiudare a Forenza dende·li una "
"potzione de salude minore."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:50
msgid "I've decided to help Forenza by agreeing to get the second key from Gylew. I should go back to Gylew now. Forenza has left the Manor island and has asked that I meet him outside of Brimhaven after my \"business\" with Gylew is complete."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de agiudare a Forenza atzetende de leare sa segunda crae dae "
"Gylew. Como dia dèpere torrare dae Gylew. Forenza at lassadu s'ìsula de su "
"palatzu e m'at pedidu de l'atopare in foras de Brimhaven cando apo a àere "
"acabbadu sos \"afàrios\" mios cun Gylew."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:45
msgid "I have decided to attack Forenza. I should return to Gylew with the key once he is dead."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de atacare a Forenza. Dia dèpere torrare dae Gylew cun sa crae "
"cando at a èssere mortu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:60
msgid "We discovered a mysterious map inside the Korhald chest and I need to follow the river going east."
msgstr ""
"Amus iscobertu una mapa misteriosa in intro de sa càscia de Korhald e depo "
"sighire su riu chi andat a oriente."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:62
msgid "I have decided to attack Gylew. I should return to Forenza with the key once he is dead."
msgstr ""
"Apo detzìdidu de atacare a Gylew. Dia dèpere torrare dae Forenza cun sa crae "
"cando at a èssere mortu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:63
msgid "I killed Gylew and should return to Forenza with Gylew's key."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu a Gylew e dia dèpere torrare dae Forenza cun sa crae de Gylew."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:65
msgid "Inside the Korhald cave, I found the Coin of Prestige and the Shield of the Brave. I should return to Forenza and show him the coin."
msgstr ""
"In intro de sa gruta de Korhald, apo agatadu sa Moneda de su Prestìgiu e "
"s'Iscudu de su Balente. Dia dèpere torrare dae Forenza e li mustrare sa "
"moneda."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:66
msgid "Inside the Korhald cave, I found the Coin of Prestige and the Shield of the Brave. I should return to Gylew and show him the coin."
msgstr ""
"In intro de sa gruta de Korhald, apo agatadu sa Moneda de su Prestìgiu e "
"s'Iscudu de su Balente. Dia dèpere torrare dae Gylew e li mustrare sa moneda."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:100
msgid "I sold Gylew the Coin of Prestige and he rewarded me handsomely for it."
msgstr ""
"Apo bèndidu a Gylew sa Moneda de su Prestìgiu e m'at dadu una bella "
"recumpensa."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:105
msgid "I gave Gylew the Coin of Prestige and he told me that if I ever make my way to Feygrad, to seek out his family and they will 'make that shield a little bit better\". Whatever that means."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Gylew sa Moneda de su Prestìgiu e m'at naradu chi, si mai arribo "
"a Feygard, depo chircare sa famìlia sua e chi issos ant a 'fàghere cussu "
"iscudu unu pagu mègius'. Chie ischit ite cheret nàrrere."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:110
msgid "I sold Forenza the Coin of Prestige and he rewarded me handsomely for it."
msgstr ""
"Apo bèndidu a Forenza sa Moneda de su Prestìgiu e m'at dadu una bella "
"recumpensa."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:odd_coin_collector:115
msgid "I gave Forenza the Coin of Prestige and he told me that if I ever make my way to Brightport, to seek out his family and they will 'reward\" me. Whatever that means."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Forenza sa Moneda de su Prestìgiu e m'at naradu chi, si mai "
"arribo a Portu Lughente, depo chircare sa famìlia sua e chi issos m'ant a "
"dare una 'recumpensa'. Chie ischit ite cheret nàrrere."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker
msgid "Take care of the caretaker"
msgstr "Pensa a su custode"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:10
msgid "I met a caretaker at Laeroth manor. He said he cannot leave because he is bound by an oath, but not one he ever gave."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu unu custode in su palatzu de Laeroth. M'at naradu chi non si nde "
"podet andare ca est ligadu a unu giuramentu, ma no a unu giuramentu chi apat "
"mai fatu issu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:15
msgid "The caretaker said that he feels honor bound by a pledge that his great-great grandfather made many years ago."
msgstr ""
"Su custode m'at naradu chi si sentit ligadu pro onore a una promissa chi su "
"babbu de su bisaju suo aiat fatu medas annos a como."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:17
msgid "Moriath told me only the past lords can release him from the oath, but they are dead. He suggested I look in the library for information about how to talk to them."
msgstr ""
"Moriath m'at naradu chi petzi sos sennores de su passadu lu podent liberare "
"dae su giuramentu, ma sunt mortos. M'at cussigiadu de chircare in sa "
"biblioteca informatziones subra de comente faeddare cun issos."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:20
msgid "I have learned the chant needed to send spirits back to their rest on the other side."
msgstr ""
"Apo imparadu su cantu chi serbit pro torrare a mandare sos ispìritos a su "
"pasu issoro in s'àtera parte."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:30
msgid "I have learned how to raise the spirits of the dead with the help of an oegyth crystal. But I also need a personal item. I should talk to Moriath again."
msgstr ""
"Apo imparadu comente evocare sos ispìritos de sos mortos cun s'agiudu de unu "
"cristallu de oegyth. Ma mi serbit fintzas un'ogetu personale. Dia dèpere "
"torrare a faeddare cun Moriath."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:35
msgid "Moriath suggested I search the master bedroom for a personal item from the last lord, Verigil."
msgstr ""
"Moriath m'at cussigiadu de chircare in s'aposentu de letu printzipale "
"un'ogetu personale de s'ùrtimu sennore, Verigil."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:40
msgid "Verigil told me he could not release the Caretaker from his oath, because he is from the wrong branch of the family. I must talk to his uncle, Eyvipa. He has gone back to his rest."
msgstr ""
"Verigil m'at naradu chi non podiat liberare su custode dae su giuramentu "
"suo, ca issu est de su ramu isballiadu de sa famìlia. Depo faeddare cun su "
"tziu suo, Eyvipa. Est torradu a su pasu suo."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:50
msgid "Moriath suggested I look for an item with \"E\" engraved on it. This would have belonged to Eyvipa."
msgstr ""
"Moriath m'at cussigiadu de chircare un'ogetu cun una \"E\" isculpida. Custu "
"diat èssere istadu de Eyvipa."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:60
msgid "I have found an expensive looking candlestick with \"E\" engraved on it. This must have belonged to Eyvipa."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unu candeleri chi paret de valore, cun una \"E\" isculpida. "
"Depet èssere istadu de Eyvipa."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:70
msgid "Eyvipa was angry that I woke him from his rest. He refused to help me because his father passed him over, and made his younger brother, Cuned, lord. I had to send him back to his rest with the chant \"estray inyay eacepay\"."
msgstr ""
"Eyvipa fiat arrennegadu ca l'aia ischidadu dae su pasu suo. At refudadu de "
"m'agiudare ca su babbu l'aiat lassadu a una parte e aiat fatu sennore a su "
"frade prus piticu, Cuned. L'apo dèpidu torrare a mandare a su pasu suo cun "
"su cantu \"estray inyay eacepay\"."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:80
msgid "I found a diary that must have belonged to Cuned."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu diàriu chi depet èssere istadu de Cuned."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:90
msgid "Cuned told me that Verigil is correct, and he cannot release the caretaker from his oath because he is from the wrong branch of the family. I must talk to his father, Jerelin."
msgstr ""
"Cuned m'at naradu chi Verigil at resone, e chi issu non podet liberare su "
"custode dae su giuramentu suo ca est de su ramu isballiadu de sa famìlia. "
"Depo faeddare cun su babbu suo, Jerelin."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:100
msgid "After much searching I found a seal for Jerelin in an old chest. I must go back to the tomb again."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere chircadu meda, apo agatadu unu sigillu de Jerelin in una "
"càscia betza. Depo torrare a sa tumba."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:110
msgid "Jerelin ignored me, and went back to his resting place. I will have to ask Cuned again what to do."
msgstr ""
"Jerelin non m'at dadu cara e est torradu a su logu de pasu suo. Apo a dèpere "
"torrare a preguntare a Cuned ite fàghere."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:120
msgid "Cuned told me to speak to his mother, Audela. Jerelin didn't listen to many people, but he listened to her."
msgstr ""
"Cuned m'at naradu de faeddare cun sa mama sua, Audela. Jerelin non daiat a "
"mente a medas persones, ma a issa li daiat a mente."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:130
msgid "I have found what appears to be a jewelry box, with \"A\" inscribed on it. It is locked though, and too heavy to move to the tomb."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una cosa chi paret un'iscàtula de sas prendas, cun una \"A\" "
"isculpida. Però est serrada a crae, e est tropu grae pro la giùghere a sa "
"tumba."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:140
msgid "I have found a key in the bedroom."
msgstr "Apo agatadu una crae in s'aposentu de letu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:150
msgid "The key fitted the jewelry box! Inside I found a necklace \"With love to Audela\" written on the back."
msgstr ""
"Sa crae est bona pro s'iscàtula de sas prendas! A intro b'apo agatadu una "
"collana cun iscritu a palas \"Cun amore, a Audela\"."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:160
msgid "Audela told me to talk to Jerelin again, but tell him Audela wants this done."
msgstr ""
"Audela m'at naradu de torrare a faeddare cun Jerelin, ma de li nàrrere chi "
"est Audela chi cheret chi si fatzat custu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:170
msgid "I spoke to Jerelin again, and told him of Audela's wishes. He told me he will release the caretaker, but with a condition. The caretakers last act must be to move his grave away from that of his nagging wife."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a faeddare cun Jerelin e li apo naradu su chi cheret Audela. "
"M'at naradu chi at a liberare su custode, ma a una cunditzione: s'ùrtimu atu "
"de su custode depet èssere de tramudare sa tumba sua a tesu dae sa de sa "
"mugere, chi no l'aiat mai lassadu in pasu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:laeroth_caretaker:180
msgid "I told the caretaker what he has to do to be released from the oath. He thanked me, and agreed to do it."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a su custode su chi depet fàghere pro èssere liberadu dae su "
"giuramentu. M'at ringratziadu e at atzetadu de lu fàghere."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord
msgid "The last lord of Laeroth"
msgstr "S'ùrtimu sennore de Laeroth"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:10
msgid "Before I leave Laeroth, perhaps I should try to find out where the last Lord went. Maybe there are clues somewhere in the manor."
msgstr ""
"In antis de mi nde andare dae Laeroth, forsis dia dèpere chircare de ischire "
"a ue est andadu s'ùrtimu sennore. Forsis b'at indìtzios in calicunu logu de "
"su palatzu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:15
msgid "I didn't really care about where the last lord went. I left this place, and whatever happened to him didn't make any difference to me."
msgstr ""
"A beru non m'importaiat a ue fiat andadu s'ùrtimu sennore. Mi nde so andadu "
"dae custu logu, e su chi li esseret sutzèdidu, pro mene fiat su matessi."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:20
msgid "I searched the caretakers room, and found a letter from \"Adakin\". It says he is leaving to explore his future, but little more than that except that it mentions a chest that contains a diary and other things he could not take with him. I should look for this chest."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu in s'aposentu de su custode e apo agatadu una lìtera de "
"\"Adakin\". Narat chi si nde andat pro iscobèrrere su benidore suo, ma non "
"narat meda de prus, a parte chi mentovat una càscia chi cuntenet unu diàriu "
"e àteras cosas chi no at pòdidu leare cun issu. Dia dèpere chircare custa "
"càscia."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:30
msgid "I have found a chest, with an inscription \"Adakin\" on the top. It is locked though, so I need to find the key. Hopefully he did not take it with him."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una càscia cun s'iscritzione \"Adakin\" in subra. Però est "
"serrada a crae, e duncas depo agatare sa crae. Ispero chi non si l'apat "
"leada cun issu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:40
msgid "I have found a key that looks like it should fit Adakin's chest."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una crae chi paret chi depat èssere sa de sa càscia de Adakin."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:50
msgid "I have opened Adakin's chest. There are some useful items in here, as well as his diary. The diary has a lock though, so it seems I must find a small key that fits this lock."
msgstr ""
"Apo abertu sa càscia de Adakin. B'at unos cantos ogetos ùtiles, e fintzas su "
"diàriu suo. Però su diàriu tenet una serradura, e duncas paret chi depo "
"agatare una crae pitica chi andet bene pro custa serradura."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:60
msgid "I have found a jeweled key that looks like it might be for the diary. Time to try it."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una crae cun gemmas chi paret chi potzat èssere sa de su diàriu. "
"Est ora de la proare."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:last_lord:70
msgid "The key unlocked the diary. The final entry did not really give an answer, except that he intended to go to either Nor City or Feygard, but had yet to decide which. Perhaps I will meet him some day."
msgstr ""
"Sa crae at abertu su diàriu. S'ùrtima nota non daiat una risposta a beru, a "
"parte chi teniat in mente de andare a Nor City o a Feygard, ma no aiat galu "
"detzìdidu a cale de sas duas. Forsis una die l'apo a atopare."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:brute_creator
msgid "Brutes"
msgstr "Bestiones"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:brute_creator:10
msgid "I have met Bidro, a fisherman on the long way to Remgard. He wondered why only few people come along nowadays."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Bidro, unu piscadore in su caminu longu pro Remgard. Si "
"preguntaiat pro ite oe in die passant gasi pagas persones."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:brute_creator:20
msgid "I told Bidro about the many nasty monsters along the way."
msgstr "Apo contadu a Bidro de sos tantos mostros malos chi b'at in su caminu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:brute_creator:35
msgid "Then I have told Bidro about this cave full of brutes."
msgstr "A pustis apo contadu a Bidro de custa gruta prena de bestiones."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:brute_creator:40
msgid "I have talked to Os, a scientist about brute matters. He has built up a brute production facility."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Os, un'iscientziadu, de chistiones de bestiones. At "
"fraigadu una fàbrica de bestiones."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:brute_creator:90
msgid "I told Bidro what I have learned from Os. He thanked me for this new story he could tell his wife."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Bidro su chi apo imparadu dae Os. M'at ringratziadu pro custa "
"istòria noa chi podiat contare a sa mugere."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer
msgid "Shadow of the torturer"
msgstr "S'umbra de su turmentadore"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:5
msgid "In the dungeon of the mansion I found some ghosts of prisoners. One of them told me their story."
msgstr ""
"In sas presones de su palatzu apo agatadu unos cantos pantasmas de "
"presoneris. Unu de issos m'at contadu s'istòria issoro."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:10
msgid "I have agreed to help the spirits in the prison be free of the prison torturer."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare sos ispìritos de sa presone a èssere lìberos dae su "
"turmentadore de sa presone."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:20
msgid "I didn't want to help the spirits in the prison be free of the prison torturer."
msgstr ""
"No apo chertu agiudare sos ispìritos de sa presone a èssere lìberos dae su "
"turmentadore de sa presone."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:25
msgid "Kotheses the torturer offered to teach me his art, as he had done for Andor before."
msgstr ""
"Kotheses, su turmentadore, m'at propostu de m'imparare s'arte sua, comente "
"aiat fatu in antis cun Andor."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:30
msgid "I accepted his offer to apprentice with him."
msgstr "Apo atzetadu sa proposta sua de mi fàghere dischente suo."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:35
msgid "Kotheses gave me an Oegyth crystal."
msgstr "Kotheses m'at dadu unu cristallu de oegyth."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:40
msgid "In order to imprison the released prisoners again, I should call the demon guard by throwing an Oegyth crystal into the abyss."
msgstr ""
"Pro torrare a pònnere in presone sos presoneris liberados, dia dèpere mutire "
"sa guàrdia de sos dimònios ghetende unu cristallu de oegyth in s'abissu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:50
msgid "Kotheses scolded me because I killed his precious demons."
msgstr ""
"Kotheses m'at fatu sa briga ca apo ochidu sos dimònios suos tantu istimados."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:60
msgid "I declined the offer to become his apprentice."
msgstr "Apo refudadu sa proposta de mi fàghere dischente suo."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:70
msgid "Kotheses attacked me."
msgstr "Kotheses m'at atacadu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:80
msgid "I told the prisoners that I had killed their torturer. Now they could get peace."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a sos presoneris chi aia ochidu su turmentadore issoro. Como "
"podiant agatare sa paghe."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:100
msgid "I have thrown an Oegyth crystal down into the abyss to call for the dark watch."
msgstr ""
"Apo ghetadu unu cristallu de oegyth in s'abissu pro mutire sos bardianos "
"iscuros."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:110
msgid "I got back the Oegyth crystal from the chief of the Demon guard."
msgstr ""
"Apo recuperadu su cristallu de oegyth dae su cabu de sa guàrdia de sos "
"dimònios."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:114
msgid "I ordered the demons to watch over the prisoners."
msgstr "Apo ordinadu a sos dimònios de bardiare sos presoneris."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:120
msgid "I took my leave from Kotheses, who, incidentally, forgot to reclaim his Oegyth crystal."
msgstr ""
"Apo saludadu a Kotheses, chi, pro casu, at ismentigadu de mi torrare a "
"pedire su cristallu de oegyth suo."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_torturer:130
msgid "Everything was in order when I left. The prisoners were back in their cells, and the Demon guard were on duty again."
msgstr ""
"Totu fiat in òrdine cando mi nde so andadu. Sos presoneris fiant torra in "
"sas tzellas issoro, e sa guàrdia de sos dimònios fiat torra in servìtziu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs
msgid "Not Pony Island"
msgstr "No est s'ìsula de sos caddigheddos"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:10
msgid "The island west of Remgard was inhabited by centaurs who were very angry about your visit. They told me to seek out their leader, Thalos. He should be in the northeast of the island."
msgstr ""
"S'ìsula a otzidente de Remgard fiat abitada dae tzentàuros chi fiant "
"arrennegados meda pro sa bìsita mea. M'ant naradu de chircare su cabu "
"issoro, Thalos. Diat dèpere èssere in su nord-est de s'ìsula."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:20
msgid "I have met Thalos."
msgstr "Apo atopadu a Thalos."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:30
msgid "He ordered me to slay a foul creature that hides in a cave on the hills of Laeroth Island, because the centaurs can't enter it."
msgstr ""
"M'at ordinadu de ochìere una creadura ischifosa chi si cuat in una gruta in "
"sos montigros de s'Ìsula de Laeroth, ca sos tzentàuros non bi podent intrare."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:110
msgid "In the cave entrance I have met Algangror, who asked for help."
msgstr ""
"In s'intrada de sa gruta apo atopadu a Algangror, chi m'at pedidu agiudu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:112
msgid "In a cave entrance I have met Jhaeld of Remgard, who asked for help."
msgstr ""
"In s'intrada de una gruta apo atopadu a Jhaeld de Remgard, chi m'at pedidu "
"agiudu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:120
msgid "A common friend would be trapped deeper in the cave and I should free him."
msgstr ""
"Un'amigu chi tenimus in comunu diat èssere presu prus a fundu in sa gruta, e "
"lu dia dèpere liberare."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:130
msgid "Down in the cave I have found my brother Andor, locked in a room with no doors or other entrances."
msgstr ""
"In fundu a sa gruta apo agatadu a frade meu Andor, serradu in un'aposentu "
"chene ghennas ne àteras intradas."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:140
msgid ""
"To open an entrance I had to find the four scrolls of elements and the three color globes. These were hidden all over the island.\n"
"The scrolls and globes would need to be properly placed around Andor's golden prison."
msgstr ""
"Pro abèrrere un'intrada depia agatare sas bator pergamenas de sos elementos "
"e sos tres globos de colore. Fiant cuados in totu s'ìsula.\n"
"Sas pergamenas e sos globos depiant èssere postos in su logu giustu a "
"inghìriu de sa presone de oro de Andor."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:150
msgid "The wall opened and gave access to the interior of the room."
msgstr "Su muru s'est abertu e at dadu atzessu a s'internu de s'aposentu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:160
msgid "With an intense sound, the wall built up again. I've been locked up!"
msgstr ""
"Cun unu sonu fortes meda, su muru s'est torradu a pesare. So abarradu "
"serradu a intro!"

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:170
#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:180
msgid "The only way out was down a staircase, which, however, seemed to be magically secured."
msgstr ""
"S'ùnica essida fiat una iscala chi calaiat a bàsciu, chi però pariat "
"amparada dae un'incantu."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:190
msgid "It was no problem going downstairs, but something was wrong there."
msgstr ""
"Calare a bàsciu no est istadu unu problema, ma b'aiat calicuna cosa chi no "
"andaiat bene."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:200
msgid "The whole thing was just a big scam to lure me into this cave to serve Dorhantarh as dinner."
msgstr ""
"Totu custu fiat petzi un'ingannu mannu pro m'atirare a custa gruta e mi "
"serbire a Dorhantarh pro chena."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:210
msgid "The moment I placed the Scroll of Fire on the table, it exploded. At the same time the wall opened again."
msgstr ""
"In su momentu chi apo postu sa Pergamena de su fogu subra de sa mesa, est "
"iscopiada. In su matessi tempus su muru s'est torradu a abèrrere."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:300
msgid "I brought the monster's heart to Thalos and told him that the danger has been averted. He was impressed and relieved at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu su coro de su mostru a Thalos e li apo naradu chi su perìgulu "
"fiat istadu evitadu. Fiat impressionadu e asseliadu in su matessi tempus."

#: questlist_laeroth.json:lae_centaurs:310
msgid "Since then I have been a welcome guest of the centaurs."
msgstr "Dae tando, so un'istràngiu benebènnidu de sos tzentàuros."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster
msgid "Fog in the woods"
msgstr "Nèula in su padente"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:5
msgid "You had entered a very unnatural looking fog and decided to find the source of it. Maybe you could lift the fog?"
msgstr ""
"Fias intradu in una nèula chi pariat pagu naturale e as detzìdidu de nde "
"agatare s'orìgine. Forsis dias pòdere fàghere isparèssere sa nèula?"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:10
msgid "After you chased away a fog monster, the fog suddenly dissipated."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi as fatu fuire unu mostru de sa nèula, sa nèula est isparida "
"totu in una."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:20
msgid "Another fog monster guarded the footbridge to the hut. As long as there was still fog somewhere around the hut, you couldn't drive it away."
msgstr ""
"Un'àteru mostru de sa nèula bardiaiat su pontigheddu chi giughet a sa "
"barraca. Finas a cando b'aiat galu nèula in calicunu logu a inghìriu de sa "
"barraca, no lu podias fàghere fuire."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:30
msgid "In the hut you encountered a terrifying looking witch."
msgstr "In sa barraca as atopadu una coga cun un'aspetu chi faghiat assustare."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:70
msgid "You defeated the old witch in battle, so she can't create a new fog."
msgstr ""
"As bintu sa coga betza in cumbata, e duncas non podet creare una nèula noa."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:80
msgid "You were able to convince the witch Mim to keep the road clear of fog."
msgstr ""
"As resèssidu a cumbìnchere sa coga Mim a mantènnere s'àndala lìbera dae sa "
"nèula."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:90
msgid "You convinced the witch Mim to replace the fog with a distraction spell."
msgstr ""
"As cumbintu sa coga Mim a sostituire sa nèula cun un'incantu de distratzione."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:fogmonster:92
msgid "Madame Mim gave you a bottle of her swamp water."
msgstr "Madame Mim t'at dadu un'ampulla de s'abba de paule sua."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby
msgid "Sobby's Trail"
msgstr "S'àndala de Sobby"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:10
msgid "On the road to Feygard I have met a boy named Tobby. He is looking for his brother Sobby."
msgstr ""
"In s'àndala pro Feygard apo atopadu unu pitzinnu chi si narat Tobby. Est "
"chirchende a su frade, Sobby."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:20
msgid "I have promised to help Tobby get past the kobolds to the south."
msgstr "Apo promìtidu a Tobby de l'agiudare a passare sos coboldos a su sud."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:21
msgid "I have killed the rat in Tobby's garden."
msgstr "Apo ochidu su sòrighe in s'ortu de Tobby."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:22
msgid "I gave Tobby a loaf of bread for his father."
msgstr "Apo dadu a Tobby unu pane pro su babbu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:23
msgid "Tobby has followed me to the beginning of the ravine with the kobolds."
msgstr "Tobby m'at sighidu finas a s'incumintzu de sa gula cun sos coboldos."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:24
msgid "Tobby has made it through the ravine."
msgstr "Tobby at resèssidu a passare sa gula."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:25
msgid "Tobby followed me further to the south."
msgstr "Tobby m'at sighidu ancora prus a su sud."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:30
msgid "I have attacked poor Tobby, but he ran away. Now he will never find his brother."
msgstr ""
"Apo atacadu a su pòberu Tobby, ma si nch'est fuidu. Como no at a agatare mai "
"su frade."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:40
msgid "We have parted. Tobby was sure now to find his brother."
msgstr "Nos semus separados. Como Tobby fiat seguru de agatare su frade."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:tobby:50
msgid "I have met Tobby again, together with Sobby in the little village in the woods."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu a atopare a Tobby, impare cun Sobby, in sa bidda pitica in su "
"padente."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment
msgid "Echoes of enchantment"
msgstr "Ecos de incantu"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:1
msgid "At the Wexlow well, I angered something evil and powerful (named Gamjee, I think) to the point that it pulled me down into the well. I've landed at the well's bottom severely injured, but alive."
msgstr ""
"In su putzu de Wexlow, apo fatu arrennegare una cosa mala e poderosa (chi si "
"narat Gamjee, mi paret) a su puntu chi m'at tiradu a intro de su putzu. So "
"rutu in fundu a su putzu feridu grae, ma biu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:2
msgid "After I landed with a thud at the bottom of the well and being concussed, I began to hear sounds off in the distance. Were they voices? Were they even real? Maybe a symptom of the concussion perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi so rutu cun unu tumbu in fundu a su putzu e chi so abarradu "
"istontonadu, apo cumintzadu a intèndere sonos a tesu. Fiant boghes? Fiant "
"mancari reales? Forsis unu sìntomu de su corfu chi apo leadu a sa conca?"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:3
msgid "After I landed with a thud at the bottom of the well and being concussed, I began to hear sounds off in the distance. Were they voices? Were they even real? Are they the voices of something more sinister?"
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi so rutu cun unu tumbu in fundu a su putzu e chi so abarradu "
"istontonadu, apo cumintzadu a intèndere sonos a tesu. Fiant boghes? Fiant "
"mancari reales? Fiant sas boghes de calicuna cosa prus mala e iscura?"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:4
msgid "The voices I thought I heard earlier seem to be persistent and seemed to be getting louder. It was hard to tell if they're real or just a figment of my imagination."
msgstr ""
"Sas boghes chi m'est partu de intèndere in antis pariant chi no acabbaiant "
"mai e chi s'intendiant semper prus fortes. Fiat difìtzile a nàrrere si fiant "
"reales o petzi unu frutu de sa fantasia mea."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:5
msgid "Deep inside the well's tunnels, I found eight people being held captive inside a very deep pit."
msgstr ""
"In fundu a sas gallerias de su putzu, apo agatadu oto persones tentas "
"presoneras in intro de unu fossu fundudu meda."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:6
msgid "I learned that these people are held captive by a troll and they need me to find a way to free them."
msgstr ""
"Apo ischidu chi custas persones sunt tentas presoneras dae unu troll e chi "
"tenent bisòngiu chi deo agate una manera de las liberare."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:7
msgid "I met the troll named Gamjee and listened to what he had to say."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu su troll chi si narat Gamjee e apo ascurtadu su chi teniat de "
"nàrrere."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:8
msgid "In an attempt to help Gamjee and the villagers, I have facilitated a conversation between Gamjee and one of the villagers."
msgstr ""
"Pro chircare de agiudare a Gamjee e a sos biddajos, apo fatu in modu chi "
"Gamjee e unu de sos biddajos faeddarent."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:9
msgid "I killed Gamjee and in doing so, I found a rope that I think might be helpful in freeing those people in that pit."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu a Gamjee e gasi apo agatadu una fune chi mi paret chi potzat "
"èssere ùtile pro liberare cussas persones in cussu fossu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:11
msgid "I killed Gamjee and in doing so, I realized that I really should go investigate the voices I heard earlier."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu a Gamjee e gasi mi so abbigiadu chi dia dèpere andare a indagare "
"a beru subra de sas boghes chi apo intesu in antis."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:10
msgid "The villagers have been freed. I should visit them back in their village of Wexlow."
msgstr ""
"Sos biddajos sunt istados liberados. Dia dèpere andare a los bisitare in sa "
"bidda issoro, Wexlow."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:12
msgid "The villagers and Gamjee agreed to a schedule for using the well, ensuring everyone has access to water without conflict. But the villagers are still in the pit."
msgstr ""
"Sos biddajos e Gamjee si sunt postos de acordu subra de unos turnos pro "
"impreare su putzu, pro chi totus potzant tènnere abba chene brigas. Ma sos "
"biddajos sunt galu in su fossu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:13
msgid "After the villagers and Gamjee agreed to a compromise, Gamjee gave me a rope and instructed me to use it to free the remaining villagers in the pit."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi sos biddajos e Gamjee si sunt postos de acordu, Gamjee m'at "
"dadu una fune e m'at naradu de l'impreare pro liberare sos biddajos chi "
"fiant galu in su fossu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:echoes_of_enchantment:14
msgid "I've visited the people of Wexlow Village after they made it home. They are happy to sleep in their own beds now."
msgstr ""
"Apo bisitadu sa gente de sa bidda de Wexlow a pustis chi sunt torrados a "
"domo. Como sunt cuntentos de dormire in sos letos issoro."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy
msgid "A Feygard delicacy"
msgstr "Una delìtzia de Feygard"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:1
msgid "Philippa, one of the lovely Feygard loyalist ladies from Wexlow that I rescued from Gamjee the troll has informed me that she is a master baker."
msgstr ""
"Philippa, una de sas sennoras de Wexlow, simpàticas e leales a Feygard, chi "
"apo sarvadu dae su troll Gamjee, m'at naradu chi est una panetera brava meda."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:2
msgid "Philippa has educated me about what a \"Feydelight\" is."
msgstr "Philippa m'at ispiegadu ite est unu \"Feydelight\"."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:3
msgid "In return for my helping to rescue Philippa, she's stated that she could make a \"Feydelight\" for me if I provide her with all of the ingredients necessary to bake one."
msgstr ""
"In càmbiu de s'agiudu chi l'apo dadu pro la sarvare, Philippa m'at naradu "
"chi mi podet fàghere unu \"Feydelight\" si li dao totu sos ingredientes chi "
"bi cherent pro nde coghere unu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:4
msgid "I need to find dough, two eggs, wine, butter, honey and five Feygard fig fruits. I can find the figs in Feygard, but maybe I could find some along the Duleian Road too?"
msgstr ""
"Depo agatare pasta, duos oos, binu, butiru, mele e chimbe figos de Feygard. "
"Potzo agatare figos in Feygard, ma forsis nde dia pòdere agatare fintzas in "
"s'àndala duleiana?"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:5
msgid "She told me that I can find the dough in Brightport or Feygard, but I could find a baker in just about any town."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu chi sa pasta la potzo agatare in Portu Lughente o in Feygard, ma "
"chi dia pòdere agatare unu paneteri belle in cale si siat tzitade."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:6
msgid "Philippa told me that I can get honey from a beekeeper. But where to find one?"
msgstr ""
"Philippa m'at naradu chi su mele lu potzo tènnere dae un'abiàrgiu. Ma in ue "
"nd'agato unu?"

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:7
msgid "I gave Philippa all the ingredients needed to bake the Feydelight. Now I just need to come back later."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Philippa totu sos ingredientes chi bi cherent pro coghere su "
"Feydelight. Como depo petzi torrare prus a tardu."

#: questlist_feygard_1.json:feygard_delicacy:8
msgid "I have received my Feydelight from Philippa. "
msgstr "Philippa m'at dadu su Feydelight meu. "

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings
msgid "It's knot funny"
msgstr "Non faghet rìere"

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:1
msgid "I met Arensia in Fallhaven. She is being taunted by lytwings while she slumbers. I agreed to help get rid of the mischevious creatures. I should talk to Rigmor to find out more, she lives north of the tavern."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Arensia in Fallhaven. Sos lytwing li faghent befas mentras "
"dormit. Apo atzetadu de l'agiudare a si nde liberare de custas creaduras "
"dispetosas. Dia dèpere faeddare cun Rigmor pro nde ischire de prus; istat a "
"nord de su tzilleri."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:10
msgid "Rigmor told me that lytwings live near large rings of mushroom growth, I should look for these in the forest surrounding Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Rigmor m'at naradu chi sos lytwing bivent acanta de chircos mannos de "
"fungos; los dia dèpere chircare in su padente a inghìriu de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:11
msgid "I have to take a gift of two red apples and two strawberries before I can talk to the lytwings. They cast some kind of spell on me for not bringing them these fruit, it made me feel very tired."
msgstr ""
"Depo giùghere unu donu de duas melas rujas e duas fràgulas in antis de "
"pòdere faeddare cun sos lytwing. M'ant ghetadu una genia de incantu ca non "
"lis aia giutu custos frutos, e mi so intesu istracu meda."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:12
msgid "The lytwings accepted my gift, and I can now talk with them."
msgstr "Sos lytwing ant atzetadu su donu meu, e como potzo faeddare cun issos."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:13
msgid "I offered my help to the lytwings in exchange for leaving Arensia alone. They are considering my request. I should check in with them shortly, to hear their decision."
msgstr ""
"Apo ofertu s'agiudu meu a sos lytwing in càmbiu de lassare in pasu a "
"Arensia. Sunt pensende a sa rechesta mea. Dia dèpere passare torra dae issos "
"a curtzu, pro ischire ite ant detzìdidu."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:20
msgid "The lytwings asked that I chop down a gnarly old tree that is inside their mushroom ring. They insisted that I use an iron axe because the cursed bark of the tree cannot be cut by other tools."
msgstr ""
"Sos lytwing m'ant pedidu de ghetare a terra un'àrbore betzu e nodosu chi est "
"in intro de su chircu de fungos issoro. Ant insìstidu chi impree un'istrale "
"de ferru, ca s'iscortza malaita de s'àrbore non si podet segare cun àteras "
"ainas."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:21
msgid "I was about to swing my axe, when the lytwings stopped me. They have changed their minds about chopping down the tree. I am beginning to think they are indecisive on purpose."
msgstr ""
"Fia giai pro artziare s'istrale, cando sos lytwing m'ant firmadu. Ant "
"cambiadu idea e non cherent prus chi ghete a terra s'àrbore. Apo cumintzadu "
"a pensare chi sunt indetzisos a posta."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:30
msgid "The lytwings want four bottles of mead. I can probably find some at the Fallhaven tavern."
msgstr ""
"Sos lytwing cherent bator ampullas de idromele. Forsis nde potzo agatare in "
"su tzilleri de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:31
msgid "They took the mead, and turned around saying they want something else. I can now see why Rigmor said they are full of mischief! But I have no other choice but to continue this fool's errand if I want to help Arensia."
msgstr ""
"Ant leadu s'idromele e luego ant naradu chi cherent un'àtera cosa. Como "
"cumprendo pro ite Rigmor m'aiat naradu chi sunt prenos de malìtzia! Ma no "
"apo àteru sèberu si non sighire custu incàrrigu chene sensu, si chèrgio "
"agiudare a Arensia."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:40
msgid "I have to find twelve wild flowers for the lytwings. I wonder where I could find those. Perhaps Arensia will know."
msgstr ""
"Depo agatare dòighi frores agrestes pro sos lytwing. Mi pregunto in ue los "
"dia pòdere agatare. Forsis Arensia l'ischit."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:41
msgid "They accepted the flowers, and as expected, said they want something else! How many more times will they make me run around?"
msgstr ""
"Ant atzetadu sos frores e, comente mi l'isetaia, ant naradu chi cherent "
"un'àtera cosa! Cantas àteras bortas m'ant a fàghere currere dae un'ala a "
"s'àtera?"

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:90
msgid "The lytwings want a token of Arensia's promise that she will not to pick their mushrooms again. I sense they are not playing another prank this time, they seemed intent about this task."
msgstr ""
"Sos lytwing cherent unu sinnu de sa promissa de Arensia chi no at a collire "
"prus sos fungos issoro. Mi paret chi custa borta non sunt faghende un'àtera "
"befa; pariant sèrios a beru subra de custa cosa."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:91
msgid "Arensia made a promise to her mother's ring, and then she gave it to me. I should take it to the lytwings at once."
msgstr ""
"Arensia at fatu una promissa subra de s'aneddu de sa mama e a pustis mi l'at "
"dadu. Lu dia dèpere giùghere deretu a sos lytwing."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:92
msgid "I gave Arensia's ring to the lytwings. Just when I thought it was done, they said they need something else! I am waiting on their decision."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu s'aneddu de Arensia a sos lytwing. Cando pensaia chi fiat totu "
"acabbadu, ant naradu chi tenent bisòngiu de un'àtera cosa! So isetende sa "
"detzisione issoro."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:99
msgid "The lytwings have agreed to stop taunting Arensia. I should go tell her."
msgstr ""
"Sos lytwing ant atzetadu de non fàghere prus befas a Arensia. Dia dèpere "
"andare a nde li faeddare."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:100
msgid "Arensia was elated to hear that the lytwings will no longer taunt her."
msgstr ""
"Arensia fiat cuntenta a s'ispèrdida de ischire chi sos lytwing non li ant a "
"fàghere prus befas."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:101
msgid "I could not take the absurd errands any more. I am no longer helping Arensia with her lytwing problem."
msgstr ""
"Non nde podia prus de cussos incàrrigos assurdos. No agiudo prus a Arensia "
"cun su problema suo de sos lytwing."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:102
msgid "I lied to Arensia's and kept her mother's ring for myself."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu una fàula a Arensia e apo tentu pro mene s'aneddu de sa mama."

#: questlist_lytwings.json:fallhaven_lytwings:103
msgid "Arensia gave me her magical promise ring as reward for helping her."
msgstr ""
"Arensia m'at dadu s'aneddu màgicu de sa promissa comente recumpensa pro "
"l'àere agiudada."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times
msgid "Troubling times"
msgstr "Tempos difìtziles"

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:10
msgid "I went to the Thieves' Guild in Fallhaven looking for things to do."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a su Grèmiu de sos Ladros de Fallhaven in chirca de cosas de "
"fàghere."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:20
msgid "Since I had helped Defy, Umar and Nanath threw me out. I cannot enter the basement again."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia agiudadu a Defy, Umar e Nanath m'ant ghetadu a fora. Non potzo prus "
"intrare in sa cantina."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:30
msgid "Since I had looted the Thieves' Guild vault after killing Defy, Umar and Nanath threw me out. I cannot enter the basement again."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia ispogiadu sa càmera blindada de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros a pustis de "
"àere ochidu a Defy, Umar e Nanath m'ant ghetadu a fora. Non potzo prus "
"intrare in sa cantina."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:40
msgid "I met Nanath, who's scared and upset, because someone put a spell on all members of the Thieves' Guild. This spell made all thieves noticeable. He asked me if I could help dispel the spell."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Nanath, chi est assustadu e apretadu, ca calicunu at ghetadu "
"un'incantu a totu sos membros de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros. Custu incantu "
"faghet chi totu sos ladros si notent. M'at pedidu si lu podia agiudare a "
"isfàghere s'incantu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:50
msgid "Nanath told me to find the Shadow priest who had cast the spell on the Guild."
msgstr ""
"Nanath m'at naradu de agatare su preìderu de s'Umbra chi aiat ghetadu "
"s'incantu a su Grèmiu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:60
msgid "I set out interviewing Shadow priests to find who had cast the spell."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu a interrogare sos preìderos de s'Umbra pro ischire chie aiat "
"ghetadu s'incantu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:70
msgid "Talion, Shadow priest of Loneford, had cast the Striking Spectacle Shadow spell on the Guild, on payment from Dameni, a mysterious lady leading a band of toughs"
msgstr ""
"Talion, preìderu de s'Umbra de Loneford, aiat ghetadu a su Grèmiu s'incantu "
"de s'Umbra \"Ispetàculu Ispantosu\", pagadu dae Dameni, una sennora "
"misteriosa chi cumandat una banda de prepotentes"

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:80
msgid "Talion could dispel the spell, using a few items - Villain's ring, Troublemaker's ring, ring of backstabbing, Tears of the Shadow potion, Luthor's ring.  He also wanted 50000 gold."
msgstr ""
"Talion podiat isfàghere s'incantu impreende unos cantos ogetos: Aneddu de su "
"malefatore, Aneddu de su chircabrigas, Aneddu de sa pugnalada a palas, "
"potzione Làgrimas de s'Umbra, Aneddu de Luthor.  Cheriat fintzas 50000 "
"monedas de oro."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:82
msgid "I have informed Nanath about the Striking Spectacle Shadow spell and Talion's demands."
msgstr ""
"Apo informadu a Nanath de s'incantu de s'Umbra \"Ispetàculu Ispantosu\" e de "
"sas rechestas de Talion."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:90
msgid "Nanath told me Thieves' Guild would give me the 50000 gold back when I have got the spell dispelled."
msgstr ""
"Nanath m'at naradu chi su Grèmiu de sos Ladros m'at a torrare sas 50000 "
"monedas de oro cando apo a àere fatu isfàghere s'incantu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:95
msgid "Nanath asked if I had already found Luthor's ring."
msgstr "Nanath m'at preguntadu si aia giai agatadu s'Aneddu de Luthor."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:100
msgid "I went back to Nanath as I couldn't find Luthor's ring anywhere."
msgstr ""
"So torradu dae Nanath ca non resessia a agatare s'Aneddu de Luthor in perunu "
"logu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:105
msgid "He told me to seek out Fanamor's friend Sly Seraphina near the Sutdover bridge."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu de chircare s'amiga de Fanamor, Seraphina sa furba, acanta de su "
"ponte de Sutdover."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:110
msgid "Seraphina didn't believe me. She told me to go away."
msgstr "Seraphina non m'at crèidu. M'at naradu de mi nde andare."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:115
msgid "Nanath sent me to Umar. He should make sure Sly carries out the order."
msgstr ""
"Nanath m'at mandadu dae Umar. Issu diat dèpere fàghere in modu chi Seraphina "
"fatzat su chi l'ant ordinadu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:120
msgid "Umar told me one of his secret passwords to convince Seraphina."
msgstr ""
"Umar m'at naradu una de sas paràulas segretas suas pro cumbìnchere a "
"Seraphina."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:130
msgid "Sly Seraphina said that Luthor's ring was to be found in the cave which Crackshot tried to open. The door was sealed by Umar and Seraphina to prevent monsters in that cave from devastating Dhayavar. The sealing was done by using Luthor's items. She and Umar decided to separate them, and keep them separate."
msgstr ""
"Seraphina sa furba m'at naradu chi s'Aneddu de Luthor si podiat agatare in "
"sa gruta chi Crackshot aiat chircadu de abèrrere. Sa ghenna fiat istada "
"sigillada dae Umar e Seraphina pro impedire a sos mostros de cussa gruta de "
"distrùere Dhayavar. Pro la sigillare aiant impreadu sos ogetos de Luthor. "
"Issa e Umar aiant detzìdidu de los separare e de los mantènnere separados."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:140
msgid "Seraphina felt that the danger was too high to open that door. So she disappeared."
msgstr ""
"Seraphina pensaiat chi su perìgulu fiat tropu mannu pro abèrrere cussa "
"ghenna. E duncas est isparida."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:150
msgid "I had to find Sly Seraphina again."
msgstr "Depia torrare a agatare a Seraphina sa furba."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:160
msgid "Nanath told me to look for her in her usual hiding places: Near one of the towns Sullengard, Stoutford, Vilegard, Prim, Loneford, or Brimhaven."
msgstr ""
"Nanath m'at naradu de la chircare in sos cuadòrgios suos de sòlitu: acanta "
"de una de sas tzitades de Sullengard, Stoutford, Vilegard, Prim, Loneford o "
"Brimhaven."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:170
msgid "Talion said that without the items he asked for he couldn't help. I had to find Seraphina."
msgstr ""
"Talion m'at naradu chi chene sos ogetos chi aiat pedidu non podiat agiudare. "
"Depia agatare a Seraphina."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:180
msgid "After beating the tough guys protecting Seraphina, she was convinced that I was strong enough to help her beat the monsters in the cave."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo bintu sos prepotentes chi amparaiant a Seraphina, issa "
"s'est cumbinta chi fia forte bastante pro l'agiudare a bìnchere sos mostros "
"de sa gruta."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:190
msgid "Seraphina gave me back the money she had stolen from me earlier."
msgstr "Seraphina m'at torradu su dinare chi m'aiat furadu in antis."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:192
msgid "I have to ask Umar for Luthor's key."
msgstr "Depo pedire a Umar sa Crae de Luthor."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:193
msgid "I have got the key."
msgstr "Tèngio sa crae."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:195
msgid "Seraphina agreed to help me and told me to meet her at the locked door in the cave where Crackshot was defeated."
msgstr ""
"Seraphina at atzetadu de m'agiudare e m'at naradu de l'atopare in sa ghenna "
"serrada a crae de sa gruta in ue est istadu bintu Crackshot."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:200
msgid "I met Seraphina at the cave door where Crackshot was defeated."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Seraphina in sa ghenna de sa gruta in ue est istadu bintu "
"Crackshot."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:210
msgid "Seraphina could open the door with Luthor's key wearing also his gloves. She entered the cave behind the door."
msgstr ""
"Seraphina at pòdidu abèrrere sa ghenna cun sa Crae de Luthor, ca giughiat "
"fintzas sos guantes suos. Est intrada in sa gruta in palas de sa ghenna."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:220
msgid "I followed her."
msgstr "L'apo sighida."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:230
msgid "Seraphina got injured attacking one of the monsters."
msgstr "Seraphina s'est ferida atachende unu de sos mostros."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:240
msgid "I have killed the monsters blocking the entrance."
msgstr "Apo ochidu sos mostros chi serraiant s'intrada."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:250
msgid "I healed Seraphina using potions."
msgstr "Apo sanadu a Seraphina impreende potziones."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:252
msgid "I tried to poison Seraphina, but she noticed in time. At least she didn't notice that I did it on purpose."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de avelenare a Seraphina, ma si nd'est abbigiada a tempus. A su "
"mancu no at cumpresu chi l'apo fatu a posta."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:255
msgid "Seraphina already started the search for the ring."
msgstr "Seraphina at giai cumintzadu a chircare s'aneddu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:260
msgid "I searched the cave for Luthor's ring. I couldn't find it."
msgstr "Apo chircadu s'Aneddu de Luthor in sa gruta. No l'apo pòdidu agatare."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:270
msgid "Sly Seraphina had found the ring. She gave it to me and told me to keep it safe. She disappeared again, probably back to Sutdover bridge. I had to go to Talion."
msgstr ""
"Seraphina sa furba aiat agatadu s'aneddu. Mi l'at dadu e m'at naradu de "
"l'allogare in logu seguru. Est torrada a isparire, est probàbile chi siat "
"torrada a su ponte de Sutdover. Depia andare dae Talion."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:280
msgid "I gave 50000 gold, Villain's ring, Troublemaker's ring, ring of backstabbing, Tears of the Shadow potion, and Luthor's ring to Talion."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Talion 50000 monedas de oro, s'Aneddu de su malefatore, s'Aneddu "
"de su chircabrigas, s'Aneddu de sa pugnalada a palas, sa potzione Làgrimas "
"de s'Umbra e s'Aneddu de Luthor."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:290
msgid "Talion used them to undo the spell."
msgstr "Talion los at impreados pro isfàghere s'incantu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:300
msgid "Talion returned Luthor's ring. The other rings were broken in the process though and the Tears of the Shadow potion was used up of course."
msgstr ""
"Talion m'at torradu s'Aneddu de Luthor. Però sos àteros aneddos si sunt "
"segados in su protzessu e, est craru, sa potzione Làgrimas de s'Umbra est "
"istada impreada totu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:302
msgid "The room with the dangerous creatures has been locked and sealed again."
msgstr ""
"S'aposentu cun sas creaduras perigulosas est istadu serradu a crae e "
"sigilladu torra."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:310
msgid "Nanath gave me 75000 gold as a reward for a job well done."
msgstr ""
"Nanath m'at dadu 75000 monedas de oro comente recumpensa pro unu traballu "
"bene fatu."

#: questlist_troubling_times.json:troubling_times:320
msgid "Sly Seraphina was friendly to me - for now."
msgstr "Seraphina sa furba fiat amiga mea... pro como."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight
msgid "Darkness in the Daylight"
msgstr "Iscuru in sa lughe de sa die"

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:10
msgid "I met Miri in the Crossroads Guardhouse."
msgstr "Apo atopadu a Miri in su corpu de guàrdia de sa Rugrada."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:20
msgid "Since I had helped Ailshara, she wouldn't tell me about Andor."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia agiudadu a Ailshara, Miri non m'at chertu nàrrere nudda de Andor."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:30
msgid "Since I had hidden the truth about the bootlegging of beer from Sullengard, she wouldn't tell me about Andor."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia cuadu sa veridade subra de su contrabbandu de birra de Sullengard, "
"Miri non m'at chertu nàrrere nudda de Andor."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:40
msgid "Since I had aided Feygard once or twice earlier, she would tell me about Andor, after I had completed an investigation for her."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia agiudadu a Feygard una o duas bortas in antis, Miri mi diat nàrrere "
"de Andor, a pustis chi aia acabbadu un'inchesta pro issa."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:50
msgid "Since Miri was poisoned by slitherers near Sullengard, and healing is taking time, she wanted me to investigate something bad in the Purple Hills in the strange areas to the south of Stoutford."
msgstr ""
"Ca Miri fiat istada avelenada dae sos istrisinadores acanta de Sullengard, e "
"pro sanare bi cheret tempus, m'at pedidu de indagare subra de una cosa mala "
"in sos Montigros Purpùreos, in sos logos istranos a sud de Stoutford."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:60
msgid "I went to the area to the south of Stoutford and encountered an impassable force there."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a sa zona a sud de Stoutford e b'apo agatadu una fortza chi non si "
"podiat passare."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:70
msgid "There was a piece of Kazaul ritual there, which I had encountered before. I should inform Miri."
msgstr ""
"B'aiat una parte de unu ritu de Kazaul, chi aia giai bidu in antis. Dia "
"dèpere informare a Miri."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:80
msgid "Miri asked me where I had seen this before. I told her about a task I had carried out on behalf of Throdna of the Blackwater settlement."
msgstr ""
"Miri m'at preguntadu in ue l'aia bidu in antis. Li apo contadu de unu "
"traballu chi aia fatu pro contu de Throdna, de s'insediamentu de Abbaniedda."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:90
msgid "Miri told me to meet him and enquire further. And gave me a phrase to use whenever he started rambling."
msgstr ""
"Miri m'at naradu de l'andare a bìdere e de indagare de prus. E m'at dadu una "
"frase de impreare si issu cumintzaiat a si pèrdere in chistiones."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:100
msgid "Throdna told me it was part of a ritual to break the barrier which forms when one does a ritual to call strong Kazaul monsters."
msgstr ""
"Throdna m'at naradu chi fiat parte de unu ritu pro segare sa barriera chi si "
"format cando si faghet unu ritu pro mutire mostros fortes de Kazaul."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:110
msgid "The ritual consisted of two parts which I had found earlier, and a chant in a book called Calomyran Secrets. I need to report this to Miri."
msgstr ""
"Su ritu fiat fatu de duas partes, chi aia giai agatadu in antis, e de unu "
"cantu in unu libru chi si narat 'Sos segretos de Calomyran'. Depo informare "
"de custu a Miri."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:120
msgid "I told Miri about finding the book for an Old Man in Fallhaven.  She told me to talk to him."
msgstr ""
"Apo contadu a Miri chi aia agatadu su libru pro unu betzu de Fallhaven.  "
"M'at naradu de faeddare cun issu."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:130
msgid "The Old Man would not let me borrow the book, so I started noting the chant in front of him."
msgstr ""
"Su betzu non m'at chertu imprestare su libru, e duncas apo cumintzadu a "
"iscrìere su cantu in presèntzia sua."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:140
msgid "The book contained half the chant. The rest was to be found in another book Azimyran Secrets."
msgstr ""
"Su libru cunteniat sa metade de su cantu. Su chi mancaiat fiat in un'àteru "
"libru, 'Sos segretos de Azimyran'."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:150
msgid "Miri told me she'd trace the book. She told me to wait for her return."
msgstr ""
"Miri m'at naradu chi diat chircare su libru. M'at naradu de isetare chi "
"torraret."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:160
msgid "Miri came back and told me that the book Azimyran Secrets was with an old hermit near Arulir mountain."
msgstr ""
"Miri est torrada e m'at naradu chi su libru 'Sos segretos de Azimyran' "
"l'aiat un'eremita betzu acanta de su Monte Arulir."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:170
msgid "I met the old hermit and asked him about the book, Azimyran Secrets."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu s'eremita betzu e li apo preguntadu de su libru 'Sos segretos de "
"Azimyran'."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:180
msgid "He refused to give it to me, so I copied the chant sitting with him. I needed to tell Miri."
msgstr ""
"At refudadu de mi lu dare, e duncas apo copiadu su cantu sètzidu cun issu. "
"Depia informare a Miri."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:190
msgid "Miri told me to hurry, and pass the barrier."
msgstr "Miri m'at naradu de fàghere lestru e de passare sa barriera."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:198
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:178
msgid "After destroying the ritual statue of Kazaul, beyond the barrier I found a crying woman."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere distrutu s'istàtua rituale de Kazaul, a s'àtera parte de sa "
"barriera apo agatadu una fèmina chi pranghiat."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:200
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:180
msgid "She was performing a ritual that should bring her husband back to life."
msgstr "Fiat faghende unu ritu chi diat dèpere torrare a sa vida a su maridu."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:210
msgid "Miri, who followed me, convinced the woman that it was actually an evil ritual to overrun Dhayavar with Kazaul's monsters."
msgstr ""
"Miri, chi m'aiat sighidu, at cumbintu sa fèmina chi in realidade fiat unu "
"ritu malignu pro invàdere Dhayavar cun sos mostros de Kazaul."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:220
msgid "The mourning woman told us that the ritual was given to her by a priest who walks on lava east of the Purple Hills."
msgstr ""
"Sa fèmina in dolu nos at naradu chi su ritu bi l'aiat dadu unu preìderu chi "
"caminat subra de sa lava, a oriente de sos Montigros Purpùreos."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:230
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:210
msgid "We let the mourning woman go."
msgstr "Amus lassadu andare sa fèmina in dolu."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:232
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:212
msgid "The mourning woman cried that she would never be happy again."
msgstr ""
"Sa fèmina in dolu pranghiat narende chi no aiat a èssere mai prus cuntenta."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:240
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:220
msgid "I had to travel to the lava wastelands."
msgstr "Depia biagiare a sos desertos de lava."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:250
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:230
msgid "There, after fighting monsters, I met a priest in red."
msgstr ""
"In cue, a pustis de àere gherradu contra a unos cantos mostros, apo atopadu "
"unu preìderu bestidu de ruju."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:260
msgid "He accused me of interfering. Miri, who again followed me, revealed the red priest to be a monster."
msgstr ""
"M'at acusadu de mi pònnere in mesu a sos fatos suos. Miri, chi m'aiat "
"sighidu torra, at iscobertu chi su preìderu ruju fiat unu mostru."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:270
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:250
msgid "I defeated the monster."
msgstr "Apo bintu su mostru."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:280
msgid "Miri fulfilled her promise and told me that Andor would be refilling his food supplies at Rosmara's food stand."
msgstr ""
"Miri at mantentu sa promissa sua e m'at naradu chi Andor diat èssere andadu "
"a si fàghere provista de màndigu in su bancu de Rosmara."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:300
msgid "Indeed, I have found Andor there."
msgstr "E difatis, b'apo agatadu a Andor."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:darkness_in_daylight:310
#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:290
msgid "He told me he couldn't come home now, and vanished."
msgstr "M'at naradu chi como non podiat torrare a domo, e est isparidu."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "Umbras"

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:10
msgid "I met Borvis on the great road near Alynndir's hut."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Borvis in s'àndala manna acanta de sa barraca de Alynndir."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:20
msgid "Since I had told Gandoren about the switch of the weapons, and also the truth about the bootlegging of beer from Sullengard, he told me to leave."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia contadu a Gandoren de su càmbiu de sas armas, e fintzas sa veridade "
"subra de su contrabbandu de birra de Sullengard, Borvis m'at naradu de mi "
"nde andare."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:30
msgid "Since I aided the Shadow once or twice earlier, he requested my further help for an urgent task."
msgstr ""
"Ca aia agiudadu a s'Umbra una o duas bortas in antis, m'at pedidu torra "
"agiudu pro unu traballu urgente."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:40
msgid "He wanted me to investigate something bad in the Purple Hills in the weird areas to the south of Stoutford."
msgstr ""
"M'at pedidu de indagare subra de una cosa mala in sos Montigros Purpùreos, "
"in sos logos istranos a sud de Stoutford."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:50
msgid "I went to the area to the south of Stoutford, and encountered an impassable force there."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a sa zona a sud de Stoutford, e b'apo agatadu una fortza chi non "
"si podiat passare."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:60
msgid "There were strange glowing, immovable pebbles there. I had to inform Borvis."
msgstr ""
"B'aiat pedras piticas istranas chi lughiant e chi non si podiant mòere. "
"Depia informare a Borvis."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:70
msgid "Borvis told me that was the basic, but effective, Shadow shield, to protect Shadow incantations from outside interference. "
msgstr ""
"Borvis m'at naradu chi fiat s'iscudu de s'Umbra de base, ma eficatze, pro "
"amparare sos incantos de s'Umbra dae interferèntzias de foras. "

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:80
msgid "For that, he would give me a chant. But I had to get him energies in the form of four 'blessings' - Shadow's Strength, Shadow Awareness, Fatigue, and Life Drain - within myself. He told me to go to Talion in Loneford for the first blessing, and for information about the others."
msgstr ""
"Pro cussu, mi diat dare unu cantu. Ma depia leare pro issu energias in forma "
"de bator 'beneditziones' (Fortza de s'Umbra, Cussèntzia de s'Umbra, "
"Istrachidùdine e Sutzada de vida) in intro de mene. M'at naradu de andare "
"dae Talion in Loneford pro sa prima beneditzione, e pro informatziones subra "
"de sas àteras."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:90
msgid "Talion bestowed me with Shadow's Strength."
msgstr "Talion m'at dadu sa Fortza de s'Umbra."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:100
msgid "Talion told me to seek out Jolnor in Vilegard for the rest of the 'blessings'."
msgstr ""
"Talion m'at naradu de chircare a Jolnor in Vilegard pro su restu de sas "
"'beneditziones'."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:110
msgid "Jolnor bestowed me with Shadow Awareness."
msgstr "Jolnor m'at dadu sa Cussèntzia de s'Umbra."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:120
msgid "Jolnor told me to seek Favlon to the west of Sullengard for the remaining two."
msgstr ""
"Jolnor m'at naradu de chircare a Favlon, a otzidente de Sullengard, pro sas "
"àteras duas."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:130
msgid "I reached Favlon who asked me for 10 Cooked Meat."
msgstr "So lòmpidu dae Favlon, chi m'at pedidu 10 bìculos de petza cota."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:140
msgid "I gave Favlon 10 Cooked Meat. He bestowed me with 'blessings' of Fatigue and Life Drain."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Favlon 10 bìculos de petza cota. M'at dadu sas 'beneditziones' de "
"s'Istrachidùdine e de sa Sutzada de vida."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:150
msgid "After a grueling travel back, I returned to Borvis."
msgstr "A pustis de unu biàgiu de torrada duru meda, so torradu dae Borvis."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:160
msgid "Borvis removed the 'blessings' from me, and made a chant."
msgstr "Borvis m'at bogadu sas 'beneditziones' e at fatu unu cantu."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:165
msgid "Borvis told me to hurry back to the barrier."
msgstr "Borvis m'at naradu de torrare lestru a sa barriera."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:170
msgid "I passed the barrier."
msgstr "Apo passadu sa barriera."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:190
msgid "Borvis, who followed me, convinced the woman that it was actually an evil ritual to overrun Dhayar with Kazaul's monsters."
msgstr ""
"Borvis, chi m'aiat sighidu, at cumbintu sa fèmina chi in realidade fiat unu "
"ritu malignu pro invàdere Dhayavar cun sos mostros de Kazaul."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:200
msgid "The mourning woman told us that the ritual was given to her by a priest in the lava wastelands."
msgstr ""
"Sa fèmina in dolu nos at naradu chi su ritu bi l'aiat dadu unu preìderu de "
"sos desertos de lava."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:240
msgid "He accused me of interfering again and again. Borvis, who again followed me, revealed the red priest to be a monster."
msgstr ""
"M'at acusadu un'àtera borta e un'àtera de mi pònnere in mesu a sos fatos "
"suos. Borvis, chi m'aiat sighidu torra, at iscobertu chi su preìderu ruju "
"fiat unu mostru."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:260
msgid "Borvis fulfilled his promise and told me that Andor would be refilling his supplies from Alynndir."
msgstr ""
"Borvis at mantentu sa promissa sua e m'at naradu chi Andor diat èssere "
"andadu a si fàghere provista dae Alynndir."

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:270
msgid "I ran to Alynndir's hut. "
msgstr "So curtu a sa barraca de Alynndir. "

#: questlist_darknessanddaylight.json:shadows:280
msgid "I found Andor there."
msgstr "B'apo agatadu a Andor."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow
msgid "A familiar shadow"
msgstr "Un'umbra connota"

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:5
msgid "In the devastated lands south of Stoutford, I found an ominous stone etched with strange symbols."
msgstr ""
"In sas terras devastadas a sud de Stoutford, apo agatadu una pedra chi daiat "
"timòria, cun sìmbulos istranos isculpidos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:10
msgid "As I touched its glowing mark, an unnatural chill ran through me, and I heard a voice in my mind, calling out for help. It spoke of torment and told me to return to Crossglen to find answers."
msgstr ""
"Cando apo tocadu su sinnu lughente suo, unu fritu chi non fiat naturale "
"m'est passadu peri totu su corpus, e apo intesu una boghe in sa mente mea "
"chi pediat agiudu. Faeddaiat de tormentos e m'at naradu de torrare a "
"Crossglen pro agatare rispostas."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:20
msgid "The presence of the mark grows unbearable. I feel an overwhelming pull to return to Crossglen. There is something wrong, and I sense it's tied to my father. I must hurry to see what's happening."
msgstr ""
"Sa presèntzia de su sinnu si faghet insuportàbile. Intendo una fortza manna "
"chi mi tirat a torrare a Crossglen. B'at calicuna cosa chi no andat bene, e "
"intendo chi est ligada a babbu meu. Depo fàghere lestru pro bìdere ite est "
"sutzedende."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:30
msgid "I spoke to father. He assured me he's fine, but mentioned Leta hasn't been herself lately. She's been pacing her home and muttering to herself. I should check on her and see what's going on."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun babbu. M'at asseguradu chi istat bene, ma m'at naradu chi "
"in custas ùrtimas dies Leta no est issa matessi. Andat a susu e a giosso in "
"domo sua e faeddat a sa sola a boghe bàscia. Dia dèpere andare a bìdere "
"comente istat e ite est sutzedende."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:40
msgid "When I confronted Leta, she seemed different--angrier, more agitated. As I pressed her, a dark spirit suddenly manifested before me and attacked."
msgstr ""
"Cando apo afrontadu a Leta, pariat diferente: prus arrennegada, prus "
"agitada. Mentras la pressaia cun preguntas, un'ispìritu iscuru est "
"aparèssidu totu in una in antis meu e m'at atacadu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:50
msgid "I defeated the Dark spirit, but it didn't feel like the end. The Dark spirit trapped inside Leta has fled back to the devastated lands south of Stoutford, where its power can grow stronger. I need to return there and finish what I started."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu s'Ispìritu iscuru, ma non pariat chi esseret sa fine. S'Ispìritu "
"iscuru presu in intro de Leta si nch'est fuidu torra a sas terras devastadas "
"a sud de Stoutford, in ue su podere suo podet crèschere de prus. Depo "
"torrare in cue e acabbare su chi apo cumintzadu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:60
msgid "In the depths of the devastated lands south of Stoutford, I found the dark spirit waiting for me. It was stronger this time, but I defeated it once and for all. Whatever bond it had with me and Leta is broken. I should check-up on Leta again."
msgstr ""
"In su fundu de sas terras devastadas a sud de Stoutford, apo agatadu "
"s'ispìritu iscuru chi m'isetaiat. Custa borta fiat prus forte, ma l'apo "
"bintu pro semper. Cale si siat ligòngiu chi teniat cun megus e cun Leta est "
"segadu. Dia dèpere torrare a bìdere comente istat Leta."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:familiar_shadow:70
msgid "I returned to Crossglen to find everything changed. Leta has aged decades in an instant. Her child is now fully grown, and her timid husband, Oromir, seems like a different man entirely. They remember nothing of what happened. The spirit may be gone, but its curse has left a permanent mark on the lives it touched."
msgstr ""
"So torradu a Crossglen e apo agatadu totu cambiadu. Leta est imbetzada de "
"deghinas de annos in un'iscutu. Su fìgiu como est mannu de su totu, e su "
"maridu tìmidu suo, Oromir, paret un'òmine diferente de su totu. Non "
"s'ammentant de nudda de su chi est sutzèdidu. S'ispìritu at a èssere andadu, "
"ma sa maleditzione sua at lassadu unu sinnu permanente in sas vidas chi at "
"tocadu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star
msgid "The exploded star"
msgstr "S'isteddu iscopiadu"

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:5
msgid "Teccow wouldn't talk to me at the moment. I should get stronger and come back later."
msgstr ""
"Pro como Teccow non cheriat faeddare cun megus. Dia dèpere crèschere in "
"fortza e torrare prus a tardu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:10
msgid "Teccow of Stoutford has seen ten tongues of light falling down to earth, or so he said."
msgstr ""
"Teccow de Stoutford at bidu deghe limbas de lughe rughende a terra, o a su "
"mancu gasi at naradu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:12
msgid "Kealwea, the priest of Sullengard, has seen ten tongues of light falling down to earth, or so he said."
msgstr ""
"Kealwea, su preìderu de Sullengard, at bidu deghe limbas de lughe rughende a "
"terra, o a su mancu gasi at naradu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:15
msgid "Teccow asked me to investigate and bring the fallen pieces."
msgstr ""
"Teccow m'at pedidu de indagare e de li giùghere sos petzos chi fiant rutos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:17
msgid "Kealwea asked me to investigate and bring the fallen pieces."
msgstr ""
"Kealwea m'at pedidu de indagare e de li giùghere sos petzos chi fiant rutos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:20
msgid "I refused to do his work."
msgstr "Apo refudadu de fàghere su traballu suo."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:21
msgid "Teccow would be delighted, I should bring the pieces to him."
msgstr ""
"Teccow diat èssere cuntentu meda; dia dèpere giùghere sos petzos a issu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:22
msgid "Kealwea would be delighted, I should bring the pieces to him."
msgstr ""
"Kealwea diat èssere cuntentu meda; dia dèpere giùghere sos petzos a issu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:23
msgid "Kealwea or Teccow would be delighted, I should bring the pieces to one of them."
msgstr ""
"Kealwea o Teccow diant èssere cuntentos meda; dia dèpere giùghere sos petzos "
"a unu de issos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:30
msgid "I told Teccow that I have found all ten pieces. He required them so that he could destroy them."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Teccow chi apo agatadu totu sos deghe petzos. Los cheriat pro "
"los pòdere distrùere."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:32
msgid "I told Kealwea that I have found all ten pieces. He required them so that he could destroy them."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Kealwea chi apo agatadu totu sos deghe petzos. Los cheriat pro "
"los pòdere distrùere."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:40
msgid "I changed my mind and would keep these glittery things. They're too pretty to be destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Apo cambiadu idea: custas cosas lughentes mi las tèngio. Sunt tropu bellas "
"pro èssere distrutas."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:45
msgid "I gave half of the pieces to Teccow who would destroy them."
msgstr "Apo dadu sa metade de sos petzos a Teccow pro chi los distruat."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:46
msgid "I gave the other half of the pieces to Teccow who would destroy them."
msgstr "Apo dadu s'àtera metade de sos petzos a Teccow pro chi los distruat."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:47
msgid "I gave half of the pieces to Kealwea who would destroy them."
msgstr "Apo dadu sa metade de sos petzos a Kealwea pro chi los distruat."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:48
msgid "I gave the other half of the pieces to Kealwea who would destroy them."
msgstr "Apo dadu s'àtera metade de sos petzos a Kealwea pro chi los distruat."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:50
msgid "I gave the pieces to Teccow who would destroy them."
msgstr "Apo dadu sos petzos a Teccow pro chi los distruat."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:52
msgid "I gave the pieces to Kealwea who would destroy them."
msgstr "Apo dadu sos petzos a Kealwea pro chi los distruat."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:60
msgid "I gave the pieces to Pangitain who was very grateful. I felt like I was filled with warmth and wisdom."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu sos petzos a Pangitain, chi m'at ringratziadu meda. Mi so intesu "
"prenu de calore e de sabiesa."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:62
msgid "I gave the pieces to Pangitain who was very grateful."
msgstr "Apo dadu sos petzos a Pangitain, chi m'at ringratziadu meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:101
msgid "I have found a brightly shining piece of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu petzu de cristallu chi lughet meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:102
msgid "I have found a second brightly shining piece of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu unu segundu petzu de cristallu chi lughet meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:103
msgid "I have found three brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu tres petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:104
msgid "I have found four brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu bator petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:105
msgid "I have found five brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu chimbe petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:106
msgid "I have found six brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu ses petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:107
msgid "I have found seven brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu sete petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:108
msgid "I have found eight brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu oto petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:109
msgid "I have found nine brightly shining pieces of a crystal."
msgstr "Apo agatadu noe petzos de cristallu chi lughent meda."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg2_exploded_star:110
msgid "Done at last - I have found the last piece of the crystal."
msgstr "A sa fine bi so resèssidu: apo agatadu s'ùrtimu petzu de su cristallu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:swamp_healer
msgid "The swamp healer"
msgstr "Su sanadore de sa paule"

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:swamp_healer:10
msgid "I encountered Vaelric, a reclusive healer living in the swamp between Mt. Galmore and Stoutford. He refused to help me unless I dealt with a dangerous creature corrupting his medicinal pools."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Vaelric, unu sanadore solitàriu chi bivet in sa paule intre su "
"Monte Galmore e Stoutford. At refudadu de m'agiudare si non mi nde ocupaia "
"de una creadura perigulosa chi fiat avelenende sas pischinas de abbas chi "
"curant suas."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:swamp_healer:20
msgid "I defeated the monstrous creature that I found on Vaelric's land. This creature was enormous and venomous, feeding on the lifeblood of the swamp."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu sa creadura mostruosa chi apo agatadu in sas terras de Vaelric. "
"Custa creadura fiat manna meda e velenosa, e si nutriat de sa linfa vitale "
"de sa paule."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:swamp_healer:30
msgid "Vaelric rewarded me for my efforts by teaching me how to use leeches to heal bleeding wounds. He warned me to save them for dire situations and respect their power."
msgstr ""
"Comente recumpensa pro s'impignu meu, Vaelric m'at imparadu a impreare sas "
"sambisuas pro curare sas feridas chi perdent sàmbene. M'at naradu de las "
"allogare pro sos momentos de perìgulu mannu e de rispetare su podere issoro."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave
msgid "Restless in the grave"
msgstr "Chene pasu in sa tumba"

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:10
msgid "I noticed that one of the Galmore grave plots looked to have been dug-up in the not-so-distant past. I should ask Vaelric about this."
msgstr ""
"Apo notadu chi una de sas tumbas de Galmore pariat chi l'aiant iscavada non "
"meda tempus a como. Dia dèpere preguntare a Vaelric de custa cosa."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:15
msgid "I noticed that one of the Galmore grave plots looked to have been dug-up in the not-so-distant past."
msgstr ""
"Apo notadu chi una de sas tumbas de Galmore pariat chi l'aiant iscavada non "
"meda tempus a como."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:20
msgid "After I mentioned to Vaelric that the graveyard near the Galmore encampment has a dug-up grave plot, he asked me to investigate it. I agreed to look for clues."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo naradu a Vaelric chi in su campusantu acanta de su "
"campamentu de Galmore b'at una tumba iscavada, m'at pedidu de indagare. Apo "
"atzetadu de chircare indìtzios."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:30
msgid "Just outside of the graveyard, I found a bell attached to a broken rope. It was partially buried and covered by grass, but I retrieved it."
msgstr ""
"Pròpiu a foras de su campusantu, apo agatadu una campanedda ligada a una "
"fune segada. Fiat mesu interrada e coberta de erba, ma l'apo recuperada."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:40
msgid "I discovered a music box in the graveyard. It was partially buried and obscured by overgrown grass."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu un'iscàtula de mùsica in su campusantu. Fiat mesu interrada e "
"cuada dae s'erba arta."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:45
msgid "I discovered the skeletal remains of a human beneath a covering of grass and weeds. I wonder if it's related to why that grave plot is dug up?"
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu sos restos de s'ischèletru de un'èssere umanu suta de erba e "
"de erbas malas. Mi pregunto si custu est ligadu a su motivu pro ite cussa "
"tumba est iscavada."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:50
msgid "I brought the bell and music box to the Galmore encampment and encountered a ghost named Eryndor that told me the items were his. I gave them to him in exchange for being \"friends\"."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sa campanedda e s'iscàtula de mùsica a su campamentu de Galmore e "
"apo atopadu unu pantasma chi si narat Eryndor, chi m'at naradu chi sos "
"ogetos fiant sos suos. Bi los apo dados in càmbiu de èssere \"amigos\"."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:60
msgid "Eryndor told me his story and said he would leave Vaelric alone if I returned his ring. I should return to Vaelric."
msgstr ""
"Eryndor m'at contadu s'istòria sua e m'at naradu chi diat lassare in pasu a "
"Vaelric si li torraia s'aneddu suo. Dia dèpere torrare dae Vaelric."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:63
msgid "Vaelric has told me his side of the story. He claimed that Eryndor came to him desperate, in a severe condition and Vaeltic said he did everything he could to save Eryndor's life. Thinking that Eryndor was dead, Vaelric buried him."
msgstr ""
"Vaelric m'at contadu sa versione sua de s'istòria. At naradu chi Eryndor "
"fiat andadu dae issu disisperadu, in cunditziones graves, e chi issu aiat "
"fatu totu su chi podiat pro li sarvare sa vida. Pensende chi Eryndor esseret "
"mortu, Vaelric l'aiat interradu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:65
msgid "After hearing Eryndor's story, I decided that he has been wronged. I also agreed to get his ring back from Vaelric."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere intesu s'istòria de Eryndor, apo detzìdidu chi li ant fatu "
"unu tortu. Apo atzetadu fintzas de li recuperare s'aneddu dae Vaelric."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:70
msgid "I informed Vaelric of the ghost's terms, and he agreed. He also gave me Eryndor's ring and now I should return it to Eryndor."
msgstr ""
"Apo informadu a Vaelric de sas cunditziones de su pantasma, e issu at "
"atzetadu. M'at dadu fintzas s'aneddu de Eryndor e como bi lu dia dèpere "
"torrare a Eryndor."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:77
msgid "I've stolen the ring from Vaelric's attic."
msgstr "Apo furadu s'aneddu dae su pianu de susu de sa domo de Vaelric."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:80
msgid "I lied to Vaelric as I informed him that I was not able to find any clues surrounding the grave site or anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu una fàula a Vaelric: li apo naradu chi no aia pòdidu agatare "
"perunu indìtziu a inghìriu de sa tumba ne in àteru logu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:85
msgid "I brought the ring back to Eryndor. Vaelric received no relief from the haunting."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu s'aneddu a Eryndor. Vaelric no at tentu pasu dae sas "
"aparitziones."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:90
msgid "I brought the ring back to Eryndor and he agreed to stop haunting Vaelric."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu s'aneddu a Eryndor e issu at atzetadu de non persighire prus a "
"Vaelric."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:95
msgid "Vaelric rewarded me by offering to make Insectbane Tonics if I bring him the right ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Comente recumpensa, Vaelric s'est ofertu de mi fàghere Tònicos contra a sos "
"babbautzos si li giugo sos ingredientes giustos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:97
msgid "I need to bring Vaelric the following ingredients in order for him to make his \"Insectbane Tonic\": five Duskbloom flowers, five Mosquito proboscises, ten bottles of swamp water and one sample of Mudfiend goo."
msgstr ""
"Depo giùghere a Vaelric custos ingredientes pro chi issu potzat fàghere su "
"\"Tònicu contra a sos babbautzos\" suo: chimbe Frores de s'iscurigada, "
"chimbe Trumbas de tzìntzula, deghe ampullas de abba de paule e una mustra de "
"Gelatina de dimòniu de ludu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:100
msgid "I brought the ring back to Eryndor just to tell him that I've decided to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu s'aneddu a Eryndor petzi pro li nàrrere chi apo detzìdidu de mi "
"lu tènnere."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:110
msgid "When I refused to return the ring, Eryndor attacked me."
msgstr "Cando apo refudadu de torrare s'aneddu, Eryndor m'at atacadu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:111
msgid "I defeated Eryndor and prevented the hauntings of Vaelric...for now, but I feel that they will resume someday."
msgstr ""
"Apo bintu a Eryndor e apo postu fine a sas aparitziones a Vaelric... pro "
"como, ma intendo chi una die ant a torrare a cumintzare."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:115
msgid "Vaelric is now able to mix up some Insectbane tonic for me."
msgstr ""
"Como Vaelric mi podet preparare unu pagu de Tònicu contra a sos babbautzos."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:120
msgid "I've informed Vaelric that I defeated Eryndor but was not able to promise an end to the hauntings, Vaelric was dissatisfied with me and the outcome even going as far as saying that Andor is a better person than I am."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Vaelric chi apo bintu a Eryndor ma chi non podia promìtere chi "
"sas aparitziones esserent acabbadas. Vaelric no est istadu cuntentu de mene "
"e de comente est andada, e at naradu fintzas chi Andor est una persone "
"mègius de mene."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:123
msgid "Eryndor has asked me to find Celdar, a woman from Sullengard and give her the mysterious music box because he has no need for it and it's the right thing to do. I think I remember hearing that name, \"Celdar\" somewhere. Eryndor stated that Celdar is intolerant of fools and petty trades and wears a garish purple dress."
msgstr ""
"Eryndor m'at pedidu de agatare a Celdar, una fèmina de Sullengard, e de li "
"dare s'iscàtula de mùsica misteriosa, ca a issu non li serbit e est sa cosa "
"giusta de fàghere. Mi paret de àere giai intesu cussu nòmine, \"Celdar\", in "
"calicunu logu. Eryndor at naradu chi Celdar non suportat sos tontos e sos "
"negòtzios de pagu contu, e chi giughet unu bestire purpùreu chi dat in ogru."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:125
msgid "In Sullengard, Maddalena informed me that Celdar was headed for Brimhaven, but may have stopped to rest along the way as it is a long trip to Brimhaven."
msgstr ""
"In Sullengard, Maddalena m'at naradu chi Celdar fiat andende a Brimhaven, ma "
"chi forsis si fiat firmada a pasare in su caminu, ca su biàgiu finas a "
"Brimhaven est longu."

#: questlist_mt_galmore2.json:mg_restless_grave:130
msgid "I gave Celdar the 'Mysterious music box' just as Eryndor had instructed and she gave me her longsword."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu a Celdar s'Iscàtula de mùsica misteriosa, comente m'aiat naradu "
"Eryndor, e issa m'at dadu s'ispada longa sua."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons
msgid "Priceful vengeance"
msgstr "Vindita a caru prètziu"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:10
msgid "Inside a house in Brightport, I met two people named Dynes and Barthold. It turned out that they are the friends Benbyr told me to visit. Rather lacking in hospitality, they offered me work."
msgstr ""
"In una domo de Portu Lughente, apo atopadu duas persones chi si narant Dynes "
"e Barthold. Apo iscobertu chi sunt sos amigos chi Benbyr m'aiat naradu de "
"andare a bìdere. Non m'ant retzidu cun meda cortesia, ma m'ant ofertu "
"traballu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:20
msgid "Barthold was hesitant because any job I could do for them would put me at odds with Gunfryk the guard commander. Taking that into account I offered to rid them of him."
msgstr ""
"Barthold fiat indetzisu ca cale si siat traballu chi aia pòdidu fàghere pro "
"issos mi diat pònnere contra a Gunfryk, su cumandante de sas guàrdias. "
"Tenende contu de cussu, mi so ofertu de los liberare de issu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:30
msgid "I was told not to kill him, but surely it won't be a problem if I do. Either way I'll resolve things for them."
msgstr ""
"M'ant naradu de no l'ochìere, ma de seguru no at a èssere unu problema si "
"l'ochio. In una manera o in s'àtera, apo a risòlvere sas cosas pro issos."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:40
msgid "I received some records from silvear that could be useful as blackmail against Gunfryk."
msgstr ""
"Apo retzidu dae Silvear unos cantos documentos chi diant pòdere èssere "
"ùtiles pro ricatare a Gunfryk."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:60
msgid "I used the records to blackmail Gunfryk. To save his reputation he begrudgingly agreed to give Barthold and Dynes some leeway."
msgstr ""
"Apo impreadu sos documentos pro ricatare a Gunfryk. Pro sarvare sa "
"reputatzione sua, at atzetadu de mala gana de lassare unu pagu de libertade "
"a Barthold e a Dynes."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:50
msgid "I lied to the commander that there are some lizardmen in the derelict house east of town, I should go there and prepare an ambush. "
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu una fàula a su cumandante: chi b'at unos cantos òmines-"
"tziligherta in sa domo abbandonada a oriente de sa tzitade. Dia dèpere "
"andare in cue e preparare un'imbuscada. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:70
msgid "I ambushed and killed Gunfryk in the house to the east, along with the two guards he brought."
msgstr ""
"Apo fatu un'imbuscada e apo ochidu a Gunfryk in sa domo a oriente, impare "
"cun sas duas guàrdias chi aiat giutu cun issu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:80
msgid "I informed the commander about Barthold and Dynes' scheme. He requested that I find some incriminating evidence of their role. "
msgstr ""
"Apo informadu a su cumandante de su pianu de Barthold e Dynes. M'at pedidu "
"de agatare provas chi mustrent sa parte issoro. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:110
msgid "I found some of the duo's merchandise in the smuggling cave east of brightport. "
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu una parte de sa mercantzia de sos duos in sa gruta de su "
"contrabbandu a oriente de Portu Lughente. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:130
msgid "I opted to blackmail the duo instead for some quick gold. Should've had the Guild's protection, suckers!"
msgstr ""
"Imbetzes, apo preferidu de ricatare a sos duos pro balangiare unas cantas "
"monedas de oro a sa lestra. Diais dèpere àere tentu s'amparu de su Grèmiu, "
"tontos!"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:135
msgid "I told the commander I couldn't find anything"
msgstr "Apo naradu a su cumandante chi no aia pòdidu agatare nudda"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:136
msgid "Barthold was disappointed in me for having done nothing about Gunfryk. Little did he know I lined my pockets with his merchandise."
msgstr ""
"Barthold fiat delùdidu cun megus ca no aia fatu nudda contra a Gunfryk. Non "
"podiat ischire chi mi fia prenadu sas butzacas cun sa mercantzia sua."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:90
msgid "Barthold was happy with my work and gave me a reward, he said I could find more work like this in Nor City. "
msgstr ""
"Barthold fiat cuntentu de su traballu meu e m'at dadu una recumpensa; m'at "
"naradu chi in Nor City dia pòdere agatare àteros traballos comente custu. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:100
msgid "Barthold was a little disappointed about me killing Gunfryk. It's possible that now Feygard might take more severe action with Brightport."
msgstr ""
"Barthold fiat unu pagu delùdidu ca apo ochidu a Gunfryk. Est possìbile chi "
"como Feygard leet provedimentos prus severos contra a Portu Lughente."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:120
msgid "Gunfryk was happy with my work, the duo will soon be jailed. He said Feygard needs more brave youngsters like me and that I should give the military academy a try."
msgstr ""
"Gunfryk fiat cuntentu de su traballu meu: sos duos ant a èssere luego postos "
"in presone. M'at naradu chi Feygard tenet bisòngiu de prus giòvanos "
"coragiosos che a mie e chi dia dèpere proare s'acadèmia militare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:119
msgid "I gave the commander the blade, even though I already got paid not to. If there's any honor among Nor City's thieves, they will surely have none to spare for me."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu sa lama a su cumandante, mancari m'aerent giai pagadu pro no lu "
"fàghere. Si b'at un'onore intre sos ladros de Nor City, de seguru non nd'ant "
"a tènnere pro mene."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons:140
msgid "I told the commander I couldn't find anything, even though I had the blade I blackmailed Barthold and Dynes with."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a su cumandante chi no aia pòdidu agatare nudda, mentras chi in "
"realidade tenia sa lama cun sa cale aia ricatadu a Barthold e a Dynes."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest
msgid "No rest for the wicked"
msgstr "Pro sos malos non b'at pasu"

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:5
msgid "I arrived at Brightport's school, only to be told that Stanwick is not allowed visitors."
msgstr ""
"So lòmpidu a s'iscola de Portu Lughente, ma m'ant naradu chi Stanwick non "
"podet retzire bìsitas."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:10
msgid "Janwick, Stanwick's grandfather, mistook me for Andor and asked me to deliver some fresh fruit to Stanwick."
msgstr ""
"Janwick, su giaju de Stanwick, m'at leadu pro Andor e m'at pedidu de "
"giùghere unu pagu de fruta frisca a Stanwick."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:15
msgid "I was allowed to visit Stanwick."
msgstr "M'ant permìtidu de bisitare a Stanwick."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:16
msgid "I learned that Stanwick is under investigation as the main suspect in the disappearance of an important scroll from the school library."
msgstr ""
"Apo ischidu chi Stanwick est suta de inchesta comente primu suspetadu de "
"s'isparimentu de una pergamena importante de sa biblioteca de s'iscola."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:20
msgid "Stanwick has something important to tell me about Andor, but I must help him first."
msgstr ""
"Stanwick tenet una cosa importante de mi nàrrere subra de Andor, ma in antis "
"lu depo agiudare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:25
msgid "I agreed to help Stanwick find the culprit responsible for the theft. I should look for clues around the school."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Stanwick a agatare su culpàbile de sa fura. Dia "
"dèpere chircare indìtzios in s'iscola."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:30
msgid "Milena, the school cook, told me that last year she noticed a dark figure sneaking off from the living quarters."
msgstr ""
"Milena, sa coghinera de s'iscola, m'at naradu chi s'annu passadu at bidu una "
"figura iscura chi si nde fuiat a cua dae sos aposentos de sos istudiantes."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:31
msgid "Dibella, the lady at the desk at the entrance, told me that Stanwick has a respectable reputation, but as the library supervisor he must be considered a suspect. "
msgstr ""
"Dibella, sa sennora de su bancone de s'intrada, m'at naradu chi Stanwick "
"tenet una bona reputatzione, ma chi, comente responsàbile de sa biblioteca, "
"depet èssere cunsideradu suspetadu. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:35
msgid "Oswald, the Headmaster, expressed his disbelief that Stanwick is guilty of the theft and accepted my help in finding the document, whilst insisting that it be returned to him."
msgstr ""
"Oswald, su diretore, at naradu chi non podet crèere chi Stanwick siat "
"culpàbile de sa fura e at atzetadu s'agiudu meu pro agatare su documentu, ma "
"at insìstidu chi li siat torradu a issu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:40
msgid "Frederich, the history teacher who moved in from Feygard, believes Stanwick is associated with \"Those Nor City savages\" and was told by them to steal the document."
msgstr ""
"Frederich, su maistru de istòria bènnidu dae Feygard, creet chi Stanwick "
"siat ligadu a \"Cussos bàrbaros de Nor City\" e chi issos li apant naradu de "
"furare su documentu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:45
msgid "Franz, the math teacher, told me that the most logical thing to do is to investigate the library, which is sealed. I must find a way to access it."
msgstr ""
"Franz, su maistru de matemàtica, m'at naradu chi sa cosa prus lògica de "
"fàghere est a indagare in sa biblioteca, chi est sigillada. Depo agatare una "
"manera de bi intrare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:46
msgid "I asked the Headmaster for access to the library, but he denied my request."
msgstr ""
"Apo pedidu a su diretore de pòdere intrare in sa biblioteca, ma at refudadu "
"sa rechesta mea."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:47
msgid "I stole the library key from the Headmaster's desk while he was distracted. Hopefully there will be no consequences."
msgstr ""
"Apo furadu sa crae de sa biblioteca dae s'iscrivania de su diretore mentras "
"fiat distratu. Ispero chi non bi siant cunseguèntzias."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:50
msgid "Counterfeit, a thieves guild member in the basement of the Brightport warehouse, gave me a copy of the library key. "
msgstr ""
"Falsàriu, unu membru de su Grèmiu de sos Ladros in sa cantina de su magasinu "
"de Portu Lughente, m'at dadu una còpia de sa crae de sa biblioteca. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:55
msgid "In the library's basement archive, I found a record of a baker named Bryma requesting to read the secret scroll, but she was denied. I should seek out her whereabouts."
msgstr ""
"In s'archìviu de sa cantina de sa biblioteca, apo agatadu unu registru de "
"una panetera chi si narat Bryma chi aiat pedidu de lèghere sa pergamena "
"segreta, ma non bi l'aiant permìtidu. Dia dèpere ischire in ue est."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:60
msgid "Richimor, the old man sitting by the lake shore in Brightport, was an acquaintance of Bryma. He said she left Brightport many years ago and did not tell him where she went, but she left a large part of her research material at his house. I should check it."
msgstr ""
"Richimor, su betzu sètzidu in s'oru de su lagu in Portu Lughente, "
"connoschiat a Bryma. M'at naradu chi si nch'est andada dae Portu Lughente "
"medas annos a como e non li at naradu a ue fiat andada, ma at lassadu una "
"parte manna de su materiale de sas chircas suas in domo sua. Dia dèpere "
"andare a bìdere."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:65
msgid "Inside Richimor's house, I found a bundle of papers left by Bryma. In there, amongst the trivial writings, one paper stood out as it talked about four strange statues in the vicinity of Brightport."
msgstr ""
"In domo de Richimor, apo agatadu unu fasche de pabiros lassados dae Bryma. "
"In mesu de sos iscritos de pagu contu, b'aiat unu pabiru chi si distinghiat "
"ca faeddaiat de bator istàtuas istranas in sos inghìrios de Portu Lughente."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:66
msgid "I discovered a strange statue in the forest south of Brightport, with several indecipherable symbols. Perhaps this is one of the statues mentioned in the writings of Bryma."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu un'istàtua istrana in su padente a sud de Portu Lughente, cun "
"unos cantos sìmbulos chi non si podent cumprèndere. Forsis est una de sas "
"istàtuas chi mentovat Bryma in sos iscritos suos."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:70
msgid "I examined a statue north of Brightport. Carved into the statue were the symbols for the letters L and H."
msgstr ""
"Apo esaminadu un'istàtua a nord de Portu Lughente. In s'istàtua b'aiat "
"isculpidos sos sìmbulos de sas lìteras L e H."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:75
msgid "I examined a statue southeast of Brightport. Carved into the statue were the symbols for the letters T and E."
msgstr ""
"Apo esaminadu un'istàtua a sud-est de Portu Lughente. In s'istàtua b'aiat "
"isculpidos sos sìmbulos de sas lìteras T e E."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:80
msgid "I examined a statue far west of Brightport. Carved into the statue were the symbols for the letters A, G, and R."
msgstr ""
"Apo esaminadu un'istàtua meda a otzidente de Portu Lughente. In s'istàtua "
"b'aiat isculpidos sos sìmbulos de sas lìteras A, G e R."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:84
msgid "The puzzle is proving itself to be very difficult. I should return to the library in Brightport to search for clues"
msgstr ""
"S'indevìngiu est difìtzile meda. Dia dèpere torrare a sa biblioteca de Portu "
"Lughente pro chircare indìtzios"

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:85
msgid "I spoke the activation word to the statue in the forest, and can now move further."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu sa paràula de ativatzione a s'istàtua de su padente, e como potzo "
"andare prus a in antis."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:86
msgid "Inside the forest was a cabin, in which I found Bryma and some strange creature made of bread."
msgstr ""
"In su padente b'aiat una barraca, e in intro b'apo agatadu a Bryma e una "
"creadura istrana fata de pane."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:92
msgid "I received the secret scroll from Bryma. I should return it to the headmaster now."
msgstr ""
"Bryma m'at dadu sa pergamena segreta. Como la dia dèpere torrare a su "
"diretore."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:95
msgid "I threatened Bryma to make her hand over the scroll. She gave it to me as she did not intend to keep it anyway."
msgstr ""
"Apo minetzadu a Bryma pro mi fàghere dare sa pergamena. Mi l'at dada ca, in "
"cale si siat manera, non teniat intentzione de si la tènnere."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:96
msgid "I returned the secret scroll to the Headmaster and Stanwick was cleared of all suspicion. I should inform him."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu sa pergamena segreta a su diretore e Stanwick est istadu "
"liberadu de totu sos suspetos. Lu dia dèpere informare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:97
msgid "I did not receive any reward."
msgstr "No apo retzidu peruna recumpensa."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:100
msgid "I received a reward from the Headmaster for having returned the scroll."
msgstr ""
"Apo retzidu una recumpensa dae su diretore pro àere torradu sa pergamena."

#: questlist_brightport.json:Stanwickquest:110
msgid "I informed Stanwick and he was relieved to hear the news."
msgstr "Apo informadu a Stanwick, e issu s'est asseliadu a intèndere sa nova."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery
msgid "Bread and circus"
msgstr "Pane e giogos"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:1
msgid "I've started some work for Allares at the bakery in Brightport. He asked me to help Delon down in the storage area."
msgstr ""
"Apo cumintzadu a fàghere unu traballu pro Allares in sa paneteria de Portu "
"Lughente. M'at pedidu de agiudare a Delon, in su magasinu de bàsciu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:5
msgid "I spoke with Delon and he's a real slacker. He wants me to do all sorts of work, all by myself."
msgstr ""
"Apo faeddadu cun Delon e est unu mandrone a beru. Cheret chi fatza totu sa "
"genia de traballos, totu a solu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:10
msgid "He told me to start by sweeping the floor, and to do that I must find a broom."
msgstr ""
"M'at naradu de cumintzare mundende su pamentu, e pro lu fàghere depo agatare "
"un'iscoba."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:15
msgid "The floor's all swept. I did it all by myself. Delon's \"help\" was more of a nuisance."
msgstr ""
"Su pamentu est totu mundadu. L'apo fatu totu a solu. Su chi Delon mutit "
"\"agiudu\" est istadu prus un'istorbu chi no àteru."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:16
msgid "No wonder it got so quiet. Delon disappeared to sleep on some sacks. And now I have a new task, to sift through some flour."
msgstr ""
"Pro cussu fiat totu gasi chietu! Delon est isparidu pro dormire subra de "
"unos cantos sacos. E como tèngio un'incàrrigu nou: sedatzare unu pagu de "
"farina."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:19
msgid "I've sifted through all of the flour."
msgstr "Apo sedatzadu totu sa farina."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:20
msgid "One last errand. An apple delivery hasn't arrived. I should ask Allares about it."
msgstr ""
"Un'ùrtimu incàrrigu. Una cunsigna de melas no est arribada. Dia dèpere "
"preguntare a Allares."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:22
msgid "Allares refuses to accept my help until I prove my capabilities by bringing him one piece of deer meat."
msgstr ""
"Allares refudat s'agiudu meu finas a cando non li giugo unu bìculu de petza "
"de cherbu pro mustrare su chi isco fàghere."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:23
msgid "After bringing the deer meat to Allares, he accepted my help, I should speak to Eatloni outside."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo batidu sa petza de cherbu a Allares, at atzetadu s'agiudu "
"meu. Dia dèpere faeddare cun Eatloni, in foras."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:25
msgid "According to Eatloni, the order of 30 apples never arrived. I should visit Deebo's Orchard to check if the order had been picked up."
msgstr ""
"Segundu Eatloni, s'òrdine de 30 melas no est mai arribadu. Dia dèpere andare "
"a s'Ortu de Deebo pro bìdere si calicunu l'aiat giai leadu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:30
msgid "I went to see Deebo at the orchard. Apparently the merchant sent by Eatloni already picked up the apples."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a bìdere a Deebo in s'ortu. A su chi paret, su mercante mandadu "
"dae Eatloni aiat giai leadu sas melas."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:35
msgid "I found some half-eaten apples in the woods north of the Duleian road."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu unas cantas melas mesu papadas in su padente a nord de s'àndala "
"duleiana."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:40
msgid "I found two crates of apples. One was intact, but the other was empty. Did the mountain cats attack the merchant for food to feed their cubs?"
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu duas càssias de melas. Una fiat intrea, ma s'àtera fiat bòida. "
"Sos gatos de monte ant atacadu su mercante pro tènnere màndigu pro sos "
"cadeddos issoro?"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:45
msgid "I paid for a new shipment out of my own pocket. Deebo promised to hurry his workers and get them picked quickly. I should receive them from the orchard supervisor."
msgstr ""
"Apo pagadu una cunsigna noa de butzaca mea. Deebo at promìtidu de fàghere "
"presse a sos traballadores suos pro chi las collant luego. Las dia dèpere "
"retzire dae su responsàbile de s'ortu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:50
msgid "I received the apples from Alduan."
msgstr "Apo retzidu sas melas dae Alduan."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:60
msgid "I brought the apples back to Eatloni. He reimbursed me for half the cost. Time to let Allares know I'm done with everything."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sas melas a Eatloni. M'at torradu sa metade de su chi aia ispesu. "
"Est ora de nàrrere a Allares chi apo acabbadu totu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:65
msgid "I brought the apples back to Eatloni. Time to let Allares know I'm done with everything."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu sas melas a Eatloni. Est ora de nàrrere a Allares chi apo "
"acabbadu totu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_bakery:70
msgid "I completed all the tasks at the bakery."
msgstr "Apo acabbadu totu sos incàrrigos de sa paneteria."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma
msgid "Too hot to handle"
msgstr "Tropu caente pro la tènnere in manu"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:5
msgid "Fiamma, the swordsmith of Brightport. Is willing to forge me a sword if I can bring him the materials."
msgstr ""
"Fiamma, su ferreri chi faghet ispadas in Portu Lughente, est dispostu a mi "
"fraigare un'ispada si li giugo sos materiales."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:10
msgid "In the mountains near the road to Remgard lies a dangerous area overrun by Arulirs, beasts with skin as tough as steel."
msgstr ""
"In sos montes acanta de s'àndala de Remgard b'at una zona perigulosa prena "
"de arulir, bèstias cun sa pedde tosta che a s'atzàrgiu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:15
msgid "Fiamma has asked for a strip of Arulir skin, coveted for its durability and flexibility. He also requires 15 cold lava rocks from the mountain cave, which burn hotter than any ordinary coal."
msgstr ""
"Fiamma m'at pedidu una tira de pedde de arulir, disigiada ca est resistente "
"e si pìnnigat bene. Tenet bisòngiu fintzas de 15 pedras de lava frita de sa "
"gruta de su monte, chi brùsiant prus caentes de cale si siat carbone normale."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:20
msgid "The final material is a red crystal from a Gornaud, a ferocious beast that sometimes forms these rare crystals in its body."
msgstr ""
"S'ùrtimu materiale est unu cristallu ruju de unu gornaud, una bèstia ferotze "
"chi a bortas format custos cristallos raros in su corpus suo."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:25
msgid "I brought Fiamma the arulir skin and lava rocks."
msgstr "Apo batidu a Fiamma sa pedde de arulir e sas pedras de lava."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:30
msgid "I brought Fiamma the red crystal."
msgstr "Apo batidu a Fiamma su cristallu ruju."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:35
msgid "I gave all the materials to Fiamma. He thanked me and told me to come back later when it's finished."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu totu sos materiales a Fiamma. M'at ringratziadu e m'at naradu de "
"torrare prus a tardu, cando at a èssere acabbada."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:40
msgid "To my surprise, the sword he forged heats up on contact with air and requires special gloves to handle. They are made of the Arulir skin I brought."
msgstr ""
"A s'ispantu meu, s'ispada chi at fraigadu s'iscaldit a cuntatu cun s'àera e "
"bi cherent guantes ispetziales pro la tènnere in manu. Sunt fatos cun sa "
"pedde de arulir chi apo batidu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:45
msgid "I asked Fiamma to give me something else, and he gave me a very sharp glaive."
msgstr ""
"Apo pedidu a Fiamma de mi dare un'àtera cosa, e m'at dadu unu farchione "
"afiladu meda."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_fiamma:50
msgid "I thanked Fiamma and went on my merry way."
msgstr ""
"Apo ringratziadu a Fiamma e mi nde so andadu cuntentu pro su caminu meu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves
msgid "Boxed in"
msgstr "Serradu in sa càscia"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:10
msgid "The Thieves Guild was due to receive a package, but the guards in Brightport have been impeding their activities. They need a new face like me to pick the package up discretly. I was told to head east of the town."
msgstr ""
"Su Grèmiu de sos Ladros depiat retzire unu pacu, ma sas guàrdias de Portu "
"Lughente sunt istorbende sas atividades issoro. Tenent bisòngiu de una cara "
"noa che a mie pro leare su pacu cun discretzione. M'ant naradu de andare a "
"oriente de sa tzitade."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:20
msgid "I met the courier from Nor City inside the house."
msgstr "Apo atopadu in sa domo a s'òmine mandadu dae Nor City."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:30
msgid "Before we could conclude the meeting we heard the town guard making noise outside."
msgstr ""
"In antis de pòdere acabbare s'addòbiu, amus intesu sas guàrdias de sa "
"tzitade faghende remore in foras."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:32
msgid "I received the package."
msgstr "Apo retzidu su pacu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:35
msgid "Thanks to some previous interactions I've had with the commander, I convinced the guards to let me go."
msgstr ""
"Pro more de unos cantos tratos chi aia tentu in antis cun su cumandante, apo "
"cumbintu sas guàrdias a mi lassare andare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:40
msgid "I couldn't fool the guards and got caught."
msgstr "Non so resèssidu a ingannare sas guàrdias e m'ant leadu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:45
msgid "I managed to hide inside a crate and waited. Eventually, the guards left. "
msgstr ""
"So resèssidu a mi cuare in intro de una càssia e apo isetadu. A s'urtimada, "
"sas guàrdias si nche sunt andadas. "

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:50
msgid "I delivered the package to Elysa, She was pleased with my work and said the Thieves Guild may have further opportunities for me in the future."
msgstr ""
"Apo cunsignadu su pacu a Elysa. Fiat cuntenta de su traballu meu e m'at "
"naradu chi su Grèmiu de sos Ladros diat pòdere tènnere àteras ocasiones pro "
"mene in su benidore."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:60
msgid "I lied to Gunfryk in a plot to kill him, and in the process the courier I was supposed to meet got arrested."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu una fàula a Gunfryk in unu pianu pro l'ochìere, e in su matessi "
"tempus s'òmine mandadu dae Nor City chi depia atopare est istadu arrestadu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_thieves:70
msgid "I failed to deliver the package to Elysa. She was not happy."
msgstr "Non so resèssidu a cunsignare su pacu a Elysa. No est istada cuntenta."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard
msgid "The balance of scales"
msgstr "S'echilìbriu de sas iscatas"

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:1
msgid "In the rundown mysterious basement behind Bryma's house, I encountered a humanoid green creature that fled beyond a pile of cave rubble."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina misteriosa e mesu isfata in palas de sa domo de Bryma, apo "
"atopadu una creadura birde de aspetu umanu chi si nch'est fuida a s'àtera "
"parte de unu muntone de pedras rutas de sa gruta."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:5
msgid "When I questioned Bryma about the creature, she explained that lizardmen live in the caves beneath her house and have been bothering her for some time."
msgstr ""
"Cando apo preguntadu a Bryma de sa creadura, m'at ispiegadu chi in sas "
"grutas suta de sa domo sua bivent òmines-tziligherta e chi dae unu tempus la "
"sunt istorbende."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:10
msgid "I agreed to help Bryma with her problem. She shared the activation phrase for another statue leading deeper into the forest."
msgstr ""
"Apo atzetadu de agiudare a Bryma cun su problema suo. M'at naradu sa frase "
"de ativatzione de un'àtera istàtua chi giughet prus a fundu in su padente."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:15
msgid "After navigating through the caves, I reached an open chamber beyond the rubble, where I found the lizardman again."
msgstr ""
"A pustis de àere caminadu in mesu de sas grutas, so lòmpidu a un'aposentu "
"abertu a s'àtera parte de sas pedras rutas, in ue apo agatadu torra s'òmine-"
"tziligherta."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:20
msgid "The lizardman regarded me suspiciously, calling me an intruder. He claimed Bryma had been stealing bones from their ancestral tomb, which his people were trying to recover."
msgstr ""
"S'òmine-tziligherta m'at abbaidadu cun suspetu e m'at acusadu de èssere "
"intradu chene permissu. At naradu chi Bryma fiat furende ossos dae sa tumba "
"de sos antepassados issoro, e chi sa gente sua fiat chirchende de los "
"recuperare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:25
msgid "I attacked the lizardman, but my attack merely grazed it, before it fled deeper into the caves."
msgstr ""
"Apo atacadu s'òmine-tziligherta, ma l'apo tocadu a pena, e si nch'est fuidu "
"prus a fundu in sas grutas."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:30
msgid "I tried to calm Emyro's worries. He hesitated but told me to visit their leader before disappearing into the shadows."
msgstr ""
"Apo chircadu de asseliare sos pensamentos de Emyro. Fiat indetzisu, ma m'at "
"naradu de andare a bìdere su cabu issoro, in antis de isparire in s'iscuru."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:32
msgid "I tracked down and killed the lizardmen's leader, Elyzard."
msgstr ""
"Apo sighidu sas rastas de su cabu de sos òmines-tziligherta, Elyzard, e "
"l'apo ochidu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:35
msgid "I killed the rest of those slimy lizards. Bryma can now rest free."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu su restu de cussas tzilighertas ischifosas. Como Bryma podet "
"istare in pasu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:36
msgid "I received a reward from Bryma for getting rid of the creatures."
msgstr ""
"Apo retzidu una recumpensa dae Bryma pro l'àere liberada de cussas creaduras."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:40
msgid "To earn the trust of the tribe's leader, Elyzard. I swore to return the 13 stolen bones."
msgstr ""
"Pro balangiare sa cunfiàntzia de su cabu de sa tribù, Elyzard, apo giuradu "
"de torrare sos 13 ossos furados."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:50
msgid "To my astonishment, I discovered that Bryma had ground the bones into dust for her research and fertilizer experiments."
msgstr ""
"A s'ispantu meu, apo iscobertu chi Bryma aiat mòlidu sos ossos e nd'aiat "
"fatu prùere pro sas chircas suas e pro sos esperimentos suos de ingrassu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:55
msgid "Bryma suggested I retrieve replacement bones from other sources. She advised hunting the hostile red lizardmen in the nearby area until I could gather the required amount."
msgstr ""
"Bryma m'at cussigiadu de agatare àteros ossos in àteros logos pro los "
"sostituire. M'at cussigiadu de catzare sos òmines-tziligherta rujos e "
"nemigos de sos inghìrios finas a regòllere sa cantidade chi bi cheret."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:60
msgid "I delivered the bones to Elyzard, who acknowledged my effort but requested one more task. He instructed me to visit the Shadow Chaplain's cave for further guidance."
msgstr ""
"Apo cunsignadu sos ossos a Elyzard, chi at reconnotu s'impignu meu ma m'at "
"pedidu un'àteru incàrrigu. M'at naradu de andare a sa gruta de su capellanu "
"de s'Umbra pro àere àteras indicatziones."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:65
msgid "From Dominio, the Shadow chaplain, I learned that beasts of darkness were attacking the tribe from an ancient ruin on the western side of the cave."
msgstr ""
"Dae Dominio, su capellanu de s'Umbra, apo ischidu chi unas bèstias de "
"s'iscuru fiant atachende sa tribù dae unas ruinas antigas in sa parte "
"otzidentale de sa gruta."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:70
msgid "To stop the attacks, I was tasked with destroying two crystals within the ruins by chanting the phrase \"Kazaul thu'um kha'zan\" before striking them."
msgstr ""
"Pro firmare sos atacos, depia distrùere duos cristallos in intro de sas "
"ruinas, cantende sa frase \"Kazaul thu'um kha'zan\" in antis de los corfire."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:75
msgid "I destroyed the first crystal."
msgstr "Apo distrutu su primu cristallu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:80
msgid "I destroyed the second crystal."
msgstr "Apo distrutu su segundu cristallu."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:90
msgid "Elyzard recognized my effort, and rewarded me with a trinbal artifact."
msgstr ""
"Elyzard at reconnotu s'impignu meu, e m'at dadu comente recumpensa "
"un'artefatu de sa tribù."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:95
msgid "I offered the lizardmen a deal of cooperation to supply Bryma with animal bones as a sign of mutual respect."
msgstr ""
"Apo propostu a sos òmines-tziligherta unu patu de collaboratzione: dare "
"ossos de animales a Bryma comente sinnu de rispetu a pare a pare."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:100
msgid "Bryma agreed to stop intruding on the lizardmen's tomb, as they promised to supply her with bones for her research."
msgstr ""
"Bryma at atzetadu de non pònnere prus pee in sa tumba de sos òmines-"
"tziligherta, ca issos ant promìtidu de li dare ossos pro sas chircas suas."

#: questlist_brightport.json:brightport_lizard:110
msgid "Bryma agreed to stop intruding on the lizardmen's tomb."
msgstr ""
"Bryma at atzetadu de non pònnere prus pee in sa tumba de sos òmines-"
"tziligherta."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map
msgid "A map of the Great Lake Laeroth"
msgstr "Una mapa de su Lagu Mannu de Laeroth"

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:10
msgid "The cartographer Thyrope Splathershed asked me to join an expedition to get the maps of Lake Laeroth completed."
msgstr ""
"Su cartògrafu Thyrope Splathershed m'at pedidu de m'aunire a un'ispeditzione "
"pro cumpletare sas mapas de su Lagu Laeroth."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:12
msgid "I should get beeswax from Leofric the beekeeper to make earplugs."
msgstr ""
"Dia dèpere leare chera de abes dae Leofric, s'abiàrgiu, pro fàghere tapos "
"pro sas origras."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:20
msgid "On a paradisiacal island, A woman named Kalypso welcomed me and offered refreshment."
msgstr ""
"In un'ìsula chi pariat unu paradisu, una fèmina chi si narat Calipso m'at "
"retzidu e m'at ofertu de ite mandigare e bufare."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:22
msgid "I took a single grape to try her food. It gave me an extraordinary boost to my vigor."
msgstr ""
"Apo leadu unu granu de ua pro tastare su màndigu suo. M'at dadu una fortza "
"istraordinària."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:24
msgid "Kalypso gave me a tiny green key as a present."
msgstr "Calipso m'at regaladu una crae birde minuda."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:26
msgid "I realized that I didn't have a desire to leave anymore."
msgstr "Mi so abbigiadu chi no aia prus gana de mi nde andare."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:28
msgid "Once the magic had worn off, I was able to leave the island again."
msgstr ""
"Cando sa màgia at acabbadu de fàghere efetu, apo pòdidu lassare torra "
"s'ìsula."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:30
msgid "You met Circe, a strange, lonely woman who kept pigs in her kitchen."
msgstr ""
"As atopadu a Circe, una fèmina istrana e sola chi teniat porcos in sa "
"coghina sua."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:31
msgid "We docked at an unknown island. Captain Burry and his men set off to replenish supplies."
msgstr ""
"Amus atracadu in un'ìsula disconnota. Su capitanu Burry e sos òmines suos "
"sunt partidos pro si fàghere provista."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:32
msgid "The ship was abandoned. Something was strange about that Circe, I decided to question her."
msgstr ""
"Sa nave fiat abbandonada. Cussa Circe teniat calicuna cosa de istranu, e apo "
"detzìdidu de l'interrogare."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:34
msgid "I realized that the Captain and his crew had been turned into pigs, and I forced Circe to turn them back."
msgstr ""
"Mi so abbigiadu chi su capitanu e s'echipàgiu suo fiant istados trasformados "
"in porcos, e apo fortzadu a Circe a los torrare a comente fiant."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:36
msgid "Impressed, Circe gave me a golden key as a parting gift."
msgstr ""
"Impressionada, Circe m'at dadu una crae dorada comente regalu de saludu."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:40
msgid "We approached the Sirens' Reef. Many sailors have lost their lives here. Captain Burry refused to sail any further."
msgstr ""
"Nos semus acurtziados a sas Rocas de sas Sirenas. Inoghe medas marineris ant "
"pèrdidu sa vida. Su capitanu Burry at refudadu de navigare prus a in antis."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:42
msgid "I distributed earplugs to the crew so that the sirens' songs could no longer harm them."
msgstr ""
"Apo distribuidu tapos pro sas origras a s'echipàgiu pro chi sos cantos de "
"sas sirenas no esserent prus perigulosos pro issos."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:44
msgid "Then I put in earplugs too."
msgstr "A pustis mi so postu fintzas deo sos tapos pro sas origras."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:46
msgid "I had myself tied tightly to the mast so that I could hear what the sirens were singing without jumping overboard."
msgstr ""
"Mi so fatu ligare bene a s'àrbore de sa nave pro pòdere intèndere su chi "
"fiant cantende sas sirenas chene mi ghetare a s'abba."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:48
msgid "We have managed to passage by the Sirens' cliff."
msgstr "Semus resèssidos a passare a costadu de sa roca de sas Sirenas."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:50
msgid "I was exploring a cave on an island with just sheep, when suddenly the dwarvish cyclops Polyphem enters, together with a flock of sheep. Polyphem has locked the door behind him."
msgstr ""
"Fia esplorende una gruta in un'ìsula in ue b'aiat petzi berbeghes, cando "
"totu in una intrat su tziclope nanu Polifemu, impare cun una tropa de "
"berbeghes. Polifemu at serradu sa ghenna in palas suas."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:52
msgid "He and his brothers would eat me in the next days."
msgstr "Issu e sos frades suos mi diant papare in sas dies chi benint."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:54
msgid "Polyphem fell onto his bed and immediatly began to snore. I should find a way to leave."
msgstr ""
"Polifemu s'est ghetadu in su letu suo e deretu at cumintzadu a roncare. Dia "
"dèpere agatare una manera pro mi nde andare."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:55
msgid "I made a strong soap solution."
msgstr "Apo fatu una solutzione forte de sabone."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:56
msgid "And poured it directly into Polyphem's eye."
msgstr "E l'apo ghetada deretu in s'ogru de Polifemu."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:57
msgid "Polyphem let all the sheep out so he could more easily search the cave for me. As he did so, he felt each sheep's back and counted them."
msgstr ""
"Polifemu at fatu essire totu sas berbeghes pro mi pòdere chircare prus a sa "
"fàtzile in sa gruta. Mentras lu faghiat, tocaiat s'ischina de cada berbeghe "
"e las contaiat."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:58
msgid "I hung myself from the side of a strong sheep to let it pull me to freedom."
msgstr ""
"Mi so apicadu a unu costadu de una berbeghe forte pro chi mi giugheret a sa "
"libertade."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:59
msgid "It worked! I've left the cave."
msgstr "At funtzionadu! So essidu dae sa gruta."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:60
msgid "Scylla, the six headed monster, had attacked our ship."
msgstr "Scilla, su mostru de ses concas, aiat atacadu sa nave nostra."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:62
msgid "We managed to defeat one of Scylla's monstrous heads. Rather than weakening her, however, this only seemed to make her more furious."
msgstr ""
"Semus resèssidos a bìnchere una de sas concas mostruosas de Scilla. Ma "
"imbetzes de l'indebilitare, custu pariat chi la faghiat petzi prus furiosa."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:64
msgid "We managed to defeat another one of Scylla's monstrous heads. We better had not..."
msgstr ""
"Semus resèssidos a bìnchere un'àtera de sas concas mostruosas de Scilla. "
"Mègius si no l'aeremus fatu..."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:70
msgid "We were swept into the abyss of the maelstrom along with the ship."
msgstr "Su remolinu nos at tiradu a intro de s'abissu suo, impare cun sa nave."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:78
msgid "At last we resurfaced again."
msgstr "A s'urtimada semus torrados a galla."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:900
msgid "Looks like we had got the map of the great Lake Laeroth complete."
msgstr "Paret chi amus cumpletadu sa mapa de su Lagu Mannu de Laeroth."

#: questlist_lake_laeroth_2.json:lake_map:910
msgid "Thyrope Splathershed is happy to have the map complete now. He seemed to doubt my story though, but he allowed me to use the ship for my leisure."
msgstr ""
"Thyrope Splathershed est cuntentu de tènnere como sa mapa cumpleta. Pariat "
"chi non creeret a s'istòria mea, ma m'at permìtidu de impreare sa nave pro "
"su praghere meu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge
msgid "A place to forge"
msgstr "Unu logu pro fraigare"

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:10
msgid "Nocmar refused to forge heartsteel in his shop, fearing discovery by Geomyr's men. He revealed that he once owned a glowing white house south of Fallhaven, where a special forge still burns. That forge was the only place he ever worked heartsteel. But after falling into debt, he lost the house to Alkapoan. If Nocmar is to forge again, I must help him regain it."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar at refudadu de fraigare atzàrgiu de coro in sa butega sua, pro "
"timòria de èssere iscobertu dae sos òmines de Geomyr. M'at naradu chi una "
"borta fiat su mere de una domo bianca lughente a sud de Fallhaven, in ue "
"b'at galu unu forru ispetziale allutu. Cussu forru fiat s'ùnicu logu in ue "
"aiat mai traballadu s'atzàrgiu de coro. Ma a pustis de s'èssere prenu de "
"dèpidos, at pèrdidu sa domo, chi est andada a Alkapoan. Si Nocmar at a "
"torrare a fraigare, lu depo agiudare a la recuperare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:20
msgid "Nocmar told me that Alkapoan holds the deed and key to the glowing white house. He said the forge within never dies, always blazing, ready for work. If I can reclaim the deed and key from Alkapoan, Nocmar will finally have his forge back."
msgstr ""
"Nocmar m'at naradu chi Alkapoan tenet s'atu de propiedade e sa crae de sa "
"domo bianca lughente. At naradu chi su forru chi b'est a intro non s'istudat "
"mai: est semper allutu, prontu pro traballare. Si potzo recuperare dae "
"Alkapoan s'atu e sa crae, Nocmar at a tènnere torra, a s'urtimada, su forru "
"suo."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:30
msgid "Alkapoan scoffed when I mentioned Nocmar. He said the only way to reclaim the glowing white house is to pay him fifty thousand gold. Nothing else will satisfy him."
msgstr ""
"Alkapoan s'est postu a rìere cando apo mentovadu a Nocmar. At naradu chi "
"s'ùnica manera de recuperare sa domo bianca lughente est de li pagare "
"chimbanta mìgia monedas de oro. Nudda àteru l'at a acuntentare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:35
msgid "I told Alkapoan I wanted the glowing white house for myself. He agreed to sell it for forty thousand gold, but only if I first complete a task for him to prove my worth."
msgstr ""
"Apo naradu a Alkapoan chi cheria sa domo bianca lughente pro mene. At "
"atzetadu de mi la bèndere pro baranta mìgia monedas de oro, ma petzi si in "
"antis fatzo unu traballu pro issu pro mustrare chi so bonu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:40
msgid "Alkapoan asked me to collect an overdue 'operation tax' of five thousand gold from a card dealer in the back room of Brimhaven's tavern. I'll need to go there and retrieve the gold for Alkapoan before he will sell me the deed to the white house for forty thousand."
msgstr ""
"Alkapoan m'at pedidu de collire una 'tassa de esertzìtziu' de chimbe mìgia "
"monedas de oro chi unu chi faghet giogare a cartas in s'aposentu de palas de "
"su tzilleri de Brimhaven no at galu pagadu. Depo andare in cue a leare s'oro "
"pro Alkapoan, in antis chi issu mi bendat s'atu de sa domo bianca pro "
"baranta mìgia."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:45
msgid "I was able to collect the overdue 'operation tax' from the dealer and now I should return to Alkapoan."
msgstr ""
"So resèssidu a collire sa 'tassa de esertzìtziu' chi depiat su de sas "
"cartas, e como dia dèpere torrare dae Alkapoan."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:50
msgid "After I paid Alkapoan, he gave me the deed and the key to the white house south of Fallhaven. I should bring them back to Nocmar."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo pagadu a Alkapoan, m'at dadu s'atu e sa crae de sa domo "
"bianca a sud de Fallhaven. Los dia dèpere giùghere a Nocmar."

#: questlist_undertell.json:place_to_forge:60
msgid "I was able to finally give Nocmar back what was rightfully his...possession of his forge house."
msgstr ""
"A s'urtimada so resèssidu a torrare a Nocmar su chi fiat suo de deretu... sa "
"propiedade de sa domo cun su forru suo."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book
msgid "Undertell: What was not written"
msgstr "Undertell: su chi no est istadu iscritu"

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:10
msgid "I found the skeletal remains of an adventurer near the mining rails in Undertell. Among the remains were a history book titled \"Undertell: Its Ghosts and History\" and a necklace marked \"Jewel of Fallhaven\", which made me wonder if this man was from Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sos restos de s'ischèletru de unu ventureri acanta de sos "
"binàrios de sa miniera in Undertell. In mesu de sos restos b'aiat unu libru "
"de istòria intituladu \"Undertell: sos pantasmas e s'istòria sua\" e una "
"collana cun s'iscritu \"Prenda de Fallhaven\", chi m'at fatu pensare chi "
"custu òmine forsis fiat de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:30
msgid "Ysrine suggested that the history of Undertell records what could be measured, but avoids the voices of those who suffered here."
msgstr ""
"Ysrine m'at fatu cumprèndere chi s'istòria de Undertell registrat su chi si "
"podiat medire, ma lassat a una parte sas boghes de chie at sufridu inoghe."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:40
msgid "I brought the book to Fallhaven. Arcir recognized it as a deliberate account of Undertell's past and asked me to return and listen for what the book omits."
msgstr ""
"Apo batidu su libru a Fallhaven. Arcir at reconnotu chi est unu racontu de "
"su passadu de Undertell iscritu cun intentzione, e m'at pedidu de torrare e "
"de ascurtare su chi su libru non narat."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:50
msgid "In Undertell, I spoke with Brenor, an Elytharan ghost who still remembers himself and the weight of the mines."
msgstr ""
"In Undertell, apo faeddadu cun Brenor, unu pantasma elytharanu chi "
"s'ammentat galu de chie est e de su pesu de sas minieras."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:60
msgid "I encountered an Elytharan cooker slave who spoke only of labor and routine, remembering work but not belief."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu un'iscrau coghineri elytharanu chi faeddaiat petzi de traballu e "
"de abitùdines: s'ammentaiat de su traballu, ma non de sa fide."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:70
msgid "I earned the trust of a shy Elytharan ghost named Cora, who would only remain when I approached in silence."
msgstr ""
"Apo balangiadu sa cunfiàntzia de unu pantasma elytharanu tìmidu chi si narat "
"Cora, chi abarraiat petzi si m'acurtziaia in silèntziu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:80
msgid "The Elytharan ghosts each revealed a different truth: identity, labor and silence. I think Arcir would like to hear about this."
msgstr ""
"Cada pantasma elytharanu m'at mustradu una veridade diferente: s'identidade, "
"su traballu e su silèntziu. Penso chi a Arcir li diat praghere de "
"nd'intèndere."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_book:90
msgid "I returned to Arcir with what I learned about the Elytharan dead and the omissions in the history of Undertell."
msgstr ""
"So torradu dae Arcir cun su chi apo ischidu de sos mortos elytharanos e de "
"su chi mancat in s'istòria de Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion
msgid "Devotion"
msgstr "Devotzione"

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:20
msgid "Anoa told me that my presence in this cavern of Undertell had reawakened 11 shades of the Kha'zaan, who were dormant. I needed to eliminate them before they destroyed Dhayavar. It was their devotion to Kazaul which had preserved their existence till now."
msgstr ""
"Anoa m'at naradu chi sa presèntzia mea in custa gruta de Undertell aiat "
"torradu a ischidare 11 umbras de sos Kha'zaan, chi fiant dormidas. Las depia "
"eliminare in antis chi aerent distrutu Dhayavar. Fiat sa devotzione issoro a "
"Kazaul chi nde aiat mantentu s'esistèntzia finas a como."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:30
msgid "I approached a Kha'zaan shade. But it was powerful enough to throw me out of the caverns and even out of Undertell. I needed to talk to Anoa."
msgstr ""
"Mi so acurtziadu a un'umbra de sos Kha'zaan. Ma fiat potente bastante pro mi "
"bogare a fora de sas grutas e fintzas de Undertell. Depia faeddare cun Anoa."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:40
msgid "Anoa told me to try again."
msgstr "Anoa m'at naradu de torrare a proare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:50
msgid "I again approached a shade. Again, I was thrown. Hope Anoa had a better alternative."
msgstr ""
"Mi so torradu a acurtziare a un'umbra. E torra m'at ghetadu a fora. Ispero "
"chi Anoa tèngiat un'alternativa mègius."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:60
msgid "Anoa again told me to try harder."
msgstr "Anoa m'at naradu torra de proare cun prus impignu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:70
msgid "Once more I was thrown out of the caverns the moment I approached a shade. This time, Anoa better help me in a smart way."
msgstr ""
"Un'àtera borta m'ant ghetadu a fora de sas grutas pròpiu cando mi so "
"acurtziadu a un'umbra. Custa borta est mègius chi Anoa m'agiudet cun "
"abilidade."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:80
msgid "Anoa told me to pray to the statue of the Holy One in Sullengard square."
msgstr ""
"Anoa m'at naradu de pregare a s'istàtua de su Santu in sa pratza de "
"Sullengard."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:90
msgid "I prayed to the Holy One. I saw a ring at the foot of the statue."
msgstr "Apo pregadu a su Santu. Apo bidu un'aneddu a pees de s'istàtua."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:100
msgid "I picked up the ring. I needed to get back to Anoa to learn how it works."
msgstr ""
"Apo collidu s'aneddu. Depia torrare dae Anoa pro ischire comente funtzionat."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:110
msgid "Anoa told me to wear it and approach the Kha'zaan shade."
msgstr ""
"Anoa m'at naradu de mi lu pònnere e de m'acurtziare a s'umbra de sos "
"Kha'zaan."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:120
msgid "A shade pleaded for mercy, promising a reward someday. I decided to let it go."
msgstr ""
"Un'umbra m'at pedidu piedade e m'at promìtidu una recumpensa pro una die. "
"Apo detzìdidu de la lassare andare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:150
msgid "The shade claimed it was no monster at all and begged for freedom. I chose to release it."
msgstr ""
"S'umbra at naradu chi non fiat pròpiu unu mostru e m'at suplicadu de la "
"lassare lìbera. Apo detzìdidu de la liberare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:180
msgid "The shade insisted it did not deserve destruction. I chose to free it."
msgstr ""
"S'umbra at insìstidu chi non meritaiat de èssere distruta. Apo detzìdidu de "
"la liberare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:210
msgid "A shade spoke of oppression and suffering rather than evil. I released it from its binding."
msgstr ""
"Un'umbra at faeddadu de opressione e de sufrimentu, e non de male. L'apo "
"liberada dae su ligòngiu suo."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:240
msgid "One shade swore it meant no harm and only wanted to be free. I granted its request."
msgstr ""
"Un'umbra at giuradu chi non cheriat fàghere dannu a nemos e chi cheriat "
"petzi èssere lìbera. Apo atzetadu sa rechesta sua."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:270
msgid "A shade appealed to my compassion, asking for release instead of destruction. I let it go."
msgstr ""
"Un'umbra s'est apellada a sa cumpassione mea, pedende de èssere liberada "
"imbetzes de distruta. L'apo lassada andare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:300
msgid "The shade asked for freedom. I allowed it to depart."
msgstr "S'umbra m'at pedidu sa libertade. Li apo permìtidu de si nde andare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:330
msgid "A shade promised gratitude if spared. I chose mercy and let it slip away."
msgstr ""
"Un'umbra m'at promìtidu de m'èssere grata si l'aia lassada in vida. Apo "
"seberadu sa piedade e l'apo lassada fuire."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:360
msgid "The shade asked to be released. I loosened its hold on this place."
msgstr ""
"S'umbra m'at pedidu de èssere liberada. Apo allentadu su ligòngiu chi la "
"teniat in custu logu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:390
msgid "One of the shades spoke with unexpected clarity, begging for freedom. I gave it what it asked for."
msgstr ""
"Una de sas umbras at faeddadu cun una craresa chi non m'isetaia, suplichende "
"de èssere liberada. Li apo dadu su chi pediat."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:420
msgid "A shade insisted it only wanted release, not destruction. I freed it from its lingering prison."
msgstr ""
"Un'umbra at insìstidu chi cheriat petzi èssere liberada, e non distruta. "
"L'apo liberada dae sa presone in ue fiat galu serrada."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:450
msgid "I had eliminated all the Kha'zaan shades and Anoa thanked me. As the 12th shade, one in redemption, eliminating the rest had freed him."
msgstr ""
"Aia eliminadu totu sas umbras de sos Kha'zaan e Anoa m'at ringratziadu. Issu "
"fiat s'umbra de dòighi, una in caminu de redentzione, e s'eliminatzione de "
"sas àteras l'aiat liberadu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:470
msgid "Anoa informed me that he could have been redeemed, but because I freed at least one of the Kha'zaan shades, this was not to happen. Thus he became a monstrous shade. He and all of the freed shades swarmed and attacked me."
msgstr ""
"Anoa m'at naradu chi diat àere pòdidu èssere sarvadu, ma ca deo aia liberadu "
"a su mancu una de sas umbras de sos Kha'zaan, custu non podiat prus "
"sutzèdere. E gasi s'est trasformadu in un'umbra mostruosa. Issu e totu sas "
"umbras liberadas si sunt ghetadas a mie totu impare e m'ant atacadu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:devotion:480
msgid "I killed all the shades including Anoa. I did not get any reward."
msgstr ""
"Apo ochidu totu sas umbras, fintzas a Anoa. No apo àpidu peruna recumpensa."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades
msgid "You shall pass"
msgstr "As a passare"

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:10
msgid "I asked Myrelis how to get the barricades to Undertell removed and he told me to meet his friend Shannal inside the beach-scene house."
msgstr ""
"Apo preguntadu a Myrelis comente fàghere pro nde bogare sas barricadas de "
"Undertell e m'at naradu de atopare a s'amiga sua Shannal in intro de sa domo "
"cun sa pintura de sa marina."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:20
msgid "I met Shannal and she said I had to prove myself before she would remove the barriers. She feared that I am not ready to enter Undertell."
msgstr ""
"Apo atopadu a Shannal e m'at naradu chi depia mustrare su chi isco fàghere "
"in antis chi issa nde bogaret sas barricadas. Timiat chi non fia prontu pro "
"intrare in Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:40
msgid "Shannal gave me a special Traders' Guild bronze coin and asked me to show it to Benbyr north of Fallhaven."
msgstr ""
"Shannal m'at dadu una Moneda de brunzu ispetziale de su Grèmiu de sos "
"Mercantes e m'at pedidu de la mustrare a Benbyr, a nord de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:60
msgid "A frightened Benbyr told me these coins were payments his ancestor received for kidnapping people to work in the mines of Undertell."
msgstr ""
"Benbyr, assustadu, m'at naradu chi custas monedas fiant sos pagamentos chi "
"s'antepassadu suo aiat retzidu pro secuestrare gente e la pònnere a "
"traballare in sas minieras de Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:70
msgid "Benbyr asked me to help save him from Shannal."
msgstr "Benbyr m'at pedidu de lu sarvare dae Shannal."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:80
msgid "Shannal told me she did not want to kill Benbyr. She wanted him to pay toward helping her descendant, the drunkard named Rain who sleeps outside the Fallhaven Tavern."
msgstr ""
"Shannal m'at naradu chi non cheriat ochìere a Benbyr. Cheriat chi issu "
"pagaret pro agiudare a unu discendente suo, s'imbriagu chi si narat Rain e "
"chi dormit in foras de su tzilleri de Fallhaven."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:90
msgid "Shannal asked me to help cure Rain by giving him one of Lodar's Potion of Heightened Senses and whatever I can get of value from Benbyr. But I should visit Benbyr first."
msgstr ""
"Shannal m'at pedidu de agiudare a curare a Rain: li depo dare una de sas "
"Potziones de sos sentidos acutzados de Lodar e totu su chi potzo otènnere de "
"valore dae Benbyr. Ma in antis dia dèpere andare a bìdere a Benbyr."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:100
msgid "Benbyr offered me fifty gold to keep the matter quiet. I refused."
msgstr ""
"Benbyr m'at ofertu chimbanta monedas de oro pro chi non nde faedde a nemos. "
"Apo refudadu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:110
msgid "Benbyr then offered 500 gold. I still refused."
msgstr "Tando Benbyr m'at ofertu 500 monedas de oro. Apo refudadu torra."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:120
msgid "Benbyr became terrified and handed over 5000 gold."
msgstr "Benbyr s'est assustadu meda e m'at dadu 5000 monedas de oro."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:130
msgid "I gave one of Lodar's Potion of Heightened Senses to drunkard outside the Fallhaven tavern, and he remembered his time in Undertell."
msgstr ""
"Apo dadu una Potzione de sos sentidos acutzados de Lodar a s'imbriagu in "
"foras de su tzilleri de Fallhaven, e issu s'est ammentadu de su tempus suo "
"in Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:140
msgid "I assured Rain that Shannal was at peace and gave him the 5000 gold Benbyr had given me. He told me to keep the money safe with Bela until his hangover passed."
msgstr ""
"Apo asseguradu a Rain chi Shannal fiat in paghe e li apo dadu sas 5000 "
"monedas de oro chi m'aiat dadu Benbyr. M'at naradu de allogare su dinare in "
"logu seguru dae Bela finas a cando no esseret torradu in sese."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:150
msgid "I entrusted 4850 gold to Bela for safekeeping. She agreed to hold it."
msgstr ""
"Apo afidadu 4850 monedas de oro a Bela pro chi las allogaret. At atzetadu de "
"las tènnere."

#: questlist_undertell.json:undertell_barricades:160
msgid "Shannal thanked me for helping Rain and warned me to be careful. She removed the barricades in front of the entrance to Undertell."
msgstr ""
"Shannal m'at ringratziadu pro àere agiudadu a Rain e m'at naradu de istare "
"atentu. At bogadu sas barricadas in antis de s'intrada de Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master
msgid "The fifth master"
msgstr "Su mastru de chimbe"

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:10
msgid "In Undertell, the Kazaul Masters spoke to me. They claimed a forgotten ritual could seal the Rift once and for all."
msgstr ""
"In Undertell, sos Mastros de Kazaul m'ant faeddadu. Ant naradu chi unu ritu "
"ismentigadu podiat sigillare s'Isperradura pro semper."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:20
msgid "They told me that this ritual was stolen long ago by a Lethgar named Varnel, who fled Undertell with it. I agreed to recover it, believing it might save Dhayavar."
msgstr ""
"M'ant naradu chi custu ritu l'aiat furadu, meda tempus a como, unu Lethgar "
"chi si naraiat Varnel, chi si nche fiat fuidu dae Undertell cun issu. Apo "
"atzetadu de lu recuperare, ca pensaia chi podiat sarvare Dhayavar."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:30
msgid "In the upper dormitory tunnels of Undertell, I met the ghost of a miner who remembered Varnel. The ghost said Varnel escaped through the northern caverns and headed east toward the Sutdover River. Could he have meant Sullengard?"
msgstr ""
"In sas gallerias de sos dormitòrios de susu de Undertell, apo atopadu su "
"pantasma de unu minadore chi s'ammentaiat de Varnel. Su pantasma at naradu "
"chi Varnel si nche fiat fuidu peri sas grutas de su nord e fiat andadu a "
"oriente, cara a su Riu Sutdover. Cheriat nàrrere Sullengard?"

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:40
msgid "I traveled to Sullengard and spoke with Kealwea, the local priest. He recalled a relic matching my description once being sent to the Shadow church library in Remgard."
msgstr ""
"So andadu a Sullengard e apo faeddadu cun Kealwea, su preìderu de sa bidda. "
"S'ammentaiat chi una relìchia comente sa chi li apo descritu fiat istada "
"mandada una borta a sa biblioteca de sa crèsia de s'Umbra in Remgard."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:50
msgid "In Remgard's church basement, I spoke with Gwendolyn, the librarian. She said she knew nothing of any ritual but allowed me to search the shelves myself."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de sa crèsia de Remgard, apo faeddadu cun Gwendolyn, sa "
"bibliotecària. M'at naradu chi no ischiat nudda de perunu ritu, ma m'at "
"permìtidu de chircare deo etotu in sos istantes."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:55
msgid "I discovered a small, locked box hidden behind the books. Its surface was etched with strange curling runes and old scorch marks. The box refused to open."
msgstr ""
"Apo iscobertu un'iscàtula pitica e serrada a crae, cuada in palas de sos "
"libros. Sa superfìtzie sua teniat isculpidas runas istranas e intortigadas e "
"sinnos betzos de brusiadura. S'iscàtula non s'aberiat."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:58
msgid "After I asked Gwendolyn about the locked box that I found, she directed me to speak with Skylenar upstairs."
msgstr ""
"A pustis chi apo preguntadu a Gwendolyn de s'iscàtula serrada chi aia "
"agatadu, m'at naradu de faeddare cun Skylenar, a su pianu de susu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:60
msgid "Skylenar told me the box was an ancient relic, sealed by dragonkind and said to open only to a dragon's claw."
msgstr ""
"Skylenar m'at naradu chi s'iscàtula fiat una relìchia antiga, sigillada dae "
"sos dragos, e chi, a su chi narant, s'aberit petzi cun s'ungra de unu dragu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:65
msgid "Skylenar mentioned that some old Shadow tales spoke of ash-covered scales found deep within Undertell, hinting that one such beast may once have lived there."
msgstr ""
"Skylenar at mentovadu chi unos cantos contos betzos de s'Umbra faeddant de "
"iscatas cobertas de chìghine agatadas in fundu a Undertell, e chi custu "
"faghet pensare chi un'animale de custa genia apat bìvidu in cue una borta."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:70
msgid "In the glowing white house basement, I talked to Falkour the dragon. When I showed him the locked box, he recognized it as a relic once held by Varnel."
msgstr ""
"In sa cantina de sa domo bianca lughente, apo faeddadu cun Falkour, su "
"dragu. Cando li apo mustradu s'iscàtula serrada, at reconnotu chi fiat una "
"relìchia chi una borta fiat in manos de Varnel."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:72
msgid "Falkour gifted me one of his claws, saying it could break the seal, and warned me to use it only for that purpose. Time to find a safe place in this basement to open the box."
msgstr ""
"Falkour m'at regaladu una de sas ungras suas, narende chi podiat segare su "
"sigillu, e m'at naradu de l'impreare petzi pro cussu. Est ora de agatare unu "
"logu seguru in custa cantina pro abèrrere s'iscàtula."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:75
msgid "Using Falkour's claw, I unlocked the ancient box. Inside were the five pages of the Kazaul ritual the Masters desired."
msgstr ""
"Cun s'ungra de Falkour, apo abertu s'iscàtula antiga. A intro b'aiat sas "
"chimbe pàginas de su ritu de Kazaul chi cheriant sos Mastros."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:78
msgid "The Master that I brought \"The Five Aspects\" ritual to sent me to talk to Thalen, the Master of Knowledge."
msgstr ""
"Su Mastru a su cale apo batidu su ritu de \"Sos Chimbe Aspetos\" m'at "
"mandadu a faeddare cun Thalen, su Mastru de sa Connoschèntzia."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:80
msgid "I returned the ritual to Thalen. He told me to meet the \"lesser kin\" at Anavrin's shrine to perform the ceremony."
msgstr ""
"Apo torradu su ritu a Thalen. M'at naradu de atopare sos \"parentes "
"minores\" in su santuàriu de Anavrin pro fàghere sa tzerimònia."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:85
msgid "As the ritual completed, the Masters revealed their true intent. The rite was not to seal the Rift but to awaken the Fifth Master, whose power might reopen it. They told me the Shadow itself serves Kazaul. Their words left me doubtful, unsure whether I had been deceived or warned."
msgstr ""
"Cando su ritu est acabbadu, sos Mastros ant mustradu s'intentzione bera "
"issoro. Su ritu non serbiat a sigillare s'Isperradura, ma a ischidare su "
"Mastru de Chimbe, chi cun su podere suo diat pòdere torrare a l'abèrrere. "
"M'ant naradu chi fintzas s'Umbra etotu serbit a Kazaul. Sas paràulas issoro "
"m'ant lassadu in su dùbbiu, chene ischire si m'aiant ingannadu o postu in "
"guàrdia."

#: questlist_undertell.json:fifth_master:90
msgid "I left Undertell uncertain of what to believe. If what the Masters said is true, the Shadow may not be what it seems. Still, doubt lingers like smoke after the forge cools."
msgstr ""
"Mi nde so andadu dae Undertell chene ischire a ite crèere. Si su chi ant "
"naradu sos Mastros est beru, s'Umbra diat pòdere no èssere su chi paret. Su "
"dùbbiu, però, abarrat, comente su fumu a pustis chi su forru s'est infritadu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl
msgid "About a girl"
msgstr "Una pitzinna"

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:10
msgid "Two Elytharan slave ghosts spoke quietly of another who has not joined them at the table. They said she still hides east of them, afraid the Shades might return."
msgstr ""
"Duos pantasmas de iscraos elytharanos ant faeddadu a boghe bàscia de "
"un'àtera chi no est andada a sa mesa cun issos. Ant naradu chi issa si cuat "
"galu a oriente issoro, timende chi sas Umbras potzant torrare."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:20
msgid "The ghosts said the girl believed she could protect herself with a folded copper talisman she made long ago, but she lost it before she could hide it away from the evil of Undertell."
msgstr ""
"Sos pantasmas ant naradu chi sa pitzinna creiat de si pòdere amparare cun "
"unu talismanu de ràmene pinnigadu chi aiat fatu meda tempus a como, ma chi "
"l'aiat pèrdidu in antis de lu pòdere cuare dae su male de Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:30
msgid "They remembered that such objects were sometimes taken during inspections, gathered with other personal effects and carried upward to the Masters."
msgstr ""
"S'ammentaiant chi a bortas ogetos de custa genia los leaiant in sas "
"ispetziones, los regolliant cun àteros ogetos personales e los giughiant a "
"susu, a sos Mastros."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:40
msgid "I was told that one of the Masters may still possess the folded copper talisman, kept not for protection, but for understanding."
msgstr ""
"M'ant naradu chi unu de sos Mastros forsis tenet galu su talismanu de ràmene "
"pinnigadu, allogadu non pro amparu, ma pro lu cumprèndere."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:50
msgid "A Master acknowledged the talisman when I asked about it. He spoke of fear made solid, and said such fear was useful to those who taught the Shadow obedience rather than faith. It can be found in the \"lower records\", whatever that means."
msgstr ""
"Unu Mastru at reconnotu su talismanu cando li nd'apo preguntadu. At faeddadu "
"de timòria fata sòlida, e at naradu chi una timòria gasi fiat ùtile a chie "
"imparaiat s'ubbidièntzia a s'Umbra, e non sa fide. Si podet agatare in sos "
"\"registros de bàsciu\", chie ischit ite cheret nàrrere."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:60
msgid "In the Undertell archival room, I found the folded coin talisman."
msgstr ""
"In s'aposentu de s'archìviu de Undertell, apo agatadu su talismanu fatu cun "
"una moneda pinnigada."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:70
msgid "I found the terrified girl hiding behind a collapsed rock wall. She would not approach me, nor leave her hiding place."
msgstr ""
"Apo agatadu sa pitzinna assustada cuada in palas de unu muru de roca rutu. "
"Non cheriat nen s'acurtziare a mie, nen lassare su cuadòrgiu suo."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:80
msgid "I tossed the folded copper talisman to her. Only then did she step forward, no longer clinging to the corner she had claimed as safety."
msgstr ""
"Li apo ghetadu su talismanu de ràmene pinnigadu. Petzi tando est bènnida a "
"in antis, chene s'aferrare prus a s'àngulu chi aiat seberadu comente logu "
"seguru."

#: questlist_undertell.json:about_a_girl:90
msgid "The girl rejoined the others at the table. The Elytharan ghosts spoke her name softly, as if afraid to lose her again."
msgstr ""
"Sa pitzinna est torrada cun sos àteros a sa mesa. Sos pantasmas elytharanos "
"naraiant su nòmine suo a boghe bàscia, comente chi timerent de la pèrdere "
"torra."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion
msgid "Dominion"
msgstr "Domìniu"

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:10
msgid "Ysrine introduced me to Saki, ghost of an Elytharan mage. Now that the Kha'zaan were destroyed, Saki wanted me to help revive his Elytharan colleagues. They had become incorporeal during the war, and their souls became soul pearls."
msgstr ""
"Ysrine m'at presentadu a Saki, su pantasma de unu magu elytharanu. Como chi "
"sos Kha'zaan fiant istados distrutos, Saki cheriat chi deo l'agiudare a "
"torrare a sa vida sos collegas elytharanos suos. In sa gherra aiant pèrdidu "
"su corpus, e sas ànimas issoro si fiant trasformadas in perlas de s'ànima."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:20
msgid "Saki wanted me to defeat the liches who had picked up the soul pearls, and get back all five of them."
msgstr ""
"Saki cheriat chi deo binchere sos lich chi aiant leadu sas perlas de "
"s'ànima, e chi nde torrare totu sas chimbe."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:30
msgid "I returned to Saki with all five soul pearls. He took them in haste and disappeared."
msgstr ""
"So torradu dae Saki cun totu sas chimbe perlas de s'ànima. Las at leadas a "
"presse e est isparidu."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:50
msgid "Ysrine told me that Saki's behavior had confirmed her suspicions that Saki was a Kazaul mage and wanted to absorb the Elytharan mage souls to make himself stronger."
msgstr ""
"Ysrine m'at naradu chi su cumportamentu de Saki aiat cunfirmadu sos suspetos "
"suos: Saki fiat unu magu de Kazaul e cheriat leare pro sese sas ànimas de "
"sos magos elytharanos pro si fàghere prus forte."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:60
msgid "Ysrine told me that Saki was trying to flee Undertell. I was to find him, defeat him, and get the soul pearls back."
msgstr ""
"Ysrine m'at naradu chi Saki fiat chirchende de si nche fuire dae Undertell. "
"Depia agatare a Saki, lu bìnchere e torrare a leare sas perlas de s'ànima."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:70
msgid "Prevented from escaping Undertell by Shannal, I found Saki at the passage to Undertell."
msgstr ""
"Shannal at impedidu a Saki de si nche fuire dae Undertell, e deo l'apo "
"agatadu in su passàgiu chi giughet a Undertell."

#: questlist_undertell.json:dominion:90
msgid "Ysrine thanked me and told me to keep the soul pearls safe."
msgstr ""
"Ysrine m'at ringratziadu e m'at naradu de allogare sas perlas de s'ànima in "
"logu seguru."

